RADAR_LOAD("2026-07",[{"id":"10.1002/cphc.70529","t":"Catalytic Ammonia Synthesis Over Metal‐Free Silicon Disubstituted Cyclo[18]carbon: A Density Functional Theory Study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cphc.70529","s":"ChemPhysChem","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"In this work, we investigated silicon disubstituted cyclo[18]carbon as a metal‐free catalyst for nitrogen activation and ammonia synthesis using density functional theory at the ωB97XD/def2‐TZVPP level. A systematic comparison of the structural features of pristine C 18 , monosubstituted C 17 Si, and nine C 16 Si 2 isomers (C 16 Si 2 (0)–C 16 Si 2 (8)) identifies C 16 Si 2 (8) as the most stable configuration, attributed to the maximum Si–Si separation and minimal distortion of the conjugated carbon framework. Electronic structure analysis indicates that dual Si substitution creates active sites that are highly electron‐deficient and a more symmetrically distributed reactive environment, thereby promoting strong N 2 adsorption and effective activation via Si → N 2 back‐donation. The activated C 16 Si 2 –N 2 complex undergoes stepwise hydrogenation via C 16 Si 2 –NH 2 and C 16 Si 2 –(NH 2","au":["Anu Arora","Sobitri Sen","Sourav Pal"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"金属自由硅二取代环[18]碳上的催化氨合成：DFT研究","zb":"采用DFT方法研究了硅二取代环[18]碳作为金属自由催化剂。C16Si2(8)异构体因最大Si-Si间距和最小共轭碳骨架畸变成为最稳定构型。双硅取代产生的电子缺陷位点促进了N2吸附和活化。C16Si2-N2复合物经逐步氢化生成C16Si2-NH2和C16Si2-(NH2)2中间体，最终生成两个NH3分子，形成自维持机制。","ob":"涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.46670/jsst.2026.35.4.330","t":"Flash-Thermal Shock Synthesis of Nanomaterials and Catalysts for Chemical Sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.46670/jsst.2026.35.4.330","s":"Journal of Sensor Science and Technology","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Suk-Jeong Kwon","Sungwoo Eo","Ji-Hwan Eum","Dong‐Ha Kim"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Thermal Shock Synthesis"],"zt":"闪热震合成用于化学传感的纳米材料和催化剂","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","bt":1},{"id":"10.55079/jtee.2026.21.2.21","t":"Recent Research Trends in Physicochemical Properties and Structural Design Strategies for Enhancing the Activity and Stability of Dry Methane Reforming Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.55079/jtee.2026.21.2.21","s":"Korean Society of Thermal Environmental Engineers","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Dry reforming of methane (DRM) has attracted much attention as a promising carbon utilization technique because it converts CH4 and CO2 into syngas (H2 and CO2) simultaneously. However, its commercialization is limited by carbon deposition and metal sintering under high temperature reaction conditions. In this review, we discuss the main physicochemical factors governing the activity and stability of DRM catalysts, such as strong metal-support interactions (SMSI), metal dispersion, particle size, basicity, and oxygen storage capacity (OSC). We also review structural design strategies including core-shell, perovskite, double metal, exsolution, and atomic layer deposition (ALD)-based catalysts to improve catalyst stability and coke resistance. Future DRM catalyst development is expected to be important as an integrated design strategy that simultaneously achieves high activity, stability, ","au":["Jin-Woo Park","Won-Jun Jang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"提高干法甲烷重整催化剂活性和稳定性的物理化学性质和结构设计策略最新研究趋势","zb":"干法甲烷重整 (DRM) 因将 CH4 和 CO2 同时转化为合成气 (H2 和 CO2) 而受到关注，但其商业化受高温反应条件下碳沉积和金属烧结限制。本文讨论了控制 DRM 催化剂活性和稳定性的主要物理化学因素，如强金属-载体相互作用 (SMSI)、金属分散度、颗粒尺寸、碱性和氧存储容量 (OSC)。还回顾了核壳、钙钛矿、双金属、析出和基于原子层沉积 (ALD) 的催化剂等结构设计策略，以改善催化剂稳定性和抗积碳性。未来 DRM 催化剂开发预计将通过简单的单个性质和催化剂结构相互作用，实现高活性、稳定性和抗积碳性的集成设计策略的重要性。","ob":"甲烷干重整；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkwOTE4NjgwMw==&mid=2247725311&idx=3","t":"「国家杰青」陈接胜领衔！上海交通大学叶天南&南方科技大学邬家臻最新JACS丨二维电子化物平衡N₂活化！","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwOTE4NjgwMw%3D%3D&mid=2247725311&idx=3","s":"顶刊动态","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"该工作为二维电子化物催化剂的理性设计以及可持续氨合成提供了新的机制依据和材料设计准则。Balancing N2 Activation in Two-Dimensional Electrides for Ammonia Synthesis，Journal of the American Chemical Society，2026，DOI：10.1021/jacs.5c22746","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"wx":1,"mt":["10.1021/jacs.5c22746"]},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2026.117088","t":"An X-ray diffraction computed tomography study determining failure mechanisms in industrial Cu/ZnO/Al2O3(−Cs2O) water–gas shift catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2026.117088","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"The water–gas shift (WGS) reaction is a key process for industrial hydrogen production used in ammonia synthesis, where Cu–Zn–Al (CZA) catalysts are typically employed. Since similar formulations are also used for methanol synthesis, 1 wt% Cs 2 O is often added to mitigate its formation as an unwanted side product. However, this addition has recently been suggested to decrease the mechanical strength of the catalyst, particularly during initial reduction, leading to premature failure. In this study, we investigate how gas composition (particularly water content) and pressure affect the structural and chemical evolution of recovered CZA pellets after a typical reduction protocol, using pseudo- in situ X-ray Diffraction Computed Tomography (XRD-CT). We find that high water content (∼20 vol%) combined with increasing Cs 2 O loading markedly promotes Cu 0 crystallite growth, favours formatio","au":["Sebastian P. Stockenhuber","Daniela M. Farmer","Danial Farooq","María Asunción Molina","Antonis Vamvakeros","Stephen W. T. Price"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"工业Cu/ZnO/Al2O3(−Cs2O)水煤气变换催化剂失效机理研究","zb":"利用原位X射线衍射层析成像研究了Cu/ZnO/Al2O3(−Cs2O)催化剂在还原过程中的结构演变。发现高水含量和Cs2O负载促进了Cu0晶粒生长和ZnO烧结，导致催化剂边缘机械强度下降，最终引发失效。"},{"id":"10.26190/unsworks/32566","t":"Configuring Nanostructured and High-Entropy Liquid Metal based Electrocatalysts for Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.26190/unsworks/32566","s":"UNSWorks (University of New South Wales, Sydney, Australia)","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia, as both a hydrogen carrier and a vital chemical feedstock, represents a promising route for sustainable energy storage and decarbonisation. This thesis focuses on developing advanced catalysts for electrochemical ammonia synthesis via nitrate reduction, combining experimental innovation with computational modelling. The background and foundational principles of the work are introduced based on a comprehensive literature review. The materials, characterisation techniques, and experimental methods used throughout the research are also outlined. Three interconnected projects are presented. First, a liquid metal-based strategy is employed to fabricate bismuth (Bi) nano-electrocatalysts by electrochemically expelling Bi from a Ga–Bi alloy. Through controlled cooling and interfacial perturbations, Bi nanostructures—including nanosheets, nanotubes, and nanoparticles—are formed, with na","au":["Sahar Nazari"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"配置纳米结构和基于高熵液态金属的电催化剂用于硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电化学氨合成通过硝酸盐还原，关键方法为采用液态金属策略制备铋（Bi）纳米电催化剂并集成到氧化石墨烯液晶中，主要结果为该系统实现400 nmol s⁻¹ cm⁻²的氨生产速率和超过90%的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.190180","t":"Kinetics modulation of Cu‑TiO2/g‑C3N4 via type‑ii heterojunction for enhanced photocatalytic nitrogen fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.190180","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Dongfeng Sun","Yu Kang","Junwei Wang","Luo Huang","Shukai Ding","Guohui Dong"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"通过II型异质结调控Cu‑TiO2/g‑C3N4的动力学以增强光催化氮固定","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/adsc.70686","t":"Entropy‐Engineered Prussian Blue Nanocubes Decouple Kinetic Bottlenecks for Selective Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Conversion in Neutral Media","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adsc.70686","s":"Advanced Synthesis & Catalysis","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO 3 RR) in neutral media offers a sustainable route for decentralized ammonia synthesis, yet remains hindered by sluggish proton‐coupled electron transfer (PCET) and severe *NO 2 − poisoning. In unbuffered media, low proton availability disrupts the Volmer–Heyrovsky equilibrium, while heterogeneous active sites exacerbate competition between *H and nitrogenous intermediates, compromising selectivity. Herein, we deploy configurational entropy as a thermodynamic lever to homogenize interfacial coordination microenvironments and decouple these kinetic bottlenecks. A quinary high‐entropy Prussian blue analog (CNCMZ PBA) is synthesized via a scalable room‐temperature co‐precipitaion route, featuring equimolar Cu, Ni, Co, Mn, and Zn integrated within a single‐phase cubic lattice (Δ S config = 1.619 R). This entropy‐stabilized framework eliminates compositio","au":["Lixue Zhou","Yiman Huang","Zhiqiang Li","Huixin Wang","Tasmia Zaman","Daming Feng"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"熵工程化普鲁士蓝纳米立方体解耦动力学瓶颈实现中性介质中硝酸盐至氨的选择性转化","zb":"研究对象为电催化中性介质中硝酸盐还原（NO3RR），关键方法为通过可扩展室温共沉淀法制备五元高熵普鲁士蓝类似物（CNCMZ PBA），采用电化学阻抗谱等手段表征，主要结果为该材料在-0.9 V vs. 可逆氢电极下实现5.283 mg h−1 mg cat. −1的氨产率率和97.76%的峰值法拉第效率，且运行稳定超过120小时。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.77474","t":"Anderson‐Type Polyoxometalates Intercalated Cobalt–Copper Layered Double Hydroxides Heterostructures With Plum Blossom‐Like for Efficient Electroreduction of Nitrate to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.77474","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrochemical nitrate reduction (NO 3 RR) attracts increasing attention due to its potential to promote environmental sustainability and restore the global nitrogen balance. However, the development of an electrocatalyst with excellent activity and stability remains a significant challenge. Herein, we report a heterostructured electrocatalyst {ZnMo 6 }@CuCo LDH composed of Anderson‐type polyoxometalate clusters ({ZnMo 6 }) anchored onto copper‐cobalt layered double hydroxide, which effectively addresses these limitations through a synergistic effect. The electrolyzer composed of {ZnMo 6 }@CuCo LDH achieves a Faradaic efficiency of 96.6% and an NH 3 selectivity of 91.7% at industrial‐scale current densities (>150 mA cm −2 ), with an overpotential of only −0.02 V vs. RHE. The catalyst shows almost no activity degradation over 100 h. Theoretical calculations indicate that the out","au":["Jia‐ning Guan","Yu‐wen Wang","Liping Cui","Mei‐ling Wang","Kai Yu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"安德森型多金属氧酸盐插层钴-铜层状双氢氧化物异质结构带梅花状用于高效的硝酸盐电还原为氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐（NO3 RR）由于其促进环境可持续性和恢复全球氮平衡的潜力而受到越来越多的关注。然而，开发具有优异活性和稳定性的电催化剂仍然是一个重大挑战。本研究报道了一种由锚定在铜-钴层状双氢氧化物上的安德森型多金属氧酸盐簇（{ZnMo6}）组成的异质结构电催化剂 {ZnMo6}@CuCo LDH，通过协同效应有效地解决了这些限制。由 {ZnMo6}@CuCo LDH 组成的电解器在工业规模电流密度（>150 mA cm −2）下实现 96.6% 的法拉第效率和 91.7% 的 NH3 选择性，过电位仅为 −0.02 V vs. RHE。该催化剂在 100 小时内几乎不活性衰减。理论计算表明，优异的催化性能源于 {ZnMo6} 簇和混合价态 Cu/Co 位点之间的协同作用。{ZnMo6} 簇的引入促进了多电子转移和 * NO 到 * NHO 转化，降低了 H 2 O 解离的自由能势垒，从而","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.25092/baunfbed.1888785","t":"The green synthesis of Cu NPs in Camelia sinensis extract and their use in ammonia borane dehydrogenation","u":"https://doi.org/10.25092/baunfbed.1888785","s":"Balıkesir Üniversitesi Fen Bilimleri Enstitüsü Dergisi","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"In the presented study, green synthesis of Cu nanoparticles was achieved in Camellia sinensis (green tea) plant extract. The polyphenolic natural components abundant in Camellia sinensis extract reduced Cu2+ ions in the solution into Cu0 nanoparticles through bioreduction also ensured the stabilization of the resulting Cu0 nanoparticles. The prepared Camellia Sinensis extract stabilized Cu nanoparticles was characterized using FT-IR, XRD, and TEM spectroscopic methods, and its catalytic activity in the ammonia borane hydrolysis reaction was investigated. The rapid manufactured and quite inexpensive catalyst has been utilized on direct hydrogen production by AB hydrolysis without going through any separation or purification procedures. The effects of catalyst amount, AB concentration, and temperature parameters on Camellia sinensis extract stabilized Cu nanoparticles catalyzed AB hydrolys","au":["Hamza Özen","Hava Özay","Melek Tercan"],"o":"回填","zt":"在山茶科植物提取物中绿色合成Cu NPs及其在氨硼烷脱氢中的应用","zb":"研究对象为绿色合成铜纳米粒子（Cu NPs）并在氨硼烷（AB）脱氢反应中应用，关键方法为在山茶科植物提取物中通过生物还原法制备，主要结果为制备的催化剂在AB脱氢反应中表现出69.96 kJ.mol-1的活化能。","ob":"氨硼烷水解"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7211156","t":"Construction of a Copper Foam-Supported Cobalt-Tannic Acid-Modified Copper Nanowire Composite Electrode for Interfacial Electric Field-Enhanced Nitrate Electroreduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7211156","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (NO3RR) is a promising approach for simultaneous nitrate removal and sustainable ammonia synthesis under ambient conditions. Herein, a copper foam-supported cobalt-tannic acid-modified copper nanowire electrode (Co-TA/Cu NW) was constructed for efficient NO3RR. The conductive Cu nanowire array provides abundant active sites and rapid electron transport, while the Co-TA interfacial layer regulates the local electric field to promote nitrate enrichment and suppress the competing hydrogen evolution reaction. As a result, the Co-TA/Cu NW electrode achieves a high NH3 Faradaic efficiency of 98.71% and an NH3 yield rate of 5.99 mg h-1 cm-2 at -0.63 V vs. RHE in 0.2 M K2SO4 + 0.01 M KNO3. The electrode also exhibits low nitrite selectivity, good stability, and excellent performance under dilute nitrate conditions. This work provides an effective str","au":["Xianyuan Xu","Peiyuan Zheng","Dengsheng Ma","Yucan Luo","Cheng Chi","Jingru Hu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"构建铜泡沫负载的钴-单宁酸改性铜纳米线复合电极用于界面电场增强硝酸盐电还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐还原（NO3RR），关键方法为构建铜泡沫负载的钴-单宁酸改性铜纳米线电极（Co-TA/Cu NW），主要结果为该电极在-0.63 V vs. RHE下实现98.71%的氨法拉第效率和5.99 mg h-1 cm-2的氨产率率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.isci.2026.116683","t":"Photoelectrocatalytic urea synthesis: Surface engineering of the constructions, mechanism insights, and technological challenges","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.isci.2026.116683","s":"iScience","d":"2026-07-31","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Traditional urea production methods, primarily the Haber-Bosch and Bosch-Meiser processes, consume substantial amounts of energy and have significant environmental impacts, calling for more sustainable alternatives. Alternatively, photoelectrocatalytic (PEC) urea synthesis utilizes sunlight and electrochemistry to facilitate C-N coupling reactions under mild, environmentally friendly conditions. This review focuses on the recent progress in electrocatalytic, photocatalytic, and photoelectrocatalytic urea synthesis, with a focus on methodology, technological constraints and innovations. Key limitations include low Faradaic efficiencies, restricted catalytic selectivity and mechanistic understanding, and suboptimal charge-transfer processes. We discuss the potential of several photo-electroactive constructions, and quantification methodologies, highlighting a need for standardized testing ","au":["Mohsen Padervand","Éric Lichtfouse","Shahnaz Ghasemi","Ali Abdollahi","Abdelkader Labidi","Aziz Habibi‐Yangjeh"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"光电催化尿素合成：结构表面工程、机理见解和技术挑战","zb":"传统尿素生产方法，主要是哈伯-博施和Bosch-Meiser过程，消耗大量能量并对环境有重大影响，需要更可持续的替代方案。替代方案，光电催化（PEC）尿素合成利用阳光和电化学促进温和、环保条件下的C-N偶联反应。本综述关注电催化、光催化和光电催化尿素合成的最新进展，重点在于方法、技术限制和创新。关键限制包括低Faradaic效率、有限的催化选择性和机理理解以及次优的电荷转移过程。我们讨论了若干光电活性结构的潜力，以及定量方法，强调了标准化测试协议的需求。还讨论了技术的经济方面，重点关注绿色尿素生产的工业可行性。尽管PEC合成在传统方法之上具有显著优势，但它仍面临挑战，包括催化剂耐久性、高能耗和有限的可扩展性。本综述提供了克服这些挑战并推进PEC尿素合成朝着可持续肥料制造中的实际应用发展的策略。","ob":"其他催化反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkwMjAzMjc5NA==&mid=2247623957&idx=2","t":"JACS重磅！平衡二维电子化物氮气活化实现高效氨合成","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwMjAzMjc5NA%3D%3D&mid=2247623957&idx=2","s":"科研云资讯","d":"2026-07-30","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"上海交通大学叶天南、水原大学Sang-Won Park、南方科技大学邬家臻在《Journal of the American Chemical Society》上发表了题为“Balancing N2 Activation in Two-Dimensional Electrides for Ammonia Synthesis”的研究论文。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6cy00716c","t":"Dual reaction pathways over a CoPc-LiH/G catalyst for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cy00716c","s":"Catalysis Science & Technology","d":"2026-07-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Developing multiple-active-site catalysts has become a critical strategy to boost activity for ammonia synthesis. Herein, cobalt phthalocyanine was used as the cobalt precursor to prepare LiH-CoPc/G, which possesses three active...","au":["Xiaowen Sun","Yefei Wang","Shasha Ge","Xibo Zhang","Lili Wang","Fei Chang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"CoPc-LiH/G催化剂上氨合成的双反应路径","zb":"以CoPc为前驱体制备了具有三种活性位的LiH-CoPc/G催化剂。该催化剂在氨合成中表现出双反应路径，其中一种路径涉及LiH与CoPc的协同作用，另一种路径涉及CoPc与石墨烯的相互作用，从而提升了催化活性。"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta05665b","t":"Dual-waste upcycling of photovoltaic silicon and spent graphite into high-performance silicon–carbon battery anodes via plasma-assisted flash Joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta05665b","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-07-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Plasma-assisted flash Joule heating upcycles waste photovoltaic silicon and spent graphite into Si/C anodes by coupling a conductive N-doped SiO x N y surface with a robust SiC interphase, enabling high initial efficiency and durable cycling.","au":["Jiacheng Li","Feihong Guo","Jabbar Gardy","Lee J. Durndell","Zijun Zhang","Junguang Meng"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过等离子辅助闪焦耳加热将光伏硅和废弃石墨双废料升级为高性能硅-碳电池负极","zb":"等离子辅助闪焦耳加热通过将导电的 N 掺杂 SiO x N y 表面与坚固的 SiC 界面耦合，将废弃光伏硅和废弃石墨升级为 Si/C 负极，实现高初始效率和耐久循环。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c04186","t":"Bioinspired Nitrite Reduction to Ammonia by Molecular Nickel Polypyridine–Quinoline Complex","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c04186","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-07-30","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract In nature, the enzyme cytochrome-c-nitrite reductase (CcNiR) selectively reduces nitrite to ammonia, involving four nitrite-reduced intermediates, e.g., nitric oxide (NO), nitroxyl species (NO– and its conjugate acid HNO), and hydroxylamine (NH2OH). Similar to enzymatic nitrite reduction, the molecular nickel nitrito complex containing a polypyridine–quinoline ligand, [NiII(2PyN2Q)(k-ONO)](BF4)] (1-ONO) exhibits nitrite reduction to ammonia, involving all four intermediates under controlled electrochemical and stoichiometric chemical conditions. All four nitrite reduced intermediates, along with ammonia (NH3) have been detected and characterized by 1H and 31P{1H} NMR, EPR, and spectrophotometric studies. Moreover, the 1-ONO complex shows electrocatalytic nitrite reduction to ammonia in nonaqueous and aqueous media with excellent Faradaic efficiencies of 86% and 98%, using tetra-","au":["Sabarni Paul","Biplab Gope","Aniruddha Paik","Lokesh Rai","Abhijit Singha","Rajib Maity"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrite Reduction"],"zt":"分子镍多吡啶-喹啉配合物仿生亚硝酸还原为氨","zb":"在自然界中，细胞色素-c-亚硝酸还原酶（CcNiR）选择性地将亚硝酸还原为氨，涉及四个亚硝酸还原中间体，例如一氧化氮（NO）、亚硝酰物种（NO-及其共轭酸 HNO）和羟胺（NH2OH）。类似于酶促亚硝酸还原，含有多吡啶-喹啉配体的分子镍亚硝酸配合物 [NiII(2PyN2Q)(k-ONO)](BF4)] (1-ONO) 在控制电化学和化学计量条件下表现出亚硝酸还原为氨，涉及所有四个中间体。通过 1H 和 31P{1H} NMR、EPR 和分光光度法研究检测并表征了所有四个亚硝酸还原中间体以及氨（NH3）。此外，1-ONO 配合物在非水介质和水介质中表现出优异的法拉第效率（86% 和 98%），分别使用四丁基铵亚硝酸（TBAN）和亚硝酸钠（NaNO2）。使用 Na15NO2 作为唯一氮源的 15N 标记氨被获得。进一步，通过 15N NMR、UV-vis、FT-IR（带有 15NO 标记）研","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.chempr.2026.103134","t":"Molybdenum doping enhances backbonding at neighboring iron centers in iron-sulfur clusters","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.chempr.2026.103134","s":"Chem","d":"2026-07-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:00:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Why is the Mo nitrogenase more adept at N2 reduction than its alternative nitrogenase counterparts (V and Fe-only)? To investigate this question, we undertook a comparative structural and spectroscopic analysis of synthetic [MoFe3S4] and [Fe4S4] clusters. We found differences in how the clusters distribute electron density, with the iron centers in the [MoFe3S4] clusters being better at backbonding to weakly π-acidic ligands. Such differences may account for the greater efficiency of the Mo nitrogenase.","au":["Alexandra C. Brown","Samantha N. MacMillan","Alex McSkimming","Denis Leshchev","Eli Stavitski","Kyle M. Lancaster"],"o":"日常","why":["N2 reduction"],"zt":"钼掺杂增强铁硫簇中邻近铁中心的反键合","zb":"为研究 Mo 氮酶比其替代氮酶（V 和 Fe-仅）更擅长 N2 还原的原因，本研究对合成的 [MoFe3S4] 和 [Fe4S4] 簇进行了结构和光谱比较分析。研究发现簇如何分配电子密度的差异，[MoFe3S4] 簇中的铁中心在弱 π-酸性配体上的反键合能力更强。这种差异可能是 Mo 氮酶效率更高的原因。","top":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=Mzg4MDUwODE2OQ==&mid=2247525102&idx=5","t":"告别哈伯-博施法：合成氨的绿色新路径！丨ENG Chem Eng","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MDUwODE2OQ%3D%3D&mid=2247525102&idx=5","s":"EngineeringJournals","d":"2026-07-30","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"文字指出绿电驱动电催化、等离子体催化等合成氨的卡脖子问题与解决策略。 1 研究背景 全世界每年合成氨的需求量在2.0亿吨左右。传统的哈伯-博施法（Haber-Bosch Process）合成氨工艺虽实现了大规模工业化，但其高温高压条件致使能耗巨大、碳排放严重，每年导致3亿吨碳排放，消耗的能源高达全世界能源总消耗的2%左右，难以满足“双碳”背景下的可持续发展需求，迫切需要研发低能耗的合成氨新方法。 石河子大学于锋教授发表观点文章，讨论了一步法合成氨和二步法合成氨的发展现状和新趋势，指出了绿电驱动电催化、等离子体催化等合成氨的卡脖子问题与解决策略。阐述了近年来在热催化、电催化、光催化及等离子体催化等温和条件下合成氨的研究进展，着重介绍了以氮氧化物（NOx）为氮源的新型合成路径，尤其是“N2先氧化后还原”两步法的创新策略，彰显出良好的原子经济性与绿色低碳潜力。文章还对比了不同催化方式的反应条件、产率及选择性，剖析了当前面临的关键挑战，为绿色、分布式、可持续的合成氨技术路线提供了理论依据与发展思路。 2 核心观点 一步法合成氨：各有突破但仍需产业化检验 两步法新策略：突破 N2加氢还原的核心瓶颈 揪出隐形痛点：规范氨的定量检测 3 未来展望 未来研究路径需聚焦3个方面：一是优化一步法催化体系，通过机器学习辅助催化剂设计、缺陷工程与异质结构建等策略，提升热/电/光/等离子体催化的活性、稳定性及能量利用效率；二是推进两步法技术，优化等离子体氧化效率以提高NO选择性、降低分离成本，强化多技术耦合与反应器规模化，拓展工业废气管网 NOx作为低成本氮源；三是建立统一的实验规范与检测体系，强制15N2同位素验证、多方法交叉校准及污染物溯源，解决数据假阳性问题。 4 详细解读 一步法合成氨：各有突破但仍需产业化检验 热催化仍是目前唯一实现工业化的合成氨技术，其核心优势在于反应速率快、产氨效率高。新型“双活性中心”催化剂可在温和条件下（< 300 ℃）实现氮气还原合成氨。虽然NO氨气化合成氨也得到了关注，但依然存在温度窗口窄、抗氧中毒性差等问题。新型低温催化剂的材料稳定性与工程可行性仍有待提升","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"ob":"等离子体制氨｜光驱动","wx":1,"mt":["10.1007/s11705-026-2625-y"]},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.21696834","t":"Haber–Bosch Mission Notebook: Chemical Equilibrium and Process Optimisation (English and Spanish)","u":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21696834","s":"Zenodo (CERN European Organization for Nuclear Research)","d":"2026-07-30","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This record contains bilingual student mission notebooks (English and Spanish) designed to accompany the interactive “Green Nitrogen (Haber–Bosch)” chemical-equilibrium mission. The material constitutes Phase 2 of a teaching sequence on perturbations in chemical equilibrium. It builds on prior guided exploration of the reaction quotient (Q) and equilibrium constant (K), and asks student pairs to apply that framework in a more open process-optimisation context. Students work with the equilibrium: N₂(g) + 3 H₂(g) ⇌ 2 NH₃(g) The interactive mission challenges them to meet three operational objectives: achieve Kc > 100, produce more than 1.5 mol of NH₃, and activate the catalyst. The web environment provides the mission objectives and system feedback but does not prescribe a sequence of actions. The accompanying notebook requires students to record the initial state, formulate predictions be","au":["Rafael Cabrera Moscoso"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"哈伯-博施任务笔记：化学平衡与过程优化（英文和西班牙文）","zb":"记录包含双语学生任务笔记（英文和西班牙文），设计用于配合互动式“绿色氮（哈伯-博施）”化学平衡任务。材料构成化学平衡扰动教学序列的第 2 阶段。基于先前对反应商（Q）和平衡常数（K）的引导式探索，要求学生成对应用该框架在更开放的过程优化环境中。学生使用 N₂(g) + 3 H₂(g) ⇌ 2 NH₃(g) 这个平衡，互动任务挑战他们达到三个操作目标：实现 Kc > 100、生产超过 1.5 mol 的 NH₃、激活催化剂。网络环境提供任务目标和系统反馈，但不规定行动顺序。随附的笔记要求学生记录初始状态、在操作系统前提出预测、使用 Q、K、Δn(gas) 和动力学考虑来解释连续决策、比较预测与观察结果、反思平衡产率与反应速率之间的权衡。活动面向已先前接触过 Q、K、平衡移动以及热力学与动力学效应区别的上 secondary 化学学生。可以每对学生使用一个设备和一个笔记。内容：• 任务笔记 —","ob":"通用催化方法"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.6c02232","t":"Atomically Dispersed Single- and Dual-Boron-Atom Nanocatalysts for Electrochemical N2 Reduction to Ammonia: Mechanistic Insights from First-Principles Studies and Synthetic Challenges","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.6c02232","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2026-07-30","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (eNRR) has emerged as a promising alternative to the energy-intensive Haber–Bosch process for sustainable ammonia production under ambient conditions. However, the activation of the inert N≡N bond and the suppression of the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) remain major challenges. In this context, atomically dispersed boron-based nanocatalysts, comprising isolated boron sites and boron-containing dual-atom motifs anchored on nanostructured supports, have emerged as promising metal-free platforms for electrochemical N2 reduction to ammonia, wherein the electron-deficient boron centers enable efficient activation and fixation of dinitrogen. At the nanoscale, the catalytic behavior of these systems is governed by the local coordination environment, subnanometer confinement, defect chemistry, and interfacial electronic coupl","au":["Manzoor Ahmad Dar","Mudasir Dar","Anjumun Rasool"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于电化学 N2 还原为氨的单原子和双硼原子纳米催化剂：基于第一性原理研究和合成挑战的机理见解","zb":"电化学氮还原反应（eNRR）已成为在环境条件下可持续氨生产的有前景的替代方案，但惰性 N≡N 键的活化和抑制竞争的析氢反应（HER）仍然是主要挑战。在此背景下，原子分散的含硼纳米催化剂，包括孤立的硼位点和锚定在纳米结构载体上的含硼双原子基元，已成为电化学 N2 还原为氨的有前景的无金属平台，其中缺电子的硼中心能够有效活化和固定氮气。在纳米尺度上，这些系统的催化行为受局部配位环境、亚纳米限域、缺陷化学以及硼中心和主体载体之间的界面电子耦合的调控。由于它们的缺电子 p-轨道构型，孤立的硼中心表现出强路易斯酸性和独特的 σ-供电子/π-反键合相互作用，能够有效极化和活化 N2，而无需依赖 d-轨道化学。本综述全面概述了单硼原子催化剂（SBACs）、同核双和多硼原子催化剂以及含硼杂核双原子催化剂（BHDACs），通过第一性原理模拟进行研究。我们批判性地分析了原子分散的含硼催化剂在不同二维纳米材料（","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.179966","t":"Energy-efficient ammonia synthesis through glycerol oxidation-assisted dinitrogen reduction with a bifunctional Cu3BiS3/CeO2 electrocatalyst: Solid-state Lewis acid-base defect chemistry","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.179966","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07-30","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Abambagade Abera Mitiku","Meselu Eskezia Ayalew","Kefyalew Hailemariam Woldeamanuel","Nafikot Berhanu Bonka","Dong–Hau Kuo"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过甘油氧化辅助的氮气还原制备双功能 Cu3BiS3/CeO2 电催化剂进行高效氨合成：固态路易斯酸碱缺陷化学","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.est.5c17394","t":"Toward an Integrated Nitrogen Budget for India: Multi-Sectoral Flows, Circularity, and Environmental Losses","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.est.5c17394","s":"Environmental Science & Technology","d":"2026-07-30","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This study presents the first comprehensive, multisectoral assessment of India's nitrogen (N) budget, quantifying N inputs, flows, circularity, and losses across ten economic sectors. We present a scalable Environmentally Extended Input-Output (EEIO) framework, trace 198 N flows to estimate the conversion potential of input N to reactive nitrogen (Nr) losses, and estimate sectoral N use efficiency (NUE). The total N-input in India is estimated at ∼50 Tg-N yr-1 in 2020, dominated by Haber-Bosch fixation (38%), imports (33%), biological N fixation (27%), and fossil fuel combustion (18%). Cropland and industry together receive ∼90% of total N inputs; however, industry exhibits higher NUE (62%) than cropland (56%), given tighter regulations, whereas agriculture operates as a semiclosed loop with substantial losses. Shifts in dietary patterns toward animal protein and processed foods exacerba","au":["Deepakshi Babbar","Srinidhi Balasubramanian"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"为印度制定综合氮预算：多部门流动、循环性和环境损失","zb":"本研究首次对印度的氮（N）预算进行了全面、多部门评估，量化了十种经济部门的氮输入、流动、循环性和损失。本研究提出了一种可扩展的环境扩展投入产出（EEIO）框架，追踪 198 种氮流动以估计输入氮转化为活性氮（Nr）损失的转化潜力，并估计了部门氮利用效率（NUE）。2020 年印度总氮输入估计为 ∼50 Tg-N yr-1，其中哈伯-博施固定占 38%、进口占 33%、生物固氮占 27%、化石燃料燃烧占 18%。耕地和工业共接收 ∼90% 的总氮输入；然而，工业的 NUE（62%）高于耕地（56%），这是由于更严格的法规，而农业作为一个半封闭循环系统，存在大量损失。向动物蛋白和加工食品的饮食模式转变加剧了饲料-食物竞争，并放大了 Nr 排放。总体而言，52% 的氮输入转化为惰性 N2，37% 以 Nr 排放，10% 的 Nr 在部门内积累。大气 Nr 损失（∼9 Tg-N）主要为 NH3（6","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1002/cphc.70490","t":"Computational Simulation of Ammonia Borane Adsorption and Activation on Transition Metal‐Doped Two‐Dimensional MoS 2","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cphc.70490","s":"ChemPhysChem","d":"2026-07-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Based on first‐principles calculations within the framework of density functional theory (DFT), this study systematically investigates the adsorption and catalytic behavior of ammonia borane (H 3 BNH 3 , AB) molecules on transition metal (Ti, V, Cr, Fe, Co, Cu, Zn, Zr, Nb, Hf, Ta, W)‐doped MoS 2 surfaces. By analyzing the adsorption energy, BH bond elongation, charge transfer, and electronic structure characteristics, Zn‐, Co‐, and Cu‐doped systems were identified as high‐performance catalytic surfaces, among which Zn‐MoS 2 exhibits the most pronounced activation effect on the BH bond, with a maximum elongation of 18.3%. Further analysis combining charge density difference (CDD), Bader charge, and projected density of states (PDOS) reveals that the incorporation of Zn effectively modulates the electronic structure of the substrate, enhances charge transfer between the substrate and AB ","au":["Jinrong Huo","Yuxin Tang","Xiaojian Sun","Chaozheng He"],"o":"回填","zt":"基于密度泛函理论的第一性原理计算研究过渡金属掺杂二维 MoS2 表面的氨硼烷吸附和活化","zb":"本研究通过密度泛函理论（DFT）计算系统研究了氨硼烷（H3BNH3, AB）分子在过渡金属（Ti, V, Cr, Fe, Co, Cu, Zn, Zr, Nb, Hf, Ta, W）掺杂的 MoS2 表面上的吸附和催化行为。通过分析吸附能、BH 键伸长、电荷转移和电子结构特征，发现 Zn-、Co- 和 Cu-掺杂体系是高性能催化表面，其中 Zn-MoS2 对 BH 键的活化效果最显著，最大伸长量为 18.3%。进一步分析结合电荷密度差（CDD）、Bader 电荷和投影态密度（PDOS）揭示，Zn 的引入有效调节了基底的电子结构，增强了基底与 AB 分子之间的电荷转移，促进了氢原子上负电荷的积累，从而显著削弱了 BH 键强度。该研究阐明了掺杂 MoS2 表面 AB 吸附和 BH 键预活化的原子和电子级特征，为设计非贵金属催化剂以实现基于 AB 的氢气初始步骤提供了理论见解。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkyNDQyNjc3OA==&mid=2247519914&idx=4","t":"上海交通大学叶天南团队JACS: 二维电子化合物中N2活化程度调控与合成氨应用","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyNDQyNjc3OA%3D%3D&mid=2247519914&idx=4","s":"催化进展","d":"2026-07-29","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"通讯作者：叶天南、Sang-Won Park、邬家臻通讯单位：上海交通大学、韩国水原大学、南方科技大学研究背景和意义研究背景氨是化肥与清洁能源核心原料，合成瓶颈在于 945 kJmol 高键能 N≡N 活化。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.1021/acssensors.6c01231","t":"Room-Temperature Trimethylamine Sensing of Spinel High-Entropy Oxide (FeCoCuCrMn)3O4 via Ultrafast Joule Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssensors.6c01231","s":"ACS Sensors","d":"2026-07-29","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Revealing the interaction between sensing materials and gas molecules from the perspective of electronic orbital configuration is key to unlocking the selectivity origin of gas sensing. Herein, the single-phase spinel high-entropy oxide (HEO), (FeCoCuCrMn)3O4, has been synthesized via ultrafast Joule heating and exhibits high trimethylamine gas selectivity and sensing response at room temperature. Such gas-sensing dynamics originate from the fact that the eg sub-orbitals of Fe3+ 3d orbitals are highly matched with lone-pair electron orbitals of trimethylamine N atoms, enabling efficient hybridization to form stable Fe–N coordination bonds and constructing the atomic basis for high gas selectivity of (FeCoCuCrMn)3O4 toward trimethylamine. The appropriate lattice distortion induced by the ultrafast Joule heating strengthens orbital matching/hybridization, enhances trimethylamine m","au":["Huiyu Lu","Xinyu Meng","Jiarui Qi","Jie Huo","Bosen Zhang","Shuangming Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"室温下三甲胺传感的尖晶石高熵氧化物 (FeCoCuCrMn)3O4 通过超快焦耳热","zb":"研究对象为尖晶石型高熵氧化物 (HEO) (FeCoCuCrMn)3O4。通过超快焦耳热合成了单相 HEO，其在室温下对三甲胺 (TMA) 具有高选择性和传感响应。TMA 传感动力学源于 Fe3+ 3d 轨道的 eg 亚轨道与 TMA N 原子的孤对电子轨道高度匹配，形成稳定的 Fe–N 配位键。超快焦耳热引起的适当晶格畸变增强了轨道匹配/杂化，增强了 TMA 分子吸附和电子转移。DFT 计算验证了 TMA 在 Fe 活性位点上的强吸附相互作用和电子转移。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1002/batt.70423","t":"Interfacial Engineering of LiNiO 2 via an Atomic Layer Deposition‐Deposited Mg x Zn y O z Layer for Enhanced Electrochemical Performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/batt.70423","s":"Batteries & Supercaps","d":"2026-07-29","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Lithium nickel oxide (LNO) is a promising cathode material for next‐generation high‐energy‐density lithium‐ion batteries owing to its high specific capacity and cost‐effectiveness. However, LNO cathodes suffer from significant interfacial instability due to structural issues, cation mixing, and aggressive reactions with the electrolyte, which leads to rapid capacity loss. Herein, we report a surface‐stabilization strategy employing atomic layer deposition (ALD) to fabricate an ultrathin (ca. 4 nm), conformal dual‐metal oxide (Mg and Zn) Mg x Zn y O z (MZO) protective layer on model LNO particles. Comprehensive characterization, including time‐of‐flight secondary‐ion mass spectrometry and scanning transmission electron microscopy–energy‐dispersive X‐ray spectroscopy, reveals a unique chemical distribution: the Zn species remain localized at the surface, whereas Mg partially diffuses into ","au":["Orly Aminov","Sankalpita Chakrabarty","Michal Ejgenberg","Gal Radovsky","Shaul Michaelson","Ayan Mukherjee"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积沉积的 Mg x Zn y O z 层界面工程 LiNiO 2 以增强电化学性能","zb":"研究对象为锂镍氧化物 (LNO) 正极材料。采用原子层沉积 (ALD) 制备了 Mg x Zn y O z (MZO) 保护层，厚度约 4 nm。通过飞行时间二次离子质谱和扫描透射电子显微镜-能量色散X射线光谱表征了 MZO 层的化学分布，发现 Zn 物种位于表面，Mg 部分扩散到超结构中。电化学实验表明，MZO 包覆的 LNO 粒子稳定性显著增强，100 次循环后容量保持率提高了约 22%，电压滞后减少，循环效率提高。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.25781/kaust-htcy9","t":"Ion exchange and structural changes in sodalite and related materials","u":"https://doi.org/10.25781/kaust-htcy9","s":"","d":"2026-07-29","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Sodalite and sodalite-like frameworks contain cages that can accommodate many guest anions, including trapped electrons in sodalite electrides. However, the encapsulation of hydride ($\\mathrmH^-$) has not been reported in sodalites. Hydrides are of interest for hydrogen storage and for catalyzing reactions such as ammonia synthesis. This thesis examines two families: the classical aluminosilicate sodalite, and the rare-earth sodalite-like oxychlorides $\\mathrmRE_3O_4Cl$ (RE = Y, Dy), with the common aim of testing whether the sodalite cage can take up hydride anions. In the first part, hydroxy sodalite ($\\mathrmNa_8[AlSiO_4]_6(OH)_2 \\cdot n\\mathrmH_2O$) was used for two routes. First, the cage $\\mathrmNaOH$ was removed by Soxhlet extraction to obtain $\\mathrmNa_6[AlSiO_4]_6$, a sodalite-electride precursor; the extent of extraction depended strongly on the synthesis route, and a crown et","au":["Naseebah A. Alhabib"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"沸石及相关材料的离子交换与结构变化","zb":"研究了Na8[AlSiO4]6(OH)2·nH2O和RE3O4Cl（RE = Y, Dy）的离子交换。结果表明，在350°C下用CaH2与羟基沸石反应可发生OH-/H-交换，而600°C下框架分解；RE3O4Cl与CaH2或NaH反应会导致非晶化。","ob":"逆水煤气变换"},{"id":"10.1093/bulcsj/uoag108","t":"NH3 synthesis from 1.0 vol% nitric oxide gas via direct electrocatalytic reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1093/bulcsj/uoag108","s":"Bulletin of the Chemical Society of Japan","d":"2026-07-29","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia is a promising zero-carbon energy carrier; however, its conventional production is energy-intensive and dependent on fossil fuels. The electrochemical reduction of nitric oxide offers a sustainable alternative for ammonia synthesis while simultaneously mitigating nitrogen oxide pollutants. In this study, a solid polymer electrolyte cell equipped with an anion-exchange membrane was employed to improve nitric oxide mass-transfer and suppress the competing hydrogen evolution reaction by establishing a localized alkaline environment. Using a copper catalyst supported on carbon, ammonia was successfully produced with a Faraday efficiency of 22%. The introduction of platinum as a secondary metal further enhanced the catalytic performance. Under continuous electrolysis at a current density of −50 mA cm−2, the bimetallic copper–platinum catalyst achieved an ammonia formation rat","au":["Kaito Oya","Shoji Iguchi","Shimpei Naniwa","Kentaro Teramura"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过 1.0 vol% 一氧化氮气体直接电催化还原合成氨","zb":"使用碳载铜催化剂在固体聚合物电解质电池（配备阴离子交换膜）中成功生产氨，Faraday 效率为 22%，通过建立局部碱性环境来提高一氧化氮传质并抑制竞争的析氢反应。引入铂作为次要金属进一步增强了催化性能。在 -50 mA cm−2 的电流密度下连续电解，双金属铜-铂催化剂实现了 2.2 mg h−1 cm−2 的氨形成速率、34% 的 Faraday 效率和 23% 的一氧化氮-氨转化率。这些结果展示了一种从稀有一氧化氮流中连续合成氨的有效策略，并提出了利用低浓度氮氧化物来源的潜在方法。","ob":"涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jwpe.2026.110634","t":"Localized interfacial heating via a Joule-heated feed spacer for energy-efficient ammonia recovery from semiconductor wastewater","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jwpe.2026.110634","s":"Journal of Water Process Engineering","d":"2026-07-29","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Seongeom Jeong","Chaebeen Park","Boram Gu","Sanghyun Jeong"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule-heat"],"zt":"通过焦耳加热的进料间隔实现局部界面加热用于能源高效的半导体废水氨回收","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2026.07.053","t":"Programmable construction of asymmetric Cu–Ru interfacial sites for efficient neutral ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2026.07.053","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2026-07-29","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Lixiang Chang","Shuting Ren","Jiacheng Jayden Wang","Kande Liu","Kangzhou Wang","Zhouyang Zhang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"可编程构建非对称 Cu–Ru 界面位点用于高效中性氨电合成","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzI4ODQ0NjUwMg==&mid=2247717631&idx=2","t":"【JACS】上海交大叶天南团队: 二维电子化合物中N₂活化-氨合成的平衡调控","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4ODQ0NjUwMg%3D%3D&mid=2247717631&idx=2","s":"ChemBeanGo","d":"2026-07-28","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"针对此挑战，上海交通大学叶天南团队以2D电子化合物YC为平台，采用双活性位点策略实现了高效稳定的氨合成。在该体系中，富电子的YC层间区域负责活化N生成关键中间体（N），负载的Ni纳米颗粒则负责解离H提供活性氢。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["氨合成"],"wx":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzIyMzcyNDM0MA==&mid=2247654029&idx=5","t":"上海交通大学叶天南&南方科技大学邬家臻最新JACS丨二维电子化物平衡N₂活化！","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzcyNDM0MA%3D%3D&mid=2247654029&idx=5","s":"催化开天地","d":"2026-07-28","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"该工作为二维电子化物催化剂的理性设计以及可持续氨合成提供了新的机制依据和材料设计准则。Balancing N2 Activation in Two-Dimensional Electrides for Ammonia Synthesis，Journal of the American Chemical Society，2026，DOI：10.1021/jacs.5c22746","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"wx":1,"mt":["10.1021/jacs.5c22746"]},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15006680/v1","t":"Mechanistic Insights into Ammonia Formation on Dynamic Liquid Metal Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15006680/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-07-28","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"The development of catalytic systems capable of ammonia synthesis under milder conditions remains an important challenge. Recent experimental studies have reported enhanced ammonia formation over gallium–copper liquid metal catalysts. Here, we integrate machine-learning interatomic potentials, well-tempered metadynamics, and electronic-structure analysis to elucidate the reaction mechanism and the role of copper in catalysis. Transiently exposed Cu atoms selectively promote H2 dissociation through favorable Cu–H orbital interactions, whereas they provide negligible π back-donation to N2 and therefore do not significantly facilitate N–N bond activation. Consequently, the computed free-energy landscape favors an associative pathway in which sequential hydrogenation precedes N–N bond cleavage. While Cu does not uniformly lower the barriers for all elementary steps, it selectively stabilizes","au":["Tarak Karmakar","Anmol and Tarak Karmakar"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"液态金属催化剂上氨合成机理研究","zb":"结合机器学习势函数和电子结构分析，研究了液态金属催化剂上氨合成的机理。计算表明，Cu原子选择性促进H2解离，但不显著促进N2活化，反应遵循氢化先于N-N键断裂的关联路径，Cu稳定了早期氢化中间体。","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c03726","t":"N2 Oxidation to Nitrate via a Phase Transition-Based Pathway","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c03726","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-28","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract Nitric acid is essential in fertilizer production, yet its current industrial synthesis via the Haber-Bosch and Ostwald process accounts for 1 % of the chemical sector’s energy consumption and produces significant greenhouse gas emissions. Despite considerable efforts, previous attempts at electrochemical nitrogen oxidation have proven unsuccessful due to competition with the oxygen evolution reaction (OER) and the inherent difficulty of activating the nitrogen (N2) bond under ambient conditions. In this work, we propose a phase transition-based approach inspired by electrochemical ammonia synthesis to circumvent these challenges. The strategy is centered around the formation of a metal nitride by direct nitridation of a suitable metal, followed by an oxidation step employing molecular oxygen (O2). Li and Ca are identified as particularly promising candidates to mediate such a p","au":["Pauline Schütt","Romain Tort","Lisbeth Karlsson","Yu Katayama","Ifan E. L. Stephens","Alexander Bagger"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于相变途径的 N2 氧化至硝酸盐","zb":"硝酸是化肥生产中必不可少的化学品，然而其当前工业合成通过哈伯-博施和奥斯特瓦尔德过程占化学部门 1 % 的能源消耗，并产生大量温室气体排放。尽管已投入大量努力，但之前的电化学氮氧化尝试因与析氧反应 (OER) 的竞争以及环境条件下氮 (N2) 键活化的固有困难而未能成功。本文提出了一种受电化学氨合成启发的相变途径方法，以规避这些挑战。该策略的核心是通过对合适的金属进行直接氮化形成金属氮化物，然后采用分子氧 (O2) 进行氧化步骤。基于反应热力学，Li 和 Ca 被确定为介导此类途径的特别有希望的候选者，实验表明 Li 氮化物在 O2 存在下确实可以被氧化以产生硝酸盐。提出的概念展示了直接 N2 氧化的巨大潜力，鼓励进一步的计算和实验研究。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3390/app16157501","t":"Performance Analysis of an Alkaline Water Electrolysis–Cryogenic Air Separation–Ammonia Synthesis System Based on Multi-Stage Compression Power Optimization","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/app16157501","s":"Applied Sciences","d":"2026-07-28","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Driven by the increasing demand for renewable energy integration and low-carbon transformation in the chemical industry, the production of green hydrogen from renewable electricity for subsequent ammonia synthesis has emerged as an important route for green ammonia production. However, the process still relies on the high-pressure Haber–Bosch synthesis loop, typically operating at 200–300 bar, where multi-stage compression, recycle gas treatment, and low-temperature condensation separation strongly influence energy consumption and feedstock utilization. In this study, a steady-state Aspen Plus (V15) model integrating an Alkaline Water Electrolysis Unit (AWE), cryogenic air separation for nitrogen production, and an ammonia synthesis loop was established for a liquid ammonia plant with an annual capacity of approximately 600,000 t. Under base-case conditions, the specific energy consumpti","au":["Bo Zhao","Hualei Zhu","Jin Zhu","Xiaoyan Zhao","Ting Tang","Yonghua Chen"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"基于多级压缩功率优化的碱性水电解-低温空气分离-氨合成系统性能分析","zb":"在可再生能源集成和化学工业低碳转型需求日益增长的驱动下，利用可再生电力生产绿色氢气用于后续氨合成，已成为绿色氨生产的重要途径。然而，该工艺仍依赖于 200–300 bar 的高压哈伯-博施合成循环，其中多级压缩、循环气处理和低温冷凝分离强烈影响能耗和原料利用率。本研究建立了集成碱性水电解单元 (AWE)、用于氮气生产的低温空气分离以及氨合成循环的稳态 Aspen Plus (V15) 模型，用于年产能约为 600,000 t 的液氨工厂。在基准条件下，液氨生产的单位能耗为 10.28 kWh/kg-NH3，而氢和氮元素利用率分别达到 87.73% 和 88.92%，均高于传统的煤炭和天然气路线。将压缩级数从 2 增加到 5 减少了新鲜合成气压缩功 6.69%，但超过四个阶段后，节能效益变得微乎其微。1–2% 的排气比实现了循环压缩功和氢/氮排气损失之间的合理平衡，而优选的冷凝温度范围为 −","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1039/d6gc02488b","t":"Plasma-electrochemistry tandem systems for ammonia synthesis: from nitrogen activation to integrated reactor engineering","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6gc02488b","s":"Green Chemistry","d":"2026-07-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This review prensents plasma–electrocatalytic tandem ammonia synthesis, covering nitrogen activation, NO x management, NH 3 formation, reactor integration, and pathways toward scalable green ammonia.","au":["Chenxi Man","Bingtao Xie","Li Lv","Lun Li","Shuai Zhang","Bangdou Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于氨合成的等离子体-电化学串联系统：从氮活化到集成反应器工程","zb":"本文综述了等离子体-电催化串联氨合成，涵盖了氮活化、NOx 管理、NH3 形成、反应器集成以及向可扩展绿色氨的途径。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsestengg.6c00134","t":"Mixed Functional Group Ligands in UiO-66(Ce): A Strategy for Efficient Photocatalytic Nitrate to Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsestengg.6c00134","s":"ACS ES&T Engineering","d":"2026-07-28","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH3) is a key chemical feedstock used in agricultural fertilizers, energy applications, and many industrial processes. However, conventional production methods like the Haber–Bosch process are energy-intensive, costly, and environmentally harmful. Photocatalytic nitrate reduction offers a sustainable, low-energy alternative for NH3 synthesis. In this study, we developed Ce-UiO-66 metal–organic frameworks (MOFs) with mixed functional groups for efficient photocatalytic nitrate reduction. We synthesized and evaluated a series of (Ce)-X catalysts, where X = H, NH2, OH, H–NH2, NH2–OH, H–OH, and H–NH2–OH. Among them, Ce–NH2–OH (NO) showed the highest ammonia production rate at 212 μmol g–1 h–1. This enhanced performance results from synergistic effects: the amine group improves visible-light absorption by narrowing the bandgap, while the hydroxy group creates shallow electro","au":["Mariyappan Shanmugam","Lekshmi Priya SL","Vincy SAP Masillamani","Prince J. J. Sagayaraj","Neelam Goyal","Keishi Oyama"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"UiO-66(Ce) 中的混合官能团配体：一种高效的硝酸盐至氨转化光催化剂策略","zb":"氨 (NH3) 是用于农业肥料、能源应用和许多工业过程的关键化学原料。然而，传统的生产方法如哈伯-博施过程是高能耗、高成本且对环境有害的。光催化硝酸盐还原为 NH3 合成提供了一种可持续、低能耗的替代方案。本研究开发了具有混合官能团的 Ce-UiO-66 金属有机框架 (MOFs) 用于高效的光催化硝酸盐还原。我们合成并评估了一系列 (Ce)-X 催化剂，其中 X = H、NH2、OH、H–NH2、NH2–OH、H–OH 和 H–NH2–OH。其中，Ce–NH2–OH (NO) 在 212 μmol g–1 h–1 的氨生产速率下表现出最高性能。这种增强性能源于协同效应：胺基通过缩小带隙提高了可见光吸收，而羟基创建了浅电子陷阱以减少电荷复合并改善电荷转移。羟基还增加了 Ce3+ 位点的比例，这些位点作为硝酸盐还原反应的活性中心。这项工作提出了一种结合结构工程和电子工程的催化剂设计策略，以促","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.iecr.6c02087","t":"Boron-Modulated Nitrogen-Doped Hollow Carbon Nanofibers as a Metal-Free Electrocatalyst for Nitrate to Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.iecr.6c02087","s":"Industrial & Engineering Chemistry Research","d":"2026-07-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Metal-free carbon-based materials have emerged as promising electrocatalysts for the nitrate reduction reaction (NO3–RR) because of their low cost, earth abundance, and environmental compatibility. Among them, carbon nanofibers (CNFs) are attractive because of their unique structural features, yet their catalytic performance remains limited by low intrinsic activity. Herein, boron and nitrogen co-doped hollow carbon nanofibers (BN-HCNFs) are developed as a metal-free electrocatalyst for nitrate-to-ammonia conversion. Owing to boron-induced electronic-structure modulation, BN-HCNFs exhibit improved NO3–RR performance relative to pristine N-HCNFs. In situ electrochemical studies reveal a hydroxylamine-related pathway on BN-HCNFs prior to NH3 formation. Theoretical calculations further show that boron doping shifts the carbon p-band center closer to the Fermi level, thereby optimiz","au":["Ruifang He","Lu Sun","Ke Ren","Peng Tian","Junwei Ye"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate to Ammonia"],"zt":"作为无金属硝酸盐至氨转化电催化剂的硼改性氮掺杂空心碳纳米纤维","zb":"无金属碳基材料因其低成本、地球丰度和环境兼容性，已成为硝酸盐还原反应 (NO3–RR) 的有前景的电催化剂。其中，碳纳米纤维 (CNFs) 因其独特的结构特征而具有吸引力，但其催化性能受限于低本征活性。本文开发了一种无金属电催化剂——硼和氮共掺杂的空心碳纳米纤维 (BN-HCNFs)，用于硝酸盐至氨转化。由于硼引起的电子结构调制，BN-HCNFs 相对于原始 N-HCNFs 表现出改进的 NO3–RR 性能。原位电化学研究揭示了 BN-HCNFs 上在氨形成之前存在与羟胺相关的途径。理论计算进一步表明，硼掺杂使碳 p 带中心更接近费米能级，从而优化 NOx 中间体吸附，促进逐步脱氧/加氢，并降低决速步骤能垒。这项工作为设计用于硝酸盐至氨转化的无金属碳电催化剂提供了一种有效策略，并提供了关于硼掺杂在 NO3–RR 中促进作用机理的见解。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.156660","t":"A probabilistic techno-economic assessment of hydrogen production via ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.156660","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-07-28","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia has emerged as one of the most promising hydrogen carriers due to its high hydrogen density, established infrastructure, and favorable storage and transportation characteristics. This study develops a probabilistic techno-economic framework for evaluating industrial-scale hydrogen production via thermocatalytic ammonia decomposition. A rigorous Aspen Plus® process simulation was integrated with a stochastic economic assessment based on Monte Carlo simulation to quantify the uncertainty associated with the Levelized Cost of Hydrogen (LCOH). The process achieved an ammonia conversion of 97.1% and produced hydrogen with a purity of 99.97%. The deterministic analysis resulted in an LCOH of US$5.54 kg -1 H 2 , while the probabilistic assessment yielded a mean LCOH of US$7.35 kg -1 H 2 . The results revealed a markedly asymmetric distribution of hydrogen production costs, identifying a","au":["Erik Eduardo Rego","Celma de Oliveira Ribeiro","Matias Campos Helmeister","Claudio A. Oller Nascimento"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"基于氨分解的氢气生产的概率技术经济评估","zb":"氨由于其高氢密度、成熟的基础设施以及有利的储存和运输特性，已成为最有希望的氢载体之一。本研究开发了一个概率技术经济框架，用于评估通过热催化氨分解进行的工业规模氢气生产。采用 Aspen Plus® 过程模拟与基于蒙特卡洛模拟的随机经济评估相结合，量化了与平准化氢成本 (LCOH) 相关的不确定性。该工艺实现了 97.1% 的氨转化率，并生产了纯度为 99.97% 的氢气。确定性分析得到 LCOH 为 US$5.54 kg -1 H 2 ，而概率评估得到平均 LCOH 为 US$7.35 kg -1 H 2 。结果表明氢气生产成本分布明显不对称，氨价格是主要的经济驱动因素，并证明单独的确定性 LCOH 值低估了投资风险。提出的框架为评估基于氨的氢供应链的投资风险提供了稳健的决策支持工具。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.179969","t":"Interfacial electron redistribution and tandem active sites enable enhanced nitrate to ammonia conversion in Zr-MOF/MoS2 heterostructures","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.179969","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07-28","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Naveen Karuppusamy","Zi-Yan Zhan","Ruspika Sundaresan","Chun Hsien Wu","Pandiyarajan Anand","Jeyakumar Karthikeyan"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"界面电子重新分布和串联活性位点使 Zr-MOF/MoS2 异质结构中的硝酸盐到氨转化增强","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/smtd.70907","t":"Carbon Nanotubes‐Supported Intermetallic CuPd Nanocrystals for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia Integrated With Energy and Resource Recycling Strategies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smtd.70907","s":"Small Methods","d":"2026-07-28","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT The discharge of nitrate wastewater has caused severe environmental problems along with accelerated industrialization. Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) has emerged as a pivotal technology integrating pollution remedy and resource recovery. In this study, palladium is prescreened as the optimal noble metal for doping into the copper lattice via DFT prediction. The carbon nanotubes‐supported intermetallic CuPd (CuPd‐CNTs) nanocrystals (mean size 10.78 ± 1.72 nm) are synthesized through a one‐step hot‐injection method. Pd‐doping optimizes the catalytic process by regulating intermediate adsorption behavior and electronic structure, and CNTs effectively inhibit metal oxidation and enhance electron transfer efficiency. Electrochemical measurements demonstrate that CuPd‐CNTs exhibit excellent NO 3 RR performance with low onset potential, Tafel slope, and charge tr","au":["Kangyi Yu","Fuyu Liu","Yinfeng Liu","Zhantao Wei","Renfei Feng","Yu Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"碳纳米管-支持的非金属 CuPd 纳米晶体用于高效电化学硝酸盐还原为氨，并与能源和资源回收策略集成","zb":"通过 DFT 预测筛选出钯作为最佳贵金属，将其掺杂到铜晶格中。通过一步热注入法合成碳纳米管-支持的非金属 CuPd (CuPd‐CNTs) 纳米晶体（平均尺寸 10.78 ± 1.72 nm）。Pd 掺杂通过调节中间体吸附行为和电子结构优化催化过程，CNTs 有效抑制金属氧化并提高电子转移效率。电化学测量表明 CuPd‐CNTs 表现出优异的 NO 3 RR 性能，具有低起始电位、Tafel 斜率和电荷转移电阻，在 NH 3 生产中实现了约 95% 的高法拉第效率和良好稳定性。原位 FTIR 和 Raman 光谱结合差分电化学质量光谱阐明了关键反应途径通过 *NO 到 *NOH 的首次加氢步骤。值得注意的是，使用 CuPd‐CNTs 的硝酸铝电池系统实现了 1.209 V 的开路电位和 5.46 mW cm −2 的峰值功率密度，并表现出优异的操作稳定性，实现了硝酸盐降解、氨生产、电能输出","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.4029889","t":"Ancillary Ligand‐Controlled Dinitrogen Cleavage and Transformation at Titanium Centers","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.4029889","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"ABSTRACT The activation and transformation of dinitrogen (N 2 ) represents a significant scientific challenge. In particular, while metal nitrides are pivotal intermediates, achieving N─N bond cleavage with 3d metals such as titanium remains scarce. Here we report unprecedented ancillary ligand control over the N 2 activation pathway in PCP‐ligated (PCP = 2,6‐( t Bu 2 PCH 2 ) 2 ‐C 6 H 3 ) titanium complexes upon reduction, wherein aryloxide or diarylamide groups facilitate complete N─N bond scission to dititanium bis( μ ‐nitrido) complexes, whereas the phenyl analogue leads to C─P bond activation of the pincer. Computational studies suggest that heteroatom‐mediated interactions with K + ions in the secondary coordination sphere facilitate isomerization of the N 2 bridge from end‐on to side‐on, thereby promoting N─N bond rupture. Moreover, these complexes catalyze the silylation of N 2 , ","au":["Wenshuang Huang","Mengru Jia","Yuan Zhiqiang","Yifan Wei","Ying Teng","Wei‐Hai Fang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"配体调控下钛中心对二氮的裂解与转化","zb":"利用PCP配体钛配合物在还原条件下，通过配体环境调控N2活化路径，实现N-N键完全断裂生成双钛双(μ-亚氮)配合物。计算表明配体中杂原子与K+离子的相互作用促进N2桥构型异构化，进而促进N-N键断裂。该配合物催化N2硅化反应，产率高达22.0当量N(SiMe3)3，为迄今IV族金属体系最高TON。","top":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzU3Njc4NDE3Mg==&mid=2247603102&idx=1","t":"上海交大叶天南团队JACS：二维电子化合物中N2活化-氨合成的平衡调控","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU3Njc4NDE3Mg%3D%3D&mid=2247603102&idx=1","s":"催化计","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"针对此挑战，上海交通大学叶天南团队以2D电子化合物Y2C为平台，采用双活性位点策略实现了高效稳定的氨合成。在该体系中，富电子的Y2C层间区域负责活化N2生成关键中间体（N2）δ，负载的Ni纳米颗粒则负责解离H2提供活性氢。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["氨合成"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c03084","t":"Reframing Reaction Pathways in Joule-Heating Catalysis: From Interfacial Heat Transfer to the Complexities of Dynamic Kinetics","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c03084","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"Abstract Joule-heating catalysis (JHC) creates a special catalytic environment defined by inverted inside-out heat transfer and dynamically driven kinetics, extending far beyond simple electrification of heat supply to establish a fundamentally distinct catalytic paradigm. This review provides a catalysis-centered analysis of JHC, emphasizing how the inverted thermal landscape (Tsolid > Tgas), ultrafast heating rates, and pulse-driven operation reshape catalytic activity and selectivity. JHC configurations (type I–III) are systematically classified to illustrate how conductive frameworks govern local heat delivery, interfacial energy transfer, and dynamic kinetic behavior. Particular attention is given to kinetic trapping of transient intermediates and selectivity inversion enabled by timescale engineering. Emerging non-thermal phenomena, including electric field-assisted lattice oxygen ","au":["Jinghao Li","Qi Wang","Jiaqi Li","Zhengpeng Qin","Shuaiyu Chen","Gaowu W. Qin"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"在焦耳热催化中重新定义反应路径：从界面热传递到动态动力学的复杂性","zb":"研究对象为焦耳热催化 (JHC)。JHC 创造了一个特殊的催化环境，其特点是倒置的热传递和动态驱动的动力学。系统地分类了 JHC 配置（类型 I–III），说明了导电框架如何控制局部热传递、界面能量传递和动态动力学行为。特别关注了瞬态中间体的动力学捕获和通过时间尺度工程实现的择形反转。重点考察了电场辅助晶格氧活化和电子介导的路径等非热现象。","ob":"通用催化方法｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热","top":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7168940","t":"Interfacial Stabilization of High-Nickel NMC Cathodes: A Comprehensive Approach using Powder and Electrode Atomic Layer Deposition Methods","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7168940","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The rapid expansion of electric vehicles and artificial intelligence–driven technologies has accelerated the demand for lithium-ion batteries (LIBs) with enhanced lifespans and safety. Atomic layer deposition (ALD) has emerged as a promising surface engineering technique for stabilizing high-nickel cathodes. However, systematic comparisons between powder and electrode ALD strategies remain limited. In this study, ZrO₂ coatings fabricated via powder and electrode ALD processes were systematically compared using LiNi0.8Co0.1Mn0.1O2 (NMC811) cathodes. Among the investigated conditions, the powder ALD strategy exhibited the best electrochemical performance, delivering a discharge capacity of 172.49 mAh g⁻¹ with an outstanding capacity retention of 95.8% after 200 cycles. Microstructural analysis revealed that powder ALD formed a highly conformal and uniformly distributed ZrO₂ stabilization l","au":["Jung Gyu Lee","Beum Geun Seo","Hyun Jin Kong","Hyung Jong Choi","Gwon Deok Han","Joon Hyung Shim"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"界面稳定的高镍NMC正极：使用粉末和电极原子层沉积方法的综合方法","zb":"电动汽车和人工智能驱动技术的快速发展加速了对具有更长寿命和更高安全性的锂离子电池（LIBs）的需求。原子层沉积（ALD）已成为一种有前景的表面工程技术，用于稳定高镍正极。然而，粉末和电极ALD策略之间的系统比较仍然有限。在本研究中，通过粉末和电极ALD工艺在LiNi0.8Co0.1Mn0.1O2（NMC811）正极上制备了ZrO2涂层，并进行了系统比较。在所研究的条件下，粉末ALD策略表现出最佳电化学性能，在200个循环后提供了172.49 mAh g⁻¹的放电容量和95.8%的出色容量保持率。微观结构分析表明，粉末ALD在单个活性颗粒上形成了一层高度均匀分布的ZrO2稳定层，而电极ALD导致在多孔电极结构中涂层分布相对不均匀。阻抗和循环后微观结构分析进一步证实，粉末ALD有效地抑制了阻抗增长、颗粒开裂和表面结构退化。这些发现表明，粉末ALD是一种实用且可扩展的界面工程策略，用于长寿命、高","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1201/9781003782254-151","t":"Exploring Atomic Layer Deposition for the Development of Single-Atom Catalysts in Hydrogen Evolution Reactions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1201/9781003782254-151","s":"","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Hydrogen (H 2 ) stands as the leading alternative to fossil fuels due to its renewable nature, exceptional energy-carrying capacity, and zero carbon dioxide emissions. Researchers increasingly favor large-scale H 2 production via water electrolysis powered by renewable energy, with water splitting being a viable method for long-term, sustainable energy storage. Noble metals efficiently catalyze the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), but the performance of water electrolysis largely depends on the activity of the electrocatalysts. To further advance renewable energy technology, researchers are developing highly efficient, stable, cost-effective, and less toxic catalysts like CuO, NiO, Co 3 O 4 , FeP/FeP 2 , CoP/Co 2 P, MoP, and NiCo 2 O 4 . Single-atom catalysts (SACs) have gained significant attention for their exceptional catalytic activity and high atom-utilization efficiency. Atomic L","au":["Patrick Ehi Imoisili","Tien-Chien Jen"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"探索原子层沉积技术在析氢反应中单原子催化剂的开发","zb":"氢气（H2）因其可再生性、卓越的能量携带能力和零二氧化碳排放，成为化石燃料的领先替代品。研究人员越来越多地倾向于通过可再生能源驱动的水电解产生大规模氢气，水裂解是一种可行的长期可持续储能方法。贵金属有效地催化析氢反应（HER），但水电解的性能很大程度上取决于电催化剂的活性。为了进一步推进可再生能源技术，研究人员正在开发高效、稳定、经济和低毒的催化剂，如CuO、NiO、Co3O4、FeP/FeP2、CoP/Co2P、MoP和NiCo2O4。单原子催化剂（SACs）因其卓越的催化活性和高原子利用率而受到极大关注。原子层沉积（ALD）已成为制造SACs的最有效方法之一，因为它能够精确地均匀沉积小原子。本文探索了SACs合成在HER方面的最新进展，重点关注ALD技术以增强催化效率和性能。","ob":"析氢反应；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6cc04055a","t":"An interference-resistant electrocatalyst for selective H 2 O 2 oxidation enabled by an atomic layer deposited oxide coating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cc04055a","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Atomic layer deposition of a permselective amorphous oxide coating onto Pt catalysts yields interference-resistant, highly selective electrocatalysts that selectively permeate H2O2 while blocking electroactive interferents.","au":["Yaolan Li","Lihui Huang","Wenjing Fan","Xichen Wang","Liping Chen","Xinjian Feng"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积氧化物涂层实现抗干扰选择性 H 2 O 2 氧化电催化剂","zb":"研究对象为 Pt 催化剂。通过原子层沉积在 Pt 催化剂上沉积了选择性的非晶态氧化物涂层，该涂层选择性地渗透 H2O2，同时阻挡电活性干扰物。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.renene.2026.126210","t":"Enhancing lipids deoxygenation for efficient sustainable fuel production over rapid Joule-heated MnFeCoNiCu/C catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.renene.2026.126210","s":"Renewable Energy","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Dechao Wang","KaiYue Wu","Quan Yao","Xin Lin","Jian Lin","Haihan Huang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule-heat"],"zt":"通过快速焦耳加热 MnFeCoNiCu/C 催化剂增强脂质脱氧以实现高效的可持续燃料生产","ob":"反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/sstr.70546","t":"Synergistic Engineering of Nanostructures via Anodic Aluminum Oxide Templates and Atomic Layer Deposition: Design Principles, Mechanisms, and Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/sstr.70546","s":"Small Structures","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Anodic aluminum oxide (AAO) templates integrated with atomic layer deposition (ALD) provide a uniquely controllable platform for engineering functional nanostructures within highly ordered, high‐aspect‐ratio (HAR) porous architectures. AAO offers scalable, long‐range ordered nanopore arrays with independently tunable geometric parameters, while ALD enables conformal, thickness‐controlled coatings via self‐limiting surface reactions. This combination transforms AAO from a passive scaffold into an actively engineerable system in which precursor transport, nucleation, and growth kinetics can be codesigned. In this review, we establish a unified framework for the AAO‐ALD hybrid platform by connecting (i) geometry‐ and transport‐governed conformality modeling in HAR pores, (ii) AAO surface chemistry and pretreatment strategies that regulate nucleation and incubation behavior, and (iii) ALD pr","au":["Hyeon Joon Choi","Neul Ha","Jisu Jung","Ryeowon Kim","Sungmin Kwon","Sunghak Park"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过阳极铝氧化物模板和原子层沉积协同构筑纳米结构：设计原理、机理和应用","zb":"阳极铝氧化物 (AAO) 模板与原子层沉积 (ALD) 结合为在高度有序、高长径比 (HAR) 多孔结构中工程功能纳米结构提供了独特可控的平台。AAO 提供可扩展、长程有序的纳米孔阵列，具有可独立调谐的几何参数，而 ALD 通过自限制表面反应实现共形、厚度可控的涂层。这种组合将 AAO 从被动支架转变为可主动工程化的系统，其中前驱体传输、成核和生长动力学可以协同设计。本文建立了 AAO-ALD 混合平台的统一框架，通过连接 (i) 几何和传输控制的 HAR 孔中共形建模、(ii) AAO 表面化学和预处理策略调节成核和孕育行为，以及 (iii) ALD 工艺策略（如暴露工程、脉冲序列控制和等离子辅助路线）扩展可及材料空间和结构结果。然后，批判性地调查了能源存储、催化和传感等应用特定实施，突出了有序限制和共形功能化使能的结构-性能关系。最后，讨论了剩余挑战——包括极端 HAR 渗透的吞吐量限","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzI4Njk3MDQ4Nw==&mid=2247798297&idx=7","t":"「国家杰青」陈接胜领衔！上海交通大学叶天南/南方科技大学邬家臻，最新JACS！","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI4Njk3MDQ4Nw%3D%3D&mid=2247798297&idx=7","s":"微算云平台","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"该工作为二维电子化物催化剂的理性设计以及可持续氨合成提供了新的机制依据和材料设计准则。Balancing N2 Activation in Two-Dimensional Electrides for Ammonia Synthesis，Journal of the American Chemical Society，2026，DOI：10.1021/jacs.5c22746","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"wx":1,"mt":["10.1021/jacs.5c22746"]},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c07954","t":"Phase Engineering of Fe-Polyoxometalate Sub-1 nm Assemblies for High-Efficiency Photoelectrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c07954","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Iron-substituted polyoxometalate (Fe-POM) clusters are promising candidates for photoelectrocatalytic nitrogen reduction due to their photosensitive and electron-buffering capabilities. However, their catalytic performances are severely hindered by the intrinsic cluster configuration and dissolution-induced detachment on the electrode. Here, using Fe-POM as “superatom” building blocks, we prepared a series of one-dimensional (1D) subnanowires and two-dimensional (2D) subnanosheets driven by different cation ligands, where clusters are connected directly with a controllable arrangement. Three kinds of Keggin-type clusters can be employed as building blocks, indicating the generality of this synthetic strategy. 1D subnanowires exhibit extraordinary catalytic activity toward the photoelectrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (PEC-NRR), with a high ammonia yield of 72.0 μg h–1 mg","au":["Xiaoya Wang","Zehui Chen","Haoyang Li","Yazhou Ren","Tian Sheng","Yan Lin"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"Fe-多金属氧酸盐亚纳米组装体的相工程用于高效光电催化氮还原","zb":"铁取代的多金属氧酸盐（Fe-POM）簇由于其光敏感性和电子缓冲能力，是光电催化氮还原的有希望的候选者。然而，它们的催化性能受到固有的簇配置和电极上的溶解诱导脱附的严重阻碍。本研究使用 Fe-POM 作为“超原子”构建块，制备了一系列由不同阳离子配体驱动的二维（1D）亚纳米线和二维（2D）亚纳米片，其中簇直接连接，排列可控。三种 Keggin 型簇可用作构建块，表明该合成策略的普遍性。1D 亚纳米线对光电催化氮还原反应（PEC-NRR）表现出非凡的催化活性，氨产率为 72.0 μg h–1 mg–1，比离散簇提高了 4.47 倍。实验和理论证据表明，Fe-POM 组装体之间的电子离域导致带隙变窄和光捕获增强，这还降低了决速步骤（*NNH 形成）的能量势垒。与活性位点微环境设计不同，超结构工程可能为催化剂的电子结构调节提供一种通用的范例。","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Fe/铁体系｜光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c01477","t":"Green Ammonia Generation with a Polypyridine Cobalt Complex and Visible Light","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c01477","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"The use of a first-row transition metal complex and visible light was exploited to promote the photosynthesis of ammonia from nitrite ions. This is achieved in neutral aqueous solution by employing a cobalt polypyridine complex (CoL) within a light-driven catalytic scheme involving [Ru(bpy)3]2+ (where bpy = 2,2'-bipyridine) as the sensitizer and ascorbate as the electron donor. Under visible light irradiation, the resulting photosystem produces NH3 with a quantum yield up to 3% and a selectivity approaching 100%, achieving a maximum turnover number (TON) up to 2150. Transient absorption spectroscopy and density functional theory provided a robust mechanistic picture, showing that binding of the NO2- substrate occurs at the one-electron reduced metal complex, while also ascertaining the energetic feasibility of subsequent elementary reaction steps. All in all, this work uncovers the great","au":["Andrea Mantovani","Federico Droghetti","Andreu Tortajada","Lubomı́r Rulı́šek","Florian Lemken","Albert Ruggi"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["synthesis of ammonia"],"ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15006589/v1","t":"Support-controlled microwave energy localization enables efficient and responsive ammonia cracking","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15006589/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:45Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Renewable-electricity-powered hydrogen supply chains require compact, efficient, and demand-responsive NH3 crackers. Here we develop a microwave-driven ammonia decomposition system based on an LTA-type zeolite catalyst loaded with 10 wt% Ru nanoparticles that directly converts electrical energy into chemical energy through localized catalyst heating. The system achieves an external energy conversion efficiency of 48%, based on the net microwave input power after subtracting the reflected power. Thermal simulations further reveal an internal energy conversion efficiency of 60%, based on the microwave energy absorbed by the catalyst, independent of microwave frequency, corresponding to a hydrogen production efficiency of 92% on a lower heating value (LHV) basis. The reactor maintains high reaction rates while keeping the reactor wall at only 450 °C, enabling the use of conventional stainle","au":["Sota Kuramoto","Ryo Ishibashi","Hiroyuki Tamiya","Seunghwan Jung","Yasuhiro Sakamoto","Hiroki Yamada"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia cracking"],"zt":"基于载体控制的微波能量局域实现高效及响应式氨分解","zb":"开发了一种基于 LTA 型沸石催化剂的微波驱动氨分解系统，催化剂负载 10 wt% Ru 纳米颗粒，通过局域催化剂加热将电能直接转化为化学能。系统实现 48% 的外部能量转换效率（基于净微波输入功率），内部能量转换效率为 60%（基于催化剂吸收的微波能量），对应 92% 的低热值氢气生产效率。反应器在保持反应器壁温仅 450 °C 的同时维持高反应速率，可采用传统不锈钢制造。多物理场模拟结合原位同步辐射全散射揭示，沸石载体的介电性能通过在催化剂内局域电磁能量促进高效的功率到化学能转换。快速启动、快速关闭及在波动功率下的稳定运行，展示了适用于分布式氢气生产且兼容可再生能源的平台。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","pre":1},{"id":"10.1093/mam/ozag053.625","t":"Bridging Atomistic Active Sites and Bulk Performance in Ammonia Synthesis Photocatalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1093/mam/ozag053.625","s":"Microscopy and Microanalysis","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Understanding structure–function relationships in Ru-based ammonia synthesis catalysts requires direct visualization of catalytic nanoparticles at atomic resolution [1]. In emerging photocatalytic ammonia synthesis systems [2], catalytic performance is highly sensitive to surface structure, step density, and local coordination environments [3]. While B5-type step-edge configurations have been proposed as active motifs for N2 dissociation [4], experimental identification of such sites within three-dimensional nanoparticles remains challenging due to limited projection angles and reconstruction artifacts. Here, we demonstrate atomic-resolution reconstruction of an individual Ru nanoparticle using only 27 tilt projections and the real space iterative reconstruction (RESIRE) algorithm. This limited-angle dataset yields a three-dimensional reconstruction with sufficient fidelity for atomic id","au":["Lin Yuan","Haozhi Sha","Colum O’Leary","Yuxuan Liao","Chengyu Song","Peter Ercius"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"在氨合成光催化剂中连接原子活性位点和体性能","zb":"理解基于 Ru 的氨合成催化剂的结构-功能关系需要原子分辨率的催化纳米颗粒的直接可视化 [1]。在新兴的光催化氨合成系统中 [2]，催化性能对表面结构、台阶密度和局部配位环境高度敏感 [3]。虽然 B5 型台阶边缘配置已被提出作为 N2 解离的活性基元 [4]，但由于投影角度有限和重建伪影，实验中在三维纳米颗粒内识别此类位点仍然具有挑战性。本研究使用仅 27 个倾斜投影和真实空间迭代重建（RESIRE）算法，展示了单个 Ru 纳米颗粒的原子分辨率重建。这种有限角度数据集产生了一个具有足够保真度的三维重建，可以进行原子识别。随后的原子追踪在纳米颗粒体积内识别了 1177 个单独的 Ru 原子。径向分布分析显示第一壳层 Ru-Ru 键距离中心在 ~2.6 Å，与体六方密堆积（HCP）Ru 一致（图 1A）。键取向映射进一步证实纳米颗粒内部存在 HCP 排序，而相当一部分原子表现出降低的配位，表","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ra90081j","t":"Correction: Pathways to sustainable lithium-mediated ammonia electrosynthesis: tuning reaction environment and advancing reactor design","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ra90081j","s":"RSC Advances","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Correction for ‘Pathways to sustainable lithium-mediated ammonia electrosynthesis: tuning reaction environment and advancing reactor design’ by Ngoc-Trung Nguyen et al. , RSC Adv. , 2026, https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ra02156e.","au":["Ngoc-Trung Nguyen","Thi Kim Cuong Phu","Minh Triet Nguyen","Trang Minh Pham","Phi Long Nguyen","Thi Viet Bac Phung"],"o":"回填","why":["lithium-mediated ammonia"],"ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c03071","t":"Bifunctional Cu–Ni Phosphide Polyhedral Architectures for Formaldehyde Oxidation-Coupled Ammonia Synthesis at Low Energy Consumption","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c03071","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrite reduction reaction (NO2RR) offers a green pathway toward ammonia synthesis under ambient conditions. However, the overall energy efficiency of this process remains constrained by the anodic oxygen evolution reaction (OER), which suffers from intrinsically sluggish kinetics. Herein, we demonstrates that the Cu-Ni phosphide polyhedral architectures grown on Cu-Ni foam (P-O-CNF) enable the simultaneous promotion of cathodic NO2RR and anodic formaldehyde oxidation reaction (FOR). The P-O-CNF catalyst exhibits exceptional bifunctional performance, delivering an ammonia Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 96% and a production rate of 21.2 mg h-1 cm-2 at -0.2 V vs RHE for NO2RR, while affording considerable FEs above 94% across the applied potential window for FOR. Leveraging this outstanding bifunctionality, the paired NO2RR-FOR system achieves a low energy consumption of only","au":["Danrui Huang","Tanyang Xiao","Aike Liu","Jing Yang Jiang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"双功能 Cu-Ni 磷化物多面体结构用于低能耗甲醛氧化偶联氨合成","zb":"电催化亚硝酸根还原反应（NO2RR）在环境条件下提供了一条绿色合成氨的途径，但该过程的整体能量效率受阳极析氧反应（OER）的限制，OER动力学内在缓慢。本研究展示了在 Cu-Ni 泡沫上生长的 Cu-Ni 磷化物多面体结构（P-O-CNF），能够同时促进阴极 NO2RR 和阳极甲醛氧化反应（FOR）。P-O-CNF 催化剂表现出优异的双功能性能，在 -0.2 V vs RHE 下，NO2RR 的法拉第效率（FE）为 96%，生产率为 21.2 mg h-1 cm-2，而 FOR 在整个应用电位窗口内提供了高于 94% 的相当大的 FE。利用这种出色的双功能性，配对的 NO2RR-FOR 系统在 200 mA cm-2 下实现了仅 7.38 kWh kgNH3-1 的低能耗，明显优于传统的 NO2RR-OER 系统（19.82 kWh kgNH3-1）。重要的是，该耦合系统可以直接由基于 P","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.156753","t":"Design and cost analysis of green hydrogen and ammonia production from hybrid offshore wind and floating photovoltaic systems","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.156753","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mikail Rıza Onat","Murat Emre Demir"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"混合海上风电和浮式光伏系统生产绿色氢和氨的设计和成本分析","bt":1},{"id":"10.54254/2755-2721/2026.35696","t":"Optimization Modeling and Performance Evaluation of Wind-Solar-Coupled Hydrogen-Ammonia Systems with Storage: A Full-Year Operational Simulation and Cost-Benefit Analysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.54254/2755-2721/2026.35696","s":"Applied and Computational Engineering","d":"2026-07-27","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Against global warming and the need to reduce reliance on fossil fuels, green ammonia produced from renewable hydrogen has emerged as a promising energy carrier for integrating intermittent wind and solar power. This study develops an integrated wind–solar–storage–hydrogen–ammonia optimization model based on phased linear programming, simulating 8,760 hours of annual operation while incorporating renewable generation, energy storage, water electrolysis, hydrogen storage, and ammonia synthesis under operational constraints. Results show that an optimal 7:3 wind-to-photovoltaic ratio combined with 15%/4 h energy storage reduces the green ammonia production cost to approximately 2,800 CNY/ton, achieves an internal rate of return of 12–15%, and shortens the payback period to 8–10 years. The optimized configuration also lowers the levelized cost of electricity to 0.15 CNY/kWh, limits renewabl","au":["Hekai Zhan","Wenguang Wang","Sheng Zhou","Ziping Dai","Leo Huang","Zhishang Wu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"风-光-氢-氨耦合系统优化建模与性能评估：全年运行模拟与成本效益分析","zb":"针对全球变暖和减少对化石燃料依赖的需求，该研究开发了基于分阶段线性规划的风-光-储-氢-氨集成优化模型，模拟了8760小时的年运行情况，同时考虑了可再生能源发电、储能、水电解、氢存储和氨合成在运行约束下的情况。结果表明，7:3的风-光伏比例结合15%/4小时的储能将绿色氨的生产成本降低至约2800元/吨，实现内部收益率为12-15%，投资回收期缩短至8-10年。优化配置还降低了平准化电力成本至0.15元/千瓦时，将可再生能源消纳率限制在3%以下，并证明300,000 Nm³的氢存储系统可以有效地稳定氨合成。对九个代表性地区的敏感性分析表明，系统性能对风力成本最敏感，其次是光伏、储能、电力存储和氢存储成本。风能主导地区受风力成本波动影响较大，光伏主导地区从储能优化中受益最多，而互补地区由于资源互补性表现出平衡的敏感性。提出的分阶段线性规划框架为集成可再生-氢-氨系统的动态优化提供了一种有效方"},{"id":"10.1002/cite.70153","t":"Impact of Trace Water on the Macroscopic Activity of Commercial Ammonia Cracking Catalysts Under Process‐Relevant Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cite.70153","s":"Chemie Ingenieur Technik","d":"2026-07-26","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Nickel‐based catalysts are widely employed in industrial ammonia cracking, however, their performance stability under process‐relevant operating conditions, particularly in the presence of trace water, remains poorly understood. This study investigates the macroscopic impact of trace water impurities on catalyst activity at elevated pressures and temperatures. A cyclic testing protocol decouples permanent degradation from reversible activity loss. Results reveal that while dry thermal stress causes negligible permanent deactivation, hydrothermal stress causes a significant, irreversible drop in macroscopic activity. Additionally, trace water induces a reversible activity drop. Ultimately, these findings demonstrate that dry testing can overestimate industrially relevant catalyst performance. Consequently, to ensure reliable industrial scale‐up, catalyst evaluation should transit","au":["Bruno Villela Pedras Lago","Sebastian Wodak","Marianne Ponceau","Axel Behrens","Jan-Peter Bohn","Sebastian Rehfeldt"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Cracking"],"zt":"痕量水对商业氨分解催化剂在工艺相关条件下的宏观活性的影响","zb":"研究了痕量水杂质在高温高压下对催化剂宏观活性的影响。循环测试方案将永久性失活与可逆活性损失解耦。结果表明，干热应力导致微不足道的永久失活，而水热应力导致宏观活性的显著不可逆下降。此外，痕量水诱导可逆活性下降。这些发现表明，干测试可能高估工业相关催化剂性能。因此，为确保可靠的工业规模化，催化剂评估应过渡到包含痕量水的工艺代表性进料。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1002/celc.70280","t":"Electrochemical Reduction of Nitrate to Ammonia on Transition‐Metal Sputtered Copper Foams","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/celc.70280","s":"ChemElectroChem","d":"2026-07-26","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia (eNO 3 RR) is an important step toward sustainable ammonia synthesis. Despite a few challenges in securing sufficient nitrate sources for commercial scale production of ammonia, a key current focus is the search for a cost‐effective yet highly active catalyst. Here, we present physical vapor deposition as a quick and straightforward technique for producing a thin layer of cobalt deposits on copper foam which shows significant performance (95% FE NH3 ) for eNO 3 RR. The superior performance of the Co–Cu foam is proposed to arise from the synergistic impact of Co–Cu on the direct reduction of NO 3 − to NH 3 , coupled with the subsequent reduction of NO 2 − produced on Cu sites.","au":["Sabita Bhandari","Nick Hausen","Xin Wei","Michael Noyong","Regina Palkovits","Ulrich Simon"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"过渡金属溅射铜泡沫上硝酸电化学还原为氨","zb":"采用物理气相沉积技术制备了铜泡沫上钴沉积的薄膜，该薄膜在硝酸电化学还原为氨（eNO3RR）中表现出显著性能（95% FE NH3）。Co-Cu 泡沫的优异性能归因于 Co-Cu 对 NO3- 直接还原为 NH3 的协同影响，以及 Cu 位点上产生的 NO2- 的后续还原。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/magnetochemistry12080081","t":"The Zeta-Minimizer Theorem as a Deductive Variational Foundation for HOR and ORR Kinetics in Proton Exchange Membrane Fuel Cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/magnetochemistry12080081","s":"Magnetochemistry","d":"2026-07-26","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The Zeta-Minimizer Theorem provides a fully deductive variational foundation for the hydrogen oxidation reaction (HOR) and oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) in proton exchange membrane fuel cells. Starting from three primitive thermodynamic axioms and the helical geometry of the phase functional, a multi-extent dynamical system is constructed that simultaneously treats the electrochemical reaction coordinates and the adsorption extents of the participating species at the solid–electrolyte interface. The combined Hessian of the phase functional yields a complete spectrum of relaxation rates whose eigenvalues and eigenvectors emerge directly from the solid blackbox constants Ck and the helical partition functions of the reactive species. Adiabatic elimination of the fast surface modes produces an effective single-extent description in which voltage (or overpotential) appears as the conjugate","au":["Muhamad Fouad"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Zeta-最小化定理作为质子交换膜燃料电池中氢氧化反应和氧还原反应动力学的演绎变分基础","zb":"Zeta-最小化定理为质子交换膜燃料电池中的氢氧化反应（HOR）和氧还原反应（ORR）提供了完整的演绎变分基础。从三个原始热力学公理和相函数的螺旋几何形状出发，构建了一个多范围动力学系统，同时处理电化学反应坐标和固体-电解质界面处参与物种的吸附程度。相函数的联合海森矩阵产生完整的弛豫率谱，其特征值和特征向量直接来自固体黑盒常数 Ck 和反应物种的螺旋配分函数。绝热消除快速表面模式产生有效单范围描述，其中电压（或过电位）作为共轭变量出现，与相应气相氨合成框架中压力的作用完全类似。得到非线性速率定律在所有条件下都是热力学一致的，恢复 Butler-Volmer 和 Tafel 形式作为明确定义的极限情况，并包含温度、稀释和催化剂特定界面常数的影响，而无需经验活化能或可调反应级数。该框架因此将平衡、动力学和模式动力学统一在一个变分结构内，提供了一种参数少、第一性原理的替代方案，以取代经典的经验电","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"wx:__biz=Mzk3NTY3NjU4Mw==&mid=2247499928&idx=2","t":"上海交通大学叶天南JACS 稀土掺杂二维电化物实现高效可控N2活化合成氨","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk3NTY3NjU4Mw%3D%3D&mid=2247499928&idx=2","s":"科研避疯港","d":"2026-07-25","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"传统的哈伯-博世（Haber-Bosch）合成氨工艺需要在高温高压下进行，能耗巨大，且依赖于贵金属催化剂，这与可持续发展的目标相悖。因此，开发在温和条件下高效合成氨的新型催化剂，特别是无过渡金属催化剂，具有重要的科学","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"wx":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzU1MTgwNzIyNA==&mid=2247813131&idx=1","t":"上海交通大学叶天南团队JACS: 二维电子化合物中N₂活化程度调控与合成氨应用","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU1MTgwNzIyNA%3D%3D&mid=2247813131&idx=1","s":"邃瞳科学云","d":"2026-07-25","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"叶天南，上海交通大学变革性分子前沿科学中心课题组组长 （PI），长聘教轨副教授，博士生导师。2015年在上海交通大学获得博士学位，同年进入日本东京工业大学元素战略研究中心任特任助理教授，期间担任日本学术振兴会","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7181494","t":"A Joule-Heating-Driven Superwetting Membrane for One-Step Complex Wastewater Purification","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7181494","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-07-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Complex oily wastewater contains emulsified oil and dissolved organic contaminants, yet conventional membranes mainly separate phases and provide limited removal of soluble pollutants. Here, we report an NCF/PTF catalytic separation membrane that integrates a nitrogen-doped carbon felt electrothermal catalytic layer (NCF) with a superhydrophilic/underwater superoleophobic polyacrylonitrile (PAN)-based separation layer formed by surface segregation. The membrane was evaluated for surface chemistry, wettability, electrothermal response, oil-water separation, dye degradation, and the catalytic mechanism. The NCF/PTF can reject oil and achieve high oil rejection (＞98%) for oil-water mixtures and emulsions (＞96%), whereas the conductive NCF layer generates localized Joule heat under a low-voltage field to activate PMS and degrade dissolved dyes, achieving the dye removal ratio exceeding 99%. ","au":["Jie Wang","Yating Ji","Chengcheng Li","Chengjian Yao","Peibo Du","Zaisheng Cai"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"用于一步复杂废水净化的焦耳加热驱动超润湿膜","zb":"复杂含油废水含有乳化油和溶解有机污染物，但传统膜主要分离相并提供有限的溶解污染物去除。本文报道了一种NCF/PTF催化分离膜，将氮掺杂碳毡电热催化层（NCF）与由表面分凝形成的超亲水/水下超疏油聚丙烯腈（PAN）基分离层集成。该膜评估了表面化学、润湿性、电热响应、油水分离、染料降解和催化机理。NCF/PTF可以拒绝油，并对油水混合物和乳液（＞96%）实现高油拒水率（＞98%），而导电的NCF层在低电压场下产生局部焦耳热，激活PMS并降解溶解染料，染料去除率超过99%。此外，NCF/PTF即使在连续五个循环后，也能在含有油和染料的复杂废水中保持高效率的油拒水率和染料去除率，仅通过过滤，展示了其能够实现复杂含油废水的原位一步净化能力。这项工作为结合界面分离和局部高级氧化提供了一种设计路线，代表了复杂废水处理的未来方向。","ob":"其他催化反应","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c01623","t":"Accurate Online Quantification of Electrocatalytic Ammonia Production Using a Gas-Selective Electrode","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c01623","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-25","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia is a key intermediate for the catalytic production of fertilizers, important industrial feedstocks, and the basis of the ammonia economy as an alternative hydrogen carrier. Therefore, there is much interest in its quantification, especially by online methods. For basic research on electrocatalytic materials for ammonia production, typically low concentrations need to be quantified, and fast measurements are highly desirable for screening and rejecting environmental influences. In this paper, we evaluate a potentiometric method based on a gas-selective electrode (GSE) for online quantification of ammonia in an alkaline electrolyte, which closes a methodical gap in the field as it allows additive-free online measurements with T90 response times shorter than 1 min for NH3 concentrations above 15 µM using a simple setup. Boron-doped nanodiamond (B-ND) is used as a test case ","au":["Giacomo Zuliani","Janina Dowideit","Maciej J. Głowacki","Johannes Ackermann","Anke Krueger","Elias Klemm"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"使用气体选择性电极精确在线量化电催化氨生产","zb":"氨是催化生产化肥、重要工业原料和作为替代氢载体氨经济基础的关键中间体。因此，对其量化，特别是在线方法，有很高兴趣。对于电催化材料氨生产的基礎研究，通常需要量化低浓度，并且为了筛选和排除环境影响，快速测量非常需要。本文评估了一种基于气体选择性电极 (GSE) 的电位测量方法，用于在线量化碱性电解质中的氨，它允许无添加剂的在线测量，对于 15 µM 以上的 NH3 浓度，T90 响应时间小于 1 分钟，使用简单的设置。使用掺杂硼的纳米金刚石 (B-ND) 作为从硝酸盐 (NO3RR) 使用旋转圆盘电极 (RDE) 设置和从一氧化氮 (NORR) 在气体扩散电极 (GDE) 设置中生产氨的测试案例。使用 Nernst 方程可预测校准曲线的参数，并且与测量结果很好地一致，即测量结果是准确的。检测限 (LOD) 和定量限 (LOQ) 确定为 0.57 和 1.36 µM。测试案例的产率速率和法拉第效","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/adma.74253","t":"Selective Electrochemical NO x Reduction to N 2 for Sustainable Ammonia Energy Systems","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.74253","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2026-07-25","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"ABSTRACT Ammonia‐based energy systems offer a pathway toward carbon‐free energy, yet NO x emissions from ammonia combustion hinder the realization of a sustainable closed‐loop. Electrochemical NO x reduction reaction (eNO x RR) provides a promising route to convert NO x to benign N 2 under mild conditions. However, under the low NO x concentrations typical of practical exhaust streams, N 2 selectivity is limited by competing hydrogenation, hydrogen evolution, and inefficient intermediate utilization. Here, we present a mechanistic perspective on selective NO x ‐to‐N 2 conversion, highlighting that eNO x RR proceeds through *NO‐mediated pathways with N 2 O as a key intermediate, while low surface coverage restricts N–N coupling. We propose that integrating tandem catalysis with interfacial microenvironment regulation offers a unified strategy to enhance N 2 selectivity. Finally, we outlin","au":["Zeliang Wu","Yuehua Chen","Zuxin Wen","Xianbiao Fu"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"选择性电化学 NOx 还原为 N2 用于可持续氨能源系统","zb":"氨基能源系统为无碳能源提供了一条途径，但氨燃烧产生的 NOx 排放阻碍了可持续闭环的实现。电化学 NOx 还原反应（eNOxRR）在温和条件下将 NOx 转化为无害的 N2 提供了一种有前景的途径。然而，在低 NOx 浓度下，N2 选择性受竞争的加氢、析氢和中间体利用效率限制。本文提出了选择性 NOx 到 N2 转换的机理视角，强调 eNOxRR 通过 *NO- 介导的途径进行，N2O 是关键中间体，而低表面覆盖限制了 N-N 耦合。本文提出，集成串联催化与界面微环境调控提供了一种统一的策略来提高 N2 选择性。最后，本文概述了在气相和稀释条件下实际应用的关键挑战，提供了高效的电化学脱硝设计原则。该框架有可能实现可扩展的 NOx 去除并支持闭环氨能源系统。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.36348/sijcms.2026.v09i04.004","t":"AI-Guided Single-Atom Electrocatalysts for Carbon-Neutral Chemical Manufacturing: from CO₂ Conversion to Green Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.36348/sijcms.2026.v09i04.004","s":"Scholars International Journal of Chemistry and Material Sciences","d":"2026-07-25","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The transition toward carbon-neutral chemical manufacturing requires catalytic systems that can convert abundant waste molecules into value-added chemicals under mild, renewable-energy-driven conditions. Single-atom electrocatalysts (SAECs), featuring isolated metal centers anchored on tailored supports, offer maximum atom utilization, tunable coordination environments, and well-defined active sites for complex multielectron reactions. This review critically examines the emerging role of artificial intelligence in accelerating the discovery, optimization, and mechanistic understanding of SAECs for carbon dioxide electroreduction and green ammonia synthesis through nitrate conversion. First, fundamental design principles are discussed, including metal–support interactions, coordination engineering, electronic-structure modulation, and stability limitations. Next, machine learning, density","au":["Swaira Anjum","Amir Sohail","Muhammad Ibrahim","Shah Faisal","Noman Hassan","Muhammad Umer Farooq"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"AI 指导的单原子电催化剂用于碳中和化学制造：从 CO₂ 转化到绿色氨合成","zb":"向碳中和化学制造转型需要能够在温和、可再生能源驱动条件下将丰富的废物分子转化为高附加值化学品的催化系统。单原子电催化剂 (SAECs)，其特征是在定制载体上锚定的孤立金属中心，为复杂的多电子反应提供最大原子利用率、可调的配位环境和明确的活性位点。本综述批判性地检查了人工智能在加速单原子电催化剂 (SAECs) 的发现、优化和机理理解方面的作用，用于 CO₂ 电还原和绿色氨合成通过硝酸盐转化。首先，讨论了基本设计原则，包括金属-载体相互作用、配位工程、电子结构调制和稳定性限制。接下来，评估了机器学习、密度泛函理论集成、高通量筛选、可解释描述符和自驱动实验室概念作为合理催化剂开发的工具。特别强调 CO₂ 价值化途径，包括 CO、甲酸盐、烃和醇，以及硝酸盐到氨转化作为可持续氮回收策略。还评估了先进的原位/操作条件表征、性能基准、选择性控制、降解机理。最后，本综述强调了与数据质量、催化剂耐久性、反","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6cc02642g","t":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia: bimetallic-site catalysts, mechanistic insights, and performance optimization","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cc02642g","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2026-07-25","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (eNO3RR) offers a sustainable route for simultaneous green NH3 synthesis and nitrate wastewater remediation. However, the complex eight-electron/proton-coupled process and competing side reactions (e.g., hydrogen evolution and N-N coupling) severely challenge catalyst activity, selectivity, and stability. Bimetallic active-site catalysts address these issues through electronic and geometric synergies, optimizing the adsorption of key intermediates and enabling functional division of labor across multi-step pathways. This review critically examines the design strategies, mechanistic roles, and performance optimization of bimetallic catalysts for eNO3RR. The reaction network, rate-determining step, and key branch points are first outlined. Catalyst classification into precious-metal-based (Pt, Pd, Au) and non-precious-metal-based (Cu, Fe, Co) s","au":["Xiaoyu Wu","Jun Ma","Shuo Geng"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"电催化硝酸盐还原为氨：双金属位点催化剂、机理见解和性能优化","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原为氨 (eNO3RR) 为同时绿色 NH3 合成和硝酸盐废水处理提供可持续路线。然而，复杂的八电子/质子偶联过程和竞争的副反应（例如，析氢和 N-N 耦合）严重挑战催化剂活性、选择性和稳定性。双金属活性位点催化剂通过电子和几何协同作用解决这些问题，优化关键中间体的吸附，并使多步途径的功能分工。本综述批判性地检查了双金属催化剂的设计策略、机理作用和 eNO3RR 性能优化。首先概述了反应网络、速率决定步骤和关键分支点。然后将催化剂分类为贵金属基（Pt、Pd、Au）和非贵金属基（Cu、Fe、Co）系统。核心重点是调节机理和协同机理。通过结合原位光谱技术（DEMS、IR 和 Raman）和密度泛函理论，强调了实验-理论协同作用以揭示反应途径和结构-性能关系。最后，讨论了催化剂稳定性、选择性控制、反应器设计和经济可行性方面的挑战，以及新型双金属架构、多技术耦合和工业规模示范的前景。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141213","t":"Proton–electron synergistic transport in nickel–Iron layered double hydroxide decorated Cu/Cu₂O heterostructure for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141213","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-07-25","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) provides a sustainable approach for ammonia synthesis and environmental remediation; however, the multi-step proton-coupled electron transfer processe poses significant challenges for achieving high efficiency and selectivity. Herein, we engineered a self-supporting NiFe-LDH@Cu/Cu2O (LDH: layered double hydroxides) heterostructure via facile hydrothermal and electrochemical deposition methods. The optimized electrode delivers exceptional NH3 synthesis performance (1.06 ± 0.058 mmol h-1 cm-2 and a Faraday efficiency of 97.6 ± 1.88% at -0.4 V vs. RHE) and an excellent long-term stability. The experimental and theoretical calculation results reveal that NiFe-LDH accelerates water dissociation to yield abundant active hydrogen (*H) species, relieving the *H shortage during the reaction. The Schottky interface of Cu/Cu2O further optimizes int","au":["Shijian Zhang","Xiuxiu Huang","Wenbin Ruan","Xiaotong Mu","Kai Chen","Ge Ge"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"镍-铁层状双氢氧化物装饰的 Cu/Cu₂O 异质结构中质子-电子协同传输用于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐还原反应 (NO3RR) 为氨合成和环境保护提供可持续方法，但多步质子-电子转移过程对实现高效率和选择性构成挑战。本研究通过水热和电化学沉积方法构建了自支撑的 NiFe-LDH@Cu/Cu2O 异质结构。优化电极在 -0.4 V vs. RHE 下提供 1.06 ± 0.058 mmol h-1 cm-2 的 NH3 合成性能和 97.6 ± 1.88% 的法拉第效率。实验和理论计算结果表明，NiFe-LDH 加速水裂解产生丰富的活性氢 (*H) 物种，缓解反应中的 *H 缺乏。Cu/Cu2O 的肖特基界面进一步优化界面电子配置，促进电子传输，增强 NO3- 和反应中间体的吸附。紧密耦合的 NiFe-LDH@Cu/Cu2O 异质界面实现高效的质子-电子协同传递。这种独特效应驱动电子和质子的协同传输，最大化活性氢的利用，加速 NO2- 中间体的深度加氢。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.179963","t":"Balancing active hydrogen species flux via spillover enables efficient dilute-nitrate electroreduction to ammonia in a neutral medium","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.179963","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07-25","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Chenghao Yang","Chang Shen","Yanjun Chen","XJ Xiao","Xia Gao","Wanglai Cen"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"通过溢流平衡活性氢物种通量实现中性介质中稀释硝酸盐电还原制备氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkxNjgwNDMxNQ==&mid=2247491646&idx=1","t":"JACS：用于氨合成的二维电子化物中N2活化的平衡调控","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNjgwNDMxNQ%3D%3D&mid=2247491646&idx=1","s":"催化笔记","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"通讯作者：叶天南副教授，邬家臻副教授，Sang-Won Park通讯单位：上海交通大学，南方科技大学，韩国水原大学https：//doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22746online：2026-07-23","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["氨合成"],"wx":1,"mt":["10.1021/jacs.5c22746online"]},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzkwNzIxMDczMQ==&mid=2247491730&idx=1","t":"叶天南团队JACS: 二维电子化合物中N2活化-氨合成的平衡调控","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwNzIxMDczMQ%3D%3D&mid=2247491730&idx=1","s":"上海交大变革性分子前沿科学中心","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:54Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"近日，上海交通大学变革性分子前沿科学中心叶天南团队以2D电子化合物Y2C为平台，采用双活性位点策略实现了高效稳定的氨合成。相关成果以“Balancing N2 activation in two-dimensional electrides for ammonia synthesis”为题发表于Journal of the American Chemical Society。 氨（NH3）是重要的化工原料与潜在能源载体。由于N≡N三键键能高达945 kJ·mol⁻1，N2活化成为氨合成的重大挑战。负载型过渡金属（TM，如Fe、Ru）催化剂因能降低N2解离能垒而性能优异，合理设计载体（如促进电子向TM转移以削弱N≡N键）可进一步增强该过程。电子化合物因低功函数和高阴离子电子密度作为载体尤为有效，但现有体系中N2的吸附与解离仍高度依赖TM，电子化合物本身直接作为N2活化位点的实例极少。 二维（2D）电子化合物具有层状结构，其离域的阴离子电子形成二维电子气，赋予材料高电子迁移率和超低功函数，有利于N2活化。然而，已报道的无TM碱土金属氮化物电子化合物（Ae2N）在含H2条件下易转化为氢化物，结构不稳定。因此，开发在氨合成条件下结构稳定的2D电子化合物至关重要。 针对此挑战，叶天南团队以2D电子化合物Y2C为平台，采用双活性位点策略实现了高效稳定的氨合成。在该体系中，富电子的Y2C层间区域负责活化N2生成关键中间体(N2)δ−，负载的Ni纳米颗粒则负责解离H2提供活性氢。结合表征与DFT计算，团队揭示了2D电子化合物中N2活化的标度关系：适中的N2结合强度利于生成高活性(N2)δ−中间体，是高效合成NH3的关键。据此，团队通过La掺杂优化Y2C的N2活化能力，所得Ni/La-Y2C催化剂在400 °C和1.0 MPa下氨合成速率达34.6 mmol·g⁻1·h⁻1，超越同条件下的Ni基、Cs-Ru/MgO及工业铁基催化剂。该N2活化调控与双位点协同策略，为设计先进2D电子化合物、实现可控N2活化与可持续氨合成提供了理性框架。 图1 二维电子化合物Y2C的晶体结构、电子结构及N2","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系","wx":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=Mzk1Nzg1NTIzMQ==&mid=2247498895&idx=1","t":"邬家臻/叶天南/Sang-Won Park JACS | 告别贵金属，二维电子化合物的氮活化平衡律让合成氨温和又高效","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk1Nzg1NTIzMQ%3D%3D&mid=2247498895&idx=1","s":"研途创见","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"叶天南 上海交通大学化学化工学院，变革分子前沿科学中心.https：//doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22746ArticleJuly 23， 2026【背景介绍】氨合成是化肥与储能载体核心制备工艺，N≡N三键键能极高，氮气活化是反应最大瓶颈。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"wx":1,"mt":["10.1021/jacs.5c22746articlejuly"]},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzY4MTMxNjE1MA==&mid=2247483874&idx=1","t":"氨合成催化｜最新JACS：上海交大叶天南/南科大吴家振，二维电子化合物平衡N₂活化，34.6 mmol·g⁻¹·h⁻¹创Ni基催化剂新纪录","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzY4MTMxNjE1MA%3D%3D&mid=2247483874&idx=1","s":"催化研究生","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:58Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"（a）不同Ni负载催化剂和纯YC在400 °C、0.1 MPa下合成氨的催化活性；插图展示了YC.和YC的晶体结构；（b）Ni/YC和Ni/YC.在0.1 MPa下合成NH的阿伦尼乌斯图；","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2026.124288","t":"Kinetic modeling of the NO-CO-H2O-H2 reaction for optimal design of NH3 synthesis process utilizing exhaust NO gas over Pt/TiO2 catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.124288","s":"Journal of environmental chemical engineering","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Recently, the NOx to Ammonia (NTA) process has gained attention as a novel technology for innovative NOx abatement and resource recycling at low temperatures. Although there are several methods for providing active hydrogen for NH 3 synthesis, a comprehensive evaluation of reductant utilization strategies incorporated with reaction temperatures is required for the optimal design of the NTA process. In this study, we propose the NO-CO-H 2 O-H 2 reaction process over a Pt/TiO 2 catalyst, utilizing reductants (CO, H 2 O, and H 2 ) derived from hydrocarbon reforming to bridge these gaps. This work provides comprehensive fundamental insights for kinetic analysis through a combined approach of reaction experiments and simulations. The NO-CO-H 2 O-H 2 reaction exhibited high NH 3 yields exceeding 80% at temperatures above 250 ℃ across several H 2 /CO molar ratios. Then, NH 3 synthesis pathways ","au":["Huichan Hwang","Thossaporn Wijakmatee","Teruoki Tago","Yuichi Manaka","Tetsuya Nanba","Hideyuki Matsumoto"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"利用尾气NO合成氨的NO-CO-H2O-H2反应动力学建模","zb":"在Pt/TiO2催化剂上研究利用烃类重整产生的还原剂(CO、H2O、H2)进行NO-CO-H2O-H2反应合成氨。通过实验与模拟结合的方法，提出基于Langmuir-Hinshelwood机理的动力学模型，发现NH2*氢化步骤控制总反应速率。模型预测NH3产率在250℃以上超过80%，数值准确度R2=0.995。","ob":"其他催化反应"},{"id":"10.1126/sciadv.aef1430","t":"Van der Waals template–encoded soft epitaxy of tellurium enabled by atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1126/sciadv.aef1430","s":"Science Advances","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"Van der Waals (vdW) epitaxy can integrate lattice-mismatched crystals with atomically sharp, pristine interfaces. However, translating this concept to atomic layer deposition (ALD), a standard for low-temperature, layer-by-layer growth, remains challenging because precursors adsorb transiently on chemically inert vdW basal planes, leading to physisorption-limited nucleation and poor crystalline ordering. Here, we introduce diffusion-steered epitaxial ALD (Epi-ALD), redefining vdW surfaces as programmable kinetic-thermodynamic landscapes and demonstrate highly crystalline tellurium at 150°C. Epi-ALD couples surface-potential-encoded physisorption with long-range diffusion to promote ordered nucleation and epitaxial alignment. This \"soft\" pathway enables strain-free tellurium epitaxy with a pristine vdW gap (∼1.4 angstrom) despite lattice mismatch (>3.6%) and generalizes across multiple vd","au":["Changhwan Kim","Hyeon Cho","Chuqiao Shi","Mingyu Jang","Wenxuan Zhu","Subin Im"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积实现的范德华模板编码软外延生长的碲","zb":"范德华（vdW）外延可以将晶格失配的晶体与原子级锋利的原始界面集成。然而，将此概念转化为原子层沉积（ALD），ALD是低温、逐层生长的标准，仍然具有挑战性，因为前驱体在化学惰性的vdW基板上暂时吸附，导致物理吸附限制的成核和结晶顺序差。本文引入了扩散引导外延ALD（Epi-ALD），将vdW表面重新定义为可编程的动力学热力学景观，并在150°C下展示了高度结晶的碲。Epi-ALD将表面势编码的物理吸附与长程扩散相结合，以促进有序成核和外延排列。这种“软”途径实现了无应变碲外延，尽管晶格失配（＞3.6%）且具有原始vdW间隙（～1.4埃），并推广到多个vdW模板。保留ALD的标志优势，包括可扩展性和均匀性，我们进一步通过vdW对称工程编程平面取向，以实现准单晶碲薄膜，具有明显的各向异性，并具有手性异常特征。我们的工作建立了一种通用的低热预算方法，用于集成vdW材料，并将外延扩展到ALD范例的","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.167943","t":"Fabrication of thiol/amine-bifunctional Fe3O4 magnetic nanoparticles via plasma-enhanced atomic layer deposition of TiO2 coating and sequential silanization","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.167943","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Developing multifunctional nanomaterials with independently reactive surface groups is promising for advanced catalytic, environmental, and sensing technologies. Here, we present a versatile strategy to engineer bifunctional magnetic nanoparticles integrating both thiol and amine surface chemistries on a single particle. A TiO 2 shell was deposited on Fe 3 O 4 nanoparticles, pre-deposited on a Si wafer, via atomic layer deposition (ALD) to create titania-modified magnetic nanoparticles. Sequential silanization was performed with (3-mercaptopropyl)trimethoxysilane (MPTMS) and (3-aminopropyl)triethoxysilane (APTES) which introduced thiol (–SH) and amino (–NH 2 ) groups, respectively. Surface characterization using X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) confirmed the successful incorporation of both moieties while the nanoparticles maintained high magnetization. Results demonstrate that the","au":["Ayman E. Ahmed Elkholy","Marcus J. Giansiracusa","Colette Boskovic","Peter Kingshott"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过等离子体增强原子层沉积TiO2涂层和顺序硅烷化制备硫醇/胺双功能Fe3O4磁性纳米颗粒","zb":"开发具有独立反应性表面基团的多功能纳米材料对于先进的催化、环境和传感技术具有前景。本文提出了一种多功能策略，在单个颗粒上集成硫醇和胺表面化学。通过原子层沉积（ALD）在Si晶圆上预沉积的Fe3O4纳米颗粒上沉积TiO2壳，以创建二氧化钛改性磁性纳米颗粒。顺序硅烷化使用（3-巯基丙基）三甲氧基硅烷（MPTMS）和（3-氨丙基）三乙氧基硅烷（APTES）进行，分别引入硫醇（–SH）和氨基（–NH2）基团。X射线光电子能谱（XPS）表征证实了两种部分的成功结合，同时纳米颗粒保持了高磁化率。结果表明，ALD辅助的顺序改性能够在不损害磁性的情况下精确控制表面功能。所得材料被用作概念验证双功能磁性平台，用于未来的偶联和应用特定研究，包括生物分子（例如抗体和核酸）的固定化、靶向吸附和多组分催化。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及Fe/铁体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/adma.74224","t":"Electrolyte‐Regulated Self‐Healing Cu/Oxide Interfaces for Stable Electrocatalysis in Strong Acid","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.74224","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"ABSTRACT Metastable metal active sites are inherently difficult to preserve under strongly corrosive electrochemical conditions, because continuous dissolution depletes the catalytically relevant surface population during operation. Here, we show that soluble metal ions can be used as an external chemical reservoir to sustain a dynamic catalytically active state through an electrolyte‐regulated dissolution–redeposition equilibrium. Using acidic nitrate‐to‐ammonia electrosynthesis as a model system, we demonstrate that dissolved Cu 2+ continuously replenishes Cu active sites, thereby mitigating catalyst degradation by maintaining a dynamic steady‐state active‐site population rather than relying on a static catalyst structure. Coupling this concept with acid‐stable WO 3 nanorods organizes the dynamic Cu reservoir into a hierarchically dispersed interfacial active state composed of anchored","au":["Fukang Liu","Rui Yu","S Liu","Aijun Du","Xin Mao","Jian Zhang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"电解质调节的自修复 Cu/氧化物界面用于强酸中的稳定电催化","zb":"亚稳态金属活性位点在强腐蚀性电化学条件下本质上难以保存，因为在操作期间连续溶解会消耗与催化相关的表面人口。这里，我们表明可溶性金属离子可以用作外部化学储层，通过电解质调节的溶解-再沉积平衡来维持动态催化活性状态。使用酸性硝酸盐到氨电合成作为模型系统，我们证明溶解的 Cu 2+ 不断补充 Cu 活性位点，从而通过维持动态稳态活性位点人口而不是依赖静态催化剂结构来减轻催化剂降解。将此概念与耐酸 WO 3 纳米棒结合，将动态 Cu 储层组织成由锚定的单原子和可补充的纳米簇组成的分级分散的界面活性状态，由强的 Cu─O─W 结合稳定。原位光谱、X 射线吸收分析和理论表明，这种适应性 Cu/WO 3 界面加强了硝酸盐捕获，并降低了关键氢化步骤的势垒。由此产生的系统在强酸中提供 90% 以上的 NH 3 法拉第效率，并在 25 cm 2 膜电极组件中持续 1000 小时以上的安培级操作，NH 3 生产","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsomega.6c02579","t":"Nitrogen Fixation by MoSn3 and MoSn5 Clusters","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsomega.6c02579","s":"ACS Omega","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The Haber–Bosch process (HBP) for the conversion of nitrogen into ammonia is arguably one of the most important chemical reactions in human history because it is the basis for the large-scale production of fertilizers and hence of global food production. Nevertheless, the HBP contributes in a decisive manner to the production of CO2 and other global warming gases, since it is an extremely energy-intensive process. Consequently, the development of alternative conditions to reduce its negative environmental impact is of the highest priority. In this study, we investigate the detailed mechanism of nitrogen fixation by molybdenum-doped tin clusters MoSn3 and MoSn5, building upon previous work that demonstrated the potential of these complexes for activating the nitrogen molecule (Inorg. Chim. Acta 2025, 577, 122493). Using a combination of density functional theory and wave function","au":["Jesús Iván Salazar-Barrientos","Thamara V. Salazar-Barrientos","Peter T. Cummings","José Manuel Guevara‐Vela","Tomás Rocha‐Rinza"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"MoSn3 和 MoSn5 簇的氮固定","zb":"研究 MoSn3 和 MoSn5 簇的氮固定详细机理，基于先前工作证明这些配合物激活氮分子的潜力。使用密度泛函理论和波函数分析，探索了上述簇表面上 N2 逐步还原为 NH3 的过程。结果揭示了 Mo 作为哈伯-博施过程的优秀催化中心的角色，以及周围锡原子作为氢吸附支架的性质。确定了六种不同反应路径上的中间体和过渡态，提供了使用 MoSn3 和 MoSn5 作为催化剂的氮固定过程的动力学方面的见解。还证明了 (i) 这些簇形成氢化物的能力模拟了氮酶的生物活性，以及 (ii) 在反应路径的关键步骤中，二氮 N≡N 中的强三键如何依次减弱。总体而言，这项工作加深了我们对通过多相催化的氮固定的理解，并为合理设计 Mo"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.179862","t":"Single atom (Co, Fe, Ni)/MIL-125(SH)2 photocatalyst for ammonia synthesis synergistically mediated by N2 activation and proton generation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.179862","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Qi Chen","Zefeng Yang","Yueling Chen","Jionghua Wu","Jimmy C. Yu","Ling Wu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"单原子 (Co, Fe, Ni)/MIL-125(SH)2 光催化剂用于氨合成，通过 N2 活化和质子生成协同介导","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Fe/铁体系｜光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.179753","t":"Steering active hydrogen in PtCu single atom alloy nanowires for efficient nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.179753","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Wei Zhang","Binwen Zeng","H Huang","Fan Dang","Xin Liu","J K Sun"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"在 PtCu 单原子合金纳米线中引导活性氢以高效将硝酸盐还原为氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.compchemeng.2026.109813","t":"A systematic modeling framework for dynamic simulation of fixed-bed reactors","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compchemeng.2026.109813","s":"Computers & Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"We present a modular and thermodynamically consistent modeling framework that systematically integrates thermodynamics, transport phenomena, reaction kinetics, and numerical discretization and simulation for fixed-bed reactors. Accurate simulation of dynamic reactor behavior is essential for enabling flexible operation in Power-to-X (P2X) applications, such as Power-to-Ammonia and Power-to-Methanol, where fluctuating renewable energy inputs demand robust and responsive process control. The proposed models integrate non-ideal thermodynamics through cubic equations of state and account for both advective and dispersive transport phenomena. We derive consistent mass and energy balances using internal energy as the energy state variable, and obtain temperature and pressure from thermodynamic constraints. The resulting workflow generates the necessary model functions for steady-state and dyna","au":["Marcus Johan Schytt","John Bagterp Jørgensen"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"一个用于固定床反应器动态模拟的系统建模框架","zb":"提出一个模块化和热力学一致的建模框架，系统地集成了热力学、传递现象、反应动力学和数值离散化及模拟，用于固定床反应器。准确的反应器动态模拟对于在 Power-to-X (P2X) 应用（如 Power-to-Ammonia 和 Power-to-Methanol）中实现灵活操作至关重要，其中波动的可再生能源输入需要强大和响应迅速的过程控制。所提出的模型通过立方状态方程整合非理想热力学，并考虑了对流和弥散传递现象。使用内能作为能量状态变量导出一致的质量和能量平衡，并从热力学约束中获得温度和压力。生成的流程生成了稳态和动态模拟以及在不同物理假设下参数敏感性分析的必要模型函数。该流程针对两个基本固定床反应器单元（固定床反应器 FBR 和直接冷却反应器 DCR）的一维伪同质模型进行了演示。在氨合成的背景下，模拟了代表性反应器变体，即绝热固定床反应器 AFBR 和等温直接冷却反应器 IDCR。模拟评估"},{"id":"10.1002/cbic.70429","t":"A Proposed Complete‐Cycle Mechanism for Conversion of N 2 to NH 3 by Mo‐Nitrogenase","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cbic.70429","s":"ChemBioChem","d":"2026-07-24","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"How does the enzyme nitrogenase convert N 2 to NH 3 under ambient conditions? This perspective expounds the Dance chemical mechanism comprising 40 explicit intermediates and 31 reaction steps, from start to finish, to effect the enzyme stoichiometry N 2 + 8H + + 8e − → 2NH 3 + H 2 . Energy profiles and kinetic barriers are derived from density functional simulations with a 483+ atom quantum model. The key to the mechanism is discovery of the unique N 2 capture step, in which N 2 tumbles into a preformed gallery of H atoms, and is activated there by concerted formation of two HN and three FeN bonds, forming bound HNNH. This sets up subsequent hydrogenations that break N–N and form NH 3 in concert. Retention of bridging S2B adjacent to bound intermediates is a crucial stereochemical component. An inconsistency with kinetic data is still to be resolved. The well‐known H 2 /N 2 exchange oc","au":["IAN G. DANCE"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"一个完整的循环机制用于 Mo-氮酶将 N2 转换为 NH3","zb":"研究酶氮酶在环境条件下将 N2 转换为 NH3 的机理。通过密度泛函模拟，阐述了包含 40 个明确中间体和 31 个反应步骤的 Dance 化学机制，实现了酶的化学计量 N2 + 8H+ + 8e− → 2NH3 + H2。关键步骤是独特的 N2 捕获步骤，其中 N2 在预形成的 H 原子画廊中翻滚，并通过协同形成两个 HN 和三个 FeN 键在那里被活化，形成结合的 HNNH。这为后续的氢化步骤奠定了基础，这些步骤协同断裂 N-N 并形成 NH3。保留相邻于结合中间体的桥接 S2B 是一个关键的立体化学成分。仍需解决与动力学数据的不一致问题。众所周知的 H2/N2 交换发生是因为 H2 在其解离时创造了 N2 捕获所需的空間。考虑了 H 原子的可能量子隧穿。讨论了反应空间和周围蛋白质的架构和功能。该机制的一个使能属性是每个化学步骤中都有有利的手性和几何形状。","ob":"生物固氮（非气相热催化）；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.5c22746","t":"Balancing N2 Activation in Two-Dimensional Electrides for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c22746","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-07-23","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":40,"ab":"Two-dimensional (2D) electrides, featuring interlayer-delocalized anionic electrons, hold promise for N2 activation but face challenges in catalytic ammonia synthesis due to structural instability under reaction conditions. Here, we introduce a dual-site catalyst using the robust 2D metal carbide Y2C electride as a platform, where N2 is activated at electron-rich interlayers and H2 dissociates on supported Ni nanoparticles, enabling efficient and stable ammonia production. Through Raman spectroscopy, XPS, and DFT calculations, we uncover a scaling relationship for N2 activation in 2D electrides: intermediate N2 binding strength correlates with the formation of reactive (N2)δ- intermediates, crucial for efficient NH3 production. Leveraging this insight, La-doped Y2C (La-Y2C) optimizes N2 activation, and the Ni/La-Y2C catalyst achieves an exceptional activity of 34.6 mmol·g-1·h-1 at 400 °C","au":["Ruoqian Jiang","Seungmin Yu","Fangkun Sun","Miao Xu","Xiaojun Lu","Zichuang Li"],"o":"旧站本地库","w":["Tian-Nan Ye"],"why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"二维电子体中N2活化的平衡研究","zb":"利用稳定的二维金属碳化物Y2C电子体作为平台构建双位点催化剂，N2在富电子层间活化，H2在负载Ni纳米颗粒上解离。通过Raman光谱、XPS和DFT计算揭示N2活化标度关系，La掺杂优化了N2活化。Ni/La-Y2C催化剂在400℃和1.0 MPa下活性达34.6 mmol·g-1·h-1，超越工业基准铁基催化剂。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系","top":1,"rb":["顶刊动态","催化开天地","微算云平台"]},{"id":"10.25500/edata.bham.00001677","t":"Dataset supporting research manuscript \"Observing nitrogen activation and transfer in lithium hydride transition metal composite catalysts for ammonia synthesis\"","u":"https://doi.org/10.25500/edata.bham.00001677","s":"University of Birmingham Research Portal (University of Birmingham)","d":"2026-07-23","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"A mixture of XRD, Raman, TGA data and associated metadata to support the figures and analysis presented in the referenced manuscript","au":["Joshua W. Makepeace","Ezri McGarrigle","Fatima Abi Ghaida"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"支持论文“观察锂氢化物过渡金属复合催化剂中氮活化与转移”的数据集","bt":1},{"id":"10.1134/s0040579526600920","t":"Study of the Possibility of Using Gas with Various Nitrogen Contents for Ammonia Production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1134/s0040579526600920","s":"Theoretical Foundations of Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-07-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Abstract— The article examines the possibility of producing ammonia from natural gases ballasted with inert components using the example of a nitrogen–methane mixture with a nitrogen content from 0 to 43 vol %. The processes of vapor and autothermal conversion, the stages of preparation of the nitrogen–hydrogen mixture, and the process of ammonia synthesis based on thermodynamic data are considered.","au":["M. Kh. Sosna","D. A. Kovaleva","D. V. Maksimova","A. M. Kozlov"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"使用不同氮含量的气体进行氨合成生产的研究","zb":"文章考察了利用含惰性组分的天然气生产氨气的可能性，以氮含量 0–43 vol % 的氮-甲烷混合物为例，分析了蒸汽和自热转化过程及氨合成过程。"},{"id":"10.1038/s41929-026-01570-3","t":"The interphase behind lithium-mediated ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41929-026-01570-3","s":"Nature Catalysis","d":"2026-07-23","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"","au":["David Kumar Yesudoss","Abdoulaye Djire"],"o":"回填","why":["lithium-mediated ammonia"],"zt":"锂介导的氨背后的界面","bt":1,"top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c02680","t":"Interfacial Cooperation-Driven Shifts of Volcano Relationships in Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c02680","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia decomposition is governed by an intrinsic trade-off between NH3 dehydrogenation and N–N coupling, giving rise to the well-known volcano relationship that has long positioned ruthenium (Ru) near the activity maximum. However, how metal–oxide interfacial cooperation influences this conventional volcano relationship remains poorly understood. Here we show that metal–oxide interfacial cooperation qualitatively alters the reaction pathway of ammonia decomposition. Using reaction-aware machine learning simulations, we find that on MgO(111)-supported metal nanoparticles, NH3 dehydrogenation, one of the most kinetically demanding steps, occurs predominantly at the metal–oxide interface with substantially reduced activation barriers, while N–N coupling remains governed by the metal surface. This spatial separation of reaction bottlenecks relaxes the classical single-site trade-of","au":["Jungwoo Choi","Sungwoo Kang","Byung Chul Yeo","Donghun Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"界面协同驱动的氨分解火山关系转变","zb":"研究对象为氨分解，采用反应感知机器学习模拟，发现 MgO(111) 载金属纳米颗粒上，氨脱氢和 N-N 耦合分别发生在金属-氧化物界面和金属表面，降低了氨脱氢的活化能，使活性火山关系向弱氮结合金属转移，Ni/MgO(111) 预测活性接近最优，Cu 也表现出强性能，可能超过 Ru。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","top":1},{"id":"10.1007/s11426-026-3722-x","t":"High-loading asymmetric transition metal single-atom catalysts for electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11426-026-3722-x","s":"Science China Chemistry","d":"2026-07-23","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jiahe Peng","Dingsheng S. Wang","Jizhou Jiang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"高负载非对称过渡金属单原子催化剂用于电催化氨合成","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.3390/catal16080667","t":"Research Progress on Photocatalytic Reduction of CO2 by Modified Layered Double Hydroxides","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/catal16080667","s":"Catalysts","d":"2026-07-23","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The use of solar energy and semiconductor photocatalysts to reduce carbon dioxide (CO2) into high-value fuels and chemicals is a promising approach to alleviate the current energy crisis and climate change. Layered double hydroxides (LDHs) are a special two-dimensional anionic clay material with a brucite-like structure. They have excellent properties such as adjustable layer cation types, interlayer anion types, and layer ratio. LDHs have been widely used in catalytic fields such as carbon dioxide reduction, water splitting, and ammonia synthesis, and are considered safe and green new photocatalysts. In recent years, researchers have conducted in-depth studies on the photocatalytic CO2 reduction performance of hydrotalcite-like materials and have made certain progress. However, the low carrier mobility and low light utilization efficiency of pure LDHs greatly limit their catalytic react","au":["Xiao-Jie Zhao","Xin Xie","Yuxuan Li","X J Li","Xiujuan Yu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"改性层状双氢氧化物用于光催化 CO2 还原的研究进展","zb":"层状双氢氧化物 (LDHs) 是一种特殊二维阴离子粘土材料，具有可调节的层间阳离子类型、阴离子类型和层比，在 CO2 还原、水分解和氨合成等领域有广泛应用。但纯 LDHs 的载流子迁移率和光利用效率低，限制了其催化性能。研究探索通过调节 LDHs 结构的方法，如改变层组成、引入空位或构建异质结，以提高产物转化效率和光利用率。","ob":"光驱动"},{"id":"10.1007/s11104-026-08876-y","t":"Modulating nitrogenase activity of encapsulated diazotrophs through oxygen-regulated microenvironments and carbon availability in alginate hydrogel beads","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11104-026-08876-y","s":"Plant and Soil","d":"2026-07-23","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Aims Biological nitrogen fixation (BNF) by free-living diazotrophs has the potential to supplement nitrogen inputs in agricultural soils, but nitrogenase activity is highly sensitive to oxygen and environmental fluctuations. This study evaluated whether alginate hydrogel beads can function as soil-applied microenvironments that regulate oxygen diffusion and support sustained nitrogenase activity of free-living diazotrophic bacteria. Methods Hydrogel beads were prepared by crosslinking sodium alginate with divalent and trivalent cations (Ca 2 ⁺, Sr 2 ⁺, Zn 2 ⁺, Ni 2 ⁺, Cu 2 ⁺, and Al 3 ⁺) to modify matrix structure and diffusion properties. The diazotrophs Azospirillum brasilense Sp7 and Herbaspirillum seropedicae Z152 were encapsulated within the beads. Oxygen concentrations, encapsulation efficiency, bacterial viability, and biodegradability in soil were evaluated. Nitrogenase ","au":["Prashant Dahal","Senthil Subramanian","Srinivas Janaswamy"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"通过氧调节微环境和碳可用性调节藻酸盐水凝胶珠中包埋固氮菌的固氮活性","zb":"该研究评估了藻酸盐水凝胶珠是否可以作为土壤应用的微环境，调节氧气扩散并支持游离固氮菌的持续固氮活性。通过用二价和三价阳离子（Ca 2 ⁺, Sr 2 ⁺, Zn 2 ⁺, Ni 2 ⁺, Cu 2 ⁺, 和 Al 3 ⁺）交联海藻酸钠制备水凝胶珠，以修改基质结构和扩散特性。将固氮菌Azospirillum brasilense Sp7和Herbaspirillum seropedicae Z152包埋在珠内。评估了氧浓度、包埋效率、细菌活性和土壤中的生物降解性。使用乙炔还原测定法量化固氮活性，并检查了将简单碳源加入珠内的影响。结果表明，所有藻酸盐基质都产生了氧还原微环境，本体当量溶解氧浓度范围为59.9 ± 16.4至215.0 ± 42.8 nmol L⁻ 1。Ca 2 ⁺-和Sr 2 ⁺-藻酸盐珠显示出最高的包埋效率和最大的细菌活性。Ca 2 ⁺-藻酸盐珠中的固氮活性达到1.76 ± ","ob":"生物固氮（非气相热催化）"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.langmuir.6c02347","t":"Structure-Inhibition Relationship of Vapor-Deposited Alkylsilane Monolayers in Area-Selective Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.langmuir.6c02347","s":"Langmuir","d":"2026-07-22","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Area-selective atomic layer deposition (AS-ALD) relies critically on molecular-scale inhibition layers to suppress precursor adsorption in nongrowth regions. Although octadecyltrichlorosilane (ODTS) self-assembled monolayers (SAMs) are widely used, their structural parameters─particularly molecular orientation and grafted molecular areal density─have rarely been systematically correlated with inhibition performance. Moreover, conventional solution-phase deposition introduces contamination risks and extended processing times, limiting practical adoption. Here, we demonstrate a rapid vapor-phase deposition route that forms ODTS blocking layers with improved molecular alignment on SiO2 within 3 min. Angle-dependent near-edge X-ray absorption fine structure (NEXAFS) spectroscopy reveals a reduced molecular tilt angle of ∼29.8 ± 0.3° for vapor-deposited ODTS compared to ∼38.7 ± 0.6° for solut","au":["Eunji Sim","Jungsub Lee","Somang Koo","Hongdeok Kim","Suk Gyu Hahm","Mi Kyung Kwon"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"蒸汽沉积烷基硅烷单层的结构-抑制关系在区域选择性原子层沉积中","zb":"区域选择性原子层沉积（AS-ALD）严重依赖于分子级抑制层来抑制前驱体在非生长区域的吸附。尽管十八烷基三氯硅烷（ODTS）自组装单层（SAMs）被广泛使用，但它们的结构参数——特别是分子取向和接枝分子面积密度——很少系统地与抑制性能相关联。此外，传统的溶液相沉积引入了污染风险和延长处理时间，限制了实际应用。本文展示了一种快速蒸汽相沉积路线，在3分钟内在SiO2上形成具有改进分子排列的ODTS阻挡层。角依赖的近边X射线吸收精细结构（NEXAFS）光谱揭示，蒸汽沉积ODTS的分子倾斜角为∼29.8 ± 0.3°，而溶液沉积薄膜为∼38.7 ± 0.6°，表明更直的平均分子取向和更低的取向无序度。分子动力学模拟建立了倾斜角与接枝分子面积密度之间的负相关关系，估计蒸汽沉积层的密度为∼2分子/nm2。当用作ALD抑制剂时，蒸汽沉积的ODTS层与本研究制备的溶液沉积ODTS层相比，对HfO2和Ru A","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c02968","t":"Alkali Hydride-Iron Oxide-Nanocomposites as Catalysts for Low-Temperature Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c02968","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-22","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Fertilizers derived from ammonia (NH3) play a vital role in global food production, and ammonia is also emerging as a carbon-free fuel or hydrogen carrier. To facilitate the use of ammonia as an energy carrier, there is a need to develop catalysts that enable ammonia production under milder conditions than the current Haber–Bosch process. Industrially, high temperatures and pressures (>450 °C, >100 bar) are required, partly due to the need to operate at conditions where the iron oxide (Fe2O3) catalysts are reduced to the active Fe phase. Herein, we show that intimate contact between Fe2O3 nanoclusters and alkali metal hydrides (LiH, NaH, and KH), arising from their co-confinement in nanoporous carbon, leads to high ammonia production under mild conditions (∼250 °C and 10 bar), without prior reduction of the Fe2O3. The alkali metal hydrides show profound differences in catalytic ","au":["Juliette C. Verschoor","Fabian J. Mohammad","Masoud Lazemi","Shusaku Hayama","Nitya Ramanan","Frank M. F. de Groot"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"碱金属氢化物-氧化铁纳米复合材料作为低温氨合成催化剂","zb":"为使氨作为能源载体得到应用，开发能在比当前哈伯-博施过程更温和条件下生产氨的催化剂至关重要。工业上需要高温高压 (>450 °C, >100 bar)，部分原因是需要使氧化铁 (Fe2O3) 催化剂还原为活性 Fe 相。研究发现，在纳米多孔碳中共同限域的 Fe2O3 纳米团簇和碱金属氢化物 (LiH, NaH, KH) 之间紧密接触，可在温和条件下 (∼250 °C 和 10 bar) 高效生产氨，无需预先还原 Fe2O3。碱金属氢化物因与 Fe2O3 纳米颗粒的相互作用/反应性及 N2 活化不同，表现出显著不同的催化活性。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","top":1},{"id":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-10361076/v1","t":"Examination of Transition Metal-doped Perovskite’s Ammonia Sensing Performance for Chemi-resistive Sensor Application","u":"https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-10361076/v1","s":"Research Square","d":"2026-07-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract The aim of this study carried out is to enhance the sensing performance of the pure material through a doping strategy. Ammonia is one of the toxic gases present in the atmosphere, released mostly from industries and agricultural pesticides, which leads to serious health issues when inhaled. A semiconducting metal oxide sensor based on a chemi-resistive mechanism is a well-known candidate in the field of sensing and detecting vapours. BaSnO 3 , an established oxide perovskite material because of its versatility and flexible properties. Undoped and nickel-doped BaSnO 3 (BaSn 1-x Ni x O 3 , x = 0.1, 0.3M) samples were prepared via solid-state reaction. The synthesized powder sample was then coated onto a glass substrate through the spin-coating technique. The XRD pattern confirms the cubic perovskite structure. FESEM micrographs reveal the porous nature and smaller particle size w","au":["Thamizhini Subramanian","B. Reyoun Frances","Vishista Kurapati"],"o":"回填","zt":"对过渡金属掺杂钙钛矿的氨气传感性能的考察用于化学电阻式传感器应用","zb":"研究对象为BaSnO3和镍掺杂BaSnO3（BaSn1-xNixO3, x=0.1, 0.3M）粉末样品，通过固态反应制备并涂覆在玻璃基板上。XRD证实了立方钙钛矿结构，FESEM显示多孔性和小粒径，BET分析发现高比表面积。在300°C下，低摩尔浓度的镍掺杂样品对氨气表现出高响应电压、高灵敏度、良好选择性和优异的重复性与稳定性。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/chem.71448","t":"Photothermal Catalysis: Material Construction, Performance Enhancement, and Application Progress","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/chem.71448","s":"Chemistry - A European Journal","d":"2026-07-22","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Photothermal catalysis is an innovative technology that integrates photocatalysis and thermochemistry to realize efficient fullspectrum solar energy utilization. It overcomes the drawbacks of conventional photocatalysis such as narrow spectral response and rapid carrier recombination, as well as high energy consumption and poor selectivity in thermocatalysis. With improved energy conversion efficiency and reduced activation energy, it has become a hot research topic in catalysis. This review elaborates three core photothermal mechanisms and classifies catalytic systems by dominant reaction pathways. It focuses on structural design, performance regulation and structure–activity relationships of typical catalysts, and summarizes applications in CO 2 reduction, methane reforming, water splitting, and ammonia synthesis. Current research challenges are also analyzed. This work establ","au":["Dengmeng Song","Li Xia","Dan Xue","Luyao Qiang","Boli Hou","Jun Li"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"光热催化：材料构建、性能提升和应用进展","zb":"光热催化结合光催化和热化学，实现全光谱太阳能利用，克服传统光催化的光谱响应窄和载流子快速复合等缺点，以及热催化的高能耗和选择性差等问题。通过提高能量转换效率和降低活化能，已成为催化领域的研究热点。综述阐述了三种核心光热机制，按主导反应路径分类催化体系，关注典型催化剂的结构设计、性能调控和构效关系，总结在 CO2 还原、甲烷重整、水分解和氨合成等领域的应用，并分析当前研究挑战。","ob":"光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c11181","t":"Atmospheric Pressure Ammonia Synthesis via CO2-Coupled Hydrogenation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c11181","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"The Haber-Bosch ammonia synthesis is a cornerstone of global agriculture and the chemical industry, yet it is fundamentally constrained by intrinsic scaling relations, necessitating energy-intensive conditions associated with a significant carbon footprint. Herein, we report a surface redox-mediated chemical looping strategy that utilizes the CO2 hydrogenation reaction as a chemical trigger to drive ammonia synthesis at atmospheric pressure over a cobalt-molybdenum bimetallic nitride (Co3Mo3N) nitrogen carrier. Mechanistic investigations reveal that CO2 induces a dynamic surface oxidation that weakens the intrinsic Mo-N bonds and facilitates the hydrogenation and release of lattice nitrogen as NH3. The cycle is closed by a subsequent nitridation step that removes surface oxygen and regenerates the nitride lattice. This redox-mediated mechanism enables an unprecedented NH3 peak concentrat","au":["Kai Ming Feng","Shuairen Qian","Xiaozhi Liu","Yi Shen","Zhengwen Li","Yuxin Chen"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"CO2耦合加氢常压合成氨","zb":"利用钴钼双金属氮化物作为氮载体，通过表面氧化还原介导的化学循环策略，在常压下实现CO2耦合加氢合成氨。CO2诱导表面动态氧化削弱Mo-N键，促进晶格氮氢化释放为NH3。该策略在500℃下实现NH3峰值浓度约2.3%和释放速率12.4 mmol·gcat-1·h-1，突破了传统低压合成氨的热力学限制。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","top":1},{"id":"10.24425/cpe.2026.158127","t":"Conversion of hydrogen to ammonia as a method of increasing energy density – a simulation study","u":"https://doi.org/10.24425/cpe.2026.158127","s":"Chemical and Process Engineering New Frontiers","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":25,"ab":"In light of the current efforts of harnessing hydrogen as a potential carbon free energy source alternative to fossil fuels, ammonia has emerged as one of the possible candidates for an effective hydrogen storage method, due to its significantly simplified storage conditions. In this work, the Haber-Bosch process for ammonia synthesis was studied for three scales of production, in the aspect of energy efficient reactor design and optimal operational conditions, with the use of a process simulator, allowing for the manipulation of desired plant parameters in a wide range of values. Moreover, the energy balance of the process has been included in the research process allowing for the visualization of energetic cost of increasing the energy density of the system. The obtained data provides a basis for analysing the Haber-Bosch process in the context of ammonia conversion for hydrogen storag","au":["Michalina Miller","Karol P. Nowacki","Maciej Kopiński","Michał Zmyślony","Alicja Wasilewska","Piotr Tomasz Mitkowski"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"利用氢气制氨以提升能量密度的模拟研究","zb":"利用过程模拟器研究了三种生产规模的哈伯-博施法，通过调节工艺参数分析了反应器设计及最佳操作条件，并计算了增加系统能量密度的能量平衡，为氨转化储氢提供了数据基础。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta04183c","t":"Mesoporous intermetallics enabled by rapid Joule heating: synthesis insights and electrocatalytic behaviours of meso -Pt 3 Sn","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta04183c","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Rapid Joule heating achieves fast synthesis of the mesoporous Pt 3 Sn intermetallic compound, which delivers an overpotential of 9 mV at 10 mA cm −2 and exhibits fair stability, advancing efficient alkaline hydrogen evolution reaction.","au":["Ke-Xin Song","Shi-Yu Zhu","Ling-Rui Wang","Tian-Yu Xia","Meng Li","Hai-Zhong Guo"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"快速焦耳热制备的介孔金属间化合物：介孔Pt3Sn的合成见解和电催化行为","zb":"快速焦耳热实现了介孔Pt3Sn金属间化合物的快速合成，其在10 mA cm−2时过电位为9 mV，表现出良好的稳定性，推进了高效的碱性析氢反应。","ob":"析氢反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acssusresmgt.6c00133","t":"Rapid Graphitization of Biomass Using Intensive Joule Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssusresmgt.6c00133","s":"ACS Sustainable Resource Management","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Graphite plays an essential role in energy storage and electrochemical applications; however, the reliance on mining and petroleum-derived precursors in conventional graphite manufacturing presents environmental and economic challenges. Biomass offers a renewable and widely available alternative feedstock for synthetic graphite production. In this study, we explore the graphitization of cellulose as a model biomass precursor, focusing on how graphitization heating conditions influence microstructural evolution and electrochemical behavior. Using rapid Joule heating and conventional thermal treatments, we characterize the resulting biocarbon materials with respect to their crystallinity, grain size, and morphology. Electrochemical testing reveals that heating rate and duration significantly impact capacity retention and rate performance, with faster heating producing smaller grai","au":["Lin Lin","Hyeongjun Koh","Shamala Gowri Krishnan","Ronan Pelé","Laurie Vion-Broussailles","Ange Nzihou"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"生物质快速焦化利用强焦耳热","zb":"石墨在储能和电化学应用中起着重要作用；然而，传统石墨制造中对采矿和石油衍生前体的依赖带来了环境和经济挑战。生物质为合成石墨生产提供了一种可再生且广泛可用的替代原料。本研究探索了纤维素作为模型生物质前驱体的焦化过程，重点关注焦化加热条件如何影响微观结构演化和电化学行为。使用快速焦耳热和传统热处理，我们表征了所得生物碳材料在结晶度、晶粒大小和形貌方面的特性。电化学测试表明，加热速率和持续时间显著影响容量保持和倍率性能，快速加热产生较小的晶粒尺寸并提高高倍率能力。这些发现表明了处理条件与电化学性能之间的直接联系，突出了生物质来源的石墨作为分布式石墨生产的可行途径。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.6c02261","t":"Geometry-Induced Light Trapping in Hollow ZnO Nanostructures for Enhanced Photocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.6c02261","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Abstract ZnO nanostructures with nanoscale confined geometries were fabricated within anodic aluminum oxide (AAO) nanochannels on transparent substrates via atomic layer deposition (ALD). By tuning the ALD cycle number, conformal ZnO layers with thicknesses of 20 and 40 nm were deposited within 70 nm AAO nanopores, resulting in partially open and fully filled nanochannel architectures, respectively. SEM, TEM, and XPS analyses collectively indicated conformal ZnO growth within the AAO nanochannels and demonstrated the structural control achievable through ALD deposition. UV–vis spectroscopy revealed reduced UV transmittance in AAO-assisted structures, suggesting enhanced optical confinement compared to planar ZnO films. Photocatalytic degradation of Methylene Blue test demonstrated improved activity for the ZnO/AAO nanochannel structure, with the ZA-20 sample exhibiting the highest perfor","au":["Fu-Gi Zhong","Vivekanandan Alangadu Kothandan","Yang-Yu Jhang","Yu-Hsin Chiu","Yu-Hsuan Yu","Shih-Hsun Chen"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"空心ZnO纳米结构的几何诱导光捕获增强光催化","zb":"在透明基板上通过原子层沉积（ALD）在阳极铝氧化物（AAO）纳米通道中制备了具有纳米级限域几何形状的ZnO纳米结构。通过调节ALD周期数，在70 nm AAO纳米孔中沉积了厚度为20和40 nm的ZnO层，分别形成了部分开放和完全填充的纳米通道结构。SEM、TEM和XPS分析共同表明了AAO纳米通道内ZnO的均匀生长，并展示了通过ALD沉积可实现的构型控制。紫外-可见光谱显示，与平面ZnO薄膜相比，AAO辅助结构的紫外透射率降低，表明了增强的光学约束。光催化降解亚甲基蓝测试表明，ZnO/AAO纳米通道结构表现出更高的活性，ZA-20样品表现出最佳性能。在相同紫外照射条件下，ZA-20的准一级反应速率常数约为平面ZnO的1.74倍。这些结果表明，纳米通道几何形状、光学响应和光催化性能之间存在相关性，突出了AAO辅助ZnO纳米结构在透明光催化涂层应用中的潜力。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-75880-2","t":"Ammonia at the net-zero crossroads","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-75880-2","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Ammonia is indispensable for food production and an emerging carbon-free energy vector, yet its synthesis via the fossil-fuelled Haber-Bosch process makes it a major source of carbon dioxide. We introduce the Ammonia Rainbow, a classification framework combining physics-based modelling, learning-curve analysis, and life-cycle sustainability assessment to evaluate net-zero transitions across eight ammonia production technologies. Here we show that, assuming global ammonia demand doubles to meet projected food and energy needs, net-zero ammonia is not achievable by 2050 under any current policy or technological scenario. Even optimistic deployment of green routes demands extensive infrastructure, consuming over 40 percent of available green hydrogen alongside large fractions of carbon capture and renewable energy capacity. Electrochemical routes offer long-term promise but are unlikely to ","au":["Thorin Daniel","Qiong Cai","Lei Xing","Huizhi Wang","X X Xu","Lirong Liu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"氨在净零交叉点","zb":"氨对食品生产和新兴碳自由能源载体至关重要，但其通过化石燃料哈伯-博施过程合成是二氧化碳的主要来源。引入氨彩虹分类框架，结合物理模型、学习曲线分析和生命周期可持续性评估，评估八种氨生产技术的净零转型。假设全球氨需求翻倍以满足食品和能源需求，在当前政策或技术情景下，2050年无法实现净零氨。乐观部署绿色路线需大量基础设施，消耗超过40%的绿氢和大量碳捕获与可再生能源。电化学路线长期有前景，但若无颠覆性创新，商业可行性可能要到2070年。","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-75665-7","t":"Dynamic catalytic interface driven three-step synergistic mechanism for boosting ammonia and hydroxylamine synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-75665-7","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Despite the short-term industrial landscape remaining unchanged, green synthesis technologies for ammonia (NH3) and hydroxylamine (NH2OH) are critical for carbon neutrality. Alternatively, electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NIRR) can be integrated with membrane separation technology via a modular design, simultaneously achieving pollution control and resource recovery. However, the microscopic mechanism of NIRR remains ambiguous given the complex dynamic catalytic interface, hindering advanced catalyst development. Here, we propose a three-step synergistic mechanism at dynamic catalytic interface, which integrates interfacial microenvironment regulation, OH species cycle, and reverse hydrogen spillover for efficient NH3 and NH2OH synthesis across different scenarios. Notably, dual-site heterostructure catalyst exhibits almost 100% NH3-Faradaic Efficiency (FENH3) across a wide nitrate co","au":["Yuxiang Li","Junliang Xie","Tingyi Weng","Zhenjie Lu","Xing Yan","Ying Liu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"动态催化界面驱动的三步协同机制用于提升氨和羟胺合成","zb":"提出动态催化界面上的三步协同机制，整合界面微环境调节、OH物种循环和逆氢溢流，实现不同场景下高效的NH3和NH2OH合成。双位点异质结构催化剂在宽硝酸浓度范围内几乎100%的NH3法拉第效率，最大产率为10.27 mmol h−1 cm−2。系统维持120小时几乎100%的NH3法拉第效率和回收效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3390/catal16070658","t":"Electrocatalytic Performance of MOF-Derived Cu-Co Bimetallic Electrode for Nitrate Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/catal16070658","s":"Catalysts","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The massive anthropogenic discharge of nitrate into aquatic environments disrupts the nitrogen cycle, posing threats to both ecosystems and human health. Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (ENRA) enables both nitrate removal and the production of high value-added NH3. Developing highly efficient and stable electrode materials, along with overcoming the rate-limiting step of nitrite accumulation, is crucial for enhancing the catalytic reduction of nitrate. In this study, by employing Cu as the core metal, a MOF-derived Cu-Co bimetallic catalytic electrode was fabricated as the cathode for converting nitrate to ammonia, while simultaneously resolving the issue of nitrite accumulation. The preparation parameters of the catalytic electrode were optimized, and the effects of current, initial pH, metal loading sequence, and other factors on ENRA performance were investigated. Experi","au":["Feng Shi","Honglin Xu","Dungang Gu","Yi-Xiang Wang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"MOF 衍生的 Cu-Co 双金属电极用于硝酸盐还原的电催化性能","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐还原为氨（ENRA），关键方法为制备 MOF 衍生的 Cu-Co 双金属催化电极，主要结果为该电极在 20 mA cm−2 电流密度下 150 分钟内 NO3− 去除和 NH4+ 生成效率分别为 94.26% 和 90.58%，显著抑制了 NO2− 积累。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.21203/rs.3.rs-9940166/v1","t":"Ultrafast Hydride Transfer Pathway in Dinitrogen Fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-9940166/v1","s":"Research Square","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Catalytic dinitrogen (N 2 ) fixation commonly proceeds through metal nitride intermediates, yet their subsequent hydrogenation is often thermodynamically challenging, because the first hydrogenation step converts a stable metal nitride into a high-energy parent metal imide, where formation of a weak N-H bond provides little thermodynamic compensation. Here we report a distinct photochemical pathway for molybdenum nitride activation that enables direct nitride-to-amide conversion by hydride transfer for ammonia synthesis. Mechanistic studies show that visible-light excitation of 4DPAIPN generates an isolable dihydroacridine derivative, PAC-AcrH 2 , whose structure was established by single-crystal X-ray diffraction. Isolated PAC-AcrH 2 functions as a photohydride donor when pre-associated with protonated molybdenum nitride complex. Visible-light excitation promotes nitride hydrogenation t","au":["Ke Hu","Zh. Zhao","Yun‐Shu Cui","Li Gj","Dan‐Dan Zhai","Limei Tian"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"氮气固定中氢转移的快速途径","zb":"研究对象为氮气固定，关键方法为光化学研究钼氮化物活化，主要结果为发现可见光激发下直接从氮化物转化为酰胺的氢转移途径。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动","pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta02327d","t":"Efficient ammonia decomposition for hydrogen production using a highly active CoNi-based catalyst by exsolution of Sr-promoted perovskite","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta02327d","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Utilizing renewable energy is essential for reducing carbon emissions.","au":["Kewei Ma","Mengyao Zhao","Yue Yu","Xinyi Liang","Qi Xia","Zihan Lin"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"利用 Sr 助剂的钙钛矿析出制备高效 CoNi 基催化剂进行氨分解制氢","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6nj02136k","t":"Synergistic Zn–Co dual-site catalyst for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6nj02136k","s":"New Journal of Chemistry","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO3RR) can provide a promising solution to replace energy- and source-intensive industrial synthesis method for ammonia production. In this study, a bimetallic metal-organic framework (ZnCo-MOF) was...","au":["Yimin Zhu","Xia Jiang","Xiangyu Sun","Yixiao Yang","Ziqiang Wang","Guan Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"协同 Zn–Co 双位点催化剂用于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐还原（NO3RR），关键方法为制备双金属金属有机框架（ZnCo-MOF），主要结果为该催化剂用于氨生产。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c07254","t":"Synergistic Active Sites in a Defect-Engineered FeMoO4/CeS2 Diphase for Highly Efficient Ambient Electrocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c07254","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The development of efficient electrocatalysts for the ambient nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) remains challenging due to sluggish N2 activation and the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Here, we report a defect-engineered FeMoO4/CeS2 diphase grown directly on nickel foam (NF) for efficient electrochemical ammonia synthesis under ambient conditions. Systematic tuning of the Fe/Mo/Ce molar ratio establishes a clear composition-activity relationship, with the optimized FeMoCe (2:4:1) (2-FeMoCe) catalyst delivering an NH3 yield rate of 5124 μg cm-2 h-1 (1139 μg mgcat-1 h-1) and a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 46% at -0.70 V vs RHE in neutral 0.5 M Na2SO4. In a membrane-separated single stack-cell configuration, the catalyst maintains strong performance, achieving 2451 μg cm-2 h-1 (613 μg mgcat-1 h-1) with an FE of 35.01%, highlighting its practical relevance. Comprehensive structu","au":["Nafikot Berhanu Bonka","Abambagade Abera Mitiku","Tsegaye Girma Eshetu","Meselu Eskezia Ayalew","Quoc‐Nam Ha","Dong–Hau Kuo"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"缺陷工程化的FeMoO4/CeS2双相中的协同活性位点用于高效环境电催化氨合成","zb":"报道了一种直接生长在镍泡沫上的缺陷工程化FeMoO4/CeS2双相，用于环境条件下高效电化学氨合成。优化Fe/Mo/Ce摩尔比为2:4:1的催化剂在-0.70 V vs RHE下实现5124 μg cm-2 h-1的NH3产率率和46%的法拉第效率。膜分离单堆电池配置中，催化剂保持2451 μg cm-2 h-1的产率率和35.01%的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c05576","t":"De Novo Designed Porphyrin-Binding Proteins Photocatalyze the Nitrogen Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c05576","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In this work, we de novo designed a two-helix α-helical protein capable of forming dimers, which features a central cavity that accommodates porphyrin molecules. The resulting porphyrin-binding protein, formed by mixing the porphyrin with the dimer protein, exhibits visible-light-driven catalytic activity for the nitrogen reduction reaction. To further optimize the protein, we selected three mutation layers and predicted their structures. From these, we identified seven mutants that retained the original protein folding structure, which are used for the photocatalytic ammonia production from nitrogen after binding porphyrin. Among them, the best-performing mutant achieved a catalytic rate of 9.704 mg gcat-1 h-1 for ammonia synthesis, which is higher than most of the current reported artificial catalysts. This work provides a promising strategy for the de novo design of porphyrin-binding ","au":["Yaoyu Liang","Da Hu","J H Ma","Congnan Wu","Yuzhi Ye","Jialin Zhou"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"从头设计的结合蛋白光催化氮还原反应","zb":"设计了一种双螺旋α-螺旋蛋白，其中心腔可容纳卟啉分子，形成结合卟啉的蛋白，具有可见光驱动的氮还原反应催化活性。通过突变优化，最佳突变体在结合卟啉后实现了9.704 mg gcat-1 h-1的氨合成催化速率，高于多数人工催化剂。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.156595","t":"Non-thermal plasma synergistic Co–Ni/γ-Al2O3 for ammonia synthesis: performance optimization and mechanism investigation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.156595","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Y.N. Wang","Shuqi Li","Zikai Zhou","Chao-Jun Chen","Wei Yang","ZHANG Si-nuo"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"非热等离子体协同Co-Ni/γ-Al2O3用于氨合成：性能优化和机理研究","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.56367/oag-051-12653","t":"How RENURE is shaping sustainable nitrogen management in the EU","u":"https://doi.org/10.56367/oag-051-12653","s":"Open Access Government","d":"2026-07-21","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"How RENURE is shaping sustainable nitrogen management in the EU Learn how the RENURE project is driving nutrient circularity in EU agriculture, offering a sustainable alternative to mineral fertilisers. The European Union is characterised by regional disparities. Certain areas with high livestock densities, such as Flanders in Belgium and the Netherlands, are struggling with chronic nutrient surpluses, while other arable regions lack nutrients to meet crop needs. Paradoxically, European agriculture remains heavily dependent on (synthetic) mineral fertilisers. These nitrogen fertilisers are either imported or produced via the energy-intensive Haber-Bosch process, which consumes substantial amounts of natural gas. On top of that, the Farm to Fork strategy requires a 20% reduction in the use of synthetic fertilisers in agriculture by 2030.","au":["Inès Verleden"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"RENURE 如何塑造欧盟可持续氮管理","zb":"RENURE 项目如何推动欧盟农业中的养分循环，为矿物肥料提供可持续替代方案。欧盟的特点是区域差异。某些高牲畜密度地区，如比利时的弗拉芒和荷兰，正努力应对慢性养分盈余，而其他耕地地区缺乏养分以满足作物需求。矛盾的是，欧洲农业仍然严重依赖（合成）矿物肥料。这些氮肥要么是进口的，要么是通过能源密集型的哈伯-博施过程生产的，该过程消耗大量的天然气。除此之外，农场到餐桌战略要求到 2030 年农业中合成肥料的用量减少 20%。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15006312/v1","t":"Sustainable Ammonia Production from Biogas: A Review","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15006312/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Green hydrogen produced from biogas reforming offers a low-carbon feedstock route to sustainable ammonia synthesis, coupling waste valorization with decarbonized fertilizer and chemical production. This review examines the technical foundations of this pathway: the composition and purification of biogas; the principal reforming routes to hydrogen — steam reforming, dry reforming, partial oxidation, and autothermal reforming — together with the catalysts that enable them; the cryogenic air separation required to supply oxygen and nitrogen to the process; and the reactor configurations and catalysts used for ammonia synthesis. The economic evaluation methodology commonly used to assess hydrogen production cost is outlined, alongside a SWOT analysis of green hydrogen production in Egypt, a country with substantial biogas feedstock potential and a strategic export position. Ammonia's princip","au":["Ahmed Said","Azza Zaher","IBRAHIM RABEE","Mahmoud Farag","Mohamed Hatem","Mohamed Osama"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"从沼气可持续生产氨气：综述","zb":"综述了利用沼气重整制取绿氢合成氨的技术基础，涵盖了沼气组成与净化、重整路线及催化剂、空气分离以及氨合成反应器配置，并对埃及的绿氢生产进行了SWOT分析。","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c03345","t":"Synergy Effect between Pt Single Atoms and Nanoclusters for Promoted Ammonia Borane Hydrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c03345","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald","nh3"],"tr":"transferable","sc":27,"ab":"Abstract Single-active-site catalytic materials, such as standalone single atoms (SAs) or nanoclusters/particles (NCs/NPs), generally face inherent trade-offs between atomic efficiency and performance. SAs offer high atomic utilization but sluggish kinetics, and NCs/NPs have high site density but poor atomic economy. Constructing SA/NC dual-site materials holds promise for overcoming these limitations. However, the dynamic synergistic interplay between these two components remains unclear. To gain insights into the synergistic behavior of dual-site materials, we herein carried out density functional theory calculations on Pt SA/NC dual sites, revealing regulated electronic states and enhanced reactant activation. The ammonia borane (AB) hydrolysis performance was investigated for a dual-site material synthesized via atomic layer deposition on TiO2 nanosheets. It exhibits a turnover frequ","au":["Ruichao Xu","Weiqi Lu","Jiani Ding","Min Ge","Wenxue He","Jinglin Yuan"],"o":"旧站本地库","w":["Junling Lu"],"why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"Pt单原子和纳米团簇之间的协同效应促进氨硼烷水解","zb":"单活性位点催化材料，如独立的单原子（SAs）或纳米团簇/颗粒（NCs/NPs），通常面临原子效率和性能之间的固有权衡。SAs提供高原子利用率但动力学缓慢，而NCs/NPs具有高位点密度但原子经济性差。构建SA/NC双位点材料有望克服这些限制。然而，这两种组分之间的动态协同相互作用尚不清楚。为深入了解双位点材料的协同行为，我们在此对Pt SA/NC双位点进行了密度泛函理论计算，揭示了调节的电子状态和增强的反应物活化。对通过原子层沉积在TiO2纳米片上合成的双位点材料进行的氨硼烷（AB）水解性能研究显示，其转化频率为1865.2 molH2molPt–1min–1，比SA-only和NC-only对应物分别高4.2和4.3倍。机理研究表明，双位点不仅实现了位点特异性活化H2O和AB，还协同提供由桥接H2O介导的连续质子转移通道，从而实现快速*H转移用于H2生产。双位点协同的普适性通过扩展到电催","ob":"氨硼烷水解；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c04647","t":"Stabilizing Nickel-Based Catalysts for Ethanol Dry Reforming via Dual-Oxide-Metal Interface Establishment: Combination Studies of In Situ Insights and Microkinetic Investigations","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c04647","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":19,"ab":"Abstract Ethanol dry reforming (EDR) provides an attractive route for syngas production, yet it is limited by unresolved questions surrounding active sites and reaction mechanisms. Here, we report a dual-oxide/metal-interface Ni/CeO2@TiO2 catalyst fabricated by atomic layer deposition that delivers high activity, selectivity, and long-term stability for EDR. Specifically, the catalyst achieves almost quantitative conversion over ethanol (∼100%) and CO2 (∼85.4%), with 94.6% CO selectivity and sustained performance over 300 h without detectable deactivation. More importantly, we introduce two independent descriptors, c.a. λ and μ, to quantify the extent of C−C bond cleavage and the completeness of EDR, respectively, thereby providing a unified metric for evaluating EDR performance. Clearly, the C−C bond rupture and reforming was dominated by the particle size of Ni, the oxygen vacancy of t","au":["Kaiyun Lu","Hongbo Zhang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过双氧化物-金属界面建立稳定镍基催化剂用于乙醇干式重整：原位洞察和微观动力学研究的结合研究","zb":"乙醇干式重整（EDR）为合成气生产提供了一条有吸引力的路线，但其受限于关于活性位点和反应机理的未解问题。在此，我们报道了一种通过原子层沉积制备的双氧化物/金属界面Ni/CeO2@TiO2催化剂，该催化剂对乙醇干式重整（EDR）表现出高活性、选择性和长期稳定性。具体而言，该催化剂对乙醇的转化率几乎为定量（~100%），对CO2的转化率为~85.4%，CO选择性为94.6%，并在300 h内持续性能而无明显失活。更重要的是，我们引入了两个独立描述符，即λ和μ，以量化C−C键断裂的程度和EDR的完整性，从而为评估EDR性能提供了一个统一的指标。显然，C−C键断裂和重整主要由Ni的颗粒尺寸、相邻氧化物的氧空位、Ni的还原程度以及原位生成的路易斯酸位点主导。原位红外光谱、X射线吸收精细结构光谱和动力学分析表明，EDR的催化作用主要由Ni-CeO2/TiO2界面内的位点主导，其中强金属-载体相互作用调","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积","top":1},{"id":"10.1063/5.0348465","t":"N-doping on Pt/C catalyst using fluidized bed reactor atomic layer deposition for PEMFC applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0348465","s":"AIP Conference Proceedings","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Dinesh Kumar Madheswaran","S. Jegadheeshwari","Ram Krishna","P. Chandramohan","Meenakshi Chinnathambi Muthukaruppan","G. Rathinasabapathi"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"使用流化床反应器原子层沉积对Pt/C催化剂进行N掺杂用于PEMFC应用","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15006347/v1","t":"High temperature and pressure sorption of ammonia using zeolites and supported metal halides: experimental investigations and sorption modeling","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15006347/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Sorption‑enhanced ammonia synthesis (SEAS) requires solid sorbents with high capacity, fast kinetics, and reliable models at elevated temperature and pressure. Here, zeolites and supported metal halides are compared systematically for high‑temperature NH3 sorption for SEAS process design. Commercial zeolites (3A, 4A, 13X, LiLSX) were screened by quasi‑continuous pulse chemisorption (ambient pressure, 50–350 °C), combining capacity determination with TPD‑based site analysis. The most promising candidate LiLSX, still adsorbing NH3 at more than 300 °C, was then benchmarked against supported MnCl2‑based sorbents in a high‑pressure magnetic suspension balance (200–400 °C, up to 12 bar ammonia partial pressure). Morphology and salt distribution were characterized by SEM/EDX. Equilibria were modeled with Langmuir, Toth, Sips and dual‑site Langmuir (DSL) isotherms. NH3 adsorption kinetics on LiL","au":["Benedikt Steinbach","Theresa Kunz","Thomas Cholewa","Stephan J. Reitmeier","René Eckert","Florian Nestler"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"高温高压下使用沸石和负载金属卤化物吸附氨：实验研究和吸附建模","zb":"研究对象为沸石和负载金属卤化物在高温高压下的氨吸附性能，用于氨合成吸附增强（SEAS）工艺设计。通过准连续脉冲化学吸附（环境压力，50–350 °C）筛选商业沸石（3A, 4A, 13X, LiLSX），结合容量测定和基于TPD的位点分析。LiLSX在超过300 °C时仍能吸附NH3，在高压磁悬浮天平（200–400 °C，最高12 bar氨分压）中与负载MnCl2基吸附剂进行对比。SEM/EDX表征了形貌和盐分布。用Langmuir、Toth、Sips和双位点Langmuir（DSL）等温线模型模拟平衡。用驱动力、拉伸指数（SE）和双SE（DSE）速率表达式拟合LiLSX上的NH3吸附动力学。LiLSX在脉冲化学吸附中在200 °C以上表现出显著的NH3摄取，在300 °C和0.1 bar氨分压下仍保持活性。TPD信号和等温线建模证实吸附在两种位点类型上。在SEAS相关条件下，LiLSX","pre":1},{"id":"10.1038/s43246-026-01289-5","t":"Electrostatic discharge as a breakthrough strategy for triboelectric nanogenerators","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s43246-026-01289-5","s":"Communications Materials","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"As the Internet of Things (IoT) has expanded, the global energy problem has increased the demand for high-performance self-powered sensors; however, traditional triboelectric nanogenerators (TENGs) are limited by low current outputs and pulsed AC signals. This review highlights electrostatic discharge (ESD) as a breakthrough mechanism for overcoming these barriers. ESD enables current amplification to the milliampere-to-ampere range through the electron avalanche effect and facilitates direct current (DC) generation by utilizing the air gap as a temporary electrical switch. We systematically categorized the ESD-based TENGs into contact-separation, sliding, and complicated designs. Furthermore, specialized self-powered applications of ESD were explored, including chemical removal, nitrogen fixation for fertilizers, and gas sensing. By addressing these critical challenges, this review prov","au":["Seh‐Hoon Chung","Sangmin Lee","Jihoon Chung"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"静电放电作为摩擦纳米发电机突破性策略的综述","zb":"针对传统摩擦纳米发电机电流输出低和信号为脉冲交流电的局限，该综述提出利用静电放电（ESD）作为突破机制。ESD通过电子雪崩效应将电流放大至毫安至安培级，并利用空气间隙作为临时开关实现直流（DC）生成。文章系统分类了基于ESD的TENGs，并探讨了其在化学去除、固氮制肥及气体传感等自供电应用中的潜力。"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c02764","t":"Effect of Alkali Metal Cations on Nitrate Electroreduction Kinetics, Mass Transport, and Cobalt Catalyst Oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c02764","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract The electroreduction of the nitrate anion is surprisingly catalyzed on surfaces that are perceived as negatively charged, conditions where cations from the electrolyte are—on average—closer to the surface in the electrical double layer (EDL). As such, the charge density of alkali metal cations and the extent of their interactions with nitrate could notably impact both transport of nitrate to the surface and the rates of its reduction. We separate these effects quantitatively for the electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) on cobalt in alkaline media, which has a high Faradaic efficiency to ammonia (∼90%). A K+-containing electrolyte has higher NO3RR kinetic currents than a Li+-containing one, though the magnitude of this difference depends on catalyst pretreatment. Surprisingly, an ∼2x difference in the apparent NO3RR diffusion limited current is observed between Li+","au":["Rajkumar Jana","O. Quinn Carvalho","Ruth Bello","Payal Chaudhary","Jiyun Hong","Adam S. Hoffman"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"碱金属阳离子对硝酸电还原动力学、质量传递和钴催化剂氧化的影响","zb":"硝酸根阴离子的电还原在通常被认为带负电的表面上被催化，在这种条件下，电解质中的阳离子在电双层（EDL）中平均更靠近表面。因此，碱金属阳离子的电荷密度及其与硝酸盐的相互作用可能显著影响硝酸盐向表面的传输及其还原速率。本研究将电催化硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR）在钴上的这些效应定量分离，该反应对氨具有高法拉第效率（~90%）。含有 K+ 的电解质比含有 Li+ 的电解质的 NO3RR 动态电流更高，尽管这种差异的大小取决于催化剂预处理。令人惊讶的是，Li+ 和 K+ 电解质之间观察到 ~2x 的表观 NO3RR 扩散限制电流差异，这与未带电反应物的还原不一致。这种差异部分源于活性位点的可用性，这些位点还参与（氧）氢氧化物形成，因为硝酸反应物和亚硝酸中间体具有强氧化性。此类物种在 NO3RR 期间的动态作用受到阳离子性质的独特影响，表明在 NO3RR 的还原条件下，（水）氧化物和阳离子在稳定阴离子","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3929/ethz-c-000803315","t":"Haber-Bosch 2.0 for low-carbon ammonia production: a global techno-economic and environmental assessment","u":"https://doi.org/10.3929/ethz-c-000803315","s":"Repository for Publications and Research Data (ETH Zurich)","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Decentralized ammonia production via electric Haber–Bosch (Haber–Bosch 2.0) could support shipping, chemical manufacturing, and local fertilizer supply chains. Unlike conventional Haber–Bosch systems, Haber–Bosch 2.0 technologies operate at lower pressures (∼30–60 bar) and temperatures (∼400 °C), enabling smaller, modular ammonia systems powered by low-carbon electricity. However, its economic viability and environmental performance under diverse conditions remain unclear. Here, we apply techno-economic and environmental life cycle assessment using a novel, open-source framework to optimally design ∼13 000 grid-connected, hybrid, and off-grid electric Haber–Bosch configurations worldwide. Our results demonstrate that decentralized ammonia production costs are between €740–4100 tNH₃⁻¹, which is substantially higher compared to centralized ammonia production (∼€300 tNH₃⁻¹ historically with","au":["Tom Terlouw","Christian Bauer","Peter Burgherr","Russell McKenna","Lorenzo Rosa"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"哈伯-博施2.0用于低碳氨生产：全球技术经济和环境评估","zb":"分散式氨生产通过电哈伯-博施（哈伯-博施2.0）可以为航运、化学制造和本地化肥供应链提供支持。与传统的哈伯-博施系统不同，哈伯-博施2.0技术以较低的压力（~30-60 bar）和温度（~400 °C）运行，可以实现由低碳电力驱动的更小、模块化的氨系统。然而，其在不同条件下的经济可行性和环境性能尚不清楚。该研究应用技术经济和环境生命周期评估，使用一种新颖的、开源的框架，优化设计了全球约13,000个并网、混合和离网的电哈伯-博施配置。结果表明，分散式氨生产成本为740-4100欧元/吨NH₃，与集中式氨生产（历史上约为300欧元/吨NH₃，最近峰值高达800欧元/吨NH₃）相比要高得多。混合配置显示出最低的成本（740-2090欧元/吨NH₃），特别是在电网电力价格低、资本成本低和/或可再生能源丰富的地区。然而，它们的温室气体排放因当地电网的温室气体强度而异。离网系统显示出最低的生命周期温","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.cgd.6c00541","t":"Enhancing NO3RR Performance of MOF-Based Electrocatalysts for Ammonia Synthesis by Introducing Sulfur Elements into Organic Ligands: Facilitating the Nitrite Hydrogenation Step","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.cgd.6c00541","s":"Crystal Growth & Design","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO3RR) offers a sustainable route to ammonia synthesis, but its practical application is hindered by the accumulation of toxic nitrite (NO2–). Herein, through the rational design and synthesis as well as the study of their NO3RR of cobalt-based metal–organic frameworks (Co-MOFs) based on different heteroatom ligands, we reveal the crucial role of sulfur in steering reaction selectivity. The optimal catalyst, Co-dpt-5AOA constructed by a thiadiazole-based ligand delivers an impressive NH3 yield of 10.8 mg h–1 mgcat–1 at −1.1 V vs RHE and 92% Faradaic efficiency at −1.0 V vs RHE, while the Faradaic efficiency of NO2– is suppressed to only 1.9%. The mechanistic studies reveal that the sulfur atom in the dpt ligand plays a pivotal role in facilitating proton transfer and promoting nitrite hydrogenation. This sulfur-mediated enhancement enables eff","au":["Ling Yun Qin","Jin‐Long An","Yue Wang","J Liu","Qiang Liu","Bo-Wen Li"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过将硫元素引入有机配体中增强MOF基电催化剂的NO3RR性能以促进亚硝酸氢化步骤","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原（NO3RR）为氨合成提供了一条可持续路线，但其实际应用受有毒亚硝酸（NO2–）积累的阻碍。本研究通过不同杂原子配体的钴基金属-有机框架（Co-MOFs）的合理设计、合成及其 NO3RR 研究揭示了硫在引导反应选择性的关键作用。最优催化剂 Co-dpt-5AOA 由基于噻二唑的配体构建，在 -1.1 V vs RHE 下产氨量为 10.8 mg h–1 mgcat–1，在 -1.0 V vs RHE 下法拉第效率为 92%，而 NO2– 的法拉第效率仅为 1.9%。机理研究表明，dpt 配体中的硫原子在促进质子转移和促进亚硝酸氢化方面起着关键作用。这种硫介导的增强使即使在质子限制条件下也能有效进行 NO2–-to-NH3 转化，有效保持副产物水平低。硫自由配体的控制实验证实硫对于驱动此氢化步骤至关重要。此外，引入亲硫金属（Cu2+, Ag+）破坏了质子转移过程，导致 NO2","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.189962","t":"Synergistic effect of 2D BiOBr/g-C3N4 for enhancing photoelectrochemical nitrogen reduction under ambient conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.189962","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yuxi Zhang","Yuesong Jin","Zhehao Chong"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["photoelectrochemical nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"2D BiOBr/g-C3N4的协同效应增强环境条件下光电化学氮还原","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.70928","t":"Micropore–Metal Synergy in FAU Zeolite‐Supported Ni Catalysts for Plasma‐Assisted Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.70928","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Non‐thermal plasma enables ammonia synthesis under mild conditions, but net performance is often limited by inefficient use of transient reactive species and plasma‐driven NH 3 decomposition. Here we demonstrate that microporous confinement becomes decisively beneficial only when coupled to metal active sites. By benchmarking Ni catalysts supported on zeolites with distinct micropore architectures (BEA, MOR, FAU) against mesoporous and nonporous analogues in a dielectric barrier discharge (DBD) reactor, FAU emerges as the most effective microporous partner and delivers markedly improved activity and energy efficiency over mesoporous benchmarks. We elucidated the origin of this advantage using targeted controls (alkaline treatment/ion exchange), plasma electrical diagnostics (Q–V analysis/ignition behavior), and N 2 /H 2 /NH 3 adsorption/desorption probing under plasma. The resul","au":["Jiaqi Cai","Kunlin Li","Jiang Li","Moshu Tan","Jingdong Lin","Shaolong Wan"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"FAU沸石负载Ni催化剂中微孔-金属协同作用在等离子体辅助氨合成中的应用","zb":"非热等离子体可在温和条件下合成氨，但净性能通常受限于瞬时活性物种的利用效率和等离子体驱动的 NH3 分解。本研究表明，微孔限域只有在与金属活性位点耦合时才具有决定性优势。通过在介电屏障放电（DBD）反应器中对具有不同微孔结构的沸石（BEA、MOR、FAU）负载的 Ni 催化剂与介孔和非多孔类似物进行基准测试，FAU 成为最有效的微孔合作伙伴，并在介孔基准之上显著提高了活性和能效。利用靶向控制（碱性处理/离子交换）、等离子体电气诊断（Q-V 分析/点火行为）和等离子体下 N2/H2/NH3 吸附/解吸探测，阐明了这种优势的来源。FAU 微孔具有双重作用：通过限域增强的停留时间在 Ni 位点附近富集等离子体产生的 N/H 物种，并通过选择性吸附到等离子体无法触及的微孔中抑制 NH3 损失。MgO 基性促进进一步减轻了 Ni 上的氢过度覆盖，在可比的温和条件下，产率为 7.55 mmol·h −","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.70822","t":"Orbital Hybridization in Ammonia Decomposition Catalysts: Mechanisms, Progress, and Design Strategies","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.70822","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Under the “carbon neutrality” goal, ammonia decomposition is a crucial pathway for producing clean hydrogen. Its core challenge lies in the design of efficient catalysts. This review takes orbital hybridization as the main thread, systematically summarizing six types of electronic interaction mechanisms in ammonia decomposition catalysts: I. d‐p hybridization (metal–support anion); II. f‐d hybridization (synergy between the 4f orbitals of rare‐earth Ce and oxygen vacancies); III. the p‐π‐d hybridization spectrum in carbon materials; IV. bimetallic d‐d synergy; V. s‐d/sp‐d hybridization under quantum confinement; and VI. support cation d‐d hybridization (e.g., in perovskites). The study indicates that the key to designing high‐performance catalysts is the precise regulation of the local electronic microenvironment of active sites to optimize the N–H bond cleavage and N 2 desorpti","au":["Guanyu Chen","Xun Qi","Xiulin Wang","Cai Chen","Hui Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"氨分解催化剂中的轨道杂化：机理、进展与设计策略","zb":"在“碳中和”目标下，氨分解是生产清洁氢气的关键途径。其核心挑战在于高效催化剂的设计。该综述以轨道杂化为主线，系统总结了氨分解催化剂中的六种电子相互作用机制：I. 金属-载体阴离子 d-p 杂化；II. 稀土 Ce 的 4f 轨道与氧空位的 f-d 杂化；III. 碳材料中的 p-π-d 杂化谱；IV. 双金属 d-d 协同；V. 量子限域下的 s-d/sp-d 杂化；VI. 载体阳离子 d-d 杂化（例如在钙钛矿中）。研究表明，设计高性能催化剂的关键在于精确调控活性位点的局部电子微环境，以优化 N-H 键断裂和 N2 解吸途径。综述总结了当前进展与挑战，并展望了未来方向，如超低温催化、动态表征与智能计算的集成、催化剂-反应器系统集成，为氨分解催化剂的合理设计提供理论基础。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.77000","t":"Stripe Arrays Comprising Uniform Concave Nanocrystals for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.77000","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Stripe patterns provide profound insights into physicochemical properties governed by the structural characteristics of their constituent building blocks. However, simultaneously controlling the geometric shape, crystallographic features, and spatial arrangement of these building blocks remains challenging. Herein, we report the successful synthesis of stripe‐patterned concave single crystals (SP‐CSC) via a facile drying‐mediated process. The SP‐CSC structure consists of concave nanocrystal building blocks that are uniformly oriented and arranged into stripe‐patterned arrays on nanosheets, integrating concave geometry, uniform orientational alignment, and stripe‐patterned arrangement. The drying temperature is critical for coordinating supersaturation‐driven nucleation, oriented growth, and contact‐line stick‐slip motion on nanosheets, ultimately leading to the formation of SP‐C","au":["Zihao Cheng","S X","Chaoqun Ma","Jean-Luc Maurice","Le Wei","Xiaoxing Ke"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"由均匀凹面纳米晶体组成的条纹阵列用于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐还原为氨，关键方法为通过简便的干燥介导过程合成条纹-凹面单晶（SP-CSC），主要结果为该结构由均匀取向排列的凹面纳米晶体组成，通过调节条纹基系统结构特征增强电催化氨合成性能。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"url:https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.17463v2","t":"Going Beyond the d-band Center to Design Intermetallic Catalysts for Nitrogen Reduction: A High-Throughput DFT and Machine Learning Study","u":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.17463v2","s":"arXiv","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-09-28T19:20:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This study combines high-throughput density functional theory (DFT) calculations with machine learning (ML) to uncover the key descriptors governing the nitrogen reduction reaction in 47 intermetallic compounds (IMCs) composed of Co, Ni, Al, Zn, V, Fe, Cu, and Pt, and the adsorption energies of key intermediates (*N2, *N2H, and *NH3) were systematically evaluated across all accessible surface sites, yielding approximately 1,200 data points. Among the IMCs studied, Fe9Co7 and Fe3Co emerge as the most balanced catalysts, exhibiting favorable adsorption energies across all three intermediates. By incorporating intrinsic material properties along with local and global electronic descriptors including s-, p- and d-band centers and fillings, as well as Bader charges of atoms neighboring the adsorbate, predictive ML models were developed with mean absolute errors (MAEs) of 0.27 eV for *N2, 0.39","au":["Parastoo Agharezaei","Kulbir Kaur Ghuman"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"超越d带中心设计用于氮还原的金属间化合物催化剂：高通量DFT和机器学习研究","zb":"该研究结合了高通量密度泛函理论（DFT）计算和机器学习（ML），以揭示控制47种由Co、Ni、Al、Zn、V、Fe、Cu和Pt组成的金属间化合物（IMCs）中氮还原反应的关键描述符，并对所有可访问表面位点的关键中间体的吸附能（*N2、*N2H和*NH3）进行了系统评估，产生了约1200个数据点。在研究的IMCs中，Fe9Co7和Fe3Co是性能最平衡的催化剂，对所有三种中间体都表现出有利的吸附能。通过结合固有材料特性以及局部和全局电子描述符，包括s-、p-和d带中心和填充，以及吸附物相邻原子的Bader电荷，开发了具有0.27 eV（*N2）、0.39 eV（*N2H）和0.17 eV（*NH3）吸附平均绝对误差（MAE）的预测ML模型。重要的是，仅使用20个关键特征（*N2H和*NH3）和38个特征（*N2）就实现了准确的吸附能预测，从而可以使用简单且计算效率高的ML模型。SHAP分析表","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","pre":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15006354/v1","t":"Design and Simulation of a Cryogenic Air Separation Unit for a Biogas-to-Ammonia Process","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15006354/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-07-20","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:45Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This paper presents the process design, steady-state simulation, and mechanical sizing of a cryogenic air separation unit (ASU) developed as part of a sustainable ammonia production flowsheet from biogas. The unit uses Linde double-column cryogenic distillation to separate atmospheric air (modeled as a ternary O2/N2/Ar mixture) into a high-purity nitrogen stream for ammonia synthesis and an oxygen stream for autothermal reforming of biogas-derived methane. The process was simulated in Aspen HYSYS at a feed rate of 1300 kmol/h, achieving a nitrogen product purity of 99.883% and an oxygen product purity of 95.04%. Detailed plate hydraulic design (Souders-Brown flooding, weeping, entrainment, and downcomer back-up checks) and AIChE tray-efficiency calculations were carried out for both the high-pressure column (HPC) and low-pressure column (LPC), followed by mechanical design of the pressur","au":["Ahmed Saied","Zeyad Mohamed"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于沼气制氨过程的低温空气分离单元的设计与模拟","zb":"本文介绍了作为可持续氨生产流程一部分开发的低温空气分离单元（ASU）的过程设计、稳态模拟和机械尺寸。该单元使用林德双塔低温精馏将空气（建模为 O2/N2/Ar 三元混合物）分离成高纯度氮气用于氨合成和氧气用于沼气衍生甲烷的自热重整。该过程在 Aspen HYSYS 中以 1300 kmol/h 的进料速率进行模拟，实现了 99.883% 的氮产品纯度和 95.04% 的氧产品纯度。对高压塔（HPC）和低压塔（LPC）进行了详细的塔板水力设计（Souders-Brown 淹没、渗漏、夹带和降液管堵塞检查）和 AIChE 塔效率计算，随后对压力容器进行了机械设计和 2024 年指数化的设备成本估算。低压塔需要 30 个理论塔板（41 个实际级），直径为 1.746 m，估计成本为 $380,368。对高压塔进行了回流比/级数优化，以确定操作成本和固定成本之间的权衡。结果表明，该 ASU 设计在","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74518","t":"Synergistic Mechanism of Carbon‐Based Dual‐Metal‐Atom Catalysts: Breakthroughs in Atomic Precision Regulation and Enhanced Electrocatalytic Performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74518","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-19","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Dual-metal-atom catalysts (DMACs), evolving from single-atom architectures, overcome constraints of linear scaling relationships in multistep electrocatalytic reactions through synergistic interactions within precisely configured bimetallic pairs. These systems enable fine-tuned modulation of reaction intermediate adsorption energetics via d-orbital coupling and intermetallic electron hybridization, while maintaining high metal-loading active site densities. Flexible coordination microenvironments further optimize orbital interactions, driving exceptional activity/selectivity in electrocatalytic carbon dioxide reduction and biomass valorization. Classification based on metal identity, atomic spacing, and ligand coordination is discussed alongside advanced syntheses (atomic layer deposition, metal-organic framework-pyrolytic confinement, vacancy-trapping). Active site characterization lev","au":["Xiaoyue Zheng","Lulu Wang","Li Zhou","Yanru Yuan","Jiwen Wu","Meifang Huang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"碳基双金属原子催化剂的协同机制：原子精度调控突破与电催化性能提升","zb":"双金属原子催化剂（DMACs）通过精确配置的双金属对内的协同作用，克服了多步电催化反应中线性缩放关系的限制。这些系统通过d轨道耦合和金属间电子杂化，实现了反应中间体吸附能的精细调控，同时保持了高金属负载活性位点密度。灵活的配位微环境进一步优化了轨道相互作用，在电催化二氧化碳还原和生物质高值化中表现出卓越的活性和选择性。研究讨论了基于金属种类、原子间距和配体配位的分类，以及先进的合成方法（原子层沉积、金属有机框架热解限域、空位捕获）。活性位点表征利用了校正像差显微镜、原位光谱和同步辐射技术。DMACs在氧化还原（redox）反应电催化中表现出优异性能，对可持续能源转换和环境修复至关重要。尽管在原子精度合成和机理阐明方面存在挑战，但其独特的双位点协同作用使其成为全球能源转型变革性的催化平台。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/jacsau.6c00696","t":"Efficient Ammonia Synthesis on Electride-Supported Single-Atom Sc Catalysts through Electron-Buffered N2 Activation and Subsurface-Hydrogen-Assisted Hydrogenation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacsau.6c00696","s":"JACS Au","d":"2026-07-18","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia synthesis is a crucial industrial process for sustainable human development. Electrides, with their unique electron-donating capability, have shown great promise in overcoming the fundamental challenge of activating the inert N≡N bond. To harness this potential, we propose a single-Sc-atom-anchored LaNiSi electride as a stable, sinter-resistant, and highly active catalyst for ammonia synthesis. Computational simulations reveal that substantial electron transfer from the electride support, exclusively effective at the Sc site, drives efficient N2 activation and dissociation. Unlike conventional electride catalysts, the Sc site not only cleaves N2 but also mediates all subsequent hydrogenation steps, exhibiting a distinctive “one-stop” catalytic mechanism. We further identify the coexistence of surface and subsurface hydrogen species, with hydrogenation dominated by the la","au":["Shan Huang","Qiang Fu","Yuxiang Bu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过电子缓冲N2活化和亚氢辅助氢化实现Sc单原子催化剂高效合成氨","zb":"构建了LaNiSi电子体负载Sc单原子催化剂，计算模拟显示电子体向Sc位点转移驱动N2活化与解离，提出表面与亚表面氢物种共存且由后者主导的“一站式”催化机制，效率与Ru基准催化剂相当。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1038/s41524-026-02242-3","t":"Annealing-aware screening of Co–Ir–Ni–Rh–Ru alloys for ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41524-026-02242-3","s":"npj Computational Materials","d":"2026-07-18","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Finite-temperature segregation complicates the screening of multicomponent materials because the operative surface state under annealing conditions can differ substantially from the bulk composition. Using ammonia decomposition reaction (ADR) on Co–Ir–Ni–Rh–Ru as a testbed, we develop a CE–MMC–microkinetic framework for multicomponent materials screening that resolves segregation, lattice strain, and mixed-surface-state retention. A single-descriptor volcano based on *N-hcp adsorption (Δ E (*N)) links temperature-dependent step statistics to activity, while a strain correction enables consistent screening across compositions. MMC simulations predict Ni/Rh surface enrichment and Ru subsurface partitioning, depressing the activity of equimolar alloys after annealing despite high rates in the randomly mixed limit. High-throughput composition-activity maps at 1500 K reveal Ru-rich activity b","au":["Xingyu Li","C WANG","Liang Cao"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"考虑退火效应筛选Co-Ir-Ni-Rh-Ru合金用于氨分解","zb":"有限温度偏析使多组分材料的筛选变得复杂，因为在退火条件下操作的表面状态可能与本体成分有显著差异。使用Co-Ir-Ni-Rh-Ru上的氨分解反应（ADR）作为测试平台，该研究开发了一个用于多组分材料筛选的CE-MMC-微动力学框架，该框架解决了偏析、晶格应变和混合表面状态保留。基于*N-hcp吸附（Δ E (*N)）的单描述符火山图将温度依赖性步态统计与活性联系起来，而应变校正使跨成分的筛选保持一致。MMC模拟预测Ni/Rh表面富集和Ru亚表面偏析，尽管在随机混合极限下具有高活性，但降低了等摩尔合金在退火后的活性。在1500 K下高通量组成-活性图揭示了富Ru活性带，最大值高达约1.4-1.5倍的Ru基准，表面构型熵代理（Δ S conf ）作为退火温度混合表面状态保留的筛选指标。高〈TOF〉带与升高的Δ S conf窗口重叠，从而实现了一个双目标的成分过滤器，联合优先考虑ADR活性和混合表","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"wx:__biz=Mzk2NDYxNDQxNQ==&mid=2247508553&idx=2","t":"上海交通大学叶天南Nature Communications：富电子双阴离子空位促进偶氮中间体用于高效化学循环氨合成","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk2NDYxNDQxNQ%3D%3D&mid=2247508553&idx=2","s":"青研经纬","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"尽管氨合成在热力学上可行，但N≡N三键的高稳定性（键能约945 kJ·mol）导致动力学严重受限。活化N需向其π反键轨道注入电子，降低键级并削弱N≡N键。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["氨合成"],"wx":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzUyMDEwMDk0MQ==&mid=2247508640&idx=3","t":"汕头实验室在合成氨研究领域获得重要进展——钾助剂在合成氨催化剂中的活性氢新机制","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMDEwMDk0MQ%3D%3D&mid=2247508640&idx=3","s":"广东实验室建设","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:57Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"近日，汕头实验室王培坤副研究员与中国科学院大连化物所陈萍研究员、郭建平研究员合作在合成氨催化钾助剂作用机制研究中取得重要突破，相关成果以《Reactive hydrogen in KH or KOH for catalytic NH3 synthesis》为题在Cell旗下综合性学","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.77169","t":"Building Asymmetric B Vacancy Coupled FeB 2 N 3 Associate Site by Joule Heating Metal‐Based Ionic Liquid for Enhanced Full Wavelength Photosynthesis of Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.77169","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3","joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":21,"ab":"ABSTRACT Building an asymmetric active site has been regarded as an effective strategy to boost photocatalytic ammonia synthesis. However, there is a lack of effective and controllable methods for rapidly constructing asymmetric sites. Herein, Fe single atoms are engineered onto BCN atomic layer (Fe‐BCN) using a metal‐based ionic liquid through a rapid joule heating method. A FeB 2 N 3 coordination structure coupled with B vacancy can be created in Fe‐BCN, forming an asymmetric associate site. This asymmetric configuration leads to the generation of local charge redistribution and a polarized electric field at the interface, promoting the photo‐generated charge separation. Moreover, the synergy between B vacancies and FeB 2 N 3 sites transforms the interfacial electronic interaction with key *NO 2 intermediate from p–p to d–p interaction, enhancing orbital hybridization between the 3d z2","au":["Yameng He","Hang Xiao","Y Zhang","Xiaomin Yang","Bo Lin","Jun Xiong"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis","Joule Heat"],"zt":"基于焦耳热金属基离子液体构建非对称B空位耦合FeB2N3关联位点用于增强全波长氨合成","zb":"构建非对称活性位点被认为是提高光催化氨合成效率的有效策略。然而，缺乏快速构建非对称位点的有效可控方法。本研究采用金属基离子液体通过快速焦耳热法将Fe单原子工程化到BCN原子层（Fe-BCN）上。Fe-BCN中可创建FeB2N3配位结构耦合B空位，形成非对称关联位点。这种非对称构型导致局部电荷重新分布和界面极化电场，促进光生电荷分离。此外，B空位和FeB2N3位点的协同作用将界面电子相互作用与关键NO2中间体的p-p相互作用转化为d-p相互作用，显著加速了Fe的3d z2轨道与NO2的2b1反键轨道之间的轨道杂化，从而加速了NO2的转化。通过15N同位素原位FTIR验证了关键反应中间体。优化后的Fe-BCN比BCN和BN的NH3生产活性分别提高了8.8倍和58.5倍，Fe-BCN-2器件的NH3生产速率达到1182.5 µmol g−1 h−1。该研究为快速构建非对称活性位点以及中间体相互作","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.chemmater.6c01728","t":"Promoting N2 Reactivity by Floating Electrons on Two-Dimensional Electride Surfaces","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemmater.6c01728","s":"Chemistry of Materials","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":17,"ab":"Abstract The activation of N2 is a critical step in ammonia synthesis but remains challenging because of the extremely high bonding energy of the N2 molecule. The present work demonstrates that two-dimensional (2D) layered electrides having the general formula Ae2N (Ae = Ca, Sr, Ba) act as electron donors to promote N2 activation. Analyses based on the electron localization function show that floating electrons on the (104) surface of Ae2N compounds directly interact with the empty π* orbitals of N2 molecules, thus promoting chemisorption at van der Waals (vdW) interstitial sites. Constrained ab initio molecular dynamics simulations indicate that the energy barrier to N2 dissociation on Ca2N and Ba2N is similar. However, exposure to a nitrogen atmosphere converts Ca2N to β-Ca3N2, which explains the experimentally observed inactivity of Ca2N toward N2 by isotopic exchange reaction. In con","au":["Chengfeng Pan","Jiang Li","Zhennan Lin","Masatake Tsuji","Shiyao Wang","Yu‐Ning Wu"],"o":"旧站本地库","w":["Hideo Hosono"],"why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过二维电化物表面的浮电子促进N2活性","zb":"二维（2D）层状电化物Ae2N（Ae = Ca, Sr, Ba）作为电子供体促进N2活化。基于电子局域函数的分析表明，Ae2N化合物的（104）表面的浮电子直接与N2分子的空π*轨道相互作用，从而促进在范德华（vdW）间隙位点上的化学吸附。约束的从头算分子动力学模拟表明，Ca2N和Ba2N上N2解离的能量势垒相似。然而，暴露在氮气气氛中将Ca2N转化为β-Ca3N2，这解释了实验上观察到的Ca2N对N2的惰性，通过同位素交换反应观察到。相比之下，Ba2N中的氮离子在vdW间隙中快速捕获氮离子，可能促进N2解离和重组。在N2与晶格氮物种交换期间，新形成的N2直接从Ba2N表面释放，而Ca2N和Sr2N上的Ae-N相互作用提供了能量势垒，阻碍N2释放。这些结果确定了控制二维电化物上有效N2活化的关键因素，为在温和条件下实现无过渡金属的N2活化提供了见解。","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨"},{"id":"10.1021/jacsau.6c00811","t":"Tackling the Scaling Relations in Ammonia Synthesis through Light-Driven Catalysis over LiH-Mediated Ru/TiN","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacsau.6c00811","s":"JACS Au","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Photothermal catalysis offers a promising pathway for sustainable ammonia synthesis under mild conditions. However, its performance is constrained by intrinsic scaling relations between dinitrogen activation and subsequent hydrogenation steps. To overcome this long-standing bottleneck, we design a Ru-LiH/TiN catalyst that enables a light-driven reaction cascade, wherein lithium hydride (LiH) serves as a dynamic “nitrogen mediator”. Under ambient pressure and illumination at 3.3 W·cm–2, the catalyst achieves an unprecedented NH3 production rate of 5574.3 μmol·g–1·h–1 (equivalent to 428.8 mmol·gRu–1·h–1), representing a 31-fold improvement over its thermal-catalytic counterpart and a 52-fold enhancement relative to Ru/TiN. Notably, the Ru-LiH/TiN exhibits robust catalytic stability over 50 h, in stark contrast to the rapid deactivation (<1 h) commonly observed in thermal catalysis","au":["Xi Zhang","Haolan Tao","Yue Wang","Yang Zhao","Teng Feng He","Jianping Guo"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过 LiH 媒介的 Ru/TiN 上的光驱动催化合成氨：解决氨合成中的比例关系","zb":"光热催化为在温和条件下可持续的氨合成提供了一条有希望的途径。然而，其性能受到氮活化与后续氢化步骤之间固有比例关系的限制。为了克服这一长期瓶颈，我们设计了一种 Ru-LiH/TiN 催化剂，它能够实现光驱动反应级联，其中锂氢化物 (LiH) 充当动态“氮介质”。在环境压力和 3.3 W·cm–2 的光照下，该催化剂实现了前所未有的 NH3 产量为 5574.3 μmol·g–1·h–1（相当于 428.8 mmol·gRu–1·h–1），比其热催化对应物提高了 31 倍，相对于 Ru/TiN 提高了 52 倍。值得注意的是，Ru-LiH/TiN 在 50 h 内表现出强大的催化稳定性，与热催化中由于 NHx (x = 1–3) 积累引起的吸附物中毒导致的快速失活（<1 h）形成鲜明对比。机理研究表明，这是一种传递式光热催化机理：光生热电子促进 Ru 位点的 N2 活化，随后氮转移到 LiH-","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c09661","t":"Interface Reconstruction Induced by Rare-Earth Incorporation Stabilizes High-Coordination Cu+ Sites for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c09661","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (eNO3–RR) represents a promising route for simultaneous wastewater treatment and sustainable ammonia synthesis. While Cu2O catalysts featuring electron-deficient Cu+ sites have been widely studied for eNO3–RR, their practical implementation is hindered by self-reduction and structural instability. Constructing Cu–O–M interfacial sites, which enhance charge transfer and stabilize catalytic sites, presents an effective strategy for addressing these challenges. Here, we report a La incorporation strategy to create Cu2O–LayO heterointerfaces (Cu1La4) for highly efficient conversion of NH3. Experimental and theoretical studies indicate that the high-coordinated Cu+ active sites at the Cu2O/La2O2(CO3) interface, together with the steric hindrance introduced by La incorporation, optimize the adsorption energy of key intermediates, thereby ","au":["Jiale Li","Yiying Zhong","Wantong Sun","Moujie Huang","Xiaoqian Ou","Qianling Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"稀土元素掺杂引起的界面重构稳定高配位 Cu+ 位点用于高效的电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原反应（eNO3–RR）催化剂，采用 La 掺杂策略构建 Cu2O–LayO 异质界面（Cu1La4），通过实验和理论研究表明，Cu2O/La2O2(CO3) 界面处的高配位 Cu+ 活性位点与 La 掺杂引入的空间位阻优化了关键中间体的吸附能，避免了传统低配位 Cu+ 位点与 *NH3→NH3 转变相关的高能垒。此外，共价 Cu–O–La 界面键抑制了 Cu+ 还原并稳定了催化体系。Cu1La4 催化剂表现出优异的 eNO3–RR 性能，在 –0.6 V 下法拉第效率（FE）为 94%，氨产率速率为 234 μmol h–1 cm–2，在膜电极组件（MEA）中持续 150 h 产生 ∼7.8 mg h–1 cm–2 氨且 FE 高达 ∼85%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c02532","t":"Electronic Structure Tailoring of Copper by Oxygen-Enriched Carbon Dots Enables Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electrosynthesis via *NO2 Decoupling","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c02532","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NITRR) represents a sustainable strategy for ambient ammonia synthesis. However, copper-based catalysts often suffer from excessive adsorption of the *NO2 intermediate due to the high electron density on the Cu surface, resulting in active-site poisoning and sluggish reaction kinetics. Achieving an optimal balance between *NO2 adsorption and activation remains a major challenge for efficient nitrate reduction. Herein, we design a NITRR electrocatalyst consisting of oxygen-enriched carbon dots (CDs) and a carbon layer encapsulating copper nanoparticles (CuCECDs). Benefiting from the optimized decoupling of *NO2, the catalyst achieves an outstanding ammonia yield rate of 2.5 mol. gcat-1 h-1 with a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 85% at -0.5 V versus RHE. Combined experimental and theoretical studies demonstrate that the oxygen-enriched carbon dot","au":["Yunliang Liu","Ruixi Dong","Yixian Liu","Jingwen Yu","Zhiquan Lang","Yaxi Li"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过氧富集碳点对铜的电子结构调控实现硝酸盐到氨的电合成：*NO2解耦","zb":"电化学硝酸盐还原反应（NITRR）代表了一种可持续的室温氨合成策略。然而，铜基催化剂由于Cu表面高电子密度，常导致*NO2中间体过度吸附，造成活性位点中毒和反应动力学缓慢。实现*NO2吸附和活化的最佳平衡仍然是高效硝酸盐还原的主要挑战。本研究设计了一种由氧富集碳点（CDs）和包覆铜纳米粒子（CuCECDs）组成的NITRR电催化剂。得益于优化的*NO2解耦，催化剂在-0.5 V versus RHE下实现了2.5 mol. gcat-1 h-1的氨产率，法拉第效率（FE）为85%。结合实验和理论研究表明，氧富集碳点有效调节了Cu的电子结构，减弱了*NO2的过度吸附，同时将其后续转化限制在碳层内，从而促进了高效的*NO2转化（*NO2解耦）。此外，碳壳诱导Cu纳米粒子（Cu NPs）的晶格应变，促进水解离和氢气生成，进一步增强了氨电合成性能。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c02513","t":"Simultaneous Activation of N2 and H2O by Bi and O Double Vacancies in Bi2WO6 for Photocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c02513","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photocatalytic nitrogen reduction to ammonia intrinsically relies on the synergistic activation of both N2 and H2O molecules by the catalyst. However, achieving simultaneous and efficient activation of these two species on a single catalyst surface remains a formidable challenge, constrained by poor N2 adsorption and the high dissociation energy barrier of the N≡N triple bond. To address this, a vacancy engineering strategy was adopted to design and fabricate a Bi2WO6 photocatalyst featuring both bismuth and oxygen dual vacancies (VBi+O-BWO). The oxygen vacancies trap photogenerated electrons for N2 activation, while bismuth vacancies enhance H2O adsorption and facilitate proton generation. Through this synergistic effect, the photocatalytic nitrogen reduction performance was significantly enhanced. Experimental results show that VBi+O-BWO achieves an ammonia production rate of 113.14 μm","au":["Jin Cheng-an","Zhiling Huang","Lianyang Zhang","Yue Meng","Guanghua Xia","Shengjie Xia"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"Bi和O双空位在Bi2WO6中同时活化N2和H2O用于光催化氨合成","zb":"光催化氮还原为氨本质上依赖于催化剂对N2和H2O分子的协同活化。然而，在单个催化剂表面同时高效活化这两种物质仍然是一个巨大挑战，受限于N2吸附差和N≡N三键的高解离能垒。为此，本研究采用空位工程策略设计并制备了一种具有铋和氧双空位的Bi2WO6光催化剂（VBi+O-BWO）。氧空位捕获光生电子用于N2活化，而铋空位增强H2O吸附并促进质子生成。通过这种协同效应，光催化氮还原性能显著增强。实验结果表明，VBi+O-BWO实现了113.14 μmol·g-1·h-1的氨产率，比未改性催化剂提高了4.9倍。N2-TPD结果表明，双空位有效增强了N2化学吸附，促进了后续活化。原位FTIR证实N2在Bi2WO6上通过远程途径吸附和转化。该研究为开发高效双空位光催化材料提供了新的见解。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.179604","t":"Nitrogen fixation using a pin-to-pin arc plasma: Effects of operating parameters on NOx formation characteristics and arc stability","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.179604","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Atmospheric-pressure plasma-based nitrogen fixation has attracted significant attention as a promising alternative to the conventional Haber–Bosch process due to its potential for decentralized operation and compatibility with renewable energy sources. In this study, nitrogen oxidation in a pin-to-pin arc plasma reactor was systematically investigated to evaluate the effects of key operating parameters on NOx formation, NO selectivity, energy cost, and arc stability. The parameters examined included pin-to-pin gap distance, swirl intensity, gas flow rate, oxygen concentration, and delivered power. Arc dynamics and plasma characteristics were analyzed using high-speed imaging combined with spectral proper orthogonal decomposition (SPOD), while optical emission spectroscopy (OES) was employed to characterize the thermal state of the plasma and the formation of reactive species. The results","au":["Hyun Sik Choi","Sol Choi","Subin Choi","Shabeeh Ul Hassan","G.H. Kim","D H Lee"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"使用针到针电弧等离子体进行氮固定：操作参数对 NOx 形成特性和电弧稳定性的影响","zb":"在大气压等离子体氮固定因其潜在的分散操作和与可再生能源的兼容性而成为传统哈伯-博施过程的替代方案而受到广泛关注。本研究系统地调查了针到针电弧等离子体反应器中的氮氧化，以评估关键操作参数对 NOx 形成的影响、NO 选择性、能耗和电弧稳定性。检查的参数包括针到针间隙距离、旋转强度、气体流速、氧浓度和输送功率。通过高速成像结合光谱正交分解 (SPOD) 分析了电弧动力学和等离子体特性，而光发射光谱 (OES) 用于表征等离子体的热状态和活性物种的形成。结果表明，增加气体流速和针到针间隙增强了 NOx 产量并降低了能耗。本研究中实现的最小能耗约为 2.5 MJ/mol，表明针到针电弧等离子体技术作为一种节能和可扩展的氮固定工艺具有潜力。氧浓度也被确定为影响氮氧化效率和放电稳定性的关键参数。在约 30% 的中间氧浓度下观察到最高的 NO 产量，而在 40% 的氧浓度下获得最高的总 NOx 产量和最","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.179575","t":"Comparative evaluation of ceramic pellet architectures for Rh-based catalysts in on-board hydrogen production via ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.179575","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"On-board hydrogen production via ammonia decomposition requires catalytic reactor designs that balance high activity with space and weight constraints. This study presents a systematic comparative evaluation of six ceramic pellet architectures as supports for rhodium (Rh)-based catalysts, including commercial γ-alumina spheres, microchannel-structured smart pellets, three types of ceramic proppants (referred to as ISP (Intermediate Strength Proppant), LWP (Lightweight Proppant), HSP (High Strength Proppant)), and SiO 2 . A scalable resorcinol–formaldehyde sol–gel method (0.5 kg batches) was used to deposit carbon xerogel (CX) coatings on the pellets, followed by impregnation with 2 wt% Rh. Catalytic performance was assessed in terms of ammonia conversion, turnover frequency (TOF), and thermal stability. Among the supports tested, commercial γ-alumina spheres exhibited the highest activit","au":["Yuxiang Liu","Jiaojiao Zheng","Jinesh Cherukkattu Manayil","Zhentao Wu","Deblina Majumder","Evangelos I. Papaioannou"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"在车载氨分解制氢中基于铑催化剂的陶瓷颗粒结构的比较评估","zb":"本研究系统比较评估了六种陶瓷颗粒结构作为铑（Rh）基催化剂载体的性能，包括商业γ-氧化铝球、微通道结构智能颗粒、三种陶瓷支撑剂（称为ISP（中等强度支撑剂）、LWP（轻质支撑剂）、HSP（高强度支撑剂））和SiO2。采用可扩展的间苯二酚-甲醛溶胶-凝胶法（0.5 kg批次）在颗粒上沉积碳干凝胶（CX）涂层，然后浸渍2 wt% Rh。在450 °C下评估了催化性能，商业γ-氧化铝球表现出最高活性，TOF总= 79 mol NH3 ·mol Rh −1 ·h −1，TOF表面= 308 mol NH3 ·mol Rh −1 ·h −1，H₂时空产率= 1013 (mol H2 ·m −3 ·h −1)，归因于其高表面积和增强润湿性，促进了均匀的Rh纳米粒子分散。其他结构活性较低（在450 °C下TOF表面为10至131 mol NH3 ·mol Rh −1 ·h −1，顺序为：Rh/CX智能>","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1016/j.watres.2026.126519","t":"Ammonia recovery from high-strength scrubber effluents via pilot-scale bipolar membrane electrodialysis: Elucidating transport limitations under high current density","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.watres.2026.126519","s":"Water Research","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Bipolar membrane electrodialysis (BPMED) is a promising technology for recovering dissolved ammonia (NH 3 ) from concentrated wastewater streams, such as scrubber effluents. To date, most research remains laboratory-scale, while existing pilot-scale studies operate at effluent concentrations of 2 g-N/L, membrane areas below 3.5 m², and current densities under 150 A/m². In this study, a pilot-scale BPMED system with an active membrane area of 21.3 m² was operated in a sequential batch mode. Real scrubber effluents (18–22 g-N/L) were treated to simultaneously recover dissolved NH₃ and regenerate citric acid. For the first time, the influence of non-ideal phenomena including proton (H⁺) competition, NH₃ back diffusion, electro-osmotic and osmotic water fluxes on NH 3 recovery, was systematically investigated at current densities beyond typical laboratory values. At feed pH below 3,","au":["Gladys Mutahi","Ian Tomassen","Jules B. van Lier","Henri Spanjers"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"通过中试规模双极膜电渗析从高浓度洗涤器废液回收氨：阐明高电流密度下的传输限制","zb":"本研究在中试规模双极膜电渗析（BPMED）系统中处理真实洗涤器废液（18–22 g-N/L），以同时回收溶解NH₃和再生柠檬酸。首次系统地研究了在典型实验室值以上的电流密度下，非理想现象（包括质子（H⁺）竞争、NH₃逆向扩散、电渗和渗透水通量）对NH₃回收的影响。在进料pH低于3时，随着电流密度的增加，电流效率和能耗急剧上升，建立了适用于中试规模BP-C系统的操作窗口。在500 A/m²下，NH₃在基室中的浓度达到48 g-N/L，对应处理能力高达1.8 kg-N/m²d。在150 A/m²时，NH₃回收受循环NH₄⁺传输（与NH₃逆向扩散相关）限制，同时电渗水通量增加。在高电流密度下，NH₃回收受电渗和渗透水通量限制，由电流密度和膜两侧的渗透压梯度驱动。尽管能耗（7–9 kWh/kg-N回收）与先前中试规模研究相当，本研究实现了更高的NH₃浓度和处理能力，并推进了机理理解。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.gloei.2026.06.004","t":"Economic dispatch optimization of off-grid wind solar complementary hydrogen synthesis ammonia system based on reverse chaos sparrow search algorithm","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.gloei.2026.06.004","s":"Global Energy Interconnection","d":"2026-07-17","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Off-grid wind-solar hydrogen and ammonia synthesis systems offer a promising route to reduce the grid impact of variable renewable generation and improve its utilization. However, the inherent intermittency and volatility of wind and solar power pose significant challenges to the stable and efficient operation of electrolysis and ammonia synthesis units. To address these issues, this study focuses on load-side ammonia supply and develops an economic dispatch model that integrates battery energy storage and hydrogen storage within an off-grid hybrid system. The model is solved using the reverse chaos sparrow search algorithm (RCSSA), and its performance is benchmarked against the original sparrow search algorithm (SSA) as well as other conventional algorithms. Case study results demonstrate that, compared with the original SSA, RCSSA reduces operating costs by approximately 7%, substantia","au":["Jianyu Yu","Huisheng Wang","Shiqi Yin","Hengli Quan","Biao Li","Xianhai Liu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于反向混沌麻雀搜索算法的离网风光互补制氢合成氨系统的经济调度优化","zb":"本研究开发了一个集成电池储能和氢储能的离网混合系统的经济调度模型，用于解决风能和太阳能的间歇性和波动性对电解和氨合成单元稳定高效运行的影响。模型采用反向混沌麻雀搜索算法（RCSSA）求解，并与原始麻雀搜索算法（SSA）和其他传统算法进行对比。案例研究结果表明，与原始SSA相比，RCSSA将运行成本降低约7%，显著减少迭代次数，并加速收敛。通过协调能源和氢储能，提出的调度策略在最小化系统总成本的同时确保了可靠的氨供应。"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.1906096","t":"Controlled Reactive Metal−Support Interactions in NiIn/CeO 2 Catalysts for Enhanced Methanol Synthesis from CO 2","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.1906096","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-07-16","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":27,"ab":"ABSTRACT Reactive metal‐support interactions (RMSIs) frequently occur under high‐temperature reaction conditions, leading to intricate reconstructions of metal‐oxide interfaces and alloy formation. Such uncontrollable features severely impede the optimization of catalytic performance. In this study, we demonstrate precise control over RMSIs by leveraging the high mobility of InO x on CeO 2 support under hydrogen reducing conditions—directly visualized by in situ environmental electron microscopy—in combination with the quantitative tuning of InO x content via atomic layer deposition. The resulting optimized catalyst delivers an exceptional space‐time yield of 1.67 g MeOH ·g cat −1 ·h −1 at 280°C in the CO 2 hydrogenation reaction, surpassing previously reported Ni‐based catalysts and even Pd‐based noble metal catalysts in the literature. In situ spectroscopic characterization reveals tha","au":["Qimeng Sun","Xinyu Liu","Yang Liu","Shichen Dong","Yan Xu","Wen Wen"],"o":"旧站本地库","w":["Junling Lu"],"why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"NiIn/CeO2催化剂中可控的活性金属-载体相互作用用于增强二氧化碳制甲醇","zb":"活性金属-载体相互作用（RMSIs）在高温反应条件下经常发生，导致金属-氧化物界面复杂重构和合金形成。此类不可控特征严重阻碍了催化性能的优化。本研究通过利用InOx在CeO2载体上在氢还原条件下的高流动性——通过原位环境电子显微镜直接可视化——并结合原子层沉积对InOx含量的定量调控，展示了对RMSIs的精确控制。所得优化催化剂在280°C下CO2加氢反应中表现出1.67 g MeOH ·g cat−1 ·h−1的优异时空产率，超过了文献中报道的Ni基催化剂，甚至Pd基贵金属催化剂。原位光谱表征表明，可控的RMSIs使InOx/NiIn界面得到优化，这促进了HCOO*向CH3O*的选择性转化，随后转化为甲醇，从而显著提高了甲醇生产。这些发现突出了精确调控RMSIs在合理设计高性能催化剂中的关键作用。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.est.2026.123547","t":"Preparation of defective porous carbon by hydrothermal carbonization coupled with rapid Joule heating from demineralized lignite for electrode materials of supercapacitors","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.est.2026.123547","s":"Journal of Energy Storage","d":"2026-07-16","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Ze Liang","Peng Zhang","Xutao Song","Xiang Lv","Mukun Xue","Jinglei Cui"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过水热碳化耦合快速焦耳热从脱矿质褐煤制备缺陷多孔碳用于超级电容器电极材料","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6ee01256f","t":"Robust organic–inorganic solid electrolyte interphase via in situ polymerization for lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ee01256f","s":"Energy & Environmental Science","d":"2026-07-16","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"In situ polymerization of trioxane reinforces the solid electrolyte interphase, suppressing surface fracture and ensuring homogeneous interfacial growth for stable lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction and enhanced ammonia faradaic efficiency.","au":["Yeongbae Jeon","Hyeongjun Kim","Chanhee Choi","Seong Hyeon Kweon","Ahee Choi","Bongseok Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"通过原位聚合制备稳健的有机-无机固体电解质界面用于锂介导的氮还原反应","zb":"原位聚合三氧杂环己烷强化固体电解质界面，抑制表面断裂，确保均匀界面生长，实现稳定的锂介导氮还原和氨法拉第效率提升。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c03344","t":"Cube-Cu 2 O/CoAl-Layered Double Hydroxide for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia: Spontaneous Nitrate Deoxygenation and Consecutive Hydrogenation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c03344","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-16","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) offers an attractive pathway for ammonia synthesis and nitrate remediation. However, its efficiency is constrained by sluggish proton-coupled electron transfer and strong competition from the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), both of which critically depend on the formation and transfer of active hydrogen (*H) intermediates. In this work, Cube-Cu 2 O/MAl-layered double hydroxides (M = Ni, Co, Mg) are constructed by a wet chemical reduction strategy. Comprehensive in situ spectroscopy and theoretical calculations demonstrate that varying the M 2+ cations in the MAl-LDH support can regulate the microenvironment of the Cu 2 O phase, among which the Cu 2 O on CoAl-LDH exhibits the fastest kinetics for driving the initial NO 3 − -to-NO 2 − step to proceed spontaneously. Moreover, the interfacial water structure is also tuned by the CoA","au":["Xinya Chen","Zhaohui Wu","Tianlei Qi","Ziheng Song","Yuhao Zheng","Xinyu Wang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Cube-Cu2O/CoAl-层状双氢氧化物用于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨：自发硝酸盐脱氧和连续加氢","zb":"研究电化学硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR）用于氨合成和硝酸盐修复。通过湿化学还原策略构建 Cube-Cu2O/MAl-层状双氢氧化物（M=Ni, Co, Mg）。研究表明，CoAl-LDH 载体调节 Cu2O 相的微环境，使 Cu2O/CoAl-LDH 在-0.48 V vs RHE 下实现 98.42%的法拉第效率和 37.4 mg cm-2 h-1 的氨产率率，优于多数报道的电催化剂。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.pmatsci.2026.101782","t":"Tailoring alloy catalysts for electrocatalytic conversion of pollutants to value-added chemicals: ammonia synthesis, CO2 reduction, Ures synthesis and plastic upcycling","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.pmatsci.2026.101782","s":"Progress in Materials Science","d":"2026-07-16","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Dengsheng Ma","Xiuqin Huo","Ming Chen","J K Chen","Cui Lai"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"为污染物电催化转化为高附加值化学品定制合金催化剂：氨合成、CO2 还原、Ures 合成和塑料升级再造","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74565","t":"Fe‐Co‐Ni Ternary Single‐Atom Catalysts for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74565","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-16","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrochemical nitrate reduction offers a sustainable route to water remediation and ammonia synthesis, yet its activity and selectivity are fundamentally limited by scaling relationships of single‐metal active sites. Here, we report a non‐equilibrium strategy that enables the construction of atomically dispersed FeCoNi trimetallic single‐atom catalyst. In‐situ experiments and theoretical calculations reveal that synergistic metal centers stabilize nitric oxide and promote its hydrogenation with a reduced activation barrier. The catalyst achieves an excellent Faradaic efficiency of 99.4% and a yield rate of 650 µmol h −1 cm −2 in 1 M KOH with 100 mM nitrate, placing it among the top‐performing multi‐metal single‐atom catalysts. Integration into a zinc‐nitrate battery enables simultaneous nitrate removal, sustained electricity generation, and continuous ammonia production. This ","au":["Jiale Zhang","Xi Zhang","T R Wang","Wang Zhang","Sheng Cheng","Xiandi Sun"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Fe-Co-Ni 三元单原子催化剂用于高效的电化学硝酸盐还原","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原催化剂，采用非平衡策略构建了原子分散的 FeCoNi 三金属单原子催化剂，原位实验和理论计算揭示协同金属中心稳定了一氧化氮并促进了其加氢，降低了活化能。该催化剂在 1 M KOH 和 100 mM 硝酸盐中实现了 99.4% 的法拉第效率和 650 µmol h −1 cm −2 的产率速率，是性能顶尖的多金属单原子催化剂之一。将其集成到锌硝酸盐电池中可实现硝酸盐去除、持续发电和连续氨生产。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.70885","t":"Graphdiyne‐Stabilized Cobalt Oxyhydroxide Quantum Dots for Efficient Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.70885","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2026-07-16","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NtRR) offers a sustainable and promising alternative to the energy‐intensive Haber–Bosch process for ambient ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis. However, its practical application is limited by sluggish reaction kinetics and low selectivity due to competing side reactions. Herein, we demonstrate the in situ transformation of cobalt oxyhydroxide (CoOOH) nanosheets into a well‐defined quantum dot (QD) architecture induced by a graphdiyne (CoOOH@GDY). Experiments combined with theoretical results demonstrate that the noninteger charge transfer between sp‐C and Co atoms at the interface enables precise electronic modulation, the formation of abundant low‐coordination sites and grain boundaries, optimized adsorption ability for reaction intermediates, and high intrinsic catalytic activity. As a result, the obtained CoOOH@GDY electrocatalyst exhibited ex","au":["Qi Wang","Yurui Xue","Lu Qi","Zhiqiang Zheng","Zhaoyang Chen","Yuliang Li"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"石墨炔稳定钴氧羟基量子点用于高效的硝酸盐到氨的电催化","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐还原反应（NtRR）催化剂，通过原位转化钴氧羟基（CoOOH）纳米片为石墨炔诱导的量子点（CoOOH@GDY）结构，实验结合理论结果表明 sp–C 和 Co 原子界面处的非整数电荷转移实现了精确的电子调制，形成了丰富的低配位位点和晶界，优化了反应中间体的吸附能力，提高了本征催化活性。CoOOH@GDY 电催化剂表现出优异的 NtRR 性能，在 1 M KOH 和 0.1 M NO 3 − 中法拉第效率为 98.01%，氨产率速率为 1644 µmol h −1 cm −2，并具有高操作稳定性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/app16147152","t":"Modeling of Transient Discharge Dynamics in an N2/H2 Planar Dielectric Barrier Discharge with Catalyst-Coated Barrier","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/app16147152","s":"Applied Sciences","d":"2026-07-16","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Plasma-catalytic ammonia synthesis can operate without high temperatures and pressures, and its performance is closely tied to discharge modes. However, research on its microscopic discharge mechanisms remains limited. A 2D fluid model incorporating plasma-activated heterogeneous reactions was developed to investigate voltage polarity effects on discharge dynamics in an N2/H2 planar dielectric barrier discharge (DBD) reactor with catalyst-coated barriers. Under both polarities, discharge starts as a gas-phase streamer at the catalyst apex due to local field enhancement and then evolves into a surface ionization wave (SIW) with an order-of-magnitude higher electron density. Positive voltage restricts the SIW to the catalyst surface, whereas negative voltage induces SIWs on both the upper bare dielectric and the catalyst, driven by distinct charge accumulation patterns. During the short di","au":["Yashuang Zheng","Chuangxin Du"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"模型化带有催化剂涂覆屏障的 N2/H2 平面介质阻挡放电的瞬态放电动力学","zb":"研究 N2/H2 平面介质阻挡放电（DBD）反应器中电压极性对放电动力学的影响。2D 流体模型结合等离子体活化非均相反应，发现正电压将放电限制在催化剂表面，负电压则诱导裸露介电层和催化剂上的表面电离波（SIW），正电压下氨峰值密度（2.85×1019 m-3）高于负电压（8.10×1018 m-3）。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ecmx.2026.102150","t":"Two-layer optimal sizing of electric-hydrogen-ammonia coupled system based on refined device characteristics and multi-scale power mapping","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ecmx.2026.102150","s":"Energy Conversion and Management X","d":"2026-07-16","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electric-hydrogen-ammonia coupled system (EHAS) is a promising solution for mitigating multi-time-scale supply–demand imbalance under high renewable energy penetration. Existing optimal sizing methods rely on simplified models, limiting their ability to capture refined device characteristics. To bridge this gap, a two-layer optimal sizing method considering refined operating characteristics of devices and multi-scale power mapping is proposed. First, refined device models are established, which take into account the lifetime degradation cost of various devices and the multi-steady-state load operating characteristics of Haber-Bosch ammonia synthesis process (HB), providing an accurate basis for operation simulation. Second, a multi-stage operation simulation method based on multi-scale net power decomposition and mapping is proposed to capture multi-time-scale energy fluctuations and","au":["Yiran Wang","Jian Chen","Yuanzhang Zhao","Wen Zhang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于精细设备特性和多尺度功率映射的电-氢-氨耦合系统双层最优尺寸","zb":"研究对象为电-氢-氨耦合系统（EHAS），提出了一种考虑设备精细操作特性和多尺度功率映射的双层最优尺寸方法。首先建立精细设备模型，考虑各种设备的寿命退化成本和哈伯-博施氨合成过程（HB）的多稳态负载操作特性，为运行模拟提供准确基础。其次，提出基于多尺度净功率分解和映射的多阶段运行模拟方法，捕捉多时间尺度能量波动，提高储能利用率和计算效率。然后，开发双层最优尺寸框架以最小化系统总成本，集成寿命退化和供需平衡，并通过精英差分加速模式搜索（EDAPS）算法求解。该框架通过多能源存储技术的协调运行，有效降低了寿命退化和系统总成本。结果表明，与传统时间尺度特征提取和典型周聚类方法相比，分别降低了 12.3% 和 8.0% 的误差，与不考虑设备退化的基准案例相比，总成本降低了 1.99%。该方法在考虑设备操作特性和系统经济性的同时提高了计算效率，提供了可靠的方法论。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74649","t":"Machine Learning‐Assisted Screening of Non‐Adjacent Dual‐Atom Catalysts on N‐Doped Graphene: Insights Into the Electron “Storage‐Feedback” Mechanism for N 2 Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74649","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-16","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Conventional dual‐atom catalysts (DACs) for the nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) primarily rely on adjacent metal sites to achieve synergistic effects. However, this configuration often suffers from inherent limitations such as steric hindrance, restricted active site density, and difficulty in finely tuning electronic interactions between metal centers, which collectively hinder catalytic performance under practical conditions. To address these challenges, we propose a novel class of bimetallic electrocatalysts featuring non‐adjacent dual‐atom sites anchored on N‐doped graphene (denoted as TM A TM B @NG II ), in contrast to the widely studied adjacent‐site counterparts (TM A TM B @NG I ). Through a combined approach of density functional theory (DFT) calculations and machine learning (ML), we systematically predict 784 transition metal combinations and identify V‐Os@NG II as a","au":["Cheng He","Z H Jiang","Wenxue Zhang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"在 N-掺杂石墨烯上非相邻双原子催化剂的机器学习辅助筛选：N2 还原中电子“存储-反馈”机制的见解","zb":"传统的用于氮还原反应 (NRR) 的双原子催化剂 (DACs) 主要依赖于相邻的金属位点来实现协同效应。然而，这种配置通常存在固有限制，例如空间位阻、活性位点密度受限以及金属中心之间电子相互作用的精细调节困难，这些因素共同阻碍了在实际条件下的催化性能。为了解决这些挑战，我们提出了一种新型双金属电催化剂，其特征在于非相邻的双原子位点锚定在 N-掺杂石墨烯上（表示为 TM A TM B @NG II ，与广泛研究的相邻位点对应物 (TM A TM B @NG I ) 相比）。通过结合密度泛函理论 (DFT) 计算和机器学习 (ML)，我们系统地预测了 784 种过渡金属组合，并确定了 V-Os@NG II 是一种非常有前景的催化剂，而 Mn-Cd@NG II 被选为代表 ML 预测的候选者进行完整路径验证。机理研究表明，这是一种前所未有的电子“存储-反馈”机制，这与相邻位点系统中观察到的传统协","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/exp.20240515","t":"Optimization of Lithium‐Mediated Nitrogen Reduction via Electrolyte Engineering","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/exp.20240515","s":"Exploration","d":"2026-07-15","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia serves as a fundamental precursor for nitrogen-based chemicals in both agriculture and industry, which is mainly produced by the Haber-Bosch process. Lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction (LiNR) has emerged as a promising alternative to the Haber-Bosch process, though further optimization of its performance is required. Based on the reaction mechanism of the LiNR process, we contend that electrolyte engineering is a pivotal method for optimization in LiNR and other metal-mediated nitrogen reduction processes (MNR). By merging insights from both LiNR and battery research, several strategies have been proposed, including composition regulation, development of non-liquid electrolytes, and decoupling the catholyte and anolyte. The perspective highlights the critical role of electrolyte engineering and inspires further refinement of MNR, contributing to greener and more efficient ammoni","au":["Xiyang Cai","Kaixiang Wang","Ruilin Wang","Liuxuan Luo","Shuiyun Shen","Guanghua Wei"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过电解质工程优化锂介导的氮还原","zb":"研究对象为锂介导的氮还原（LiNR）过程，关键方法是电解质工程，包括成分调节、非液体电解质开发和阴极室与阳极室解耦等策略，主要结果为电解质工程对金属介导的氮还原（MNR）过程的优化起关键作用，有助于更绿色高效的氨合成。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/celc.202600005","t":"Engineering Cu, Mn, and Co‐Modified Graphene/Ferrites on Gas Diffusion Layers Electrodes for Efficient Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/celc.202600005","s":"ChemElectroChem","d":"2026-07-15","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Graphene with spinel ferrites (MFe 2 O 4 , M: Mn, Co, and Cu) is excellent low‐cost material as electrocatalysts for ammonia synthesis. This study investigated the enhanced electrocatalytic efficiency of GDL/graphene‐MnFe 2 O 4 , GDL/graphene‐CoFe 2 O 4 , and GDL/graphene‐CuFe 2 O 4 for the reduction of nitrogen (N 2 ) and addressed gaps in ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis via electrocatalytic N 2 reduction, seeking decentralized, low‐carbon alternatives to the Haber–Bosch process. The materials were synthesized using water rich in natural organic matter as a solvent and were deposited onto a gas diffusion layer (GDL) electrode using the drop‐coating method. The main results highlighted the efficiency of all electrodes, but a higher yield was obtained for GDL/graphene‐MnFe 2 O 4 , which reached 48 µg h −1 cm −2 and a faradaic efficiency of 56%. These findings highlight the influence of transiti","au":["Clécia Andrade dos Santos","Marina Medina","Luciane Pimenta Cruz Romão","Maria Valnice Boldrín Zanoni"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"在气体扩散层电极上工程化 Cu、Mn 和 Co-改性石墨烯/铁氧体用于高效电催化氮还原为氨","zb":"研究 GDL/石墨烯-MnFe2O4、GDL/石墨烯-CoFe2O4 和 GDL/石墨烯-CuFe2O4 电极的电催化效率。通过水富集天然有机物的溶剂和滴涂法合成材料，GDL/石墨烯-MnFe2O4 实现了 48 µg h-1 cm-2 的产率和 56% 的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/catal16070642","t":"A Mild Substitution–Polymerization Strategy Enables Non-Invasive Hydrogel Stabilization of Electrocatalysts for Nitrate-to-Ammonium Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/catal16070642","s":"Catalysts","d":"2026-07-15","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The insufficient durability of electrocatalysts constitutes a critical bottleneck for electrocatalytic nitrate-to-ammonium reduction (NRA), and most existing stabilization strategies are implemented under harsh modification conditions. Herein, a sequential polymerization substitution polymerization strategy is proposed to fabricate a porous NDI-PPy conductive hydrogel catalytic electrode on a self-supported Ag-FeOOH substrate. Initially, an ND hydrogel network is constructed through the copolymerization of N-acryloxysuccinimide (NAS) and N,N-dimethylacrylamide (DMA). Amine-rich aromatic units were subsequently introduced through mild substitution with 4,4′-iminodianiline (IDA) to form the NDI hydrogel, and conductive polypyrrole (PPy) is further grown via Fe3+-triggered in situ polymerization of pyrrole. This non-invasive strategy is designed to preserve the catalytic functionality of th","au":["Yanhui Xu","Rongjun Xia","Xingxing Ji","Jiwen Hu","Fangzhi Huang"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"温和的取代-聚合策略使电催化剂非侵入性水凝胶稳定化用于硝酸盐到铵的转化","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐到铵的还原（NRA），关键方法是制备 NDI-PPy 导电水凝胶催化电极，主要结果为优化电极表现出 89.34% NO3−-N 去除效率，94.27% NH4+-N 选择性，89.53% 法拉第效率，2.95 mg h−1 cm−2 的 NH4+-N 产率率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6cp02081j","t":"Ternary synergy and structural effects in Heusler X 2 YZ (X = Ru, Os) alloys for efficient nitrogen reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cp02081j","s":"Physical Chemistry Chemical Physics","d":"2026-07-15","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This study explores the NRR performance of Ru/Os-based Heusler alloys via DFT. Ru 2 HfGa is the best catalyst with −0.34 V limiting potential and high selectivity. Ternary charge synergy and atomic size effects yield a cliff-type activity relationship.","au":["GeLiang Wu","Jing Zhou","Dingwang Yuan"],"o":"回填","why":["NRR"],"zt":"Heusler X 2 YZ (X = Ru, Os) 合金中三元协同效应和结构效应对高效氮还原为氨的影响","zb":"研究对象为 Ru/Os 基 Heusler 合金，关键方法是 DFT 计算，主要结果为 Ru 2 HfGa 合金具有最优性能，极限电势为 −0.34 V，高选择性，三元电荷协同和原子尺寸效应产生陡峭的活性关系。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1002/chem.71414","t":"Bismuth Chalcogenide‐Based Photocatalysts for Nitrogen Reduction: Recent Progress and Prospects","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/chem.71414","s":"Chemistry - A European Journal","d":"2026-07-15","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Bismuth chalcogenides and related bismuth‐based materials have recently attracted considerable attention as promising photocatalysts for sustainable nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) due to their unique electronic structures, visible‐light responsiveness, stereochemically active Bi 6s 2 lone pair, and tunable band positions that facilitate nitrogen adsorption and activation. This review summarizes recent advances in the rational design of bismuth chalcogenide‐based photocatalysts for light‐driven ammonia synthesis. Fundamental aspects of photocatalytic N 2 reduction and reliable methodologies for ammonia quantification are critically discussed. Material engineering strategies, including defect modulation, elemental doping, heterojunction construction (Type‐II, Z‐scheme, and S‐scheme systems), and hybrid structural design, are analyzed with respect to charge separation and band a","au":["Mukesh Kumar Verma","Muhammad D. Bala","Phindile B. Khoza","Tshephiso R. Papo","Mzamo L. Shozi"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于铋硫族化合物光催化剂的氮还原：最新进展与前景","zb":"铋硫族化合物及其相关材料因独特的电子结构、可见光响应、立体化学活性 Bi6s2 独对电子和可调带位而成为可持续氮还原反应（NRR）的光催化剂。综述了铋硫族化合物基光催化剂在光驱动氨合成中的理性设计进展，讨论了光催化 N2 还原的基础和氨定量方法，分析了缺陷调制、元素掺杂、异质结构建（Type-II、Z-方案和 S-方案系统）和混合结构设计等策略对电荷分离和带调谐的影响，并强调了低 N2 活化效率、竞争析氢反应、电荷复合和可重复性等挑战。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1039/d6fd00092d","t":"Catalyst-driven pathways to novel reactors for green ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6fd00092d","s":"Faraday Discussions","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"A detailed model-based analysis compares the operation of a conventional adiabatic Haber–Bosch reactor and an externally direct-cooled polytropic fixed-bed reactor, assessing how catalyst improvements affect reactor performance and design.","au":["Lukas Gottheil","Jens Bremer"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"催化剂驱动的绿色氨合成新型反应器路径","zb":"基于详细模型分析了传统绝热哈伯-博施反应器与外置直接冷却多变固定床反应器的运行情况，评估了催化剂改进对反应器性能和设计的影响。"},{"id":"10.2172/3685157","t":"Synthesis of High Entropy Alloy Catalysts Using Flash Joule Heating [POSTER]","u":"https://doi.org/10.2172/3685157","s":"","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Braden Williams","Matthew N. Gordon","Taylor Adams"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"利用闪焦耳热合成高熵合金催化剂 [海报]","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7118380","t":"Spent Lithium Iron Phosphate-Mediated Flash Joule Heating for Inducing Amorphization Transformation of Fly Ash towards High-Efficiency Recovery of Valuable Components","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7118380","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The stable mullite structure in fly ash (FA) and the stubborn olivine structure in spent lithium iron phosphate cathode materials (SLFP) are the core challenges restricting the metal resource utilization of these two types of solid wastes. This study innovatively proposes a new method of flash Joule heating (FJH) synergistic conversion of SLFP and FA (SLFP-FJH). This strategy utilizes the high-temperature shock generated during the FJH process to induce an in-situ reaction between SLFP and FA. Among them, the Li+ and Fe2+ released by the decomposition of SLFP act as charge compensation ions, effectively balancing the negative charge gap produced by [AlO4]5- replacing [SiO4]4- in mullite, promoting the fracture of the stable Bridging Oxygen in mullite and reconstituting the highly active amorphous glass phase. The effects of material ratio, FJH treatment temperature and time, and leaching","au":["SiQi Jiang","Tanzila Anjum","Tianqi Kong","Aimin Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"废旧磷酸铁锂介导的闪焦耳热诱导粉煤灰非晶化转变实现高效回收有价值组分","zb":"稳定莫来石结构是粉煤灰（FA）的核心挑战，而废旧磷酸铁锂负极材料（SLFP）中难处理的橄榄石结构限制了金属资源利用。本研究创新性地提出 SLFP 和 FA（SLFP-FJH）的闪焦耳热（FJH）协同转化新方法。该策略利用 FJH 过程产生的高温冲击诱导 SLFP 和 FA 之间的原位反应。其中，SLFP 分解释放的 Li⁺ 和 Fe²⁺ 作为电荷补偿离子，有效平衡莫来石中 [AlO₄]⁵⁻ 替代 [SiO₄]⁴⁻ 产生的负电荷间隙，促进莫来石中稳定桥氧的断裂并重构高活性的非晶玻璃相。系统研究了材料配比、FJH 处理温度和时间、浸出剂浓度对金属浸出率的影响。结合 XRD、FT-IR、拉曼和 XPS 分析，揭示了莫来石向非晶相转变的结构演化机制和电荷平衡机制。动力学研究表明，SLFP-FJH 产物的浸出过程符合阿夫拉米模型。结果表明，1800 °C 处理 8 s 后，Al 和 Li 的浸出率分","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系｜焦耳热用于制备","pre":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7117864","t":"Fabrication of SiCN Aerogels by Joule Heating: Highly Efficient Preparation of Ultrathin Broadband Absorbing Materials for Radar Stealth Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7117864","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"In view of the fact that the existing absorbing materials are difficult to take into account the comprehensive indexes of thin, light, wide and strong, the technical bottlenecks of high energy consumption and long cycle of traditional preparation process, this study combines polymer-derived ceramics (PDCs) and Joule rapid heating process to prepare high-performance SiCN aerogel. Raman characterization results confirm that the Joule heating sample has higher defect density and smaller graphite domain size, and can introduce more polarization loss sites than the tube furnace sample. Prepared via rapid sintering at 1100 °C, the PDN-1100 sample exhibits an RLmin of -53.49 dB at an ultrathin thickness of 1.55 mm and an EAB of 5.25 GHz, featuring strong attenuation and a broad absorption band. Microscopic and phase analysis show that the wave absorption performance of the material is synergist","au":["Daidi Liu","Yurun Feng","Lanzhe Guo","Xiaofan Wang","Hui Tang","Kaidi Mao"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"焦耳热法制备 SiCN 气凝胶：用于雷达隐身应用的超薄宽带吸收材料的高效制备","zb":"为解决现有吸收材料难以兼顾薄、轻、宽、强等综合指标及传统制备工艺高能耗、长周期的技术瓶颈，本研究结合聚合物衍生陶瓷（PDCs）与焦耳快速加热工艺制备高性能 SiCN 气凝胶。拉曼表征证实，焦耳加热样品具有更高的缺陷密度和更小的石墨域尺寸，比管式炉样品引入更多极化损耗位点。通过 1100 °C 快速烧结制备的 PDN-1100 样品在 1.55 mm 超薄厚度下具有 -53.49 dB 的最小反射损耗（RLmin）和 5.25 GHz 的吸收带宽，表现出强衰减和宽带吸收特性。微观和物相分析表明，材料的波吸收性能由石墨化程度和多相界面协同调控，多种损耗协同高效耗散电磁波。雷达散射截面模拟证明，该材料的远场隐身控制能力突出。经超结构优化后，其雷达散射截面抑制效果比理想导体高 14.61 dBm²，具有优异的隐身应用价值。基于该材料构建隐身天线模型，可为设备隐身工程落地提供支持。本研究揭示了焦耳热","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/cey2.70330","t":"Strongly‐Anchored Ionomer‐Free Anode Catalyst Layer Fabricated via Joule Heating Achieves Efficient Electron/Mass Transfer for Acidic Water Electrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cey2.70330","s":"Carbon Energy","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT Conventional ionomer‐based membrane electrode assemblies (MEAs) in proton exchange membrane water electrolysis (PEMWE) suffer from severe catalyst agglomeration and high interfacial resistance, especially at ultralow iridium loadings. These issues, stemming from the insulating nature and uneven distribution of ionomers, significantly restrict electron and mass transport. Herein, we present a novel ionomer‐free anode catalyst layer (ACL) fabricated via a rapid Joule heating method, which partially anchors IrO 2 nanoparticles into the proton exchange membrane (PEM) to form an ultrathin (~0.7 μm), dense, and crack‐free ACL, forming a robust mechanical anchoring interface. The resulting MEA with ionomer‐free ACL structure (MEA‐J) effectively mitigates ionomer‐induced catalyst agglomeration and adhesion failure, achieving 99.7% catalyst electronic connectivity, a fivefold increase in","au":["Yuyang Wang","Shuheng Zhang","Haokai Xu","Xianqing Zhu","Jian Huang","Liang Zhang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"通过焦耳热制备强锚固无离子膜阳极催化剂层实现高效电子/质量传输用于酸性水电解","zb":"传统的基于离子膜的膜电极组件（MEAs）在质子交换膜水电解（PEMWE）中存在严重的催化剂团聚和高界面电阻问题，尤其是在超低铱负载量下。这些问题源于离子膜的绝缘性和不均匀分布，显著限制了电子和质量传输。本研究提出了一种通过快速焦耳热方法制备的新型无离子膜阳极催化剂层（ACL），将IrO2纳米颗粒部分锚定到质子交换膜（PEM）中，形成厚度约0.7 μm、致密无裂纹的ACL，形成坚固的机械锚定界面。所得离子膜ACL结构（MEA-J）有效缓解了离子膜诱导的催化剂团聚和粘附失效，实现了99.7%的催化剂电子连接性，体积活性面积增加了五倍，界面粘附强度提高了十倍以上，与传统的MEA相比。格子玻尔兹曼模拟进一步验证了离子膜ACL中形成的连续和共形的含水膜作为质子/水传输的有效途径，与水合体相离子膜相当。MEA-J在2.0 V下电流密度为3.1 A·cm−2，铱负载量仅为0.2 mg Ir·cm−2，并","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1051/epjap/2026009/pdf","t":"Molecular dynamics simulations of thin film and coatings: a review","u":"https://doi.org/10.1051/epjap/2026009/pdf","s":"Springer Link (Chiba Institute of Technology)","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"The synthesis of thin films and coatings constitutes a cornerstone of modern materials science, underpinning technologies ranging from semiconductor logic gates to tribological barriers and catalytic membranes. Over the last decades, the need for precise control over film microstructure has driven a transition towards highly energetic processes, such as High Power Impulse Magnetron Sputtering (HiPIMS), and chemically complex methods like Atomic Layer Deposition (ALD) and solution-based processing. While continuum models effectively classify growth regimes based on macroscopic parameters, they inherently lack the resolution to describe the discrete atomic assembly processes—nucleation, island coalescence, and defect formation—that define functional performance. This review presents a comprehensive survey of Molecular Dynamics (MD) simulations applied to thin film growth. We detail the evo","au":["Pascal Brault"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"薄膜和涂层分子动力学模拟综述","zb":"薄膜和涂层的合成是现代材料科学的核心，支撑着从半导体逻辑门到减摩屏障和催化膜等技术的开发。在过去的几十年里，对薄膜微观结构的精确控制需求推动了向高能过程（如高功率脉冲磁控溅射（HiPIMS））和化学复杂方法（如原子层沉积（ALD）和溶液法处理）的转变。虽然连续模型基于宏观参数有效地对生长机制进行分类，但它们本质上缺乏描述定义功能性能的离散原子组装过程（成核、岛状物合并和缺陷形成）的分辨率。本综述全面概述了应用于薄膜生长的分子动力学（MD）模拟。详细介绍了原子间势的演变，从经典描述（EAM、Tersoff）到反应力场（ReaxFF）和新兴的机器学习势（MLIP）。综述批判性地分析了MD对有机系统（等离子体聚合物、自组装单层、溶剂蒸发）和无机涂层（金属、复杂氧化物、高熵合金）的贡献。MD展示了它如何弥合等离子体物理和材料工程之间的差距，为密度、固有应力和粗糙度提供预测缩放定律。此外，通过回顾将","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaenm.6c00494","t":"Amorphous MoS x –FeOOH Electrocatalyst for Selective Nitrate-to-Ammonia Conversion via Enhanced Intermediate Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaenm.6c00494","s":"ACS Applied Engineering Materials","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia offers a sustainable route for both nitrogen recovery and decentralized ammonia production but remains limited by low selectivity and competing hydrogen evolution. Here, we report an amorphous MoSx–FeOOH electrocatalyst synthesized via a simple two-step electrodeposition method on carbon paper. The FeOOH-modified MoSx structure promotes the reduction of nitrate-derived intermediates, leading to enhanced ammonia selectivity. The MoSx–FeOOH catalyst achieves a Faradaic efficiency of 93.3% and an NH3 yield rate of 400 μg h–1 cm–2 at −0.35 V vs RHE (reversible hydrogen electrode) in a neutral electrolyte, outperforming MoSx by more than four times. The improved performance is attributed to the electronic modulation of MoSx and the formation of surface MoOx species, which facilitate intermediate conversion and mitigate hydrogen evolution. ","au":["Caio V.S. Almeida","Lucia Helena Mascaro"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"非晶态MoSx-FeOOH电催化剂用于通过增强中间体还原实现硝酸盐到氨的选择性转化","zb":"采用两步电沉积法在碳纸上合成非晶态MoSx–FeOOH电催化剂，FeOOH改性的MoSx结构促进硝酸盐衍生的中间体还原，提高氨选择性。在中性电解质中，-0.35 V vs RHE下，法拉第效率为93.3%，氨产率率为400 μg h–1 cm–2，性能优于MoSx。电子调制和表面MoOx物种的形成促进了中间体转化并抑制了析氢反应。催化剂在长时间电解和循环中表现出稳定性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpclett.6c01842","t":"Mechanistic Insights into Ammonia Synthesis from Nitrogen and Water Microdroplets","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.6c01842","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry Letters","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH 3 ), the second most produced chemical globally, is predominantly synthesized via the traditional, energy-intensive Haber–Bosch process. Increasing attention has been devoted to exploring alternative methods for NH 3 synthesis that can be driven by renewable energy and operated under mild conditions. Recently, ammonia formation from nitrogen and water microdroplets at room temperature and ambient pressure has been proposed. In this work, using ab initio molecular dynamics (AIMD) simulations, we reveal the pivotal role of hydrated electrons in microdroplets for the nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) and propose that the associative–dissociative mechanism is the dominant pathway for nitrogen reduction at the microdroplet interface. This mechanism comprises two key steps: (i) nitrogen is reduced via an associative mechanism to form two potential intermediates, *NHNH 3 and *NH 2 N","au":["Qiuyue Zhang","Bo Tang","Zhenyu Li"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"氨合成从氮和水微滴的机理洞察","zb":"采用ab initio分子动力学（AIMD）模拟研究氮和水微滴中的氮还原反应（NRR），揭示水合电子在微滴中的关键作用，并提出关联-解离机制是微滴界面氮还原的主导途径。该机制包括两步：氮通过关联机制还原形成*NHNH3和*NH2NH2两个中间体，随后*NHNH3和*NH2NH2发生N-N键断裂生成氨。*NH2NH2作为氮还原过程中的中间体，与实验结果一致。此外，H2O、*OH和*H2O等物种可作为质子供体，表面吸附的*H2O在促进反应中起重要作用。"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpcc.6c03053","t":"Electrodeposited Bismuth on Copper for Enhanced Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction to Ammonia through Surface Oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpcc.6c03053","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry C","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (eNRR) offers a sustainable route to ammonia synthesis under ambient conditions, but achieving high selectivity over the competing hydrogen evolution reaction remains a challenge. Here, we report the synthesis and electrochemical evaluation of bimetallic bismuth-on-copper (Cu/Bi) catalysts prepared by electrodeposition at three potentials (0.01 V, −0.29 V, and −0.59 V vs RHE) on Cu substrates, with and without a subsequent electrooxidation treatment. The Cu/Bi electrode deposited at −0.29 V and subsequently oxidized achieves the highest Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 25% and an NH 3 production rate of 5.7 μg cm –2 h –1 at 0 V vs RHE, nearly doubling the FE of its nonoxidized counterpart. X-ray diffraction, scanning electron microscopy, atomic force microscopy, and contact angle measurements collectively demonstrate that the electrooxidation st","au":["David K. Stem","Matthew R. Shaver","Macy A. Hopping","Christopher J. Barile"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"电沉积的铋在铜上用于通过表面氧化增强电化学氮还原为氨","zb":"电化学氮还原反应 (eNRR) 为在环境条件下合成氨提供了一条可持续的途径，但实现高选择性以克服竞争的析氢反应仍然是一个挑战。在这里，我们报告了通过在铜基板上以三种电位（0.01 V、−0.29 V 和 −0.59 V vs RHE）电沉积制备的双金属铋-铜 (Cu/Bi) 催化剂的合成和电化学评估，以及随后的电氧化处理（有和没有）。在 −0.29 V 电沉积并随后氧化的 Cu/Bi 电极实现了最高的法拉第效率 (FE) 为 25%，在 0 V vs RHE 下 NH 3 产量为 5.7 μg cm –2 h –1，几乎是它的非氧化对应物的两倍。X 射线衍射、扫描电子显微镜、原子力显微镜和接触角测量共同表明，在 −0.29 V 电沉积的电极中，金属 Bi 被选择性地转化为晶体 Bi 2 O 3，伴随着表面重构为板状氧化物晶体和表面粗糙度的增加。电化学活性表面积测量证实，性能的提高源于位点密","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c02077","t":"Boron-Modified Ni–Cu Heterostructure Electrocatalyst for Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c02077","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrochemical nitrate reduction represents a dual-functional strategy for sustainable ammonia production and the remediation of nitrate-laden water. Developing robust electrocatalysts that combine high activity, selectivity, and stability is essential to realizing this potential. Herein, we report a boron-modified nickel–copper heterostructure catalyst (B–Ni2(CO3)(OH)2/Cu(OH)2/CF) for the nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR). The catalyst achieves an impressive ammonia yield of 6.8 mg h–1 cm–2 with a Faradaic efficiency of 92.0% at −0.7 V (vs RHE) in 0.1 M PBS with 0.1 M NO3–, while demonstrating strong durability over extended operation. Mechanistic studies reveal that boron doping induces surface BOx species and modulates the electronic structure of Ni sites, enhancing nitrate activation and hydrogenation kinetics. This work highlights the promise of boron doping in designing ","au":["Zhicheng Wang","Wei Wang","Fang Han","Yun Hu","Qingqing Guo","TianYu Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"硼改性镍-铜异质结构电催化剂用于硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR），采用硼改性的镍-铜异质结构催化剂（B–Ni2(CO3)(OH)2/Cu(OH)2/CF），在0.1 M PBS溶液中，-0.7 V（vs RHE）下氨产率为6.8 mg h–1 cm–2，法拉第效率为92.0%，表现出良好的稳定性。硼掺杂引入表面BOx物种并调节镍位点的电子结构，增强硝酸盐活化和加氢动力学。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.156572","t":"Electroreduction-induced in situ surface reconstruction of grain boundary-rich Co3O4 enhancing electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2026.156572","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Tao Sun","Yue Wang","Zenghui Li","Anning Jiang","Lijuan Yang","JiJun Feng"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"电还原诱导的晶界丰富的 Co3O4 表面重构增强电催化氨合成","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.179454","t":"Air plasma-assisted NOx− supply for efficient ammonia production on oxygen vacancy-defective NiCuGe-oxide nanorod films","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.179454","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Quoc‐Nam Ha","Yan-Wei Huang","Dong–Hau Kuo"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"空气等离子体辅助的 NOx− 供应用于高效氨生产在氧空位缺陷的 NiCuGe-氧化物纳米棒薄膜上","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74561","t":"Bifunctional Cu 2 O@CoMoO 4 for Synergistic Photothermal‐Electrocatalytic Ammonia Production From Nitrate Coupled With Glucose Oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74561","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT The Photoelectrocatalytic nitrate reduction (PEC NO 3 RR) for ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis offers a promising pathway to address global nitrogen cycle synthesis; however, current systems remain insufficient for industrial applications, addressing the issue of sluggish nitric acid reduction kinetics and competitive hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). In this study, the photothermal Cu 2 O@CoMoO 4 composite was synthesized via a hydrothermal method and applied to PEC NO 3 RR. Under an applied potential of −1.6 V (vs. RHE), the catalyst exhibited an excellent NH 3 yield rate of 5.4 mmol h −1 cm −2 and a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 96%. Furthermore, Cu 2 O@CoMoO 4 also demonstrated high catalytic activity for the glucose oxidation reaction (GOR). In a 0.5 M Na 2 SO 4 solution containing 100 mmol L −1 glucose, the conversion rate reached 72.5%. Based on these results, we constructed a PE","au":["Chenyang Zhou","Lei Zhang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"双功能 Cu 2 O@CoMoO 4 用于协同光热-电催化硝酸盐与葡萄糖氧化联产氨","zb":"研究对象为光电催化硝酸盐还原（PEC NO 3 RR），关键方法是合成 Cu 2 O@CoMoO 4 复合材料，主要结果为在 −1.6 V (vs. RHE) 下，NH 3 产率率为 5.4 mmol h −1 cm −2，法拉第效率（FE）为 96%，且对葡萄糖氧化反应（GOR）也表现出高活性。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化；涉及Fe/铁体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1088/1361-6595/ae8a7c","t":"High-concentration, long-lived aqueous nitric oxide via microwave plasma: electrochemical insights into self-regeneration","u":"https://doi.org/10.1088/1361-6595/ae8a7c","s":"Plasma Sources Science and Technology","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Nitric oxide (NO) is a multifunctional small molecule central to vascular regulation, wound healing, cellular signalling, and antimicrobial defence, while also functioning as a reactive intermediate in sustainable nitrogen and catalytic cycles. However, its rapid oxidation and poor stability in aqueous environments critically limit both biomedical and environmental applications of NO. Here, we report microwave-plasma-generated NO water ( μ PG-NOW) as a high-concentration and long-lived aqueous NO reservoir, providing a reagent-free and scalable platform for controlled NO generation. Electrochemical analyses using cyclic voltammetry and electrochemical impedance spectroscopy reveal record-high NO concentrations (300–2100 µ M) and exceptional stability (>1800 h), corresponding to a twelve-fold lifetime enhancement over conventional NO solutions. These properties originate from syn","au":["JaeWoo Park","Wonsun Kim","Juneyoung Kil","Myeonggyu Kim","Hyeryun Jeong","Kimin Lee"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"微波等离子体产生高浓度、长寿命的水合一氧化氮：电化学自再生洞察","zb":"微波等离子体生成的NO水（μ PG-NOW）作为高浓度、长寿命的水合NO储存库，提供无试剂、可扩展的控NO生成平台。循环伏安法和电化学阻抗谱显示NO浓度高达300–2100 µ M，稳定性>1800 h，寿命提升12倍。这些特性源于协同自脱氧和歧化驱动的再生，持续维持游离NO并加速氧化还原动力学，交换电流密度比酸化亚硝酸盐衍生的NO生成参考溶液高55倍。μ PG-NOW也作为温和、环保的试剂用于NiOx半导体的表面改性，实现其电子结构和界面能的重复调控。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ta03183h","t":"Bridging the ammonia-to-hydrogen energy vector: a review of catalyst innovation, mechanistic elucidation, and future prospects in NH 3 thermal-catalytic decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ta03183h","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2026-07-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Thermocatalytic ammonia decomposition is key to hydrogen supply. This review outlines recent progress, emphasizing reaction mechanisms, structure–activity relationships and catalyst design for efficient catalyst development.","au":["Kai Hu","Fang Dong","Xiuzi He","Zhicheng Tang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"连接氨到氢能向量：催化剂创新、机理阐明和氨热催化分解的未来展望","zb":"综述热催化氨分解的关键进展，强调反应机理、结构-活性关系和催化剂设计对高效催化剂开发的重要性。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzI2NzE3OTE1OA==&mid=2247488603&idx=1","t":"科研进展 | 汕头实验室在合成氨研究领域获得重要进展——钾助剂在合成氨催化剂中的活性氢新机制","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2NzE3OTE1OA%3D%3D&mid=2247488603&idx=1","s":"化学与精细化工广东省实验室","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:57Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"近日，汕头实验室王培坤副研究员与中国科学院大连化物所陈萍研究员、郭建平研究员合作在合成氨催化钾助剂作用机制研究中取得重要突破，相关成果以《Reactive hydrogen in KH or KOH for catalytic NH3 synthesis》为题在Cell旗下综合性学 在氢化钾或氢氧化钾中 使用反应性氢气进行催化合成氨 Research progress 近日，汕头实验室王培坤副研究员与中国科学院大连化物所陈萍研究员、郭建平研究员合作在合成氨催化钾助剂作用机制研究中取得重要突破，相关成果以《Reactive hydrogen in KH or KOH for catalytic NH3 synthesis》为题在Cell旗下综合性学术期刊 The Innovation（IF=39.5）上发表（DOI： 10.1016/j.xinn.2026.101435）。 研究背景 钾是工业铁基合成氨催化剂中不可或缺的经典助剂，其显著提升催化活性的现象已被发现逾百年，但钾在催化过程中的真实化学态与作用机理长期存在争议。传统观点多将钾视为电子助剂，认为其通过向铁提供电子促进氮气解离；而钾前驱体在反应条件下的存在形式、氢物种如何参与氮活化与氨生成等核心科学问题，仍未得到清晰阐明。 研究概况 针对上述问题，论文聚焦钾的不同化学态，系统对比研究了KH与KOH作为助剂时对碳纳米管负载铁催化剂（Fe/CNTs）合成氨性能的影响，从活性氢视角解析钾的促进机制。研究发现，KH与KOH 均可提升铁基催化剂的合成氨活性，但作用路径与效果存在差异。在 300℃、1MPa 条件下，KH体系活性较纯 Fe/CNTs 提升约两个数量级，是KOH体系的近6倍；其TOF约为 KOH 体系的3倍。 机理研究表明，两种钾助剂中的氢均直接参与氨的生成：KH 中的负氢（H⁻）具有强还原性，可与铁氮化物发生氧化还原，生成KNH₂中间体并释放活性铁位点，后续经氢气氢化高效生成氨；KOH 中的质子氢（H⁺）则通过质子化表面吸附氮，经KFeO与KNH₂中间体路径实现氨合成。同位素示踪实验直接证实，KH 与 KOH 中","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料","wx":1,"mt":["10.1016/j.xinn.2026.101435"]},{"id":"10.20944/preprints202607.0631.v2","t":"The Zeta-Minimizer Theorem: A Deductive Axiomatic Framework for Variational Thermodynamics, Chemical Equilibrium, and Heterogeneous Catalysis with Applications to Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.20944/preprints202607.0631.v2","s":"Preprints.org","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The Zeta-Minimizer Theorem (ZMT) furnishes a rigorous axiomatic foundation for thermodynamics through three principles—strict concave entropy maximization, uniform Gibbs free energy landscapes with spectral minima, and irreducibility enforced by perpetual bounded oscillations—augmented by helical geometry in which prime numbers emerge as indivisible cycle lengths. The multi-component grand-partition function Z(s) is constructed and establish its universal categorical invariance under functorial mappings, thereby providing a parameter-free backbone for equilibrium and dynamical phenomena. From this structure the thermodynamic conjugate pairs and variational Maxwell relations, the emergence of chemical equilibrium and the equilibrium constant are deductively derived directly from the grand potential, explicit fugacity coefficients, and a variational reaction-rate law governed by the analyt","au":["Muhamad Fouad"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"Zeta最小化定理：变分热力学、化学平衡与异相催化的演绎公理框架及其在氨合成中的应用","zb":"提出了Zeta最小化定理，构建了多组分巨配分函数并推导出化学平衡与反应速率定律，建立了异相催化界面条件及线性标度关系和Sabatier火山图的演绎起源，发展了氨合成循环分析与催化剂优化方法。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系","pre":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2026.140641","t":"Microwave-assisted fluidized bed reactors: Modeling and application to chemical looping ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2026.140641","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Kazem Adavi","Jaber Shabanian","Adrián Carrillo García","Hicham Haddar","Jamal Chaouki"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"微波辅助流化床反应器：建模及其在化学链氨合成中的应用","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141139","t":"Plasma-driven synthesis of amorphous/crystalline carbon-encapsulated Fe/MnO nanoclusters for efficient oxygen evolution reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141139","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"The development of high-performance, non-precious metal electrocatalysts for the oxygen evolution reaction (OER) is crucial for sustainable energy conversion. Herein, we report a rapid one-step synthesis of ternary Fe/MnO nanoclusters uniformly encapsulated within an amorphous/crystalline carbon matrix (FMC) via a direct current arc plasma method. This unique core–shell architecture emerges from the extreme temperature (~10 4 K) and millisecond-scale rapid quenching inherent to the plasma process, characterized by a highly graphitized outer carbon layer and an inner defective carbon region. The as-synthesized FMC catalyst exhibits outstanding OER activity in alkaline media, requiring a low overpotential of only 317 mV to achieve 10 mA cm −2 , with a small Tafel slope of 104.1 mV dec −1 , comparable with commercial RuO₂ and most reported transition metal-based catalysts. Comprehensive exp","au":["Xiaoping Dong","Ye Liao","Yuping Duan","Dongliang Fei","S H Li","Zhixiang Li"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["non-equilibrium synthesis"],"zt":"等离子体驱动合成非晶/结晶碳包覆的 Fe/MnO 纳米团簇用于高效析氧反应","zb":"为开发高性能非贵金属析氧反应（OER）电催化剂，本研究通过直流电弧等离子体方法，快速一步合成了三元 Fe/MnO 纳米团簇均匀包覆在非晶/结晶碳基质（FMC）中。这种独特的核壳结构源于等离子体过程产生的极端温度（~10⁴ K）和毫秒级快速淬火，具有高度石墨化的外碳层和内部缺陷碳区。合成的 FMC 催化剂在碱性介质中表现出优异的 OER 活性，仅需 317 mV 的过电位即可达到 10 mA cm⁻²，具有 104.1 mV dec⁻¹ 的小 Tafel 斜率，与商业 RuO₂ 和大多数报道的过渡金属基催化剂相当。综合实验研究和密度泛函理论（DFT）计算揭示，其优异性能源于三个关键因素的协同作用：Fe 和 MnO 之间的强电子耦合优化了氧中间体的吸附，碳层防止了纳米颗粒团聚并确保耐久性，以及非晶/结晶碳基质促进了电荷和质子传输。该工作为通过非平衡合成设计高效多组分电催化剂提供了新策略。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzE5ODM3NTI3Nw==&mid=2247484050&idx=1","t":"谁说省属高校没硬实力？福大拿下国家级科技大奖，狠狠打脸偏见","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzE5ODM3NTI3Nw%3D%3D&mid=2247484050&idx=1","s":"校大叔","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-09-30T19:10:00Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"福州大学实力逆袭，以第一完成单位身份，凭借江莉龙研究员主持的大型低压合成氨成套催化技术开发及产业化项目，斩获国家科学技术进步奖二等奖，含金量直接拉满！","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"wx":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.9522099","t":"Nonmetallic Si Doping Constructs Cu 2 O/Co–O–Si Tandem Sites for Neutral Nitrate Reduction Electrocatalysis Toward Ammonia Recovery and Energy‐Integrated Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.9522099","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"ABSTRACT The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) in neutral media is impeded by sluggish water dissociation and the lack of spatial coordination between distinct active phases. Here, we report a nonmetallic Si doping strategy to construct a Si‐CoCu@CF catalyst featuring a “Co–O–Si” interfacial bridge. This unique bonding motif not only regulates the in situ evolution of Cu 2 O but also establishes robust electronic communication between β ‑Co(OH) 2 and Cu 2 O, enabling a precisely engineered tandem catalytic cascade. The catalyst achieves a remarkable NH 3 yield rate of 26.6 mg h −1 cm −2 and a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 97.9% at –1.0 V vs. RHE, maintaining stability for 25 h in a neutral electrolyte of 100 mM NO 3 – + 0.5 M Na 2 SO 4 . Mechanistic studies reveal a clear functional division: Cu 2 O governs the swift deoxygenation of NO 3 – to NO 2 – , while the “Co–O–S","au":["Kunxuan Zhao","Yaxin Sun","X X Yang","Jingwen Pu","Yulan Shi","Pei Chen"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"非金属元素 Si 掺杂构建 Cu 2 O/Co–O–Si 联合位点用于中性硝酸盐还原电催化制氨及能源集成应用","zb":"研究对象为中性介质中硝酸盐还原反应（NO 3 RR），采用非金属元素 Si 掺杂策略构建 Si‐CoCu@CF 催化剂，其特征为具有“Co–O–Si”界面桥。该独特结合基元不仅调控 Cu 2 O 的原位生成，还建立 β ‑Co(OH) 2 与 Cu 2 O 之间的强电子通信，实现精确设计的串联催化级联。催化剂在 –1.0 V vs. RHE 下实现 26.6 mg h −1 cm −2 的 NH 3 产率率和 97.9% 的法拉第效率，在 100 mM NO 3 – + 0.5 M Na 2 SO 4 中性电解质中稳定 25 h。机理研究表明，Cu 2 O 控制 NO 3 – 迅速脱氧生成 NO 2 – ，而“Co–O–Si”界面加速 Volmer 步骤以富集表面 * H，促进 NO 2 – 主要通过羟胺途径氢化生成 NH 3 。该系统进一步实现鸟粪石回收、甲醇耦合电解节能和稳定 Zn‐N","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及Fe/铁体系","top":1},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.21344381","t":"Processi alternativi ad Haber-Bosch in fase di analisi - fase di test teorico","u":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21344381","s":"Zenodo (CERN European Organization for Nuclear Research)","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ipotesi 1 La sintesi industriale dell'ammoniaca ($NH_3$) tramite il classico processo Haber-Bosch presenta limitazioni termodinamiche e cinetiche intrinseche, richiedendo pressioni di $15-25 \\text{ MPa}$ e temperature di $400-500^\\circ\\text{C}$ a causa dell'elevata energia di dissociazione del triplo legame dell'azoto molecolare ($\\text{N}\\equiv\\text{N}$, $945 \\text{ kJ/mol}$). Per superare queste limitazioni con un processo più economico, veloce e scalabile, si propone un processo catalitico elettrochimico a temperatura e pressione moderate (MTP-EC) accoppiato a un sistema a membrana a conduzione protonica selettiva. Questo approccio elimina la necessità di grandi impianti di compressione e l'uso di idrogeno gassoso ad alta pressione derivante da steam reforming, integrando direttamente la scissione dell'acqua e la riduzione dell'azoto. Processo Proposto: Riduzione Elettrochimica dell'A","au":["Luigi Usai"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"为哈伯-博施工艺提供替代方案的分析-理论测试","zb":"研究对象为工业上合成氨($NH_3$)的经典哈伯-博施工艺，该方法存在固有的热力学和动力学限制，需要$15-25 ext{ MPa}$的压力和$400-500^\\circ ext{C}$的温度，这是由于分子氮($ ext{N}\\equiv ext{N}$)三键具有高解离能($945 ext{ kJ/mol}$)。为克服这些限制，提出一种更经济、快速和可扩展的催化电化学方法(MTP-EC)，该方法在温和的温度($150-200^\\circ ext{C}$)和压力(低于$1 ext{ MPa}$，通常为$0.5 ext{ MPa}$)下运行，使用高选择性的纳米结构非均相催化剂。该方法利用固体质子传导膜($ ext{La}_{1-x} ext{Sr}_x ext{P}_{1-y} ext{Si}_y ext{O}_{4-\\delta}$)将质子($H^+$)从阳极传输到阴极，无需气体渗透。阳极(","ob":"析氢反应","pre":1},{"id":"10.1051/e3sconf/202672601049/pdf","t":"Simplified Absorption-Enhanced Haber-Bosch Process for Green Ammonia Recovery: Aspen Plus® Simulation, Separation Optimization and Energy Assessments","u":"https://doi.org/10.1051/e3sconf/202672601049/pdf","s":"Springer Link (Chiba Institute of Technology)","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work presents an Aspen Plus simulation of an ammonia recovery subsystem based on NH3 absorption in water followed by solvent regeneration via distillation. The study focuses on the absorber-distillation loop with water recycle, analyzed independently from the full Haber-Bosch gas recycle to isolate intrinsic separation behavior. A parametric analysis was performed for absorber pressures between 40 and 70 bar, and reflux ratios between 1.2 and 2.5. Near complete NH3 purity 100 mol% was achieved with an overall recovery of 97% under optimal conditions P = 50 bar, R = 1.5. However, the process is strongly constrained by thermodynamic limitations of the NH3–H2O system. At low pressure, reduced NH3 solubility leads to increased solvent circulation and dilution, resulting in a sharp rise of reboiler duty up to 60 MW. Energy analysis shows that the distillation reboiler accounts for 98% of","au":["Kaoutar Eddarraji","Achraf El Kasmi"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"简化吸收增强的哈伯-博施工艺用于绿色氨回收：Aspen Plus® 模拟、分离优化和能量评估","zb":"研究对象为基于 NH3 在水中吸收随后通过蒸馏再生溶剂的氨回收子系统。研究重点为具有水回路的吸收-蒸馏循环，独立于完整的哈伯-博施气体循环进行分析以隔离内在分离行为。对 40 至 70 bar 的吸收器压力和 1.2 至 2.5 的回流比进行了参数分析。在最优条件 P = 50 bar, R = 1.5 下，实现 100 mol% 的 NH3 纯度（97% 的总回收率）。然而，该过程受限于 NH3–H2O 体系的 thermodynamic limitations。低压下，NH3 溶解度降低导致溶剂循环增加和稀释，导致再沸器负荷急剧上升至 60 MW。能量分析表明，蒸馏再沸器占总热需求的 98%。与文献比较证实了趋势，并突出了热集成的作用。该研究提供了一个详细、可重复的框架用于分析和优化 NH3 回收子系统。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.est.6c06178","t":"Operando Tracking of Atomic Hydrogen Dynamics and Lifetime Extension for Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.est.6c06178","s":"Environmental Science & Technology","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Nitrate (NO3–) contamination in aquatic environments poses a significant threat to ecosystems and public health. The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (eNO3RR) represents a promising remediation approach, yet its efficiency is generally compromised by the rapid dimerization of atomic hydrogen (H*) into H2. In this work, we established a strategy that leverages hydrogen spillover to prolong the lifetime of H* intermediates and thereby benefits the overall reaction. Specifically, protons were first reduced to H* on NiOx sites, followed by the rapid H* spillover onto a Bi metallene support that facilitates NO3– adsorption and reduction. In situ UV–vis spectroscopy provided direct evidence to understand hydrogen spillover dynamics, and transient current measurements further quantified a 5-fold increase in H* lifetime. This work demonstrated a design principle to enhance the","au":["Yiyi Guo","Dexuan Li","Shuo Zhang","Jingguo Li","Dahong Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"原位追踪原子氢动力学和寿命延长用于硝酸盐至氨的电还原","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原反应（eNO3RR），其效率通常受原子氢（H*）快速二聚成 H2 的影响。本研究建立利用氢溢流延长 H* 中间体寿命的策略，具体为质子在 NiOx 位点还原成 H*，随后快速溢流到 Bi 金属烯载体上，该载体促进 NO3– 吸附和还原。原位紫外-可见光谱提供了理解氢溢流动力学的直接证据，瞬态电流测量进一步量化了 H* 寿命的 5 倍增加。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s11164-026-06065-1","t":"MOF-derived Cu electrode for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction and ammonia production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11164-026-06065-1","s":"Research on Chemical Intermediates","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Feng Shi","Honglin Xu","Bin Wu","Jinguo Wang","Jianxing Liang","Jinping Jia"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"MOF 衍生的 Cu 电极用于电催化硝酸盐还原和氨生产","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74585","t":"Cobalt Single Atoms in Hexagonal Boron Nitride Host for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74585","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Stabilizing transition‐metal single atoms in chemically inert hexagonal boron nitride (hBN) remains a fundamental challenge due to the absence of intrinsic anchoring sites. Here, we report an in situ co‐pyrolysis strategy that simultaneously constructs hBN nanosheets and anchors atomically dispersed Co single atoms. Our first experimental demonstration shows that nitrate‐to‐ammonia electroreduction (NO 3 RR) performance of Co single atoms in hBN (Co 1 /hBN) is far superior to Co single atoms in N‐doped graphene (Co 1 /NG), with over sixfold enhancement in per‐site turnover frequency compared with carbon‐supported Co single atoms. The Co 1 /hBN catalyst delivers high Faradaic efficiency, yield rate, low Tafel slope, and definitive 15 N isotopic validation. Importantly, the structural adaptability of the polar hBN lattice significantly enhances nitrate adsorption, lowers the adsor","au":["Kanhai Kumar","Arpan Chakraborty","Omeshwari Yadorao Bisen","Chandrani Nayak","Ashok Kumar Yadav","Rajashri R. Urkude"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"六方氮化硼宿主中的钴单原子用于高效的电化学硝酸盐还原","zb":"在大化学惰性六方氮化硼 (hBN) 中稳定过渡金属单原子仍然是一个基本挑战，因为缺乏固有的锚定位点。在这里，我们报告了一种原位共热解策略，它同时构建了 hBN 纳米片并将原子分散的 Co 单原子锚定。我们的首次实验证明，六方氮化硼 (hBN) 中的 Co 单原子 (Co 1 /hBN) 的硝酸盐到氨电还原 (NO 3 RR) 性能远优于 N-掺杂石墨烯 (Co 1 /NG) 中的 Co 单原子，与碳负载的 Co 单原子相比，每位点转换频率提高了六倍以上。Co 1 /hBN 催化剂提供高法拉第效率、产率速率、低 Tafel 斜率和明确的 15 N 同位素验证。重要的是，极性 hBN 晶格的结构适应性显著增强了硝酸盐吸附，降低了 NO 3 − 衍生中间体的吸附自由能，并显著加速了 NO 3 RR 动力学，相对于 Co 1 /NG。结合 EXAFS 和 DFT 分析确定了 Co–N 6 配位环境","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.70923","t":"Nanoporous CoMn Catalyst for Efficient Electrosynthesis of Ammonia From Nitrate Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.70923","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2026-07-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Ammonia plays a crucial role in modern industry, yet its production heavily relies on the energy‐intensive and highly pollutive Haber–Bosch process. The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NITRR), powered by renewable electricity, offers a new pathway for NH 3 synthesis and nitrate pollutant mitigation. However, due to the complex reaction pathway and sluggish reaction kinetics, achieving high Faradaic efficiency and yield remains challenging. Herein, we report a nanoporous CoMn catalyst fabricated via a dealloying process, which achieves an NH 3 yield rate of 4.81 mg h −1 cm −2 along with a Faradaic efficiency of 99.90% at −0.3 V in alkaline media. In situ FTIR spectroscopy reveals the potential reaction pathway over the catalyst, and in situ Raman spectroscopy demonstrate that the incorporation of Mn improves the coordination environment with water, and optimizes the ","au":["Yifan Li","Zhonghui Gao","Yanqin Liang","Hui Jiang","Zhaoyang Li","Zhenduo Cui"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesis of Ammonia"],"zt":"纳米多孔 CoMn 催化剂用于硝酸盐还原反应的高效电合成氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸盐还原反应（NITRR），采用脱合金工艺制备纳米多孔 CoMn 催化剂，在碱性介质中 –0.3 V 下实现 4.81 mg h −1 cm −2 的 NH 3 产率率和 99.90% 的法拉第效率。原位 FTIR 光谱揭示催化剂上的潜在反应路径，原位拉曼光谱表明 Mn 的引入改善了与水的配位环境，优化了氢化步骤中的质子供应。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.70865","t":"From Waste to Wealth: Single‐Atom Catalysts for Green Ammonia Synthesis via Nitrate Electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.70865","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2026-07-12","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":") offers a green and sustainable approach for treating nitrogen-containing wastewater and is regarded as a promising alternative to the energy-intensive Haber-Bosch process. However, this reaction entails multielectron transfer and complex reaction pathways, and its efficiency is often hampered by competing side reactions such as the hydrogen evolution reaction, as well as challenges related to the safe storage and transport of products. These limitations underscore the urgent need to develop electrocatalysts that exhibit high activity, stability, and selectivity. Since their emergence, single-atom catalysts (SACs) have attracted extensive interest due to their exceptional atomic utilization efficiency and relatively low cost. To elucidate the structure-performance relationships and underlying catalytic mechanisms of SACs in nitrate electroreduction, this review summarizes recent advance","au":["Xichen Feng","Jinghuan Peng","Jianjun Chen","Guisheng Li","Hui Ling Xu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"从废物到财富：通过硝酸盐电还原进行绿色氨合成中的单原子催化剂","zb":"提供了一种绿色和可持续的方法来处理含氮废水，并被视为能源密集型哈伯-博施过程的替代方案。然而，这种反应涉及多电子转移和复杂的反应路径，其效率通常受到竞争的副反应（如析氢反应）以及与产品安全储存和运输相关的挑战的阻碍。这些限制突出了开发具有高活性、稳定性和选择性的电催化剂的迫切需要。自出现以来，单原子催化剂 (SACs) 由于其卓越的原子利用效率和相对较低的成本而引起了广泛关注。为了阐明 SACs 在硝酸盐还原中的结构-性能关系和潜在催化机理，本综述总结了基于 SACs 的电催化剂的最新进展，重点介绍了各种单原子材料类别及其相应的设计策略。最后，我们概述了该领域 SACs 的未来研究方向，旨在为设计高效、低能耗和环境友好的电化学硝酸盐还原系统提供有价值的见解和指导，以实现实际工业应用。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.202600018","t":"Single‐Site Ru(II) in a BODIPY‐Based Conjugated Porous Polymer–TiO 2 Heterostructure: A Case Study of Photothermal Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.202600018","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2026-07-12","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work explores the photothermal Nitrogen Reduction Reaction (NRR) to ammonia over a hybrid catalyst composed of TiO 2 and a BODIPY‐based conjugated porous polymer functionalized with a Ru(II) complex. The metal–organic conjugated porous polymer, denoted IEP‐37 (IMDEA Energy Polymer number 37), was synthesized by incorporating a (dipyrrin)(bipyridine)ruthenium(II) complex into a BODIPY network and subsequently integrated with anatase TiO 2 nanoparticles to form a IEP‐37@T‐10 heterostructure. Extended X‐ray absorption fine structure analysis indicates the presence of isolated Ru coordination sites, with no detectable Ru–Ru coordination. Under photothermal conditions, IEP‐37@T‐10 achieved approximately fivefold higher NH 3 production than pristine TiO 2 , and a 3.5‐fold enhancement compared with the Ru‐free hybrid analogue, highlighting the essential role of Ru incorporation in the NRR ","au":["Teresa Naranjo","Laura Oropesa Collado","Alejandro Herrero","Miguel Gomez-Mendoza","Edgar Eduardo Villalobos-Portillo","Miguel García‐Tecedor"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"基于BODIPY的共轭多孔聚合物-TiO 2 异质结构中的单位点Ru(II):光热氨合成案例研究","zb":"研究一种由TiO 2 和功能化的Ru(II)配合物组成的混合催化剂，用于光热氮还原反应(NRR)合成氨。金属-有机共轭多孔聚合物IEP-37通过将(dipyrrin)(bipyridine)ruthenium(II)配合物引入BODIPY网络并随后与锐钛矿TiO 2 纳米颗粒结合形成IEP-37@T-10异质结构。扩展X射线吸收精细结构分析表明存在孤立的Ru配位位点，未检测到Ru-Ru配位。在光热条件下，IEP-37@T-10的氨($NH_3$)产率比原始TiO 2 高约五倍，比无Ru的混合类似物高3.5倍，突出了Ru引入在NRR活性中的关键作用。IEP-37@T-10表现出良好的光化学和热稳定性，并在连续反应循环中保持可测量的活性。在光和热同时激活下获得的$NH_3$产率超过了单独光催化和热催化过程的贡献，表明光化学和热驱动途径之间存在协同作用。时间分辨光谱研究表明，Ru的引入改变了聚合","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74575","t":"Phase‐Restructured SnS 2 Nanodots: Unlocking ORR Activity through Thermal Stress‐Mediated Fracturing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74575","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-11","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"ABSTRACT The production of electrocatalytically active materials from inert precursors through intricate engineering represents a frontier in sustainable energy research. The present study unveils a transformative thermal stress‐mediated fracturing strategy to activate the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) in SnS 2, a material traditionally considered unsuitable for such electrocatalytic applications. By subjecting bulk SnS 2 hexagonal plates to extreme thermal shock via rapid heating followed by instant quenching in liquid nitrogen, a simultaneous reduction in dimensionality and a critical 1T‐to‐1H phase transition has been achieved, yielding ultra‐small 1H@1T‐SnS 2 nanodots (2–5 nm). High‐resolution aberration‐corrected STEM imaging reveals a restructured atomic lattice where the emergence of the 1H phase, coupled with plentiful edge sites, fundamentally reconfigures the electronic lands","au":["Parbati Basu","Sugandha Saxena","Jayita Chakraborty","Pijush K. Gan","Koustav Mandal","Soumya Nandi"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["rapid heating"],"zt":"相结构重构的 SnS₂ 纳米点：通过热应力介导的断裂解锁 ORR 活性","zb":"从惰性前驱体制备电催化活性材料是可持续能源研究的前沿。本研究揭示了一种热应力介导的断裂转化策略，激活传统上被认为不适用于此类电催化应用的 SnS₂ 的氧还原反应（ORR）。通过将块状 SnS₂ 六边形板快速加热后立即在液氮中淬火，实现了维度降低和关键 1T-到-1H 相变，产生活性超小 1H@1T-SnS₂ 纳米点（2–5 nm）。高分辨率 STEM 成像揭示重构的原子晶格，其中 1H 相的出现与丰富的边缘位点共同重塑了电子环境。而原始 1T-SnS₂ 遵循低效的 2-电子途径，相结构重构的纳米点则表现出稳健的 4-电子氧还原机制。DFT 理论计算证实，1H-相变与边缘位点富集的协同作用降低了中间体吸附的吉布斯自由能，有效“解锁”了 SnS₂ 的催化潜力。该工作为非贵金属二硫化物（TMDs）的相和尺寸工程提供了深刻蓝图，将普通半导体转化为下一代燃料电池和金属空气电池的高性能电催化剂。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c07080","t":"Steric Hindrance of Proton Donors Modulates Heterogeneous Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction Reaction Selectivity in Nonaqueous Electrolytes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c07080","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-07-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) in aqueous electrolytes is severely limited by the early buildup of adsorbed H (*H) at cathodic potentials, which suppresses N2 adsorption (*N2) and promotes the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Nonaqueous electrolytes containing molecular proton donors offer a route to mitigate this competition, but molecular design principles that suppress the HER without comparably slowing the NRR remain poorly defined. Here, density functional theory calculations, potential-dependent free energy analysis, and microkinetic modeling show that proton donor steric hindrance selectively gates interfacial proton-coupled electron transfer (PCET) on Ru(0001) in acetonitrile. Increasing donor steric bulk substantially raises the barrier for the HER Volmer step, while only weakly perturbing the rate-determining *N2 protonation step. This asymmetry origina","au":["Dongmin Park","Changhyeok Choi","Jaeyune Ryu","Yousung Jung"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrogen Reduction Reaction"],"zt":"质子供体的空间位阻调节非水电解质中非均相电化学氮还原反应的选择性","zb":"在非水电解质中进行的电化学氮还原反应(NRR)受阴极电位下吸附的H(*H)的早期积累严重限制，这抑制了$N_2$吸附(*$N_2$)并促进了析氢反应(HER)。含有分子质子供体的非水电解质提供了一条缓解这种竞争的途径，但抑制HER而不相应地减慢NRR的分子设计原理仍然定义不佳。密度泛函理论计算、电位依赖的自由能分析和微动力学建模表明，质子供体的空间位阻选择性地控制了Ru(0001)上的界面质子偶联电子转移(PCET)。增加供体位阻大小显著提高了HER Volmer步骤的能垒，而仅微弱扰动*$N_2$质子化步骤的速率决定步骤。这种不对称性源于质子受体的几何形状：将质子转移到平坦的金属位点需要质子供体接近表面，并且越来越大体积的取代基会越来越阻碍这种转移，而吸附的*$N_2$的远程N原子从表面突出，并且相对容易接近。与这种图景一致，HER的有效对称因子随着供体位阻的增加而降低，在能垒和电位响应","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c05664","t":"Electrochemical C–N Bond Formation from CO2 and Nitrate Using Molecular Catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c05664","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-07-11","f":"2026-10-01T07:42:49Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract The emerging direction of electrochemical C–N bond formation from CO2 and small N-containing molecules has gained wide attention in recent years as a sustainable route in producing high-value products such as amines and amides. To date, the majority of C–N bond electrocatalysts discovered have been heterogeneous and/or solid-state in nature, which have some limitations when investigating structure–activity relationships toward the buildup of a fundamental knowledge base. Molecular electrocatalysts, on the other hand, have a wide range of advantages for fundamental studies, as these catalysts can be easily tuned, showing direct relationships between catalytic activity and the metal center, ligand, secondary coordination sphere, and much more. To this end, we demonstrate the use of a monohydroxy terpyridine nickel complex (NitpyOH) as a homogeneous molecular electrocatalyst for C–","au":["Morgan McKee","Devashish Bhave","Sai Phani Kumar Vangala","Hamed Heidarpour","Jörg Daniels","Ralf Weisbarth"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"利用分子催化从CO 2 和硝酸盐形成C-N键","zb":"研究利用单羟基酞菁镍配合物(NitpyOH)作为均相分子电催化剂，在水体系中形成C-N键。在-0.69 V vs RHE下，使用1 mM NitpyOH生产甲酰胺作为主要C-N产物，峰值法拉第效率为35%，部分电流密度为0.095 mA cm–2。通过原位光谱、电分析技术和计算建模相结合，阐明了C-N偶联产生甲酰胺的关键催化机制。这些见解为分子系统在电化学小分子交叉偶联反应中的应用铺平了道路。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7100193","t":"Fibrous Scaffold-Based Artificial SEI for Continuous Lithium-Mediated Nitrogen Reduction Flow Cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7100193","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-07-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) is a promising electrochemical pathway for ambient NH3 synthesis, yet its efficiency remains limited by dendritic Li plating, parasitic reactions, and interfacial instability. Here, we introduce electrospun artificial solid electrolyte interphases (SEIs) on gas diffusion electrodes (GDEs) as an effective strategy to improve the performance of Li-NRR flow cells. In this system, an effective artificial SEI should simultaneously stabilize the electrode–electrolyte–gas triphase interface and guide the formation of a favorable interphase for uniform Li plating. Among the examined polymers, poly(vinylidene fluoride-co-hexafluoropropylene) (PVDF-HFP) was the most effective, providing a fibrous scaffold that reacts with Li during operation and induces a LiF-rich SEI. Morphological and spectroscopic analyses indicate that a LiF-rich interp","au":["Mingyun Kim","Song Kyu Kang","Won Bae Kim","Kijung Yong"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"基于纤维支架的人工SEI用于连续锂介导的氮还原流电池","zb":"研究对象为锂介导的氮还原反应（Li-NRR）流电池，关键方法为在气体扩散电极（GDEs）上电纺人工固体电解质界面（SEIs），主要结果为PVDF-HFP聚合物形成的纤维支架与Li反应产生富含LiF的SEI，优化电极在相同条件下实现了65.5 ± 7.4%的法拉第效率，比裸露的不锈钢（SS）网格的43.2 ± 2.7%提高了近50%，氨气气相比例增加了三倍以上。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacsau.6c00733","t":"Ammonia Oxidation with a Ruthenium Polypyridyl Complex: Mechanism-Guided Approach to Low Overpotential Electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacsau.6c00733","s":"JACS Au","d":"2026-07-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract The use of ammonia as a potential zero-carbon fuel has attracted high interest in the quest for novel sustainable energy carriers. This requires a deep understanding of the principles of the ammonia oxidation reaction (AOR) to guide the development of efficient catalysts. Here, we report the complex [RuII(TPA)(NH3)2](PF6)2 (1(PF6)2; TPA = tris(2-pyridylmethyl)amine), and we demonstrate that its 1e– oxidation in MeCN is partially ligand centered and finally produces [RuII(TPA)(MeCN)(NH3)](PF6)2 (2(PF6)2). Deprotonation of 13+ (pKA = 12.6) is derived as the rate-determining step, and bimolecular N–N coupling of the key intermediate [Ru(TPA)(NH3)(NH2)]2+ (42+) is proposed based on 15N labeling experiments and electrochemical studies. 1(PF6)2 is then investigated as a homogeneous AOR electrocatalyst, and the formation of N2 and H2 is confirmed during electrolysis at a moderate opera","au":["Maximilian Seiß","Elisa Dickgießer","Sebastian Dechert","Franc Meyer"],"o":"回填","zt":"使用钌多吡啶配合物进行氨氧化：基于机理的低压电催化方法","zb":"报道配合物[RuII(TPA)(NH3)2](PF6)2 (1(PF6)2; TPA = tris(2-pyridylmethyl)amine)，并证明其1e-氧化在MeCN中部分是配体中心化的，最终产生[RuII(TPA)(MeCN)(NH3)](PF6)2 (2(PF6)2)。去质子化13+ (pKA = 12.6)被认为是速率决定步骤，基于15N标记实验和电化学研究，提出关键中间体[Ru(TPA)(NH3)(NH2)]2+ (42+)的双分子N-N偶联。1(PF6)2被研究作为均相氨氧化反应(AOR)电催化剂，在中等操作电位下电解时确认生成了$N_2$和$H_2$。DFT计算建立了完整的PCET图谱以评估潜在反应途径，并与光谱和电化学研究以及使用15N标记的产品分析相结合，允许提出一个催化循环，其中N-N键形成通过分子间偶联(I2M)在PCET序列的早期酰胺阶段(42+)发生。避免更","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.21372880","t":"Social assessment report","u":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21372880","s":"Zenodo (CERN European Organization for Nuclear Research)","d":"2026-07-10","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Renewable methanol (MeOH) is considered an important fuel for hard-to-abate transport sectors and a key platform chemical for the defossilisation of products and services. The ēQATOR concept enables the production of renewable MeOH from biogas (CH₄+CO₂) derived from biomass residues and biogenic waste. Syngas (CO and H₂) is first produced via either catalytic dry reforming (only biogas) or mixed reforming (biogas plus water), followed by the actual MeOH synthesis in a second step. While syngas is conventionally produced from methane steam reforming, the ēQATOR project has developed two electrical heating concepts, microwave and resistive heating, to drive the reforming reaction. As part of the overall sustainability assessment of the process, a social life cycle assessment (S-LCA) has been carried out that will be integrated into a comprehensive integrated life cycle assessment. The S-LC","au":["Institut für Energie- und Umweltforschung Heidelberg","SINTEF","Nils Rettenmaier","Hanna Karg","Sonja Haertlé","Heiko Keller"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["electrical heat"],"zt":"社会评估报告","zb":"研究利用生物气生产可再生甲醇的ēQATOR概念，采用微波和电阻加热驱动重整反应。通过社会生命周期评估（S-LCA）分析供应链和运营风险，发现电力消耗是主要风险热点，而技术设计参数对生物气和电力的需求影响较小。","ob":"甲烷干重整"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.71279","t":"Calcium Imide: A New Catalyst for Plasma‐Catalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71279","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2026-07-10","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":21,"ab":"ABSTRACT Plasma‐catalytic ammonia synthesis is an emerging alternative approach for the sustainable conversion of dinitrogen (N 2 ) to ammonia (NH 3 ) using renewable electricity. However, the development of efficient catalysts for plasma‐driven ammonia synthesis remains a formidable challenge. Herein, we report that calcium imide (CaNH) functions as an active, transition‐metal‐free catalyst for plasma‐driven ammonia synthesis. Under 25 W and 20 kHz dielectric barrier discharge (DBD) conditions, the ammonia synthesis rate over CaNH is approximately three times that of the blank test, representing a performance enhancement comparable to the widely studied benchmark Ni/Al 2 O 3 catalyst. Combined experimental and computational results reveal that the CaNH surface, with plasma‐generated coordinatively unsaturated calcium sites, plays a critical role in promoting the hydrogenation of N x H y","au":["Jiaqi Wen","Yanbo Deng","Hui Li","Yaolin Wang","Runze Wang","Wenbo Gao"],"o":"旧站本地库","w":["Ping Chen"],"why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"钙酰胺：一种用于等离子体催化氨合成的全新催化剂","zb":"研究对象为钙酰胺（CaNH）在等离子体催化氨合成中的活性。采用25 W和20 kHz介电屏障放电（DBD）条件进行实验，并结合计算研究。结果显示，CaNH表面因等离子体产生的缺配位钙位点促进了NxHy物种的加氢生成NH3，而非N2的活化，从而提升了氨合成速率至空白测试的约三倍，性能提升与广泛研究的基准催化剂Ni/Al2O3相当。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.chempr.2026.103136","t":"Direct conversion of N2 and CH4 to valuable N-containing compounds via a plasma-activated catalytic process","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.chempr.2026.103136","s":"Chem","d":"2026-07-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:00:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Direct co-conversion of N2 and CH4 into alkylamines and NH3 is achieved under mild conditions via a non-thermal plasma-activated catalytic process over a Ni/SiAlO catalyst. The plasma-catalysis synergy not only facilitates the activation of reactants by increasing the mean electron energy but also enables catalyst-regulated N–C and N–H coupling of adsorbed intermediates with plasma-derived reactive species. This one-step process bypasses the energy-intensive Haber-Bosch and amination cascade processes, offering a sustainable synthetic route under mild conditions.","au":["Di Li","Ziming Liu","Chenxin Wu","Tao Sha","Li Yi","Chengyuan Liu"],"o":"日常","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"通过等离子体活化催化过程将N2和CH4直接转化为有价值的含氮化合物","zb":"研究对象为N2和CH4直接共转化为烷基胺和NH3的等离子体活化催化过程，关键方法为在Ni/SiAlO催化剂上通过非热等离子体活化催化，主要结果为等离子体催化协同作用不仅通过增加平均电子能量活化反应物，还使催化剂调控吸附中间体的N-C和N-H偶联，该一步法过程避免了哈伯-博施和胺化级联过程的高能耗，在温和条件下提供可持续合成路线。","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d6nr02270g","t":"Mo-doped Ti 2 O 3 nanoparticles for efficient electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis at ambient conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6nr02270g","s":"Nanoscale","d":"2026-07-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) has emerged as a promising sustainable approach for ambient-condition ammonia synthesis. Extensive studies have identified Ti3+ as the predominant active site that facilitates NRR by lowering activation barriers and enhancing N2 chemisorption, which accounts for the remarkable catalytic performance of Ti2O3. The incorporation of molybdenum (Mo), a key component of nitrogenase active centers, has been shown to further improve NRR efficiency through its dual functionality in simultaneously activating and stabilizing the reaction intermediate. In this work, we report Mo-doped Ti2O3 nanoparticles that demonstrate superior NRR performance, achieving an ammonia yield of 30.84 μg h-1 mgcat-1 with a faradaic efficiency of 29.8%. These findings provide fundamental insights into the design principles of high-efficiency NRR catalysts and represent ","au":["Xueliang Lu","Wanfeng Shi","Rongji Wang","Yu Ding","Yan Du","Baotong Qi"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Mo掺杂的Ti 2 O 3纳米颗粒用于在环境条件下高效的电催化氨合成","zb":"电催化氮还原反应（NRR）已成为环境条件下氨合成的可持续方法的曙光。大量研究表明，Ti3+是主要活性位点，通过降低活化能和增强N2化学吸附来促进NRR，这解释了Ti2O3的优异催化性能。钼（Mo）的掺入，氮ase活性中心的组成部分，已被证明通过其同时活化稳定反应中间体的双重功能进一步提高了NRR效率。在这项工作中，我们报告了Mo掺杂的Ti2O3纳米颗粒，表现出优异的NRR性能，实现了氨产率为30.84 μg h-1 mgcat-1，法拉第效率为29.8%。这些发现为高效NRR催化剂的设计原则提供了基本见解，并代表了向可持续氨生产技术迈进的重要进展。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaem.6c01647","t":"Copper−Aluminum Fluorides as Active Catalysts for Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaem.6c01647","s":"ACS Applied Energy Materials","d":"2026-07-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Fluorinated multimetal materials have recently attracted attention as catalysts for nitrate reduction to ammonia (NO3−RR). However, their rational design and activity remain largely unexplored. Here, we report, for the first time, the NO3−RR performance of a hydrated fluorinated copper−aluminum, Cu3Al2F12(H2O)12, previously reported as a precursor of an oxyfluorinated electrocatalyst prepared by calcination. Co-precipitation synthesis, through optimization of the synthesis parameters, significantly improves its purity compared to evaporation-based synthesis. Thermal monitoring of the decomposition process of Cu3Al2F12(H2O)12 by X-ray diffraction (XRD) and thermogravimetric analysis, complemented by 19F nuclear magnetic resonance measurements, made it possible to establish the reaction scheme involving the formation of AlF3−x(OH)x and Cu(OH)F. The comparative study of the electro","au":["Noémie Andrieu","Edouard Boivin","Christophe Legein","Monique Body","Annie Hémon-Ribaud","Jérôme Lhoste"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"铜-铝氟化物作为硝酸盐还原为氨的活性催化剂","zb":"氟化多金属材料最近作为硝酸盐还原为氨（NO3−RR）的催化剂引起了关注，但其合理设计和活性仍很大程度上未得到探索。本研究首次报道了之前报道的羟基氟化铜-铝（Cu3Al2F12(H2O)12）的NO3−RR性能，该材料是制备氧化氟化电催化剂的前驱体，通过煅烧制备。共沉淀合成通过优化合成参数，与基于蒸发的合成相比，显著提高了其纯度。通过X射线衍射（XRD）和热重分析对Cu3Al2F12(H2O)12的分解过程进行热监测，补充了19F核磁共振测量，从而建立了涉及AlF3−x(OH)x和Cu(OH)F形成的反应方案。对氟化材料的电催化性能的比较研究表明，合成方法或煅烧过程对NO3−RR性能没有显著影响。这导致选择了通过最简单和可扩展的合成路线制备的羟基氟化物Cu3Al2F12(H2O)12，在0.1 M KNO3中中性pH下，24小时后法拉第效率约为70%，氨产率为31 mg·h−1·mgcat−","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.energyfuels.6c01652","t":"Photothermal Catalysis Enables Sustainable Ammonia Production over Cs-Promoted Fe-Based Catalyst Supported on Carbon","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.energyfuels.6c01652","s":"Energy & Fuels","d":"2026-07-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photothermal catalysis, an approach that harnesses both thermal and nonthermal contributions of sunlight, has emerged as a promising strategy to drive chemical transformations with enhanced efficiency and reduced energy requirements. In this study, we report a Cs-promoted Fe-based catalyst derived from the pyrolysis of Fe phthalocyanine precursor for photothermal ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis. Among the studied catalysts, those pyrolyzed at 600 °C displayed the highest performance, with an average NH 3 production rate of 26 mmol g Fe –1 h –1 at 400 °C and 20 bar under light irradiation. In addition, the catalyst displayed remarkable stability for over 50 h on stream. Mechanistic studies revealed a predominant contribution from nonthermal effects, particularly at higher light intensities (>3.5 W cm –2 ), indicating that charge carrier-mediated contributions dominate the reaction pathway. Over","au":["Angel Sousa","Lidia Karpova","Natalia Morlanes","Vladislav Liamin","Maksim Zakharzhevskii","Eganathan Kaliyamoorthy"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"光热催化使Cs助剂的Fe基催化剂负载于碳上实现可持续氨生产","zb":"研究对象为Cs助剂的Fe基催化剂光热氨合成，关键方法为从Fe酞菁前驱体热解制备催化剂，主要结果为600°C热解的催化剂在400°C、20 bar和光照下平均氨产率为26 mmol g Fe-1 h-1，稳定性超过50小时，机理研究表明非热效应（尤其是>3.5 W cm-2的光强度）起主要作用，表明电荷载体介导的贡献主导反应路径。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74477","t":"Mechanistic Insight Into Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction to Ammonia Over PdBi Single‐Atom Alloys","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74477","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction is promising for sustainable ammonia production, but is hindered by a high protonation energy barrier and severe competition from the hydrogen evolution reaction. Although PdBi single‐atom alloy has been demonstrated to be an efficient electrocatalyst for electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia, the underlying mechanism of the electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction over this type of catalyst remains unclear. Herein, a PdBi single‐atom alloy is prepared by anchoring Bi single atoms onto thin Pd nanosheets and applied for the electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction. The induced electronic coupling between Bi and Pd atoms optimizes charge distribution, thereby enhancing N 2 adsorption‐activation and decreasing the free‐energy barrier of the rate‐determining step of *N 2 → *NNH from 0.71 to 0.61 eV. The optimized PdBi 10 single‐ato","au":["Jianglin Tu","Hang Zhao","Zhefei Pan","Liang An","Xun Zhu","Rong Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"PdBi单原子合金上电催化氮还原为氨的机理研究","zb":"研究对象为PdBi单原子合金电催化氮还原反应，关键方法为制备Bi单原子锚定的薄Pd纳米片，主要结果为Bi和Pd原子间的电子耦合优化电荷分布，降低*N2→*NNH决速步骤的自由能势垒从0.71 eV降至0.61 eV，优化的PdBi10单原子合金在-0.2 V（vs. RHE）下实现46.9 µg h-1 mg-1的氨产率，法拉第效率为13.3%，并具有优异的长期稳定性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74160","t":"Iron‐Oxide Nanoarrays Covered Carbon Fiber Promotes Ammonia Electrosynthesis and Multi‐Scenario Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74160","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-10","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT The development of electrocatalysts with complex environmental adaptability is the key path to promote the directional conversion of nitrate into high value‐added ammonia. Herein, low‐cost self‐supporting carbon fiber was used as a carrier to successfully prepare uniform‐sized Fe 2 O 3 nanoarrays with four‐corner double cone morphology (named Fe 2 O 3 /CF) through a one‐step in situ growth method. Fe 2 O 3 /CF exhibits excellent performance in the electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia: it maintains stable activity in a wide pH range and exhibits significant resistance to common interfering ions in complex water; The Faradaic efficiency of ammonia generation can reach 95%, and it has good long‐term stability. The open‐circuit voltage of 1.37 V and the power density of 12.3 mW cm −2 can be achieved in the Zn‐NO 3 − battery system based on Fe 2 O 3 /CF. Ammonia synthesis","au":["Zhikang Wu","Xuejia Zhan","Jie Jiang","Wen Luo","Xuguang An","Fang Tan"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"覆盖氧化铁纳米阵列的碳纤维促进氨电合成和多场景应用","zb":"研究对象为硝酸电催化还原为氨的催化剂，关键方法为通过一步原位生长法制备Fe2O3纳米阵列/碳纤维（Fe2O3/CF），主要结果为Fe2O3/CF在宽pH范围和复杂水环境中表现出优异的稳定性和抗干扰能力，氨生成法拉第效率达95%，在Zn-NO3-电池系统中实现1.37 V的开路电压和12.3 mW cm-2的功率密度，结合太阳能发电模块和等离子体空气活化技术可实现绿色氨合成和液态氮肥连续生产。","ob":"等离子体制氨；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.7488/era/7411","t":"Levelised costs for the transportation of hydrogen: a real-world multi-modal optimisation framework","u":"https://doi.org/10.7488/era/7411","s":"ERA","d":"2026-07-10","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Green hydrogen has the potential to decarbonise hard to electrify sectors, but the cost of producing green hydrogen varies across locations and optimum production locations do not necessarily align with optimum hydrogen demand centres. Delivering hydrogen to end users requires transport, which can be achieved through pipelines; road tube trailers; or maritime shipping, either as liquid hydrogen or as a carrier such as ammonia. Existing studies typically compare these transport vectors in isolation, yet real project geographies may necessitate sequential use of multiple modes of transportation. This gap motivates the development of a framework to evaluate end-to-end hydrogen delivery chains. This work contributes a novel modelling framework, which integrates multiple hydrogen transport modes and processing steps into end-to-end delivery chains, enabling more accurate estimation of hydroge","au":["Callum Turnbull"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"氢运输的平准化成本：一个现实的多模式优化框架","zb":"绿氢有潜力使难以 electrify 的部门脱碳，但生产绿氢的成本因地点而异，最佳生产地点并不一定与最佳氢需求中心一致。将氢输送到最终用户需要运输，这可以通过管道；公路管式拖车；或作为液体氢或载体（如氨）的海上运输来实现。现有研究通常单独比较这些运输矢量，但实际项目地理位置可能需要顺序使用多种运输方式。这一差距促使开发一个评估端到端氢交付链的框架。这项工作贡献了一个新的建模框架，该框架将多种氢运输模式和加工步骤集成到端到端交付链中，能够比单一矢量评估更准确地估计氢分配成本。该模型将管道、管式拖车和作为液体氢（LH2）和氨（NH3）的运输整合在一起，以及相关的加工步骤，包括压缩、液化、再气化、哈伯-博施合成和氨裂解。可再生能源可以转换为氢，可选择性地合成为氨作为能源载体，然后重新转换为氢或直接用于供热。使用欧洲和北非港口的数据库来确定可能的进口和出口港口对。这结合了路线规划和管道成本模型，以","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1016/j.joule.2026.102548","t":"A dilute nitrate electrolyte for all-climate batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.joule.2026.102548","s":"Joule","d":"2026-07-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:00:02Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"You et al. report a data-driven strategy that enables inexpensive lithium nitrate to serve as the main salt in a dilute lithium-ion battery electrolyte. The designed low-concentration electrolyte reduces cost while stabilizing battery interfaces, enabling all-climate operation in pouch cells.","au":["Haipeng You","Jiahui Chen","Ruhong Li","Long Chen","Ke Wang","Yuxin Qiu"],"o":"日常","zt":"一种用于全气候电池的稀硝酸电解质","zb":"研究报道了一种以廉价硝酸锂为主盐的稀锂离子电池电解质。设计的低浓度电解质降低了成本，同时稳定了电池界面，使软包电池能够在全气候条件下运行。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ccr.2026.218294","t":"Vacancy engineering in TiO2 nanostructures for photocatalytic nitrogen fixation and sustainable ammonia production: A review","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ccr.2026.218294","s":"Coordination Chemistry Reviews","d":"2026-07-09","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zahra Salmanzadeh-Jamadi","Aziz Habibi‐Yangjeh","Khadijeh Pournemati"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"TiO2纳米结构中的空位工程用于光催化氮固定和可持续氨生产：一篇综述","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74549","t":"N–Co–S Single‐Atom Electronic Bridge Enables a Z‐Scheme Heterojunction for Room‐Temperature Photocatalytic Hydrogen Production From Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74549","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-09","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Ammonia (NH 3 ) decomposition to hydrogen (H 2 ) offers a sustainable route for clean energy generation, benefiting from abundant feedstocks, ease of storage and zero‐carbon cycle. Conventional NH 3 decomposition, however, relies on Ru‐based noble metal catalysts and requires temperatures above 400°C, resulting in high cost and limited scalability. The development of efficient, low‐cost catalysts that operate under mild conditions is therefore imperative. Here, we report a novel Z‐scheme photocatalyst composed of Co‐doped CdS quantum dots anchored on NH 2 ‐MIL‐53(Al) (Co‐CdS QDs/MIL) via an interfacial N–Co–S single atom electron bridge (Co‐SAEB). By precisely steering the separation and migration of photogenerated charges, this architecture drives efficient photocatalytic NH 3 decomposition at ambient temperature. The catalyst achieves an exceptional H 2 evolution rate of 18 µm","au":["Ning Zhao","Guanyu Chen","Yongcheng Jin","Shuangshuang Yao","Aonan Zhu","Aoxuan Du"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"N-钴-硫单原子电子桥实现Z式异质结用于室温光催化氨分解制氢","zb":"氨（NH 3 ）分解为氢（H 2 ）为清洁能源生产提供了一条可持续的途径，受益于丰富的原料、易于储存和零碳循环。然而，传统的NH 3 分解依赖于基于Ru的贵金属催化剂，并且需要在400°C以上的温度下进行，导致成本高和可扩展性有限。因此，开发在温和条件下运行的效率高、成本低催化剂至关重要。在这里，我们报告了一种新型Z式光催化剂，由锚定在NH 2 ‐MIL‐53(Al)上的钴掺杂的CdS量子点（Co‐CdS QDs/MIL）通过界面N–Co–S单原子电子桥（Co‐SAEB）组成。通过精确引导光生电荷的分离和迁移，这种架构驱动了在环境温度下高效的 photocatalytic NH 3 分解。该催化剂实现了18 µmol·g −1 ·s −1 的优异H 2 产率，超过了现有的光催化系统，并接近光热NH 3 分解过程的性能。综合表征和理论分析表明，Co‐SAEB在建立直接的Z式电荷转移途径中至关","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2026.139278","t":"Synergistic alloying-Phosphidation engineering of CuSn/Cu3P Heterostructures for high-efficiency nitrate Electroreduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2026.139278","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2026-07-09","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Jihua Yu","Hao Wang","Keqi Li","Boran Yang","Aiyang Li","Zixin A"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"CuSn/Cu3P异质结构的协同合金化-磷化工程用于高效硝酸盐电还原合成氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2026.124044","t":"Recent advances in rational design of electrocatalysts for efficient nitrate removal from wastewater: From nanoparticles, nanoclusters to single atoms","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2026.124044","s":"Journal of environmental chemical engineering","d":"2026-07-09","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Dan Zhu","Congqi Zhu","Fengyi Liu","Ruchun Li","Baojiang Jiang"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"电催化剂合理设计的最新进展用于从废水中高效去除硝酸盐：从纳米颗粒、纳米簇到单原子","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c02264","t":"Insights into Improved Coking Resistance of Pd/Al2O3 Modified by Atomic Layer Deposition of Fe2O3 for Dry Reforming of Methane","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c02264","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"Abstract Atomic layer deposition (ALD) of an ∼0.4 nm iron oxide overlayer on a Pd/Al2O3 catalyst was investigated. TEM/EDS mapping, XRD, and XPS analyses confirmed the formation of an Fe2O3 layer over the Pd particles, forming a protective ‘core-shell’ structure. The deposited film remained thermally stable and XRD-amorphous, with crystallinity related to α-Fe2O3 emerging above 900 °C. All catalytic assessments and characterizations were conducted under conditions where the Fe2O3 phase was defined. After high temperature treatment, the Fe2O3 layer maintained good interfacial contact with Pd, and this interaction inhibited coking from deactivating Pd despite exposure to CH4-rich streams at 900 °C for 100 h of operation. In contrast, conventional catalysts, prepared by incipient wetness infiltration (IWI), deactivated over this duration. When these catalysts were tested for dry reforming o","au":["Ning Wang","Joseph Jolley","Jihwan Kim","Shaoliang Guan","Stephan Hofmann","Tzia Ming Onn"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积的 Fe2O3 改性的 Pd/Al2O3 催化剂对甲烷干式重整的积碳抗性研究","zb":"研究对象为在 Pd/Al2O3 催化剂上原子层沉积（ALD）的 ∼0.4 nm 氧化铁过层。TEM/EDS 映射、XRD 和 XPS 分析证实了在 Pd 颗粒上形成了 Fe2O3 层，形成了一种保护性的‘核壳’结构。沉积的薄膜在高温处理后保持热稳定且 XRD 非晶质，α-Fe2O3 的结晶性在 900 °C 以上出现。在 900 °C 下暴露于富含 CH4 的气流中 100 h 后，Fe2O3 层与 Pd 保持良好的界面接触，这种相互作用抑制了 CH4 导致的 Pd 活化。","ob":"甲烷干重整；涉及Fe/铁体系、原子层沉积","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsnano.6c06516","t":"Precursor-Engineered Strategy for Constructing Supported Tetra-Atom Pt Clusters to Boost Propane Dehydrogenation under Direct Resistive Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.6c06516","s":"ACS Nano","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The commercial platinum-based catalysts used in propane dehydrogenation (PDH) reactions face challenges such as ambiguous active sites, low stability, and poor propylene selectivity. Atomically precise platinum catalysts, featuring well-defined active structures and controllable electronic properties, offer an effective approach to addressing these issues. Herein, we successfully constructed atomically precise Pt 4 nanoclusters stabilized on oxygen-functionalized carbon nanotubes (Pt 4 /OCNT) through a precursor-engineered strategy. Combined advanced characterization and density functional theory (DFT) calculations revealed that the Pt 4 clusters are consistent with the tetrahedral model stabilized by Pt–C/O bonds with the support. Under direct resistive heating for PDH at 500 °C, Pt 4 /OCNT reached 99.6% propylene selectivity while exhibiting the highest space-time conversion, demonstra","au":["Panpan Li","Guangsheng Liu","Najie Zhuang","Jingjing Tu","Taotao Gao","Xiaoyang Ren"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Resistive Heat"],"zt":"前驱体工程策略构建负载四原子 Pt 簇以促进直接电阻加热下的丙烷脱氢","zb":"研究对象为用于丙烷脱氢（PDH）反应的原子精确 Pt4 纳米簇。通过前驱体工程策略成功构建了在氧官能化碳纳米管（Pt4/OCNT）上稳定的 Pt4 簇。先进表征和密度泛函理论（DFT）计算表明，Pt4 簇与四面体模型一致，由 Pt-C/O 键与载体稳定。在 500 °C 下直接电阻加热进行 PDH 时，Pt4/OCNT 达到 99.6% 的丙烯选择性，同时表现出最高的时空转换率，性能优于原子分散的 Pt1/OCNT 和工业 Pt/C 催化剂。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1021/acsnano.6c05022","t":"Silicon-Mediated Laser Shock Synthesis of Nanocrystalline Diamonds from Low-Rank Coal","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.6c05022","s":"ACS Nano","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Coal is traditionally regarded as a primary energy resource for combustion. However, its high carbon content renders it an ideal precursor for the synthesis of carbon nanomaterials. The valorization of low-value coal into high-value nanocrystalline diamonds (NDs) offers a promising strategy. In this work, we developed a facile and rapid strategy for the synthesis of NDs from low-rank long-flame coal via silicon-mediated laser-induced shockwave high pressure within a water-confinement layer. The as-synthesized products show an average crystallite size of ∼5 nm and exhibit features consistent with cubic diamond, including the (111), (220), and (311) reflections and ∼0.20 nm lattice fringes with a ∼70° intersection angle. C 1s X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy indicates an enhanced sp3-bonded carbon contribution after laser shock treatment. Raman spectra of the coal/Si pellet surfaces demons","au":["Yanmei Zhang","Zhenghe Zhang","Rui Wang","Zheng He","Zhongqi Wei","Yuankong Wei"],"o":"回填","why":["Shock Synthesis"],"zt":"硅介导的激光冲击合成低阶煤纳米金刚石","zb":"研究对象为从低阶长焰煤中通过硅介导的激光诱导冲击高压和水约束层内的快速合成纳米金刚石（NDs）。合成的产物平均晶粒尺寸约为 5 nm，表现出与立方金刚石一致的 (111)、(220) 和 (311) 反射以及 ∼0.20 nm 晶格条纹和 ∼70° 的交角。C 1s X 射线光电子能谱表明，激光冲击处理后 sp3 杂化碳的贡献增强。煤/Si 丸表面的拉曼光谱表明，激光诱导的煤到 ND 的转化是一个动力学控制过程。分子动力学（MD）模拟表明，煤衍生碳和活性 Si 加剂的化学反应可能局部提供额外的化学驱动力，促进 C-C 键活化并加速 sp3 类似、金刚石类结构基元的形成。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.chemmater.6c01148","t":"A Liquid Ruthenium Precursor for Atomic Layer Deposition of Low-Resistivity Ruthenium Films","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.chemmater.6c01148","s":"Chemistry of Materials","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract The application of a liquid and volatile Ru precursor ([η5-C5H5Ru(CO)2(CH2)3N(CH3)2] or dicarbonyl(η5-cyclopentadienyl)(3-(dimethylamino)propyl)ruthenium, trade name HeRu31) in an atomic layer deposition (ALD) process yielded high-purity and conductive Ru metal thin films. The films were deposited at temperatures from 200–300 °C on Si substrates, exhibiting self-limiting, linear growth behavior with a growth per cycle (GPC) of 1.1 Å at a deposition temperature (Tdep) of 280 °C. Comprehensive characterization of Ru thin films validates the growth of closed, nanocrystalline Ru films with resistivities in the range of 24–29 μΩ cm. These unprecedented findings offer further insights into the impact of the Ru precursor, paving the way to explore Ru films for microelectronic applications.","au":["Niklas Huster","Ilamparithy Selvakumar","Florian Preischel","Jorit Obenlüneschloß","Michael C. Gock","Michael Unkrig-Bau"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"一种用于原子层沉积低电阻率 ruthenium 薄膜的液体 ruthenium 前驱体","zb":"研究对象为 [η5-C5H5Ru(CO)2(CH2)3N(CH3)2] 在原子层沉积（ALD）过程中的应用。在 200–300 °C 下在 Si 基板上沉积的高纯度导电 Ru 金属薄膜表现出自限制、线性生长行为，每个循环的生长量（GPC）为 1.1 Å（Tdep = 280 °C）。Ru 薄膜的综合表征验证了生长的封闭、纳米晶 Ru 薄膜，其电阻率在 24–29 μΩ cm 范围内。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74462","t":"Transient Thermal Engineering of Pt@rGO Nanocatalysts via Oxygen Anchoring and Chlorine Coordination for Efficient Hydrogen Generation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74462","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"ABSTRACT The accelerating transition to clean hydrogen energy demands highly efficient and stable platinum‐based electrocatalyst for the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). However, achieving uniform low‐Pt‐loading catalysts remains challenging due to weak interfacial interactions and inadequate dispersion control. Herein, we developed a synergistic interfacial coordination engineering strategy through integrating freeze‐drying with transient non‐equilibrium Joule heating, enabling the ultrafast synthesis of uniformly dispersed 1.84 ± 0.58 nm Pt nanoclusters on the reduced graphene oxide (i.e., Pt@rGO‐T) within 20 s. Structural characterizations and theoretical calculations reveal that oxygen anchoring sites and chlorine coordination cooperatively strengthen the electron–metal–support interaction and modulate the Pt d‐band center, thereby tuning the H* adsorption free energy toward a more","au":["X F Li","Xinyu Zhu","Shaorou Ke","Shitao Min","Shujie Yang","Wenhao Peng"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"Pt@rGO 纳米催化剂的瞬态热工程：氧锚定和氯配位用于高效制氢","zb":"研究对象为用于析氢反应（HER）的 Pt@rGO 纳米催化剂。通过冷冻干燥与瞬态非平衡焦耳加热的协同界面配位工程策略，在 20 s 内合成了均匀分散的 1.84 ± 0.58 nm Pt 纳米簇。结构表征和理论计算表明，氧锚定位点和氯配位协同增强电子-金属-载体相互作用并调节 Pt d-带中心，将 H* 吸附自由能调至更有利的热中性范围附近。Pt@rGO-T 在 10 和 100 mA cm⁻² 下分别表现出 29.6 和 73.0 mV 的低过电位，以及 6.23 A mg⁻¹ 的高质量活性，并在 200 h 内表现出优异的耐久性。","ob":"析氢反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1093/nsr/nwag417","t":"Self-single-atomization of active sites in electrochemical ammonia synthesis unveiled by machine learning potential","u":"https://doi.org/10.1093/nsr/nwag417","s":"National Science Review","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrochemical nitric oxide (NO) reduction reaction (eNORR) has emerged as a promising route for the synthesis of green ammonia. Fe was observed experimentally with great activity and selectivity for eNORR to ammonia. However, we found that electrochemical performance over iron is not due to its intrinsic activity, but from an adaptive capability of self-single-atomization in operando conditions. We first performed Grand Canonical Monte Carlo simulations driven by a machine learning potential, where we explored ∼2.5 million possible active structures and their evolution with increasing electrode potential. Microkinetic modeling indicates that Fe surface will be predominantly covered by adsorbed N* species in reaction, resulting in the formation of FeNx motifs by self-single-atomization. Statistical results indicate that the top sites of isolated FeNx motifs contribute higher ac","au":["Jun Long","C R Yang","Hui Li","Hao Li","J N Xiao"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3390/compounds6030042","t":"Advances in Gaseous Ammonia Decomposition for Hydrogen Production: Catalysts and Emerging Pathways","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/compounds6030042","s":"Compounds","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH3) is a compelling carbon-free hydrogen carrier. Its catalytic decomposition to produce a hydrogen/nitrogen (H2/N2) gas stream is central to the “NH3-H2” clean energy cycle, provided that residual NH3 is removed to fuel-cell-grade purity downstream. This review integrates advances from the past five years across four major catalytic NH3 decomposition pathways, encompassing conventional thermocatalysis, plasma-catalytic, photo(thermal), and electrically driven catalysis, within a unified mechanistic and practical framework, distinguishing it from existing single-pathway reviews. Noble metal catalysts, particularly Ru-based systems, achieve superior low-temperature activity through support engineering, promoter effects, and active-site construction. However, our analysis reveals that non-noble metal (Fe, Co, Ni) catalysts and their alloys, nitrides, and carbides have made substa","au":["Hao Wu","Tongtong Chu","Ying Xin","Zhaoliang Zhang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"气态氨分解制氢的进展：催化剂和新兴途径","zb":"氨是碳无氢载体。其催化分解产生氢/氮气体流是“氨-氢”清洁能源循环的核心，前提是下游去除残余氨以获得燃料电池级纯度。本综述整合了过去五年涵盖传统热催化、等离子体催化、光(热)催化和电驱动催化四大主要氨分解途径的进展，在统一的机理和实践框架下区分于现有的单途径综述。贵金属催化剂，特别是基于钌的系统，通过载体工程、助剂效应和活性位点构建实现低温活性。然而，非贵金属(铁、钴、镍)催化剂及其合金、氮化物和碳化物已取得实质性进展，某些钴基和双金属系统通过界面氧空位工程和电子结构调制接近钌级性能。新兴非热路线有效克服热力学障碍，在传统热要求温度200–300 °C以下运行，但每个路线都面临不同的能效、稳定性和可扩展性挑战。本综述评估了所有途径向实际应用 remaining 的关键挑战，包括残余氨去除和氢纯化、催化剂失活和稳定性、热管理和能效、启停动态以及系统集成和经济性。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15005808/v1","t":"Atomically precise metal nanoclusters in nitrate-to-ammonia electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15005808/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:45Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Driven by the growing need for sustainable ammonia production and effective nitrate remediation, the electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) has emerged as a promising technology. This process enables the conversion of nitrate pollutants into ammonia under mild operating conditions, offering a greener alternative to the energy-intensive Haber–Bosch route. However, the complex multi-electron and multi-proton transfer pathways involved in NO3RR require catalysts capable of precisely regulating intermediate adsorption, activation, and transformation. Atomically precise metal nanoclusters (NCs), with their well-defined atomic structures, tunable electronic properties, and identifiable active sites, have recently attracted considerable attention as model catalysts for elucidating structure–activity relationships. This review discusses the fundamental aspects of NO3RR, including ke","au":["Sourav Mandal","Tokuhisa Kawawaki","Sourav Biswas","Yuichi Negishi"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"原子精确金属纳米团簇在硝酸盐至氨电催化中","zb":"研究对象为原子精确金属纳米团簇（NCs）在硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR）中将硝酸盐污染物转化为氨的过程。系统比较了单、双、三金属NCs的催化性能，讨论了活性位点工程、配体调制、异金属掺杂和团簇组装对活性和选择性的调控作用。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7081550","t":"Delafossite-type CuCoO2 for efficient electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia in neutral electrolyte","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7081550","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia over copper-based catalysts in neutral electrolyte presents an environmentally benign alternative to the conventional Haber–Bosch process. However, the practical application of Cu-based catalysts is severely constrained by an insufficient supply of active hydrogen (*H) at Cu sites, which limits both the ammonia yield rate and Faradaic efficiency. Herein, a delafossite-type CuCoO2 electrocatalyst was successfully constructed through a B-site metal regulation strategy and applied to electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia under neutral conditions. It found that the optimized CuCoO2 catalyst achieves a remarkable ammonia Faradaic efficiency of 98% and an ammonia production rate of 18.04 mg h-1 cm-2, substantially surpassing the performance of reference Cu2O (FE: 62%; yield rate: 10.08 mg h-1 cm-2). Mechanistic investigations, combin","au":["Zefu Huang","Jun Ma","Shiyi Liu","Shuo Geng"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"尖晶石型CuCoO2用于中性电解液中高效的硝酸还原为氨的电催化","zb":"通过B位金属调控策略构建了尖晶石型CuCoO2电催化剂，用于中性条件下电催化硝酸还原为氨。优化后的CuCoO2催化剂实现了氨法拉第效率98%和氨产率18.04 mg h-1 cm-2。机理研究表明，Cu2O性能较差源于活性氢供应不足，导致亚硝酸中间体积累。CuCoO2的优异性能归因于Cu和Co双原子活性位点在同一尖晶石晶格内的协同作用，增强活性氢的生成和利用。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c02514","t":"Ruthenium-Engineered Active Hydrogen Dynamics in Cobalt Hydroxide: Enabling Enhanced Ammonia Synthesis and Photothermally Assisted Zn-Nitrite Battery","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.6c02514","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrite reduction reaction (NO 2 RR) offers a viable route for converting nitrite-contaminated wastewater into high-value ammonia (NH 3 ) under mild conditions. However, its practical application is impeded by limited selectivity and slow kinetics, primarily stemming from an insufficient supply of active hydrogen (*H). Herein, we rationally design and fabricate a ruthenium nanoparticle-decorated cobalt hydroxide nanowire (Ru–Co(OH) 2 ) electrocatalyst for enhanced NO 2 RR, achieving an ammonia yield rate of 7.71 mg h –1 cm –2 and a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 93.1% at −0.5 V vs RHE. Operando spectroscopic studies and theoretical calculations reveal that the incorporation of Ru significantly strengthens interfacial water adsorption and lowers the water dissociation energy barrier. Moreover, by leveraging the localized surface plasmon resonance (LSPR) of Ru, a photothe","au":["Qiancao Liu","Xuchen Liu","Aike Liu","Jing Yang Jiang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"钴羟基中的钌工程化活性氢动力学：实现氨合成增强和光热辅助的锌亚硝酸电池","zb":"研究对象为钴羟基电催化剂，通过引入钌纳米颗粒增强亚硝酸还原反应，实现氨产率7.71 mg h-1 cm-2和法拉第效率93.1%。通过原位光谱研究和理论计算，揭示钌的引入增强了界面水吸附并降低了水裂解能垒。此外，利用钌的局域表面等离子体共振，开发了一种光热辅助的锌-亚硝酸电池，在近红外光照射下功率密度显著增加。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.colsurfa.2026.141253","t":"Machine learning-driven nanoarchitectonics of C8N4 monolayer-supported single-atom catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.colsurfa.2026.141253","s":"Colloids and Surfaces A Physicochemical and Engineering Aspects","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xingkao Zhang","Jinlong Chen","H B Wu","Xiangjie Fu","H T Wang","Xiaohua Yu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"机器学习驱动下C8N4单层负载单原子催化剂用于电催化硝酸盐还原合成氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.179247","t":"Exfoliated g-C3N4–MoO3–Fe3O4 hybrids enabling selective and electrochemical ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.179247","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Eun Kyung Lee","Saleem Sidra","Kanishka Prasad Deliwala Kuruppu Mudiyanselage","Rajathsing Kalusulingam","Do Hwan Kim","Jun Ho Shim"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"剥离的g-C3N4–MoO3–Fe3O4杂合物实现选择性和电化学氨合成","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74253","t":"Hierarchical Electronic Structure Modulation of Cu‐Co Dual‐Site and CNT Tandem Interface Enables Highly Efficient Electrocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74253","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia (NO 3 RR) is a highly efficient dual strategy that can both reduce NO 3 − pollution and achieve sustainable NH 3 production. To overcome the low efficiency bottleneck under neutral electrolyte conditions, this study designed a tandem catalyst Cu‐Co‐O/CNT‐2 based on carbon nanotubes (CNT). By anchoring the Cu‐Co dual sites on the CNT support, the electronic structure and reaction pathway were optimized. At −0.9 V vs RHE, the Cu‐Co‐O/CNT‐2 catalyst exhibited an ammonia yield of 5.088 mg h −1 cm −2 and a Faradaic efficiency of 81.83%, significantly improving the NO 3 RR performance. In situ FTIR characterization revealed the dominant NHO pathway and successfully captured the * NH 2 OH intermediate. DFT calculations and in situ EPR analysis further indicate that the Cu‐Co‐O active sites preferentially adsorb * NO x , while CNT effecti","au":["Zhi Song","Dongxu Han","Boxia Liu","Jing Zhang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"Cu-Co双位点CNT串联界面分级电子结构调控实现高效电催化氨合成","zb":"研究设计了一种基于碳纳米管(CNT)的串联催化剂Cu-Co-O/CNT-2，以克服中性电解质条件下硝酸盐还原合成氨的低效率瓶颈。通过将Cu-Co双位点锚定在CNT载体上，优化了电子结构和反应路径。在-0.9 V vs RHE时，Cu-Co-O/CNT-2催化剂表现出5.088 mg h-1 cm-2的氨产率和81.83%的法拉第效率，显著提高了NO3RR性能。原位FTIR表征揭示了主导的NHO路径，并成功捕获了*NH2OH中间体。DFT计算和原位EPR分析表明，Cu-Co-O活性位点优先吸附*NOx，而CNT通过促进d带中心向上移动(-1.837 eV)，有效降低了反应能垒，提高了多电子转化效率，从而驱动NO3-的去氧化和逐步氢化合成NH3。该研究为高效串联催化系统的设计提供了理论支持，并为NO3RR反应中的氨生成和资源转化提供了新见解。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3762/bjnano.17.61","t":"Light-driven ammonia electrooxidation via carbon nitride–ruthenium molecular interfaces","u":"https://doi.org/10.3762/bjnano.17.61","s":"Beilstein Journal of Nanotechnology","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The homogeneous–heterogeneous catalysis gap remains an unresolved challenge in solar fuels research. Molecular catalysts offer unique selectivity and mechanistic transparency but suffer from poor electrode contact and limited recyclability, while heterogeneous semiconductors provide scalable light harvesting but lack precisely defined active sites. Anchoring molecular ruthenium (Ru) catalysts onto heterogeneous semiconductors, like carbon nitride (C 3 N 4 ), offers a chemically rational strategy to bridge this gap, yielding hybrid photoelectrodes capable of driving ammonia oxidation, a reaction of growing importance as a sustainable hydrogen carrier. Inspired by natural photosynthesis, in which a light-harvesting antenna is spatially coupled to a multielectron catalytic centre, the proposed hybrid system assigns distinct and complementary roles to each component: C 3 N 4 absorbs visible ","au":["Jan Holub","Pablo Jiménez-Calvo"],"o":"回填","why":["electrocatalytic ammonia"],"zt":"通过碳氮-钌分子界面进行光驱动氨电氧化","zb":"研究对象为碳氮（C3N4）-钌（Ru）分子界面，关键方法为将分子钌催化剂锚定在碳氮半导体上制备光电极，并利用非共价和共价键合策略构建异质界面，主要结果为C3N4吸收可见光分离电荷载体，金属配合物接受光生空穴驱动氨的六电子氧化，两种锚定策略分别控制表面密度、电子耦合和催化剂稳定性。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c08585","t":"Immobilization of Single Ni Sites and Separated Pd Clusters in Covalent Organic Framework for Enhanced Electrochemical Reduction of Nitrite to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c08585","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of nitrite (NO2-) to ammonia (NH3) offers a promising strategy for simultaneously purifying wastewater and producing value-added chemicals. The metal active site struggles to simultaneously optimize the adsorption strengths of NO2- and H*, resulting in a mismatch between the kinetics of intermediate activation and hydrogenation. In this work, we construct a composite catalyst of NiSS-COF/Pd ICs, which enhances the catalytic performance by precisely incorporating nickel single sites (NiSS) and Pd metal-isolated clusters (Pd ICs) into covalent organic frameworks. Thus, NiSS-COF/Pd ICs exhibit an NH3 production rate of 20.9 mg h-1 mgcat-1 and a high NH3 Faradaic efficiency of 95.5% at -1.0 V (vs RHE). With -1.3 V applied, NiSS-COF/Pd ICs yielded 35.3 mg h-1 mgcat-1 NH3, the turnover number reached 58421, and the turnover frequency was 3436.8 h-1 per Ni. The NiS","au":["Pei Liu","Bing Han","Yingnan Cao","Jie-Sheng Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 production"],"zt":"在共价有机框架中固定单原子镍和分离的钯簇以增强亚硝酸电化学还原为氨","zb":"构建了NiSS-COF/Pd ICs复合催化剂，通过精确引入镍单原子和钯金属隔离簇，增强亚硝酸还原为氨的催化性能。在-1.0 V (vs RHE)下，氨产率为20.9 mg h-1 mgcat-1，法拉第效率为95.5%。NiSS调节电子结构以增强亚硝酸吸附，而Pd ICs通过溢流机制产生氢，促进快速氢化，实现协同催化。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cjoc.70633","t":"Electrochemical Conversion of Inert Small Molecules for Sustainable Chemistry","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cjoc.70633","s":"Chinese Journal of Chemistry","d":"2026-07-08","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Comprehensive Summary The sustainable electrochemical conversion of inert small molecules, such as N 2 , CH 4 , and CO 2 , is opening new frontiers in green chemistry and energy technologies. Each of these molecules can be individually converted into a valuable chemical, offering the potential to replace existing industrial processes. Electrochemical N 2 reduction to NH 3 could replace the Haber‐Bosch process, avoiding the high‐temperature and high‐pressure conditions. Beyond NH 3 , N 2 fixation is expanding toward diverse nitrogen‐containing chemicals. The catalytic oxidation of CH 4 is referred to as the “Holy Grail” reaction, as it is difficult to activate the first C–H bond and control the product selectivity. Nevertheless, CH 4 oxidation under mild electro/photo‐electrochemical conditions enables the facile activation of the inert C–H bond, and the selectivity can be efficiently adj","au":["Z Zhang","Zuxin Wen","Yixin Chen","Shuya Hao","C Chen","Xianbiao Fu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"惰性小分子的电化学转化用于可持续化学","zb":"研究综述了惰性小分子如N2、CH4和CO2的可持续电化学转化，为绿色化学和能源技术开辟了新前沿。这些分子可以分别转化为有价值的化学品，有潜力替代现有工业过程。电化学N2还原合成NH3可以替代哈伯-博施法，避免高温高压条件。CH4的催化氧化被称为“圣杯”反应，因为难以活化第一个C-H键并控制产物选择性。CH4在温和的电/光电化学条件下氧化，可以方便地活化惰性C-H键，并通过精妙设计电极界面高效调节选择性。电催化CO2还原是实现碳中和的关键技术。目前，该反应正从单碳产物向多碳产物发展，活性稳定性得到提高。此外，N2和CO2之间的C-N偶联反应等分子间耦合反应提供了进一步的机会。这些努力代表了从化石基过程向可扩展、环保的增值化学品路径的转变。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c01652","t":"Spin-State Engineering in Co–N–C Catalysts Enables Efficient Bifunctional Oxygen Electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c01652","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":19,"ab":"Abstract The spin state of metal centers is a pivotal yet underexploited descriptor for electrocatalysis. This challenge is acute in bifunctional oxygen electrocatalysts, where the desirable high-spin state for optimal intermediate adsorption on single-atom sites is difficult to achieve and further complicated by the concurrent need to stabilize co-existing metallic nanoparticles against sintering. We propose that geometric distortion can serve as a driver to simultaneously distort single-atom sites and suppress nanoparticle sintering. To demonstrate this, we developed a poly(ionic liquid)-confined ultrafast thermal shock synthesis. Applied to a cobalt–nitrogen–carbon system, this strategy induces geometric distortion in Co-N4 moieties, triggering a low-to-intermediate-spin transition and simultaneously suppressing Co NP agglomeration. Combined spectroscopic, magnetic, and theoretical an","au":["Junhua Zhang","Yongya Zhang","Ce Wang","Leyi Zhang","Yusong Guo","Qingying Qiao"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["thermal shock synthesis"],"zt":"Co-N-C 催化剂中的自旋态工程实现高效的二元氧电催化","zb":"通过几何畸变驱动自旋态调制，开发了 Co-N-C 催化剂，实现了低至中间自旋态转换，优化了与氧中间体的轨道重叠，降低了反应能垒。优化后的催化剂表现出高二元活性（ORR E1/2 = 0.84 V；OER η = 366 mV at 20 mA cm−2），峰值功率密度为 312 mW cm−2，在锌空气电池中循环 ∼1360 次后仍保持其结构。","ob":"通用催化方法｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"url:https://aaltodoc.aalto.fi/handle/123456789/147797","t":"Engineering of anatase TiO2 morphology by fluorine-free hydrothermal synthesis and using the material for Photo-ALD substrate","u":"https://aaltodoc.aalto.fi/handle/123456789/147797","s":"Aaltodoc (Aalto University)","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Titanium dioxide (TiO₂) in the anatase polymorph is one of the most widely studied semiconductor photocatalysts owing to its chemical stability, non-toxicity, low cost, and facet-dependent surface chemistry. The photocatalytic performance of anatase TiO₂ is strongly governed by the crystallographic facets exposed at the particle surface, as distinct facets possess different surface energies, reactive site densities, and charge carrier behaviours. Conventional facet engineering has predominantly relied on hydrofluoric acid (HF) as a capping agent, a toxic and corrosive chemical that raises serious environmental and safety concerns. Additionally, the use of specific anatase facets as substrates for Photo-Assisted Atomic Layer Deposition (Photo-ALD) of metal co-catalysts has not been previously explored, representing a clear gap in the existing literature. This thesis investigated the fluor","au":["Komal Raana"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过无氟水热合成工程化锐钛矿 TiO2 形貌并使用该材料作为光化学原子层沉积基板","zb":"锐钛矿型二氧化钛 (TiO2) 是一种最广泛研究的半导体光催化剂之一，由于其化学稳定性、无毒、低成本和 facet-dependent 表面化学而备受关注。锐钛矿 TiO2 的光催化性能强烈受控于颗粒表面的晶体学晶面，因为不同的晶面具有不同的表面能、反应位点密度和电荷载体行为。传统的晶面工程主要依赖于氢氟酸 (HF) 作为封端剂，这是一种有毒和腐蚀性的化学物质，引发了严重的环境和安全问题。此外，使用特定的锐钛矿晶面作为光辅助原子层沉积 (Photo-ALD) 金属共催化剂的基板尚未被探索，这代表了现有文献中的一个明显空白。本研究调查了使用氧化钛纳米线 (KTNWs) 作为前驱体和尿素作为绿色、无毒封端剂的锐钛矿 TiO2 的无氟水热合成，以控制 {001}、{101} 和 {010} 晶面的暴露。合成的晶面粉末随后被用作 Photo-ALD 基板。{001} 和 {101} 晶面被成功合成","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.3390/ma19132917","t":"Large Improvement of the Mechanical Strength of Carbon Nanotube Films by Joule Heating Dominated Post Treatments","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/ma19132917","s":"Materials","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Carbon nanotube (CNT) films prepared via floating catalyst chemical vapor deposition generally suffer from residual iron impurities, structural defects, and weak inter-tube interfaces, which severely limit their mechanical performance. Here, we propose a post-treatment approach, which is dominated by Joule heating, to substantially improve the mechanical properties of CNT films. Acid washing after Joule heating effectively removes iron catalyst and amorphous carbon, increasing the specific strength from 0.64 N/tex to 2.96 N/tex. Pre-stretching induces alignment of the CNTs along the stretching direction, further raising the specific strength to 5.57 N/tex. Subsequent Joule heating not only raises graphitization degree and repairs lattice defects but also transforms the weak van der Waals contacts between tubes into continuous carbon networks, leading to network densification and locking ","au":["Zujia Hu","Yifan Feng","Haitao Zhang","Kangfei Liu","Xinran Cheng","Yunxiao Du"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"通过焦耳热主导的后处理大幅提高碳纳米管薄膜的机械强度","zb":"通过浮动催化剂化学气相沉积制备的碳纳米管 (CNT) 薄膜通常存在残留铁杂质、结构缺陷和弱的管间界面，这严重限制了它们的机械性能。本研究提出了一种以焦耳热为主导的后处理方法，以显著提高 CNT 薄膜的机械性能。焦耳热后的酸洗有效去除铁催化剂和非晶态碳，将比强度从 0.64 N/tex 提高到 2.96 N/tex。预拉伸导致 CNT 沿拉伸方向排列，进一步提高比强度至 5.57 N/tex。随后的焦耳热不仅提高了石墨化程度和修复晶格缺陷，还将管间弱的范德华接触转变为连续的碳网络，导致网络致密化和排列结构的锁定。最终比强度达到 7.04 N/tex，真拉伸强度 8.05 GPa，超过以往代表性碳材料。焦耳热净化机制取决于薄膜的初始铁含量：对于高铁薄膜，铁熔化、迁移并形成 Fe/Fe3C@C 核-壳颗粒，可以通过酸蚀刻转化为空心碳壳；对于低铁薄膜，铁通过原子扩散和蒸发去除。这项工作为高性能 C","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01361766mtgabs","t":"ALD Iridium-Coated Titanium Porous Transport Layers for PEM Water Electrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01361766mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Porous transport layers (PTLs) are a critical component of proton exchange membrane water electrolyzers (PEMWEs) that must prove durable in harsh low-pH and high-voltage environments. Titanium sinters are the most cost-effective and promising PTL materials in these conditions, yet they passivate in the presence of oxygen, forming an insulative TiO 2 layer. As such, they require conductive anti-passivation coatings over the surface that are often deposited either by electroplating or by physical vapor deposition (PVD). PTL coatings are usually comprised of precious metals such as platinum, iridium, or gold. Platinum and iridium are reported to be the most stable over longer time periods due to the oxidation of gold above 1.5 V. 1 Even with conductive platinum and iridium coatings, uneven coverage can lead to pockets of TiO 2 growth, increasing the contact resistance of the PTL with the ca","au":["Alexandra M. Oliveira","Dane Lindblad","Amir Peyman Soleymani","Ravel Larose","Matthew S. Weimer","Arrelaine A. Dameron"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"ALD 沉积铱涂覆钛多孔传输层用于 PEM 水电解","zb":"研究了使用原子层沉积（ALD）在钛多孔传输层（PTL）上沉积铱涂层，以防止钛在 PEM 水电解的苛刻环境中钝化。ALD 允许在低厚度下实现单分子层生长，具有共形和连续的表面覆盖，有望减少贵金属金属的总量。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1038/s41598-026-46686-5","t":"Joule-Heated direct writing: an electrically-driven additive manufacturing paradigm for space fabrication","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-026-46686-5","s":"Scientific Reports","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:23:23Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The imperative for in-space manufacturing drives the development of compact, energy-efficient metal additive manufacturing (AM) technologies. This work introduces and investigates a novel Joule-Heating Additive Manufacturing (JHAM) process, inspired by the Joule–Lenz effect, for the direct writing of metallic structures. A fully coupled thermal-electrical-structural finite element model is developed to simulate the multilayer deposition of 304 stainless steel wire, elucidating the unique \"tusk-shaped\" temperature field evolution and the effects of current, speed, and contact width. Single-bead, five-layer walls are fabricated experimentally, and the influence of process parameters on macrostructure, geometry (width, height, overlap rate), surface roughness (Ra, Rz), and cross-sectional hardness is systematically characterized. The results demonstrate that optimal macroscopic quality is a","au":["Suli Li","Zhuang Gao","Jie Xiong","Heng Zhang","Laixia Yang","Bingheng Lu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"焦耳加热直接书写：一种用于空间制造的电动增材制造范例","zb":"介绍并研究了基于焦耳加热的增材制造（JHAM）工艺，用于直接书写金属结构。开发了热-电-结构耦合有限元模型，模拟了 304 不锈钢丝的多层沉积，揭示了独特的“獠牙状”温度场演变和电流、速度、接触宽度的影响。实验制备了单珠、五层墙，系统表征了工艺参数对宏观结构、几何（宽度、高度、重叠率）、表面粗糙度（Ra, Rz）和横截面硬度的影响。","ob":"反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c10450","t":"Simulation-Guided Atomic Layer Deposition Enables Deterministic Interfacial Mechanics for Predictive Nanoimprint Lithography","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c10450","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Nanoimprint lithography (NIL) is a key enabler for next-generation nanomanufacturing, yet its industrial scalability remains constrained by persistent challenges at the mold-resist interface, including mold fracture, structural deformation, and inefficient demolding. These limitations arise from the lack of coordinated control over adhesion, friction, and stress evolution during imprinting. Guided by simulation-based insights that identify tunable interfacial layers as a critical lever, we employ conformal molecular/atomic layer deposition (MLD/ALD) as a rational strategy to actively regulate these coupled interactions. Here we systematically investigate MLD/ALD-grown graphene, Al2O3, and polyurea as model interfacial layers for NIL molds. By integrating molecular dynamics simulations, finite element modeling, atomic force microscopy (AFM), and experimental imprinting, we establish quant","au":["Chaoyu Chen","Jiulong Li","Youquan Jiang","Haonan Song","Li M","Huiyun Jiang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"模拟引导的原子层沉积实现可预测的界面力学，用于预测性纳米压印光刻","zb":"纳米压印光刻 (NIL) 是下一代纳米制造的关键使能技术，但其工业可扩展性仍受限于模具-抗蚀剂界面持续的挑战，包括模具断裂、结构变形和脱模效率低下。这些限制源于在压印过程中对粘附、摩擦和应力演变的协调控制不足。基于模拟的见解识别出可调谐的界面层是关键杠杆，我们采用共形分子/原子层沉积 (MLD/ALD) 作为合理策略来主动调节这些耦合相互作用。本文系统地研究了 MLD/ALD 生长的石墨烯、Al2O3 和聚脲作为 NIL 模具的模型界面层。通过结合分子动力学模拟、有限元建模、原子力显微镜 (AFM) 和实验压印，建立了涂层化学、界面能、应力演变和图案保真度之间的定量联系。在所研究的材料中，石墨烯表现出最有利的性能平衡，将压印引起的峰值机械应力降低到裸硅的 ∼20%，同时保持超低表面能 (≤0.13 J m-2) 和摩擦系数 (≤0.1)，从而最大限度地减少压印过程中的结构变形。我们进一步确","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.167747","t":"A computational approach to investigate adsorption on polar metal oxide surfaces: A DFT study of H2O2 dissociation and interaction with ALD-fabricated ZnO(002)","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.167747","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The explicit structure of both polar and stable ZnO(002) surface has been under investigation for decades. The answer to this question is even harder to obtain in normal conditions, where the surface is in contact with molecules of ambient air. As modelling of surface reactions generally require an explicit description of the surface, this has made zinc oxide, a material abundant in applications, painstakingly difficult to model. Here, we present a density functional theory-based approach to investigate surface reactions on polar zinc oxide surface in ambient conditions. Hydrogen peroxide was used as an adsorbate, and the utilized surface structure replicates atomic layer deposition. We discovered that the dissociation of hydrogen peroxide on ZnO(002) is a mildly endothermic (0.14 eV) reaction with an activation energy of 0.53 eV, and follows an Eley-Rideal mechanism. It is followed by a","au":["Mario Mäkinen","Kari E. Laasonen"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"基于计算的方法研究极性金属氧化物表面的吸附：对 H2O2 在 ALD 制备的 ZnO(002) 表面上的解离和相互作用的 DFT 研究","zb":"使用密度泛函理论研究了 H2O2 在 ZnO(002) 表面的吸附和解离行为，该表面结构模拟了原子层沉积。发现 H2O2 在 ZnO(002) 上的解离是一个温和的吸热反应（0.14 eV），活化能为 0.53 eV，遵循 Eley-Rideal 机制，随后发生放热解离（-0.43 eV 和 -0.46 eV）。此外，研究了 ZnO(002) 表面作为 H2O2 传感器和 H2O2 生产催化剂的性能。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1007/s11771-026-6362-7","t":"Rapid synthesis of functional materials by flash joule heating for environmental and energy applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11771-026-6362-7","s":"Journal of Central South University","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Shuai-chao Miao","Zhen-Xing Zhou","Xi Zhang","Yi-Xiang Wang","Gong-gang Liu","Chongqing Wang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"闪光焦耳加热快速合成功能材料用于环境和能源应用","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01472324mtgabs","t":"Understanding the Influence of Areal Cu Nanoparticle Density on CO 2 Reduction Reaction Selectivity","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01472324mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Electrocatalytic CO 2 reduction is an economically feasible approach for producing valuable chemical fuels and feedstocks. Cu is the only pure metal reported to be capable of producing high-value C 2+ products, such as ethylene, and has been studied extensively as a CO 2 reduction catalyst. 1 However, Cu undergoes electrochemical reconstruction through a dissolution-redeposition mechanism at relevant CO 2 reduction potentials. The electrochemical reconstruction of Cu has been shown to heavily influence the nature of active sites and, therefore, electrode activity, selectivity, and stability. 2 Most previous work has focused on investigating the identity of transient species that mediate reconstruction, as well as how catalyst properties such as nanoparticle size, shape, and oxidation state affect reconstruction. 2–4 However, there have been limited investigations on the role of the areal","au":["Kelsey Ramp","Si Young Lee","Daniel O. Delgado Cornejo","Camellia Schwartzman","Charles A. Roberts","Neil P. Dasgupta"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"Cu 纳米粒子面密度对 CO2 还原反应选择性的影响","zb":"电催化 CO2 还原是一种经济可行的方法，用于生产有价值的化学燃料和原料。Cu 是唯一一种能产生高价值 C2+ 产物的纯金属，已被广泛研究作为 CO2 还原催化剂。然而，Cu 在相关 CO2 还原电位下通过溶解-再沉积机制发生电化学重构。这种重构严重影响活性位点的性质，进而影响电极活性、选择性和稳定性。本研究使用等离子体增强原子层沉积 (PE-ALD) 作为一种控制 Cu 纳米粒子在气体扩散电极 (GDE) 上面核密度有用工具，并研究了这种影响如何影响反应选择性。使用原位拉曼技术、以及离位 SEM 和 TEM 成像研究了面纳米粒子密度对电化学重构的影响，作为观察到的选择性差异的潜在机制。此外还研究了催化剂的其他特性，例如通过 ICP-MS 定量的 Cu 负载量。这些结果强调了在评估经历电化学重构的体系中的选择性时考虑纳米结构面密度的必要性。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01361763mtgabs","t":"( Invited ) Advanced Porous Transport Layer Design and Manufacturing for PEM Electrolyzers","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01361763mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Green hydrogen powered by renewables has the potential to decarbonize the manufacturing of ammonia, methanol, and other critical chemicals, transforming the chemical industry. However, that opportunity will not be realized without green hydrogen attaining cost parity with the incumbent technology: steam reformed natural gas. In the case of proton exchange membrane (PEM) water electrolysis, cost reductions can be won via decreasing capital expenditures and through improvement of the electrical efficiency of the cell stack module. The anode porous transport layer (PTL) is a linchpin of this development strategy and the basis of this talk. We approached the problem systematically, investigating both the PTL itself and its interactions with the other cell components. Platinum is typically used as an antipassivation coating due to the small palette of materials capable of withstanding the hig","au":["Alexander Blair Papandrew","Alexandra Oliveira","Amir Peyman Soleymani","Ravel Larose","Albert Blank","Dane Lindblad"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"先进多孔传输层设计与制造用于 PEM 电解槽","zb":"由可再生能源驱动的绿色氢有潜力脱碳化氨、甲醇和其他关键化学品的生产，从而改造化学工业。然而，除非绿色氢实现与现有技术相当的成本平价，否则这一机遇将无法实现。在质子交换膜 (PEM) 水电解中，可以通过降低资本支出和提高电堆模块的电气效率来降低成本。阳极多孔传输层 (PTL) 是此发展策略的关键，也是本演讲的基础。我们系统地研究了 PTL 本身及其与其他电池组件的相互作用。由于 Pt 典型用作抗钝化涂层，因为能够承受 PEM 电解槽阳极高电位的材料种类有限。由于 Pt 的成本高且波动，我们通过两条路线寻求此涂层的替代材料系统。首先，采用热化学方法利用 PTL 生产中已使用的热量与廉价反应物结合，在 PTL 表面诱导形成钛化合物。在平行活动中，我们利用原子层沉积技术在 PTL 上精确沉积超薄保护层。同时，我们使用先进成型技术优化 PTL 的结构。这通过提高贵重铱金属阳极催化剂的利用率来影响资本","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.5281/zenodo.21248833","t":"AMMIAKNI \"YASHIL\" SINTEZ QILISH USULLARI: ILMIY-TAJRIBIY TADQIQOT","u":"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21248833","s":"Zenodo (CERN European Organization for Nuclear Research)","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Ushbu maqolada ammiak (NH₃) ishlab chiqarishning an’anaviy vazamonaviy usullari tahlil qilinadi, xususan “yashil” sintez konsepsiyasiga e’tiborqaratiladi. Tadqiqotda Haber-Bosch usuli bilan solishtirish, elektroximik, fotokatalitikva biologik usullar, energiya sarfi, uglerod izlari va atrof-muhit xavfsizligi masalalariko‘rib chiqiladi. Maqolada 5 ta ilmiy adabiyotdan foydalanilgan va natijalar ammiakniekologik jihatdan toza, energiya tejamkor usulda ishlab chiqarish istiqbollariniko‘rsatadi","au":["Bo'riyeva Muhabbat"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zb":"分析传统氨（NH₃）生产方法，特别是“绿色”合成概念。与Haber-Bosch方法对比，讨论了电化学、光催化和生物方法，以及能耗、碳足迹和环境安全性。引用5篇科学文献，表明清洁、节能的氨生产方法具有前景。"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c04148","t":"Plasma-Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c04148","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrogen reduction under ambient conditions is constrained by the kinetic inertness of N 2 and competition from the hydrogen evolution reaction. Here, we report an integrated plasma–electrolysis membrane-electrode assembly that couples a microstructured nonthermal surface discharge directly to a gas-diffusion cathode, enabling in situ generation and delivery of vibrationally excited N 2, N 2 (ν), to the electrocatalytic interface. Among 14 metal catalysts screened, Ag provided the best balance of activity and selectivity, achieving an NH 3 production rate of 7.7 ± 0.8 nmol s –1 cm –2 with an electrochemical Faradaic efficiency of 86 ± 14% at −0.54 V versus RHE under atmospheric pressure and room temperature. Plasma/electrolysis on–off controls and 15 N 2 isotope-labeling experiments establish that NH 3 formation requires simultaneous plasma activation and electrochemical ","au":["T Zhang","Rusen Zhou","Jungmi Hong","Jingyi Luo","Yufei Xue","Qiang Song"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"等离子体电催化氮还原用于氨合成","zb":"研究对象为电化学氮还原在环境条件下的动力学惰性和析氢反应竞争问题。采用集成等离子体-电解池膜电极组件，将微结构非热表面放电直接耦合到气体扩散阴极，实现振动激发N2, N2(ν)的原位生成和输送至电催化界面。Ag催化剂在–0.54 V vs. RHE下实现7.7 ± 0.8 nmol s –1 cm –2的氨产率和86 ± 14%的法拉第效率。等离子体/电解池开-关控制和15N2同位素标记实验表明，NH3形成需要等离子体活化和电化学极化同时进行。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.6c03820","t":"Alternating Magnetic Field Promotes Ammonia Cracking by Disrupting the Sabatier Limitation of Ruthenium Catalytic Species","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.6c03820","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-29T09:35:19Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"When catalyzing a reaction comprising elementary reaction steps that demand both strong and weak adsorption of sequential intermediates to complete a full cycle, catalytic metals often exhibit reactivity compromises, known as Sabatier constraints. Herein, computational and experimental findings suggest that dynamic modulation of the catalyst spin state can provide a new handle to overcome such limitations via low- and high-spin catalysis for ammonia decomposition, which is a reaction that exemplifies Sabatier constraints due to the difficulty in achieving strong NH3 binding as well as weak *H and *N binding for efficient H2 and N2 formations, respectively. We demonstrate that the self-heating ferrimagnetic Ru/Fe3O4 catalyst operating under an alternating magnetic field (AMF) exhibits at least a 5-fold enhancement in activity relative to standard thermal operation below 400 °C. The key be","au":["Alexander Adogwa","Hajar Hosseini","Abby Gardner","Jacob DeWitt","Gabriel Thompson","Sijie Guo"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Cracking"],"zt":"交替磁场促进钌催化物种的氨分解：通过打破萨巴蒂尔极限","zb":"研究交替磁场（AMF）对钌催化物种氨分解的影响。计算和实验表明，动态调节催化剂自旋状态可通过低自旋和高自旋催化克服萨巴蒂尔限制。在AMF下，自加热铁磁Ru/Fe3O4催化剂在低于400 °C时的活性至少提高5倍。AMF下的时变磁通使钌位点快速电子响应，减轻钌氮化，通过瞬时诱导高自旋配置。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c03454","t":"Quantum Controlled Catalysis: The Role of Spin in the Electrochemical Reduction of Nitrate to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c03454","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Transforming reactive nitrogen species into fuels and fertilizers is central to a circular nitrogen economy. Electrochemical nitrate reduction (NO3RR) bypasses the high energy demand of the Haber–Bosch process and the challenge of N≡N bond cleavage, while converting nitrate waste into value-added NH3. Here, we demonstrate that spin polarization arising from the chiral-induced spin selectivity (CISS) effect markedly enhances NO3RR on transition-metal oxide catalysts (CoOx, NiOx, and CuOx). Among these, the chiral CuOx catalyst exhibits the highest activity, delivering 200 mA cm−2 at −0.378 V vs RHE with an NH3 yield rate of 14.53 ± 0.3 mg h−1 cm−2 and a Faradaic efficiency of 91.4 ± 2.5%. Computational studies reveal that the chiral catalyst exhibits enhanced NO3RR activity compared to its achiral counterpart and suppresses the competing N–N coupling pathways that lead to undesir","au":["Aravind Vadakkayil","Sudhin Rathnakumaran","Fiham Fahim","Anisha Mondal","Sooraj Kunnikuruvan","Brian P. Bloom"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"量子控制催化：自旋在硝酸电化学还原为氨中的作用","zb":"研究对象为手性诱导自旋选择性（CISS）效应，关键方法为在过渡金属氧化物（CoOx, NiOx, CuOx）上实现NO3RR，主要结果为手性CuOx催化剂在-0.378 V vs RHE下活性最高（200 mA cm−2，NH3产率14.53 ± 0.3 mg h−1 cm−2，Faradaic效率91.4 ± 2.5%），通过自旋选择性效应增强NO3RR活性并抑制导致副产物的N-N耦合路径。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.8722468","t":"Twin‐Boundary Cu 2 ‐Pair Pockets Drive Spatial Proximity of Key Intermediates for Efficient Urea Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.8722468","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic urea synthesis from carbon dioxide (CO 2 ) and nitrate (NO 3 − ) offers an alternative to the energy‐intensive Bosch‐Meiser process but is limited by poor selectivity and Faradaic efficiency (FE). Herein, we proposed a defect engineering strategy by constructing ordered Cu nanowire electrocatalysts enriched with abundant twin boundaries (TBs) that can drive spatial proximity between the key intermediates derived from asymmetric activation of CO 2 and optimized adsorption of NO 3 − . Specifically, it could achieve a high FE of 61.81% and a peak yield rate of 5.80 mg h −1 cm −2 for urea production under a three‐electrode configuration. The underlying mechanism can be described as the TB‐induced compression shortening the Cu–Cu bond, creating Cu 2 ‐pair pockets that geometrically matched CO 2 adsorption and enabled asymmetric activation to *CO, further strengthenin","au":["Mingyu Cheng","S K Wang","Bocheng Zhang","Yanxu Chen","Yifan Wu","Zhenghua Duan"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"双边界铜对偶口袋驱动关键中间体空间邻近以实现高效的尿素电合成","zb":"研究对象为具有丰富孪晶边界（TBs）的有序铜纳米线电催化剂，关键方法为缺陷工程策略，主要结果为在CO2和NO3-不对称活化和优化吸附下实现尿素合成的Faradaic效率61.81%和峰值产率5.80 mg h−1 cm−2，TBs压缩缩短Cu-Cu键创建Cu2-对偶口袋匹配CO2吸附并实现不对称活化，Smoluchowski平滑使脊状Cu位点电子缺陷富集NO3-。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.7719126","t":"Quantitative Active Hydrogen Modulation via Mastering Interfacial Water Over Single Rare Earth Atom on Copper for NO 3 − ‐to‐NH 3 Electroreduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.7719126","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia offers a sustainable route for NH 3 synthesis, where active hydrogen (H*) plays a pivotal role. However, the quantitative modulation of H* and its atomic‐scale impact on catalytic performance remains largely unexplored. Herein, we engineer single‐atom rare earth in copper matrix encapsulated within carbon (CuYb SA @C and CuLa SA @C) for efficient NO 3 − ‐to‐NH 3 conversion. In situ Raman spectroscopy, electrochemical measurements, and ab initio molecular dynamics simulations reveal that the isolated rare earth atoms master the interfacial water structure to enrich K·H 2 O at the catalyst surface, promoting H* generation and utilization. A quantitative positive correlation has been established between interfacial K·H 2 O population, H* utilization rate and catalytic performance via single‐atom site modulation. Impressively, the CuYb SA","au":["Yu-Cheng Liu","Haolin Lu","Xue‐Zhi Song","De-Kun Liu","Ji‐Hong Dong","Lizhao Liu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"通过掌控界面水对铜基单稀土原子上的硝酸根至氨电还原的定量活性氢调制","zb":"研究对象为CuYb SA @C和CuLa SA @C催化剂在硝酸根至氨电还原中的性能。通过原位拉曼光谱、电化学测量和从头算分子动力学模拟，发现孤立稀土原子掌控界面水结构，富集K·H2O以促进H*生成和利用。CuYb SA @C催化剂在–0.6 V vs. RHE下实现39.75 ± 1.03 mg·h −1 ·mg cat −1的氨产率率和94.5 ± 2.46%的法拉第效率。机制研究表明，Yb单原子促进水吸附和分解，实现定向H*溢流，调制电子结构，并降低N-含中间体的加氢能垒。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3929/ethz-c-000802748","t":"Kinetic and Oxygen-Poisoning Study of Ammonia Synthesis and Decomposition over Supported MXene Mo₂CTₓ","u":"https://doi.org/10.3929/ethz-c-000802748","s":"Repository for Publications and Research Data (ETH Zurich)","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The synthesis and decomposition of NH3 have gained renewed attention in the context of using NH3 as a renewable energy carrier. Both reactions require active catalysts based on earth-abundant metals that are also stable against common poisons. Here, we dispersed two-dimensional Mo2CTx MXene nanosheets onto SiO2 to improve the accessibility of their active sites. In doing so, we achieved a ca. 10-fold improvement in Mo utilization for both reactions relative to an unsupported 3D beta-Mo-2 Nu. A comparison with this reference catalyst showed that SiO2 strongly affects the Mo active sites and alters the kinetic parameters of both reactions. For the NH3 decomposition reaction, the support effect is stronger at lower Mo loadings, whereas at higher Mo loadings, a partial restacking occurs, and such Mo2CTx/SiO2 catalysts behave similarly to bulk beta-Mo-2 Nu. Interaction with the SiO2 support i","au":["Evgenia Kountoupi","Diana V. Piankova","Tristan Petit","Christoph Rüdiger Müller","Alexey Fedorov"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"负载MXene Mo₂CTₓ上氨合成和分解的动力学与氧中毒研究","zb":"氨的合成和分解在使用氨作为可再生能源载体的背景下受到重新关注。两种反应都需要基于地球丰产金属的活性催化剂，这些催化剂对常见毒物也具有稳定性。将二维Mo₂CTₓ MXene纳米片分散到SiO₂上以提高其活性位点的可及性，相对于 unsupported 3D beta-Mo-2 Nu，实现了两种反应中Mo利用率的10倍提高。与参考催化剂的比较表明，SiO₂强烈影响Mo活性位点并改变两种反应的动力学参数。对于氨分解反应，载体效应在较低的Mo负载量时更强，而在较高的负载量时，发生部分堆叠，此类Mo2CTx/SiO2催化剂的行为类似于块状beta-Mo-2 Nu。与SiO₂载体相互作用增加了Mo2CTx对H-2中毒的敏感性，但同时也增强了其对蒸汽（8000 ppm）的稳定性。此外，SiO₂限制了Mo2CTx的可还原性，从而阻碍了在氨合成条件下N-2和H-2的活化。与beta-Mo-2 Nu不同，Mo"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7070298","t":"Pulse electrodeposited Cu-Co-Fe trimetallic catalysts for highly efficient and selective electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7070298","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In order to carry out electrochemical nitrate reduction efficiently, the catalytic electrodes should be able to initiate the reaction at the surface of the electrode and further catalyze the transformation of the intermediates of nitrate to ammonia. In this work, Fe was added to a CuCo electrodeposited frame to fabricate CuCoFe/Ni foam cathodes for nitrate-to-ammonia conversion to further enhance intermediate hydrogenation and catalyst mass utilization. The CuCoFe electrode obtained by direct current (DC) electrodeposition removed 96.0% of NO3-N in 1 h and the maximum NO2-N accumulation was 4.5% with a faradaic efficiency of NH3 of 91.0%. The catalyst architecture was also controlled by pulse-reverse potential electrodeposition which reduced the amount of deposited catalyst and enhanced the electrochemically active surface area and interfacial charge transfer. The optimized pulse-reverse","au":["MD SHAMIM HOSSAIN","Lianfeng Zhou","Li Hongshuang","Kaipei Qiu"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 production"],"zb":"脉冲电沉积 Cu-Co-Fe 三金属催化剂用于高效和选择性地电化学将硝酸盐还原为氨。通过在 CuCo 电沉积骨架中添加 Fe 制备 CuCoFe/Ni 泡沫阴极，以进一步增强中间氢化和催化剂质量利用率。直接电流（DC）电沉积的 CuCoFe 电极在 1 小时内去除 96.0% 的 NO3-N，最大 NO2-N 积累为 4.5%，氨的法拉第效率为 91.0%。催化剂结构也通过脉冲反向电位电沉积进行控制，减少了沉积催化剂的量，并增强了电化学活性表面积和界面电荷转移。优化的脉冲反向 CuCoFe 催化剂实现了 96.82% 的 NO3-N 去除，NO2-N 峰值最低为 3.75%，氨生产质量归一化为 0.408 mmol h-1 mg-1，约为直接沉积 CuCoFe 电极的 1.9 倍。基于结构和电化学表征，以及亚硝酸盐还原研究，表明改进的性能是由于 Cu、Co 和 Fe 的综合活性。Cu 促进","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01472375mtgabs","t":"Chalcogenide Vacancy-Rich Exfoliated Transition Metal Dichalcogenides as an Efficient Electrocatalyst/Photo-Electrocatalyst for Green Ammonia Production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01472375mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The catalytic conversion of N 2 gas and NO 3 - ions into ammonia at ambient conditions through electrochemical and photoelectrochemical pathways offers an attractive alternative to the energy-intensive and high-carbon featuring Haber-Bosch process. Therefore, developing highly active, product-selective catalysts with good durability in a cost-effective manner is highly desirable. In this context, we studied vacancy-rich transition metal dichalcogenides for electrochemical NRR and NO 3 RR to produce ammonia. The sulfur vacancy-rich ex-MoS 2 demonstrated a high Faradaic efficiency of 69% with an ammonia yield rate of 5.56 mmol g cat –1 h –1 during electrolysis without a light source, which increased to 80% with a yield of 7.48 mmol g cat –1 h –1 under visible light illumination towards NO 3 RR. Similarly, selenium vacancy-rich ex-MoSe 2 achieved a Faradaic efficiency of 93.6% and a yield r","au":["Alankar Kafle","Manan Guragain","Puimi P Kularathne","Qasim Adesope","Mohammad K. Altafi","Renuka N. R. Mudiyanselage"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"富缺位剥离过渡金属二硫族化合物作为绿色氨生产的有效电催化剂/光电催化剂","zb":"研究对象为电化学和光电化学途径将N₂气和NO₃⁻离子在环境条件下转化为氨，关键方法为研究富缺位过渡金属二硫族化合物。富硫缺位ex-MoS₂在无光源电解时表现出69%的法拉第效率和5.56 mmol g cat⁻¹ h⁻¹的氨产率率，在可见光照射下向NO₃RR时，效率增加到80%，产率率为7.48 mmol g cat⁻¹ h⁻¹。富硒缺位ex-MoSe₂在NO₃RR时实现了93.6%的法拉第效率和4.9 mmol gcat⁻¹ h⁻¹的产率率。此外，ex-MoSe₂在NRR时表现出933 μmol g cat⁻¹ h⁻¹的产率率和9.39%的法拉第效率，而ex-WSe₂达到了7.22%的法拉第效率和753 μmol g cat⁻¹ h⁻¹的产率率。DFT计算支持N₂和NO₃⁻物种在这些二硫族化合物中的缺位处结合，形成*N，随后被还原为氨。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01472345mtgabs","t":"Mechanistic Study of Osmium-Based Catalysts for Electrocatalytic Ammonia Oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01472345mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia splitting has recently drawn significant research interest due to the reaction product, hydrogen, can be utilized as a clean, carbon-free chemical fuel.Electrocatalytic ammonia oxidation has been recently investigated since the kinetics of ammonia oxidation is sluggish due to multiple electrons and protons are involved, with a concomitant high overpotential. Various transition metal-based complexes have been synthesized as catalysts for ammonia oxidation. Ruthenium complexes, in particular, have shown promising performance and interesting reaction mechanisms. Several iron catalysts have also been reported, with fast kinetics but even greater overpotentials than ruthenium analogs. Instead of iron, we expect that moving down the periodic table to osmium will utilize higher energy d-electrons which will lower the redox potential of the molecular catalyst and enable lower overpotenti","au":["Xiaoyin Zhang","Thomas Hamann"],"o":"回填","why":["Electrocatalytic Ammonia"],"zt":"基于钌的催化剂的电催化氨氧化机理研究","zb":"研究对象为电催化氨氧化，关键方法为电化学测量和化学计量光谱实验，以理解反应机理和揭示速率限制步骤。介绍了两种钌配合物的钌类似物[Os(tpy)(bpy)NH₃](PF₆)₂和[Os(tpy)(dmabpy)NH₃](PF₆)₂，并研究了氨氧化反应化学。结果与钌配合物的机理相似，但也存在显著差异，归因于钌与钌相比更大的后键合能力。从钌切换到钌确实降低了过电位，因为钌配合物具有更低的热力学电位。然而，添加更多给电子配体表现出不同的行为，使配位的氨更不酸性，从而减慢了反应速率。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01402042mtgabs","t":"Sodium-Mediated Redox Cascade for Electrochemical Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01402042mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Artificial ammonia synthesis is vital to modern life; however, the Haber-Bosch process, by which most ammonia is synthesized, is capital- and carbon-intensive. Zero-valent-metal-mediated ammonia synthesis is a promising alternative but requires a metal that is both a strong reductant and forms a stable nitride. Only a small number of metals, like lithium, can satisfy these constraints. Therefore, we developed an electrochemical paradigm enabling the use of different reductants by orthogonalizing the roles of the zero-valent metal between sodium metal and a Ti active site. These components are cheaper than lithium by two orders of magnitude. Using a sodium-naphthalene-titanium cascade, we achieved a rate of 475 nmol cm -2 s -1 and a Faradaic efficiency of 24%, and found that the reaction rate depends primarily on current density.","au":["Channing K. Klein","Alexis Lindenfelser","Michael A. Yusov","Anukta Jain","Ryan J. R. Jones","John M. Gregoire"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"钠介导的氧化还原级联用于电化学氨合成","zb":"研究对象为利用钠金属和Ti活性位点正交化角色实现不同还原剂的电化学氨合成，方法为使用钠-萘-钛级联，在电流密度下实现速率475 nmol cm-2 s-1和法拉第效率24%，结果表明反应速率主要取决于电流密度。","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01371920mtgabs","t":"High-Performance Li-Mediated Nitrogen Reduction Assisted by Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01371920mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Development of technologies for decentralised green ammonia (NH 3 ) production is one of the major challenges of this century, which will help to satisfy its progressively increasing demand in both fertiliser production and as a global carbon-free energy carrier, which is projected to reach ~690 Mt by 2050. ( 1 ) Among various approaches, electrochemical process based on the lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) is the current most promising practical method that enables sustainable synthesis of NH 3 from renewables with very high faradaic efficiency and yield rate. Despite its short yet intensive development, the Li-NRR has achieved several key commercialisation benchmarks, including close to 100% faradaic efficiency, ( 2 ) practical yield rates, ( 2 ) and long-term stability. ( 3 ) One of the primary requirements for efficient performance of the Li-NRR is the continuous","au":["Koustav Banerjee","Duong T.H. Truong","Darcy Simondson","Ngoc Trung Trung Nguyen","Cuong K. Nguyen","Cameron L. Bentley"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"由氨辅助的高性能锂介导氮还原","zb":"研究对象为锂介导的氮还原反应（Li-NRR）用于分布式绿色氨（NH3）生产，方法为研究氨作为质子载体对Li-NRR性能的影响，结果表明Li-NRR具有接近100%的法拉第效率、实际产率和长期稳定性，电解质界面（SEI）的形成和性质受质子载体影响，乙醇质子载体在实用高率氨电合成条件下稳定性未验证，磷鎓阳离子和酚类可作为替代质子载体，尽管无专用质子载体效率较低，但溶剂分解产物或电解质杂质可能运输质子。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01371915mtgabs","t":"Decentralized Ammonia Production: Insights into Lithium-Mediated Electrochemical Synthesis in Non-Aqueous Media","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01371915mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia functions as an effective energy carrier and alternative fuel, making it a critical component in the transition to resilient energy solutions. Additionally, it plays a vital role in modern agriculture, serving as a key component in nitrogen-based fertilizers that significantly boost crop yields to satisfy global food demands. Currently, however, ammonia production relies heavily on the energy- and carbon-intensive Haber-Bosch process, which requires large, centralized plants. This has led to an increased interest in on-site ammonia generation, which would reduce dependency on long supply chains, enhance energy security, and provide flexibility in energy use across various sectors, including agriculture, industry, and military applications. Electrochemical nitrogen reduction to ammonia offers a promising solution due to its distributed operation capabilities, high energy density, ","au":["Ana I. Alvarez","Michael A. Yusov","Ryan J. R. Jones","David R. Baker","Karthish Manthiram"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"分布式氨生产：非水介质中锂介导电化学合成的见解","zb":"研究对象为锂介导的电化学氨合成（LiMEAS）在非水介质中，方法为利用锂在环境条件下断裂氮三键形成锂氮化物（Li3N），随后与质子源反应生成氨，通过高通量平台进行快速筛选和性能参数分析，研究了空气和水作为直接输入到电化学反应器的电解质的影响，尽管创新电池设计减轻了空气和水带来的负面影响。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01371840mtgabs","t":"Alkali Cation Effects on Activity and Selectivity of the Nitrate Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01371840mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia offers a promising approach for remediation of nitrate-contaminated wastewater and the mitigation of carbon emissions as an alternative to the Haber-Bosch process. While considerable efforts have been made towards optimizing electrocatalysts, it is important to also consider how alkali metal cations (K+, Li+, Na+ and Cs+) may modulate NO3RR kinetics and the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Insights from similar reactions, such as CO2RR, suggest that cation identity can modulate cathode activity and faradaic efficiencies. Here, we study the effect of alkali metal cation identity and concentration on NO3RR kinetics, product selectivity, and the activity at silver (Ag) electrodes. Our results reveal stark differences in the magnitude to which cation identity impacts NO3RR by comparing acidic and alkaline environments. We consider ","au":["Ruth Bello","Kelsey A. Stoerzinger"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"碱金属阳离子对硝酸还原反应活性和选择性的影响","zb":"研究对象为碱金属阳离子（K+, Li+, Na+和Cs+）对硝酸还原反应（NO3RR）动力学、产物选择性和银电极活性的影响。结果显示，阳离子身份对NO3RR的影响程度在酸性和碱性环境中存在显著差异。这些发现表明，调节碱金属阳离子身份可以增强NO3RR活性，并突显其在调控反应动力学中的关键作用。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01281420mtgabs","t":"Impedance Analysis of a Porous Cantor Alloy for Ammonia Production in Aqueous Solution","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01281420mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia has been extensively used as a primary raw material for producing inorganic fertilizers and, more recently, as a medium for energy storage and hydrogen transportation. Typically, ammonia is made via the Haber-Bosch process, which is characterized by high energy consumption, a significant carbon footprint, and operation at high temperatures and pressures, with fossil fuels serving as the primary source of hydrogen [1-4]. In this study, ammonia electrolysis was carried out using a porous high-entropy alloy of CoCrFeNiMn (equiatomic composition), known as the Cantor alloy [5-7], as the cathode to catalyze the nitrogen reduction reaction by chronoamperometry in a 0.1 M K 2 SO 4 solution at neutral pH and room temperature. Surface, microstructural, and electrochemical analyses were performed before and after electrolysis of the porous Cantor alloy. Linear and cyclic voltammetry demons","au":["Mamié Sancy","Daniela Silva","Paulo Molina","Luis Herrán","Erik Castañeda","Magdalena Walczak"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"多孔康托合金用于水溶液中氨生产的阻抗分析","zb":"研究对象为CoCrFeNiMn（等原子比）多孔康托合金作为阴极催化氮还原反应，方法为在0.1 M K2SO4溶液中室温下进行氨电解，通过计时电流法和线性及循环伏安法进行电化学分析，结果表明多孔康托合金在室温下表现出催化活性，电位依赖性活性，在-0.5 V vs. SCE下产率约为10 µg h-1 cm-2，法拉第效率接近25%，扫描电子显微镜和X射线衍射分析显示化学元素分布均匀且面心立方晶体结构稳定，X射线光电子能谱显示多孔康托合金表面形成稳定的多元氧化物层，且电解后表面形成N-H键，电化学阻抗谱显示全频率范围内电容响应，至少有两个时间常数，电解电位应用时阻抗模量降低。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01281388mtgabs","t":"Unified Electrochemical Strategies for Sustainable Inorganic Nitrogen Valorization and Fuel Generation: Nitrate Reduction and Ammonia Electrolysis Processes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01281388mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Throughout recent years, electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia and ammonia electrolysis have gained significant attention as promising approaches for producing valuable carbon-free compounds. These processes are being actively explored because of their wide range of potential applications, including wastewater treatment, sustainable fuel production, nitrogen circularity, and fertilizer manufacturing. 1 Ammonia electrolysis, pioneered and advanced by Botte’s group, is now recognized as one of the most efficient and clean methods for hydrogen production. 2 Similarly, electrochemical nitrate reduction has emerged as an energy- and cost-efficient route for ammonia synthesis, offering high faradaic efficiencies and strong operational stability. 3 In this presentation, three different systems are examined in depth for the previously mentioned applications: ammonia electrolysis, nitrate ","au":["Alejandro Gutierrez-Carballo","Pravin Babar","Christian E Alvarez Pugliese","Gerardine G Botte"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"统一电化学策略用于可持续无机氮增值和燃料生成：硝酸盐还原和氨电解过程","zb":"近年来，电化学硝酸盐还原到氨和氨电解在产生有价值无碳化合物方面引起了极大关注。这些过程因其广泛的应用潜力而受到积极探索，包括废水处理、可持续燃料生产、氮循环和化肥制造。氨电解，由Botte团队开创和推进，现被认为是氢生产最有效和清洁的方法之一。类似地，电化学硝酸盐还原已成为氨合成的一种能源和成本高效途径，提供高法拉第效率和强操作稳定性。本研究深入考察了三种不同系统：氨电解、硝酸盐还原和同时硝酸盐还原/氨氧化系统。后者最近在Botte实验室引入，用于处理高浓度硝酸铵溶液。氨电解被认为是当今最有前途的技术之一，尽管仍存在一些挑战有待解决。本研究研究了氨电解，目标是生产氮和氢作为主要产品。基于铂的催化剂为该过程提供非常高的效率，在相对较低的应用电压（约0.8 V）下运行。然而，催化剂稳定性通常成为限制因素，取决于所用合成方法。通过在电沉积的基于铂的催化剂上应用疏水和亲水层，我们发现该催化剂在50","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1093/pastj/gtag023","t":"Food Security, Nitrates Capitalism, and the Haber–Bosch Revolution","u":"https://doi.org/10.1093/pastj/gtag023","s":"Past & Present","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract This article reinterprets the early history of the Haber–Bosch process of ammonia synthesis through the transnational development of synthetic nitrogen production at Ludwigshafen am Rhein and Billingham-on-Tees, County Durham. It argues that the nitrates revolution in the early twentieth century was not simply a technological breakthrough but a contested project linking industrial strategy, state power, and food security. Tracing the British government’s wartime construction and subsequent privatization of the Billingham plant, it shows how economic orthodoxy constrained efforts to sustain state-led industrial co-ordination, even as private firms pursued cartelized forms of governance. It situates the British and German chemical industries within a shared political economy, and reframes fertilizer production as central to the emergence of modern food politics and the internation","au":["Patricia Clavin"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"粮食安全、硝酸盐资本主义与哈伯-博施革命","zb":"通过合成氮生产在路德维希港和比林厄姆的跨国发展，重新解读了氨合成哈伯-博施过程的早期历史。文章认为，20世纪初的硝酸盐革命不仅是技术突破，还是连接工业战略、国家权力和粮食安全的争议性项目。追踪英国政府在战争期间建设和随后的比林厄姆工厂私有化，展示了经济正统如何限制国家主导工业协调的努力，同时私营企业追求卡特尔化治理形式。将英国和德国化学工业置于共享的政治经济中，并将化肥生产重新定义为现代粮食政治和国际政治经济的核心，预示着后来的主权、不平等和环境限制的争论。恢复这些历史揭示了粮食安全作为工业现代化的基础问题，硝酸盐资本主义受国家资源治理、科学专长和全球市场决策的影响。","ob":"通用催化方法"},{"id":"10.1021/acsmaterialslett.6c00317","t":"Metal-Organic Coordination Nanotubes as Advanced Architectures for Efficient Ammonia Electrosynthesis via Pure Nitrate Reduction in Neutral Media","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsmaterialslett.6c00317","s":"ACS Materials Letters","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Metal-organic coordination materials have emerged as promising candidates for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NITRR), but the molecular-level engineering required for constructing high-efficiency electrocatalysts remains challenging. This study addresses this gap by developing a class of metal-organic coordination nanotubes (MONTs) as atomically precise single-site electrocatalysts, including Fe-MONTs, Co-MONTs, and Ni-MONTs. Benefited from the unique coordination structure, the Co-MONT electrode exhibited superior electrocatalytic performances for the NITRR, achieving an ammonia production Faradaic efficiency of 89.9% at −0.7 V (vs reversible hydrogen electrode) and an ammonia yield rate of 231.3 mmol h−1 g−1cat. in pure nitrate solution. Through combining in situ characterizations and theoretical simulations, the electrocatalysis mechanisms and active site configu","au":["M Y Wang","Qian Teng","Qianchuan Yu","H J Zhou","Sen Yang","Tianyu Shen"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"金属有机配位纳米管作为高效氨电合成先进架构：中性介质中纯硝酸盐还原","zb":"研究对象为金属有机配位材料在电催化硝酸盐还原反应（NITRR）中的应用。通过构建金属有机配位纳米管（MONTs）作为单原子位点电催化剂，包括Fe-MONTs、Co-MONTs和Ni-MONTs。Co-MONT电极在-0.7 V（vs可逆氢电极）下对NITRR表现出优异的电催化性能，氨法拉第效率为89.9%，氨产率率为231.3 mmol h−1 g−1cat。结合原位表征和理论模拟阐明了电催化机制和活性位点配置。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141080","t":"Atomically dispersed cobalt on niobium oxide enables photothermal nitrogen fixation via nitrogen-hydrogen coupling","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141080","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Developing highly efficient photothermal catalyst for N2-to-NH3 conversion remains a great challenge. Here we report atomically dispersed cobalt on niobium oxide (Co-Nb2O5) for NH3 synthesis through a photothermal NH coupling mechanism. This catalyst exhibits 28-fold enhancement in the rate of NH3 formation (14 mmol.g-1.h-1) over pristine Nb2O5 (0.46 mmol.g-1.h-1). The mechanistic study reveals that under photothermal stimulation, photoexcited Co 3d orbitals donate electrons into the π* antibonding orbitals of adsorbed N2, weakening the NN bond and enabling stepwise hydrogenation while reducing the apparent activation energy by more than 50%. Complementary DFT calculations and in-situ spectroscopies reveal that Co sites stabilize key intermediates along the associative distal pathway. These findings manifest single-atom coordination chemistry to control molecular activation and multi-ele","au":["Fazal Raziq","Mohammad Z. Rahman","Sharafat Ali","Ashfaq Ahmad","Muhammad Shoaib","Rajwali Khan"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"位于氧化铌上的原子分散钴实现光热氮固定通过氮-氢耦合","zb":"研究对象为原子分散钴（Co）在氧化铌（Nb2O5）上的光热催化剂，关键方法为光热NH耦合机制，主要结果为Co-Nb2O5比Nb2O5的氨形成速率提高28倍（14 mmol.g-1.h-1），光热刺激下Co 3d轨道电子注入吸附N2的π*反键轨道减弱NN键，降低表观活化能50%，Co位点稳定关联远程路径上的关键中间体。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127209","t":"Orbital-orthogonality-mediated active-site decoupling for ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127209","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environmental","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction (NRR) offers a promising route for sustainable ammonia production but suffers from low efficiency due to the competitive hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) and inadequate N 2 mass transfer in conventional aqueous systems. Here, we propose a rational strategy of orbital orthogonality to reconfigure lattice-intrinsic orbital hybridization, effectively decoupling HER and NRR onto distinct frontier orbital domains. Using non-stoichiometric MoS x as a model platform, we identify two mechanistic paradigms: while terminal S 2- species in MoS 2-x lead to single-site competition, the bridging S 2 2- species in MoS 2+x force S 3p orbitals to be spatially orthogonal to Mo‑d orbitals. This orthogonal configuration segregates proton capture (S-p states) from N 2 activation (Mo-d states), thereby eliminating direct electronic competition. Furthermore, an integrated \"","au":["Hao Fei","Bo Liu","Songhua Yang","Feipeng Yang","Caiyun Wang","Guanzhen Chen"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"轨道正交介导的活性位点解耦用于氨电合成","zb":"研究对象为非化学计量的MoSx，关键方法为轨道正交性策略重构晶格内轨道杂化，主要结果为桥接S2-物种使S3p轨道与Mo-d轨道空间正交，分离质子捕获（S-p态）和N2活化（Mo-d态），消除直接电子竞争，优化MoS2.57催化剂实现峰值NH3产率303.63 ± 3.49 μg h-1 mg-1和100小时耐久性。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/cryst16070438","t":"Electrocatalytic NO Reduction to NH3: Theoretical Advances in Low-Dimensional Materials, Interfaces, and Microenvironments","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/cryst16070438","s":"Crystals","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitric oxide reduction reaction (NORR) for ammonia synthesis has emerged as a research focus in artificial nitrogen fixation. Unlike previous reviews that primarily focus on experimental catalyst development, this work offers a comprehensive and systematic summary of recent theoretical progress in NORR, with special emphasis on low-dimensional materials. We connect four important areas: atomic-level design principles for active sites, emerging mechanistic ideas that go beyond conventional scaling relations, realistic simulations of the electrochemical microenvironment, and data-driven machine learning approaches for catalyst discovery. We begin by discussing the reaction mechanism, analyzing the orbital interactions that control NO activation and the thermodynamic and kinetic features of different reaction pathways. For active-site construction, we examine electronic syn","au":["Yu Liang","D D Zhang","Weiyi Wang","Shijie Xiong","Hua Yang","Jiajun Wang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"电催化一氧化氮还原为氨：低维材料、界面和微环境的理论进展","zb":"电催化一氧化氮还原反应（NORR）用于氨合成是人工固氮研究的热点。本文系统总结了近期NORR的理论进展，特别强调低维材料。连接了四个重要领域：活性位点原子级设计原理、超越传统比例关系的Emerging机理概念、电化学微环境的真实模拟以及用于催化剂发现的机器学习方法。分析了反应机理，研究了控制NO活化的轨道相互作用以及不同反应路径的热力学和动力学特征。对于活性位点构建，考察了单原子和双原子催化剂中的电子协同作用、配位微环境调节、掺杂和应变引起的电子结构调制以及允许多自由度调节的异质结界面。为了探索新的机理概念，引入了p区元素协同作用、反向活化、磁性和自旋控制以及表面电子奇异性作为克服传统比例关系的策略。关于反应微环境，分析了覆盖度、溶剂化、局部pH值和施加电位如何共同影响选择性和活性。最后，总结了机器学习在构建描述符和加速催化剂筛选中的作用。本文旨在为设计具有高活性、选择性和长期稳定性的高效","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-018744mtgabs","t":"( Invited ) Ammonia and Hydrogen Generation Using 2D Transition Metal Chalcogenides","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-018744mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"We use transition metal chalcogenides to facilitate the nitrate reduction to ammonia (NH 3 ) and proton reduction to hydrogen (H 2 ) via dark and photo electrocatalysis. The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) presents a promising route to generate NH 3 from nitrate for fuel and fertilizer applications. This study investigates a polycrystalline vanadium sulfide (VS X ) electrocatalyst, derived from annealed solvothermally grown VS 2 , which exhibits exceptional activity (2.3 ± 0.6 mg·cm–2·h–1 @ –0.92 V vs RHE) and Faradaic efficiency (69 ± 6% @ –0.69 V vs RHE) for NO 3 RR in a neutral pH electrolyte. Grand-canonical density functional theory (GC-DFT) simulations identify sulfur vacancies in VS 2 as key active sites for NO 3 – adsorption and NH 4 + production, where NO 3 – outcompetes H + for adsorption. The GC-DFT shows multiple favorable reaction mechanisms at undercoor","au":["Elisa Miller-Link"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zb":"使用二维过渡金属硫族化合物通过暗和光电催化促进硝酸盐还原为氨（NH3）和质子还原为氢（H2）。研究了多晶硫化钒（VSX）电催化剂，该催化剂由退火溶剂热生长的 VS2 制备，在中性 pH 电解质中表现出优异的活性（2.3 ± 0.6 mg·cm–2·h–1 @ –0.92 V vs RHE）和法拉第效率（69 ± 6% @ –0.69 V vs RHE）。GC-DFT 模拟确定了 VS2 中的硫空位是硝酸盐吸附和 NH4+ 生成的关键活性位点，其中 NO3- 竞争性吸附优于 H+。GC-DFT 显示在欠配位的 V 位点存在多种有利反应机制。此外，研究了使用 MoS2 单层与 GaInP 接口的光电化学析氢。MoS2 单层在 GaInP 上表现出优异的 > 100 h 的 H2 生成性能，优于裸 GaInP。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01562708mtgabs","t":"Electrochemical Separation Technology Platform for Resources Recovery of Multiple Products from Waste","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01562708mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"We propose a unified electrochemical separation platform for the selective recovery of resources from complex aqueous waste streams, including nitrogen, mineral salts, and organic species. The overarching goal is to convert high-salinity and nutrient-rich wastewaters into value-added products through electrochemically driven, adsorption-based separations. This approach reduces energy consumption, chemical use, and waste generation while advancing a circular economy for water, materials, and nutrients. An integrated electrochemical–adsorption reactor has been developed for nitrogen removal and recovery that couples nitrogen conversion with biogas upgrading. In contrast to conventional activated sludge treatment and Haber–Bosch-based nitrogen management, this system enables the direct transformation of aqueous nitrogen species into solid nitrogen-containing fertilizers under ambient condit","au":["Yupo J. Lin","Po-Chih Tseng"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zb":"提出了一种统一的电化学分离平台，用于从复杂的水系废水中选择性回收资源，包括氮、矿物盐和有机物种。通过电化学驱动的吸附分离，将高盐和营养丰富的废水转化为高价值产品。该系统将氮转化与沼气升级耦合，在环境条件下将水系氮物种直接转化为固体含氮肥料，无需外部化学氧化剂或还原剂。电化学驱动力控制氮的物种和传输，选择性吸附剂介质捕获和浓缩铵和其他氮物种为可回收的固体产品。此外，还将讨论使用电化学吸附分离技术（EAST）选择性提取矿物盐。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01522530mtgabs","t":"Ammonium Ion Sensing with Capillary Electrophoresis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01522530mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Capillary electrophoresis (CE) as a method for the determination of ammonium ions, particularly for the treatment of agricultural wastewater is examined. A low-cost, easily deployable electrophoresis setup is demonstrated. Common issues associated with CE and agricultural wastewater such as variable elution times and separation of alkaline metals are addressed. Introduction More than half of the world’s population is dependent on synthetic nitrogen-based fertilizers which are produced via the Haber-Bosch process. Besides approximately 1% of the world’s annual energy supply going into this process [1], it is carbon intensive in the form of requiring methane and is responsible for approximately 1% of global anthropogenic CO 2 emissions [2]. This along with the logistics of ammonia transport make more localized processes, that can reuse other agricultural wastes, a topic of recent interest.","au":["Daniel Struk","Christopher A. Heist","Jie Xu","Peter J. Hesketh"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"使用毛细管电泳进行铵离子传感","zb":"该研究考察了毛细管电泳（CE）作为测定铵离子的方法，特别是在处理农业废水中的应用。展示了一种低成本、易于部署的电泳装置。解决了与CE和农业废水相关的问题，如洗脱时间的可变性和碱金属的分离。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01502448mtgabs","t":"( Keynote ) Copper Based Metal Organic Frameworks: Development of Electrocatalytic Systems for Oxygen Reduction, Conversion of Nitrates to Ammonia and Hydrogen Evolution","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01502448mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Metal–organic frameworks (MOFs) are porous coordination polymers of metal clusters coordinated by organic ligands to form one-, two- or three-dimensional structures. The fact that MOFs can be precisely engineered to obtain systems with adjustable pore sizes, controllable compositions with precisely formed (e.g., single atom) active sites permits, in principle, designing of electrocatalytic systems for specific reactions and applications. While the separated and monodispersed metal nodes (ions or clusters) of MOFs act as highly efficient active sites, the functionalized organic ligands could contribute to the chemical and structural selectivity with respect to both reactants and products. Various MOFs have been examined for electrochemical catalytic applications, such as energy conversion reactions, including hydrogen evolution, hydrogen oxidation, oxygen evolution and oxygen reduction re","au":["Pawel Kulesza","Anna Chmielnicka","Iwona A. Rutkowska","Shaghayegh Naghdi","Dominik Eder"],"o":"回填","zb":"基于铜的金属有机框架（MOFs）用于开发电催化系统，包括氧还原、硝酸盐转化为氨和析氢反应。MOFs 是金属簇与有机配体配位形成的多孔配位聚合物，具有可调的孔径和可控的组成，允许设计针对特定反应和应用的电催化系统。铜基 MOFs 因其活性位点可与贵金属催化剂媲美而受到关注，其活性位点可视为贵金属催化剂的替代方案。Cu 对 O2、CO2、H2O、NO3- 等分子系统或 CO、H2O2、NOx 等反应中间体的结合亲和力接近理想。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01502447mtgabs","t":"( Keynote ) Durable Electrocatalysts of Fluorine-Doped Strontium Ferrite for Urea Production from CO2 and Nitrate Ions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01502447mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Urea is conventionally synthesized through the Bosch–Meiser process, which involves reacting CO 2 with ammonia. Since ammonia is made using the Haber–Bosch process, the overall production of urea is quite energy-intensive. An electrochemical route for urea synthesis has been introduced as an energy-efficient alternative to meet the substantial demand. However, challenges of low Faraday efficiency and urea productivity have prompted numerous studies to overcome these obstacles. This talk addressed electrocatalytic urea synthesis using fluorine-doped strontium ferrite as a durable catalyst. It demonstrates superior performance in urea formation when fluorine doping regulated A-site vacancy for the structural reconstruction of catalytic surface under CO 2 atmosphere. The reconstructed fluorine-doped strontium ferrite catalyst achieved a high Faraday efficiency of 36 % and an impressive prod","au":["Jae W Lee"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zb":"氟掺杂锶铁氧体作为耐久电催化剂用于从 CO2 和硝酸根离子制备尿素。通过氟掺杂调节 A 位空位以重构催化表面结构，在 CO2 大气中实现了优异的尿素形成性能。在 H 细胞中，该催化剂实现了 36% 的高法拉第效率和 2087 mgg-1 h-1 的生产速率，稳定性超过 15 个循环。原位拉曼光谱识别了反应中间体，DFT 结果表明，催化表面的重构通过提供更有利的电子结构促进了尿素合成，这是由于 Fe 的 d 带中心较低，有利于 C-N 偶联和 CO2 还原。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01502446mtgabs","t":"( Keynote ) Sustainable Photoelectrocatalytic Pathways for Ammonia and Urea Production from N 2 and CO 2 Reduction in Aqueous Media","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01502446mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This work shows the feasibility to use photoeletrosynthesis of ammonia and urea from dissolved N 2 and CO 2 in aqueous medium and seawater. Materials such as MFe 2 O 4 ferrite (M = Co 2+ , Cu 2+ and Mn 2+ ) and graphene were used as photocathode, operating as p -type and p-n homojunction semiconductors. The performance of CoFe 2 O 4 , CuFe 2 O 4, and MnFe 2 O 4 ferrites supported on GDL electrodes were tested in ammonia, fuels alcohols and urea formation by photoelectrocatalytic method. The main results highlighted the efficiency of all electrodes, but higher yield ammonia conversion, ethanol formation ant the best urea synthesis were obtained at GDL/MnFe 2 O 4 @FeOOH at -0.2 V vs Ag/AgCl/Cl - and artificial solar irradiation.","au":["Maria Valnice Boldrin Zanoni","Clécia Andrade dos Santos"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesis of ammonia"],"zt":"(关键演讲) 可持续的用于从N₂和CO₂还原在水中生产氨和尿素的 photoeletrosynthesis 途径","zb":"研究对象为从水相中的N₂和CO₂通过 photoeletrosynthesis 生产氨和尿素，关键方法为使用MFe₂O₄铁磁体（M = Co²⁺、Cu²⁺和Mn²⁺）和石墨烯作为光电阴极，分别作为p型半导体和p-n同质结半导体。测试了CoFe₂O₄、CuFe₂O₄和MnFe₂O₄铁磁体负载在GDL电极上的性能，通过光电催化方法在氨、燃料醇和尿素形成中。主要结果突出了所有电极的效率，但在-0.2 V vs Ag/AgCl/Cl⁻和人工太阳照射下，GDL/MnFe₂O₄@FeOOH获得了更高的氨转化率、乙醇形成和最佳尿素合成。","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及碳材料｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01442799mtgabs","t":"Advancing Solid Oxide Electrochemical Cells: Materials Synthesis, Ceramic Processing, Interface Engineering, Device Fabrication, and Characterizations","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01442799mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This poster introduces the research directions and laboratory capabilities of a newly established research group (PI: Fan Liu) at Penn State University, focusing on intermediate-temperature solid oxide electrochemical cells and heterogeneous catalysis for sustainable energy conversion and storage. The group aims to advance efficient and scalable electrocatalytic and thermal-catalytic systems through integrated efforts in materials synthesis, ceramic processing, interface engineering, device fabrication, and advanced characterization. Our research emphasizes the rational design of functional materials, including electrodes and electrolytes, oxide-supported metal catalysts, and liquid metal systems, to enable a range of energy-relevant reactions, such as hydrogen production, carbon dioxide conversion, ammonia synthesis/decomposition, dry reforming of methane, and natural gas upgrading. Par","au":["Fan Liu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"推进固体氧化物电化学电池：材料合成、陶瓷加工、界面工程、器件制造和表征","zb":"研究对象为中间温度固体氧化物电化学电池和异质催化，关键方法为材料合成、陶瓷加工、界面工程、器件制造和先进表征。研究强调功能材料的理性设计，包括电极和电解质、氧化物负载金属催化剂和液态金属系统，以实现多种能源相关反应，如氢生产、二氧化碳转化、氨合成/分解、甲烷干式重整和天然气升级。特别关注多尺度下的结构-性能关系。研究利用宾夕法尼亚州立大学材料研究所（MRI）的先进设施，采用原位和离位表征技术，如原位和操作中FTIR-MS、TGA-MS、XRD、XPS、SEM、TEM和拉曼光谱，直接观察热和电化学刺激下的表面化学、相变和催化行为。同时，研究组积极与建模团队合作，将实验观察与理论见解（包括密度泛函理论和数据驱动方法）相结合，以加速材料发现。","ob":"甲烷干重整｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01422117mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Developing an Industrial Metabolism System at Idaho National Laboratory","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01422117mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The modern world is built on the creative application of the large scale industrialization of natural and synthetic processes. Some of these modern processes would be very familiar to humans from several thousand years ago such as large-scale agriculture or iron production. These sorts of processes are more efficient, mechanized, and perhaps performed on a larger scale, but are essentially unchanged from those used Millenia ago. However, other common processes such as aluminum or fixed nitrogen production would be entirely unrecognizable and are fundamentally different than they were performed even 150 years ago. Likewise, Idaho National Laboratory (INL) is investigating an industrial metabolism analog where concentrated nuclear thermal energy is substituted for diffuse solar radiation for the production of hydrocarbon resources. The INL thermosynthetic pathway directly mirrors photosynt","au":["Micah J. Casteel"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"（邀请）在爱达荷国家实验室开发一个工业代谢系统","zb":"爱达荷国家实验室研究了以集中的核热能替代分散的太阳辐射来生产碳氢资源的工业代谢类似物。该研究开发了一种热合成途径，直接模拟光合作用和酶促碳固定，通过电化学电池、先进催化剂和热集成驱动从热能到复杂化学产品的循环转化过程。通过紧密耦合热化学过程以及中间产物的循环，该系统提供了一种将核能与现有碳氢基础设施耦合的方法。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01412090mtgabs","t":"Complex Displacement Deposition: A Self-Templating Mechanism for Forming High-Surface-Area Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01412090mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Controlling nanoscale morphology and phase composition during electrodeposition remains a fundamental challenge in the design of electrocatalysts and functional metal coatings. Here we introduce Complex Displacement Deposition (CDD), a new electrodeposition framework that couples metal-ligand coordination chemistry with a competitive precipitating agent (PA) to regulate when and how a solid phase nucleates during metal deposition. Unlike conventional methods that rely on uncontrolled local alkalinization, CDD decouples metal reduction from precipitation by using a PA that competes with the metal for the ligand only under specific interfacial conditions. This mechanistic separation enables precise control over precipitate formation, morphology evolution, and metal/oxide (or metal/complex) ratios. Using the Cu-citrate-Ca²⁺ system as a model, we identify and characterize a previously unrepo","au":["Ariel Friedman","Stoyan Bliznakov","Leonard J. Bonville","Radenka Maric"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"复杂置换沉积：形成高表面积催化剂的自模板机制","zb":"研究对象为电催化剂和功能金属涂层，关键方法为复杂置换沉积（CDD），通过金属-配体配位化学与竞争沉淀剂（PA）耦合来调控固相成核时机与方式。使用Cu-柠檬酸-Ca²⁺体系作为模型，发现并表征了一种新的混合金属络合物，该络合物在沉积过程中短暂形成于电极表面。在还原电位下，该相反复沉淀并被还原，产生自模板的沉淀-还原循环，生成高孔隙率的金属Cu沉积物。所得高表面积铜对硝酸还原反应（NO₃RR）表现出优异活性。在0.5 M KOH + 100 mM NaNO₃中，优化的CDD-Cu催化剂对NH₃的部分电流密度为243 mA cm⁻²，产率率为1.13 mmol h⁻¹ cm⁻²，在-0.6 V vs RHE下，该值超过传统电沉积Cu和商业Cu/C催化剂。尽管法拉第效率较低（≈64%），但纯金属表面的NH₃电流密度凸显了CDD实现的形貌控制带来的催化优势。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01371916mtgabs","t":"Development of the Ambient Green Ammonia by Three Routes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01371916mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"In industry, NH 3 is usually produced by the Haber-Bosch process, a synthesis technology that has been indispensable to human society for over a century. Still, the method operates at high temperatures (400-500°C) and high pressures (15-25 MPa). It consumes a large amount of hydrogen produced by fossil-fuel steam reforming to react with nitrogen, which requires more energy and has a high social cost due to its carbon footprint. In recent years, we have explored green ammonia production through photocatalytic and electrocatalytic N 2 reduction (PNRR vs. eNRR) and electrocatalytic NO 3 - reduction (eNO3RR). The 1% Ag-BiMn-based oxysulfide photocatalyst for PNRR achieved a high yield of ~3 mmol/g.h, but its yield remains much lower than the photo-H 2 yield. eNO3RR with a CuCo-based oxide/sulfide catalyst prepared by a hydrothermal route can yield above 44.6 mg/h.cm 2 with a single-stack cel","au":["Dong–Hau Kuo","Merga Hailemariam Hailemariam","Tsegaye Girma Eshetub","Abambagade Abera Mitiku"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"通过三条路线开发环境友好型氨","zb":"研究对象为绿色氨生产通过光催化和电催化氮还原（PNRR vs. eNRR）和电催化硝酸根还原（eNO3RR），方法为制备1% Ag-BiMn基氧化硫化物光催化剂用于PNRR，CuCo基氧化物/硫化物催化剂通过水热法制备用于eNO3RR，CuBi基硫氧化物催化剂通过化学法制备在Ni泡沫上用于eNRR，结果表明PNRR、eNRR和eNO3RR的产率分别为~3 mmol/g.h、>3.0 mg/h.cm2和>44.6 mg/h.cm2，反应机理研究表明PNRR和eNRR涉及惰性、三键非极性N2反应物，反应具有挑战性。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2026-01241310mtgabs","t":"(Dielectric Science & Technology Division Thomas D. Callinan Award) Plasma‐Catalysis for Chemical Production: Hydrogen, Green Methanol, and Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2026-01241310mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2026-07-07","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Current technologies for hydrogen production—and for its downstream use in methanol and ammonia synthesis—are largely based on steam reforming of fossil fuels, which results in substantial carbon dioxide emissions. Transitioning these processes toward electrified and modular reactor systems enables compatibility with distributed renewable energy sources and reduces overall carbon footprint. Conventional industrial ammonia and methanol processes require high pressures to activate relatively inert molecules such as nitrogen and methane. In this work, we will highlight our work on how plasma excitation, combined with uniquely engineered nanowire-based catalysts and novel reactor configurations, overcomes the activation barriers and enables ammonia and methanol synthesis at atmospheric pressure. Earlier, we developed several plasma–catalytic schemes for the processing of nanowire material sy","au":["Mahendra Kumar Sunkara"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"(介电科学与技术 division Thomas D. Callinan 奖) 等离子体催化用于化学生产：氢气、绿色甲醇和氨","zb":"当前氢气生产及其在甲醇和氨合成中的下游使用技术主要基于化石燃料的蒸汽重整，导致大量二氧化碳排放。向电气化和模块化反应器系统转型，使这些过程与分布式可再生能源源兼容，并减少整体碳足迹。传统工业氨和甲醇过程需要高压来活化相对惰性的氮和甲烷分子。本研究重点介绍了等离子体激发、独特设计的基于纳米线的催化剂和新型反应器配置如何克服活化能垒，在大气压下实现氨和甲醇合成。在氢气生产中，等离子体催化方法采用低熔点金属如镓驱动甲烷热解。该方案先前已用于合成具有可调形态的碳微管[1]，产生高表面积无杂质的碳。熔融镓通过在显著降低的温度下促进热解起关键介导作用；然而，等离子体激发或甲烷热分解对于实现镓介导的键断裂仍然是必要的。在甲醇和氨形成中，等离子体激发的气相物种与催化剂表面的协同作用导致显著的单程转化率[2]。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ra05773j/v1/review1","t":"Review for \"Ceria support enhances activity of CoNi catalysts for ammonia synthesis under magnetic heating\"","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ra05773j/v1/review1","s":"","d":"2026-07-06","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3","joule"],"tr":"cross","sc":46,"ab":"","au":[],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis","magnetic heat"],"zt":"Ceria support enhances activity of CoNi catalysts for ammonia synthesis under magnetic heating 综述","bt":1},{"id":"10.5445/ir/1000194975","t":"Decoupling Geometry and Surface Chemistry in 3D-Printed ALD-Functionalized Porous Ceramic Channels","u":"https://doi.org/10.5445/ir/1000194975","s":"Repository KITopen (Karlsruhe Institute of Technology)","d":"2026-07-06","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Capillary-driven transport is traditionally attributed to the static pore geometry and wettability. However, the time-dependent surface energy of metal oxides, amplified by the high surface area of porous media, remains a key yet underexplored aspect. This study introduces a novel manufacturing route capable of decoupling macroscopic geometry from surface chemistry by integrating additive manufacturing combined with colloidal assembly (AMCA) and functionalization by atomic layer deposition (ALD). This approach enables the fabrication of highly porous aluminum(III) oxide (Al$_2$O$_3$) and titanium dioxide (TiO$_2$) ceramic channels after thermal burn-out. Within these structures, the structural and chemical properties are tuned and investigated. Spontaneous imbibition experiments at 0, 6, and 24 h after burn-out reveal a transition from a classical Lucas–Washburn rise to a resistance-limi","au":["Antoine E. Jimenez","Diego Ribas Gomes","Carina Hedrich","Manuel Brinker","Fortune Minna","Patrick Huber"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"在 3D 打印的 ALD 功能化多孔陶瓷通道中解耦几何形状和表面化学","zb":"毛细驱动传输传统上归因于静态孔隙几何形状和润湿性。然而，金属氧化物的时间依赖性表面能，由于多孔介质的高表面积而被放大，仍然是一个关键但尚未充分探索的方面。本研究介绍了一种通过结合增材制造和胶体组装 (AMCA) 以及原子层沉积 (ALD) 功能化的新型制造路线，能够解耦宏观几何形状和表面化学。这种方法能够在热烧蚀后制造出高度多孔的氧化铝 (Al2O3) 和二氧化钛 (TiO2) 陶瓷通道。在这些结构中，结构和化学特性被调整和研究。在烧蚀后 0、6 和 24 小时进行的自发浸渍实验表明，从经典的 Lucas-Washburn 上升过渡到受蒸发和粘性阻力主导的阻力限制状态。时间分辨接触角测量显示，这两种氧化物在烧蚀后都变得超亲水，并随后发生疏水恢复。尽管 TiO2 本质上更亲水，但 Al2O3 通道始终表现出更快的浸渍速率和更高的液体上升。这种行为归因于 Al2O3 的快速表面弛豫，这减少了接","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.2298/tsci260121096y","t":"Study on the electro-thermal coupling properties of porous joule heating catalyst supports for MSR hydrogen production","u":"https://doi.org/10.2298/tsci260121096y","s":"Thermal Science","d":"2026-07-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"In this study, A three-dimensional multiphysics model coupling electric and thermal fields was developed to systematically explore the effects of microscopic structural parameters (wire diameter and spacing) on current density distribution, Joule heat source characteristics, and temperature field uniformity within the Joule heating catalyst support (JHCS).The results indicated that increasing the wire diameter directed current shunt toward the branch channels, thereby improving heat generation uniformity. Conversely, increasing the wire spacing led to current \"dead zones\" in the branch channels due to increased electrical resistance. This non-uniformity was further amplified because Joule heat was proportional to the square of the current density. The temperature field was primarily governed by the heat transfer radius determined by the pore size of the JHCS; excessively small wire diame","au":["Ding Yuan","Xinying Li","Xiaoyan Shi","Wu Luo"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"多孔焦耳热催化剂载体电热耦合特性的研究","zb":"本研究开发了一个结合电场和热场的三维多物理场模型，系统地探索微观结构参数（线直径和间距）对电流密度分布、焦耳热源特性以及温度场均匀性的影响。结果表明，增加线直径使电流分流到分支通道，从而提高热产生均匀性。相反，增加线间距由于电阻增加导致分支通道出现电流“死区”。这种不均匀性由于焦耳热与电流密度的平方成正比而被进一步放大。温度场主要由由焦耳热催化剂载体 (JHCS) 的孔隙尺寸确定的传热半径控制；过小的线直径或大的间距导致通道中心出现显著的低温区。综合来看，0.10 mm 的线直径和 0.25 mm 的线间距被确定为最佳结构，实现了热产生效率和热均匀性之间的平衡。"},{"id":"10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c04101","t":"Dynamic Evolution of Cu2O-CuO/Cu Electrocatalyst for Ammonia Synthesis by Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acssuschemeng.6c04101","s":"ACS Sustainable Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2026-07-06","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (eNO3RR) is a promising alternative to the Haber–Bosch process for ammonia production. Besides, it can transform and utilize the nitrate in waste water. Copper catalysts are widely employed; however, they exhibit weak binding affinity for most reaction intermediates, and their weak hydrogen binding energy limits the hydrogenation of these intermediates, thereby affecting both the reaction activity and ammonia selectivity. In this study, a two-step electrochemical synthesis method was used to sequentially load CuO and Cu2O onto the Cu foam surface to make a Cu2O-CuO/Cu heterostructure. Combination of in situ FTIR and Raman spectra confirmed that the synergistic effect of Cu2O and CuO promoted the eNO3RR efficiency. This synergy effectively enhanced the binding affinity of reaction intermediates, where Cu2O facilitated NO3– adsorption and catalyz","au":["Jin-Ying Du","Yong-Qing Yan","H Chen","Xuekai Pei","Feng‐Lei Jiang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"电催化硝酸盐还原制备氨气的 Cu2O-CuO/Cu 电催化剂的动态演变","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原 (eNO3RR) 是一种有前景的哈伯-博施工艺替代方案，用于氨气生产，同时可转化和利用废水中的硝酸盐。铜催化剂被广泛使用；然而，它们对大多数反应中间体的结合亲和力较弱，氢结合能较弱限制了这些中间体的加氢，从而影响反应活性和氨选择性。本研究采用两步电化学合成方法将 CuO 和 Cu2O 依次负载到 Cu 泡沫表面，制备了 Cu2O-CuO/Cu 异质结构。原位 FTIR 和 Raman 光谱的结合证实了 Cu2O 和 CuO 的协同效应促进了 eNO3RR 效率。这种协同效应有效增强了反应中间体的结合亲和力，其中 Cu2O 促进 NO3– 吸附并催化其转化为 NO2，而 CuO 有助于水分解以增强活性氢的可用性。密度泛函理论 (DFT) 计算表明，Cu2O-CuO/Cu 有效降低了从 *NO2H 到 *NO 以及从 *NH2OH 到 *NH2 的能垒。此外，该反应涉及 Cu","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.surfin.2026.110055","t":"Ti/V/Cr/Co single atoms on h‑BN divacancy defects as efficient NRR catalysts: A DFT study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.surfin.2026.110055","s":"Surfaces and Interfaces","d":"2026-07-06","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Keqi Ding","Xuyun Zhang","Qingxin Kang","Xiaoting Xu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["NRR"],"zt":"h‑BN二空位缺陷上的Ti/V/Cr/Co单原子作为高效的NRR催化剂：DFT研究","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/smtd.70806","t":"Synergistic Integration of Intermediate Adsorption and Hydrogen Supply to Boost Nitrate Electroreduction to Ammonia Performance via Anchoring Nickel on Monolithic Copper Nanocone Arrays","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smtd.70806","s":"Small Methods","d":"2026-07-06","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (NRA) is a sustainable approach for wastewater remediation and value‐added ammonia synthesis. The development of high‐performance electrocatalysts is crucial for practical implementation. Herein, we reported a rationally designed nickel‐anchored monolithic copper nanocone array (Ni/Cu‐NCAs) as an efficient NRA catalyst. The catalyst demonstrated outstanding NRA performance, achieving 96% nitrate conversion, 96.3% ammonium (NH 4 + )selectivity, 95.4% NH 4 + Faradaic Efficiency, and a high NH 4 + yield rate of 0.272 mmol·h −1 ·cm −2 . Combined experimental characterizations and density functional theory (DFT) calculations confirmed that the introduced Ni species modulated the d ‐band center of Cu sites to optimize the adsorption of key reaction intermediates, while simultaneously providing abundant active hydrogen (*H) for subsequent h","au":["Aijing Ma","Xuan Wu","Xin Li","Dan Liu","Alex Tawanda Kuvarega","Bhekie Brilliance Mamba"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过锚定镍在多孔铜纳米锥阵列上实现中间吸附和氢供应协同集成以提升硝酸盐电还原为氨的性能","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原为氨（NRA）是废水处理和增值氨合成的一种可持续方法。高性能电催化剂的开发对于实际应用至关重要。本文报道了一种合理设计的锚定镍多孔铜纳米锥阵列（Ni/Cu‐NCAs）作为高效的NRA催化剂。该催化剂表现出优异的NRA性能，实现了96%的硝酸盐转化率、96.3%的铵根离子（NH 4 + ）选择性、95.4%的铵根离子法拉第效率以及0.272 mmol·h −1 ·cm −2 的高铵根离子产率率。结合实验表征和密度泛函理论（DFT）计算证实，引入的Ni物种调节了Cu位点的d ‐带中心，以优化关键反应中间体的吸附，同时同时提供丰富的活性氢（*H）用于后续的加氢步骤。协同效应显著加速了反应动力学，并促进了选择性氨的形成。这项工作开发了一种高效的多孔Cu基NRA电催化剂，并为硝酸盐电还原的双金属协同机制提供了新的见解。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.70857","t":"Cobalt‐Doped Manganese Oxide/Ruthenium Oxide Composite Interface for Acidic Oxygen Evolution Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.70857","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2026-07-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The oxygen evolution reaction (OER) in acidic media is critical for acidic water electrolysis, electrochemical CO 2 reduction, nitrate reduction, etc. However, its harsh corrosive and oxidative environment imposes severe demands on catalysts. Ru‐based catalysts offer high activity and low cost, but their poor stability in acidic media remains a key obstacle to practical application. Herein, we report a robust composite catalyst of cobalt‐doped manganese oxide ((Co 0.08 Mn 0.92 ) 3 O 4 )‐supported RuO 2 on a titanium substrate for high activity and stability in acidic media. (Co 0.08 Mn 0.92 ) 3 O 4 is uniformly immobilized on a titanium substrate via a sol–gel method, followed by a hydrothermal and calcination treatment to uniformly hydrolyze RuCl 3 and convert it into RuO 2 within the loose and porous (Co 0.08 Mn 0.92 ) 3 O 4 . The Co doping induces the strong electron interaction of Co","au":["Tao Yang","Yu‐Qing Wu","Jia‐Yi Chen","Yu‐Qiong Huang","Hui Fang","Zhong‐Li Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"钴掺杂锰氧化物/二氧化钌复合界面用于酸性析氧反应","zb":"酸性介质中的析氧反应（OER）对酸性水电解、电化学CO2还原、硝酸盐还原等至关重要。然而，其苛刻的腐蚀性和氧化环境对催化剂提出了严重要求。基于Ru的催化剂具有高活性和低成本，但其在酸性介质中的稳定性仍然是一个关键障碍。本文报道了一种由钴掺杂锰氧化物((Co 0.08 Mn 0.92 ) 3 O 4 )-负载的RuO 2 在钛基板上的复合催化剂，在酸性介质中具有高活性和稳定性。(Co 0.08 Mn 0.92 ) 3 O 4 通过溶胶-凝胶法均匀固定在钛基板上，然后通过水热和煅烧处理，在疏松多孔的(Co 0.08 Mn 0.92 ) 3 O 4 内部均匀水解RuCl 3 并将其转化为RuO 2 。Co掺杂诱导了Co、Mn和Ru的强电子相互作用，形成了高活性的RuO 2 /(Co 0.08 Mn 0.92 ) 3 O 4 界面。优化的催化剂仅需185 mV过电位即可实现10 mA cm −2 ","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/advs.76415","t":"Bipolar Palladium Membrane Enabling Crossover‐Free Selective Proton Transport","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/advs.76415","s":"Advanced Science","d":"2026-07-06","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Establishing a proton‐selective membrane, capable of completely blocking the crossover of other chemical species, has been regarded as a long‐sought‐after goal for the stable and efficient operation of electrochemical devices. Conventional polymeric membranes suffer from an inherent trade‐off between conductivity and selectivity, imposed by their water‐mediated proton‐conduction mechanism, which precludes crossover‐free proton transport. Herein, we demonstrate a unique proton shuttling mechanism of the bipolar palladium membrane that enables selective proton transport while suppressing molecular crossover. Through bipolar electrochemical proton absorption and desorption, coupled with the lattice‐channeled hydrogen diffusion in palladium, the conductivity–selectivity relationship can be fundamentally circumvented. Using the bipolar electrochemical palladium membrane, we construct","au":["Jiyeon Baek","Yeongbae Jeon","Seunga Lee","Ahee Choi","Joonmok Shim","Kyungho Lee"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Li-mediated"],"zt":"具有无交叉选择质子传输的双极钯膜","zb":"该研究展示了双极钯膜的独特质子传递机制，能够在抑制分子交叉的同时实现选择性质子传输。通过双极电化学质子吸收和解吸，以及钯中的晶格通道氢扩散，可以根本性地绕过电导率-选择性的权衡关系。使用双极电化学钯膜，构建了一个水介导的氮还原系统，即使在连续流动下，也能抑制水从水相阳极液到非水相阴极液之间的交叉，使水成为可持续的质子来源。在电位循环下，实现了51%的氨法拉第效率和12小时的稳定运行。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/nano16130826","t":"Interfacial Electron Engineering for Nitrate-to-Ammonia Electrocatalysis: Mechanistic Insights and Design Strategies","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nano16130826","s":"Nanomaterials","d":"2026-07-05","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) enables sustainable ammonia synthesis from nitrate waste, yet its complex mechanism and severe competition from the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) demand precise control over interfacial electronic structures. This review provides a mechanistic overview of interfacial electron engineering for NO3RR via charge transfer, d-band center modulation, and d-p orbital coupling. We propose a reverse-engineering framework that starts from the three kinetic bottlenecks of NO3RR (nitrate activation, *H supply, and intermediate poisoning) and back-extracts the required electronic effects (charge transfer, d-band shift, and d-p orbital coupling). From this perspective, we cover the construction of built-in electric fields (BIEFs) in heterojunctions, engineering atomic-scale active sites (e.g., single-atom and dual-atom catalysts), and exploiti","au":["X Y Liu","Jianqiang Zhu","Zaidong Wang","Meng Han","Yu Ma","Lishi Jiao"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于硝酸盐至氨电催化的界面电子工程：机理见解和设计策略","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原反应 (NO3RR) 使可持续地从硝酸盐废物中合成氨成为可能，然而其复杂机制和氢演化反应 (HER) 的严重竞争要求精确控制界面电子结构。本综述提供了通过电荷转移、d 带中心调制和 d-p 轨道耦合对 NO3RR 进行界面电子工程的机理概述。我们提出了一种逆向工程框架，该框架从 NO3RR 的三个动力学瓶颈（硝酸盐活化、*H 供应和中间体中毒）开始，并反向提取所需的电子效应（电荷转移、d 带偏移和 d-p 轨道耦合）。从这一角度来看，我们涵盖了在异质结构建内置电场 (BIEFs)、工程原子级活性位点（例如单原子和双原子催化剂），以及利用氢溢流和反向溢流进行跨空间质子传递。鉴于合理的界面在操作条件下动态演变，我们强调原位/操作工况表征捕获了价态的动态重构、配位环境和形貌，建立了清晰的结构-电子-活性关系。最后，我们讨论了关键挑战并概述了未来方向，包括机器学习加速的筛选、动态界","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv.15005664/v1","t":"Potential‑Driven Tetragonal CuFe2O4 Phase Transition Enables Near‑Complete Nitrate‑to‑Ammonia Conversion with Minimal Nitrite Accumulation","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv.15005664/v1","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2026-07-05","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:45Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The development of electrocatalyst for nearly complete electrocatalytic nitrate reduction without accumulating nitrites in the product feed is indispensable for sustainable nitrate contaminated wastewater treatment and carbon-neutral green ammonia production. In this study, CuFe 2 O 4 nanowires could mimic the bifunctional nature of nitrite reductase where Cu act as nitrate adsorption and deoxygenation center while Fe promoted adsorption of H* and the reduction of *NO to NH 2 . We demonstrate the involvement of a hydride‑transfer pathway supported by obtaining four‑electron transfer from rotating‑disk voltammetry and further corroborated by the mechanistic insights obtained from DFT analysis. The faradaic efficiency for ammonia exceeded 95% at all applied potentials, with an ammonia‑to‑nitrite yield‑rate ratio of 13 at −1.1 V vs. Reversible Hydrogen Electrode. The enhanced nitrite reduct","au":["Nidia Recuay Arana","Jessenia Villaverde Herrera","Rafael Pulido Del Pino","Erick Cirilo","Jesús Valdiviezo","Kamala Kanta Nanda"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"电位驱动的四方 CuFe2O4 相变实现硝酸盐向氨气的近乎完全转化并最小化亚硝酸盐积累","zb":"开发用于近乎完全电催化硝酸盐还原而不在产品进料中积累亚硝酸盐的电催化剂对于可持续硝酸盐污染废水处理和碳中和绿色氨气生产至关重要。在本研究中，CuFe2O4 纳米线可以模拟亚硝酸还原酶的双功能性质，其中 Cu 作为硝酸盐吸附和去氧中心，而 Fe 促进 H* 吸附和 *NO 的还原为 NH2。我们证明了涉及由旋转圆盘伏安法获得的四电子转移支持的氢转移途径，并通过 DFT 分析进一步证实了机理见解。在所有施加的电位下，氨的法拉第效率超过 95%，在 –1.1 V vs. 可逆氢电极下，氨-亚硝酸盐产率比为 13。增强的亚硝酸盐还原是由于在更高的过电位下发生的立方到四方相变，暴露了欠配位的铁位点，促进 H* 吸附和 *NO 的加氢。串联电催化机制同时导致高 NH3 选择性，抑制析氢反应，并导致微不足道的亚硝酸盐积累。这项工作建立了氨选择性、表面结构和尖晶石 CuFe2O4 相之间的相关性，并为 N","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.74504","t":"Dual Active Sites Enhanced Plasmon‐Driven N 2 Photoreduction Over MoO 3−X Nanosheets Under Visible Excitation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.74504","s":"Small","d":"2026-07-05","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Nitrogen photo‐fixation used solar energy as a prospective way, has received more attention. In this study, a series of Ru‐C/MoO 3‐x photocatalysts with enhanced localized surface plasmon resonance effects for N 2 photo‐fixation are developed, which not only construct abundant adsorption active sites but also promote the photocatalytic performances through reducing the N≡N bond dissociation activation energy. Notably, an additional LSPR peak at around 490 nm is observed in the UV–vis DRS spectra upon the introduction of the Ru element. Furthermore, increased N 2 adsorption capacity and more efficient carrier separation are obtained via the carbon decoration over the catalysts. Among these, the highest ammonia production rate over the Ru‐C co‐decorated photocatalyst achieves 864 µmol·g cal −1 ·h −1 . Furthermore, a markedly apparent quantum efficiency exceeding 1.9% is achieved u","au":["Huaiwei Zhang","Liang Bao","Ying Pan","LW Xu","Wei Wang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"可见光激发下 MoO3-X 纳米片的双活性位点增强等离子体驱动 N2 光还原","zb":"氮光固定利用太阳能作为有前景的方法，已引起更多关注。本研究开发了一系列 Ru-C/MoO3-x 光催化剂，具有增强的局域表面等离子体共振效应，用于 N2 光固定，这不仅构建了丰富的吸附活性位点，还通过降低 N≡N 键解离活化能来促进光催化性能。值得注意的是，在引入 Ru 元素后，在紫外-可见 DRS 光谱上观察到在 490 nm 附近出现额外的 LSPR 峰。此外，通过催化剂上的碳装饰获得了增加的 N2 吸附能力和更有效的载流子分离。在这些催化剂中，Ru-C 共装饰光催化剂的最高氨产率达到 864 µmol·g cal −1 ·h −1。此外，在 420 nm 下可见光激发时，实现了超过 1.9% 的明显量子效率，这是迄今为止报道的金属氧化物催化剂光催化 N2 固定中最高的值之一。密度泛函理论计算表明，光催化氮还原反应遵循远端途径，样品中的 Ru/C 复合活性位点可以降低速率控制步骤的能垒","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Ru/钌体系、碳材料｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-026-75113-6","t":"Dual-interface stabilization of low-iridium anodes for durable proton exchange membrane water electrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-75113-6","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2026-07-04","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":19,"ab":"Abstract The durability and cost of iridium-based anodes remain key challenges for high-current density operation of proton exchange membrane water electrolyzers. Here, we report a dual-interface stabilization strategy based on atomic layer deposition of TiO 2 onto IrO 2 catalysts. The resulting anodes sustain operation at 3.0 A cm −2 for 2600 h with near-zero voltage degradation at an iridium loading of 0.4 mg cm −2 , whereas bare IrO 2 exhibits continuous voltage decay over 1000 h at a rate of 31.5 mV kh −1 . Combined experimental characterization and theoretical calculations reveal that interfacial Ti-O-Ir coupling suppresses Ir over-oxidation and dissolution, while the TiO 2 -coated surface strengthens ionomer-catalyst interactions and preserves mass-transport pathways during prolonged operation. This strategy is fully compatible with roll-to-roll manufacturing, enabling industrially","au":["Eui Tae Kim","Sangwoo Kim","S. C. Park","PumSuk Park","Eunbyeol Ko","Jemee Joe"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"低铱阳极的双界面稳定用于耐久质子交换膜水电解","zb":"通过原子层沉积 TiO 2 到 IrO 2 催化剂上，报道了一种双界面稳定策略。所得阳极在 3.0 A cm −2 下持续运行 2600 h，铱负载量为 0.4 mg cm −2 时电压几乎不衰减，而裸 IrO 2 在 31.5 mV kh −1 的速率下持续电压衰减超过 1000 h。实验表征和理论计算揭示，界面 Ti-O-Ir 结合抑制了 Ir 过氧化和溶解，而 TiO 2 包覆表面增强了离子膜-催化剂相互作用并保留了长期运行期间的传质路径。该策略与卷对卷制造完全兼容，可扩展到多种电化学能源转换技术。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.scriptamat.2026.117482","t":"Ultrafast synthesis of Bi–Sr–Ca–Cu–O superconductor within seconds via thermal shock","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.scriptamat.2026.117482","s":"Scripta Materialia","d":"2026-07-04","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Conventional synthesis of cuprate superconductors typically requires hours to days of thermal processing, hindering rapid exploration of synthesis conditions and materials space. In contrast, ultrafast processing techniques capable of accessing high temperatures on short timescales can significantly accelerate data-driven materials discovery. Here, we demonstrate the formation of a superconducting phase in the Bi – Sr – Ca – Cu – O system by thermal shock within seconds in air. Direct-current (DC) and alternating-current (AC) susceptibility measurements confirm the presence of superconductivity, with a superconducting transition temperature of 90 – 92 K, consistent with Bi 2 Sr 2 CaCu 2 O 8 + y . Thermal shock is achieved by indirect Joule heating using a pre-oxidized tungsten sheet, enabling ~100 × faster synthesis than conventional solid-state processing. Thermal shock is further exten","au":["Vivienne Yiwei Liu","Weiyin Chen","Yimeng Huang","Zihan Lin","Ethan Yupeng Zheng","Yaoshen Niu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"Bi–Sr–Ca–Cu–O 超导体秒级热冲击合成","zb":"通过热冲击在空气中秒级合成 Bi – Sr – Ca – Cu – O 系统的超导相。直流和交流磁化率测量证实存在超导性，超导转变温度为 90 – 92 K，与 Bi 2 Sr 2 CaCu 2 O 8 + y 一致。热冲击通过预氧化的钨片间接焦耳加热实现，比传统固相处理合成速度快约 100 倍。该技术进一步扩展到 Y – Ba – Cu – O 超导体合成，为快速筛选超导氧化物化学及其适当合成条件提供了新方法。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.compositesa.2026.110080","t":"Closing the loop: upcycling recycled carbon fibres as Joule heating elements for energy efficient composite tooling","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compositesa.2026.110080","s":"Composites Part A Applied Science and Manufacturing","d":"2026-07-04","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The widespread deployment of high-performance composites across various industries, while beneficial, has led to an inevitable increase in composite waste and intensified concerns over resource and energy efficiency, challenging efforts toward sustainable manufacturing and circular material use. Although recycling efforts have successfully reclaimed valuable materials like recycled carbon fibres (rCF), effectively utilising these materials in value-added applications remains challenging. This study introduces a sustainable upcycling strategy that utilises rCF as energy-efficient heating elements integrated into composite tooling. Designed for enhanced thermal insulation and mechanical robustness, the developed tooling successfully cures carbon fibre/epoxy laminates with comparable properties to oven-cured specimens, while achieving a 90% reduction in energy consumption compared to tradit","au":["Qinrong He","Georgios Xypolias","Shanshan Huo","Yushen Wang","James A. Mills","Zhe Liu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"闭环：将回收碳纤维作为焦耳热元件用于高效复合材料工具","zb":"高性能复合材料的广泛部署虽然有益，但不可避免地导致复合材料废弃物增加，并加剧了资源和能源效率问题，挑战了可持续制造和循环材料利用的努力。尽管回收工作已成功回收了有价值的材料，如回收碳纤维 (rCF)，但有效地利用这些材料在增值应用中仍然具有挑战性。本研究介绍了一种可持续的升级回收策略，利用 rCF 作为复合材料工具中集成的节能加热元件。设计的工具针对增强的热绝缘性和机械鲁棒性，成功地固化碳纤维/环氧层压板，其性能与烘箱固化样品相当，同时与传统的烘箱工艺相比，实现了 90% 的能耗降低。比较的、筛查级的生命周期评估 (LCA) 表明，与传统金属相比，其环境效益更高，气候影响降低了 70%（40 vs. 140 kg CO2 eq. 每个功能单元），突出了其显著减轻复合材料制造部门环境影响的潜力。将回收 rCF 作为节能加热元件的简单集成为实现更可持续的复合材料制造提供了一条途径。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.71238","t":"Reciprocal Synergistic Evolution of Cu‐Co Sites Boosts Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.71238","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2026-07-04","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"ABSTRACT The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) offers a promising route for sustainable ammonia synthesis. Due to the interfacial synergistic effects, Cu–Co catalysts exhibit outstanding activity. However, the underlying evolution of active sites remains poorly understood, which induces the reported advantageous phase‐segregating in situ restructuring. By monitoring Co(OH) 2 /Cu catalysts, our observations revealed that Cu‐ and Co‐related sites undergo dynamic, “seesaw‐like” reciprocal reactivation instead of mutual stabilization. In situ SERS, DMPO‐EPR and DFT calculations show that this process is driven by the competing oxidative/reductive forces under NO 3 RR conditions, which cause site deactivation, and mediated via the transfer of ∙O/∙OH and H* radicals across interfaces. Critically, these radicals trigger the conversion of deactivated CuO x and Co(OH) 2 sites ","au":["Tanlun Wang","Bowen Fu","Yang Wang","Fengjie Wu","Hongzhi Wang","Shuo Yao"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Cu-Co 位点的相互协同演变增强电催化硝酸盐还原至氨气","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原反应 (NO3RR) 为可持续氨合成提供了一条有前景的路线。由于界面协同效应，Cu–Co 催化剂表现出优异的活性。然而，活性位点的潜在演变仍然知之甚少，这导致了报道的有利的原位相分离重构。通过监测 Co(OH)2/Cu 催化剂，我们的观察揭示了 Cu-和 Co-相关位点经历动态的“跷跷板式”相互再活化的过程，而不是相互稳定。原位 SERS、DMPO-EPR 和 DFT 计算表明，该过程是由 NO3RR 条件下的竞争氧化/还原力驱动的，这些力导致位点失活，并通过 ∙O/∙OH 和 H* 自由基在界面之间的转移进行介导。关键的是，这些自由基触发了失活的 CuOx 和 Co(OH)2 位点的转化，分别形成了高度活性的氧化物衍生的 Cu0 和 CoOOH。由于界面自由基的转移构成一个不可逆过程，因此观察到的原位重构是合乎逻辑的。这种共轭的、跷跷板式的机制加速了 Cu–Co 异质界面","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.electacta.2026.149468","t":"Enhancing nitrate-to-ammonia electrosynthesis on 3D Cu/Cu2O cathodes: The role of Cu+/Cu0 ratio in mediating an indirect hydrogenation pathway","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.electacta.2026.149468","s":"Electrochimica Acta","d":"2026-07-04","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Nessa Hald","Kenneth Flores","Mauro C. Santos","Sergi Garcia‐Segura","Caio Machado Fernandes"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"在 3D Cu/Cu2O 阴极上增强硝酸盐至氨电合成：Cu+/Cu0 比率在介导间接加氢途径中的作用","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.65206/pajes.1922045","t":"One-dimensional non-isothermal modeling and parametric analysis of a hydrogen-based ammonia synthesis reactor","u":"https://doi.org/10.65206/pajes.1922045","s":"Pamukkale University Journal of Engineering Sciences","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Context—Ammonia synthesis is a key process in the global chemical industry, especially for fertilizer production and emerging hydrogen-based energy systems. With growing interest in green hydrogen, ammonia has gained attention as both an energy carrier and a chemical feedstock. Therefore, understanding reactor behavior under different operating conditions is essential, and mathematical modeling provides an effective tool for analyzing performance and evaluating parameter effects without extensive experimental work.Objective—The objective of this study is to develop a one-dimensional non-isothermal packed-bed reactor model for hydrogen-based ammonia synthesis and to evaluate the effects of key parameters, including inlet composition, pressure, and catalyst loading, on reactor performance.Method—The model is based on species mass balances, an energy balance, and pressure drop described by ","au":["Yağmur Nalbant Atak"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于氢气的氨合成反应器一维非等温建模与参数分析","zb":"基于质量守恒、能量守恒和Ergun方程，建立了氢基氨合成反应器的一维非等温模型。在基础工况下，模型预测出口氮氢转化率约为0.1161，氨摩尔流率为3.84 × 10-5 mol/s。通过系统分析入口组成、压力和催化剂负载等参数，评估了其对反应器性能的影响。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.70901","t":"Construction of Uranium‐Graphdiyne Nanowall Composite for Efficient Thermal Catalytic Synthesis of Ammonia Under Mild Conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.70901","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"ABSTRACT We report herein on the preparation of the uranium‐graphdiyne nanowall composite (U/GDY‐NW) and thus the efficient thermal catalytic synthesis on ammonia under mild conditions through the construction of a local catalytic microenvironment. U/GDY‐NW exhibits significant catalytic activity starting at 70 °C. At 150 °C and 15 bar, the ammonia production rate reaches as high as 1037 ± 70 µmol·g −1 h −1 . Within the local microenvironment, the U/GDY‐NW composite not only catalyzes ammonia formation via the distal pathway mechanism but also enables oxygen‐containing functional groups on the surface to actively participate in the reaction by generating hydroxylamine intermediates, thereby significantly enhancing the overall catalytic efficiency. Our findings advance the catalysts development for ammonia synthesis under mild conditions, support green ammonia industrialization, and revea","au":["Fan Wang","Xinghai Shen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"构建铀-石墨炔纳米墙复合材料用于温和条件下高效热催化合成氨","zb":"制备了铀-石墨炔纳米墙复合材料，在局部催化微环境中实现了温和条件下的氨合成。该材料在70 °C即表现出显著催化活性，在150 °C和15 bar下氨产率高达1037 ± 70 µmol·g−1 h−1。研究揭示了GDY受限结构对热催化产氨的影响，并提出了锕系-碳杂化材料的理性设计策略。"},{"id":"10.3390/pr14132173","t":"Joule Heating-Assisted Synthesis of CoP-Loaded Carbons with Developed Porosity and Surface Phosphorous Functionality as Cathode Materials for Lithium–Sulfur Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/pr14132173","s":"Processes","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Given the confining effect of porous carbon and strong surface polarity of transition metal phosphides, their composite would be a promising cathode candidate to solve the problems of lithium–sulfur batteries including volume expansion and the shuttling effect of polysulfides. Herein, cobalt phosphide (CoP)-loaded phosphorous (P)-containing carbonized bamboo (CoP/PCBs) composites were fabricated via the co-pyrolysis of phytic acid, waste bamboo and Co(NO3)2·6H2O via Joule heating at 600–1200 °C. Hydrogen radicals released from phytic acid enabled CoP/PCBs with developed porosity (438.1–812.4 m2/g). CoP nanoparticles coated with graphitic carbon were distributed uniformly on a porous matrix of PCBs. CoP/PCBs presented obviously enhanced adsorption capabilities for Li2S6, and 57.8–80.4 wt.% of sulfur was confined in CoP/PCBs/S cathodes. CoP/PCB heated at 1200 °C exhibited a high reversible","au":["Zerui Bi","Xiaokai Zhou","Weiyue Feng","Fangang Zeng"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"焦耳加热合成负载 CoP 的多孔碳及其表面磷官能化作为锂硫电池正极材料","zb":"通过焦耳加热在 600–1200 °C 下将植酸、废竹和 Co(NO3)2·6H2O 共热解，制备了负载磷化钴 (CoP) 的含磷碳化竹 (CoP/PCBs) 复合材料。植酸释放的氢自由基使 CoP/PCBs 具有发达的孔隙率 (438.1–812.4 m2/g)。CoP 纳米颗粒被石墨碳包覆，均匀分布在 PCBs 的多孔基质上。CoP/PCBs 对 Li2S6 具有明显增强的吸附能力，CoP/PCBs/S 正极中 57.8–80.4 wt.% 的硫被限制。在 1 C 电流密度下，1200 °C 热处理的 CoP/PCB 在 500 次循环后表现出 477.5 mAh/g 的高可逆容量，平均容量衰减率为 0.045%。在 4.0 mg/cm2 的高硫负载下，300 次循环后比容量仍保持在 453.3 mAh/g。电化学过程中硫/多硫化物的转化通过物理限制硫和 Li2S6 的化学限制得到促进","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.6c07890","t":"Fabrication of Catalytic Distillation Membranes with Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.6c07890","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"High Resolution Image Download MS PowerPoint Slide The integration of catalysts onto the surface of membranes enables simultaneous physical separation and catalytic transformation of constituents in a feed stream, facilitating improved contaminant removal and fouling mitigation. Distillation membranes are a particularly attractive platform for catalytic membranes because they reject nonvolatile species and exhibit exceptional resistance to oxidative and radical-driven degradation. However, imparting catalytic functionality onto hydrophobic, porous distillation membranes has proven challenging since the membranes used are chemically inert and difficult to modify. Furthermore, catalysts on the membrane surface can decrease hydrophobicity and increase the membrane’s susceptibility to pore wetting and failure. In this work, we create a catalytic distillation membrane by coating a polytetrafl","au":["Elizabeth A. Hjelvik","Kian P. Lopez","Samuel D. Marks","Bryce Knutson","Scott C. Minas","Madison King"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积制备催化蒸馏膜","zb":"通过等离子体辅助原子层沉积将二氧化钛 (TiO 2 ) 涂覆在聚四氟乙烯膜表面，制备了催化蒸馏膜。通过精确调节 ALD 参数，实现了 TiO 2 在聚四氟乙烯膜表面附近（约 1 μm 范围内）的局部生长，形成催化活性界面，同时保留了底层的疏水孔结构。电子显微镜和光谱技术证实了 TiO 2 的局部生长，ALD 涂覆 500 个周期的膜在 12.8 bar 的压力下表现出压力耐受性，并在压力驱动蒸馏中具有高于 95% 的盐截留率。在紫外照射下对亚甲基蓝染料降解的实验表明，增加 TiO 2 负载量可提高染料降解效率。这些结果为将催化功能集成到化学惰性膜提供了一种通用策略。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.31635/ccschem.026.202607688","t":"Ambient Ammonia Production from Nitrogen and Hydrogen Gases Enabled by Dissociative High-Energy Electron Impact Interactions","u":"https://doi.org/10.31635/ccschem.026.202607688","s":"CCS Chemistry","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Primary ammonia synthesis via the Haber–Bosch process operates under harsh conditions (15–25 MPa, 400–500 °C), largely constrained by the high dissociation energy of the N≡N triple bond and the scaling relations between adsorption and transition-state energies. Here, we present ambient-condition NH3 synthesis driven by MeV-level electron beam irradiation. Optimizing the beam parameters in a catalyst-free system alone achieves an industrially relevant yield of 0.14 μmol·L−1·s−1, a two-order-of-magnitude enhancement compared to conventional electrocatalytic/photocatalytic methods. Macroscopic-microscopic Monte Carlo simulations identify that the reaction initiation is primarily driven by a cascade of low-energy secondary electrons (150–250 eV). Upon further introduction of Ru nanoclusters, irradiation enables the catalytic system to achieve a peak yield 2.8-fold higher than the maximum yie","au":["Zijian Lin","Zhaoqing Chu","Sinan Chen","Yifan Li","Zhiwen Jiang","Changjiang Hu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"由氮和氢气体在解离高能电子撞击相互作用下实现的常温氨生产","zb":"主要的氨合成通过哈伯-博施过程在苛刻条件（15–25 MPa, 400–500 °C）下进行，这主要受N≡N三键的高解离能和吸附能与过渡态能之间的比例关系限制。这里，我们提出由MeV级电子束辐照在无催化剂系统下仅通过优化束参数实现的环境条件NH3合成。与传统的电催化/光催化方法相比，实现了0.14 μmol·L−1·s−1的工业相关产率，提高了两个数量级。宏观-微观蒙特卡洛模拟确定反应初始化主要由150–250 eV的低能二次电子级联驱动。进一步引入Ru纳米簇后，辐照使催化系统实现比非催化基线的最大产率高2.8倍的峰值产率。密度泛函理论计算表明，Ru催化剂作为能量阶梯，将N2解离能垒与气相相比降低了~32.7 kcal·mol−1，并通过自由基介导的表面途径（N· + H·）稳定中间体。这种结合物理-化学见解的电子束规模化策略，在温和条件下显示出有希望的能量性能潜力。由于该系统可以直接由可","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2026.240888","t":"Synergistic effect of Cu and Cu+ sites in MOF-derived coral-like heterostructures for efficient electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2026.240888","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xingjia Liu","Ziyang Liu","Kai Zhou","Chenyong Wang","Suyuan Liu","Xue‐Zhi Song"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"MOF衍生珊瑚状异质结构中Cu和Cu+位点的协同效应，用于高效的电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ces.2026.124582","t":"Mixed ion/electron conduction engineering of Li+-intercalated CdPS3 for low-bias photoelectrochemical ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ces.2026.124582","s":"Chemical Engineering Science","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Hui Li","Weiming Mi","Xiaxin Wang","Wenli Zhao","Yuxiu Zou","Mengyang Xia"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Li+-插层CdPS3的混合离子/电子传导工程，用于低偏压光化学氨合成","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.167754","t":"Intermetallic electrocatalysts for green ammonia synthesis: recent trends, opportunities, and challenges","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.167754","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Olga Konstantinovna Lebedeva","Dmitry Kultin","Irina I. Kuznetsova","Sergey Nesterenko","Leonid Modestovich Kustov"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于绿色氨合成的金属间电催化剂：最新趋势、机遇与挑战","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127192","t":"Delayed HER kinetics enabled by dual-metal sites in 2.5D WSe2 catalysts for high-yield electrochemical ammonia electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127192","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environmental","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Joo-Won Lee","Sungju Jun","Wantae Kim","Min-Seok Kim","S K Oh","Hyo Sang Jeon"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"由双金属位点在2.5D WSe2催化剂中实现的延迟HER动力学，用于高产率电化学氨电合成","ob":"析氢反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/slct.73735","t":"From the Haber–Bosch Process to the Green Ammonia Production: Advances and Challenges in Photocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/slct.73735","s":"ChemistrySelect","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT As a basic industrial material and a promising green energy carrier, ammonia (NH 3 ) is widely utilized in agriculture, chemical industry, and energy sector. Nevertheless, the traditional Haber–Bosch process continues to encounter sustainability bottlenecks. It operates under extreme temperature and pressure conditions, leading to intensive energy demands and high carbon emissions. In recent years, photocatalytic ammonia synthesis has emerged as a sustainable alternative to the Haber–Bosch process. This article provides a systematic review of the reaction mechanisms of pNRR, theoretical and experimental research methods, catalyst design strategies, the application of AI, as well as experimental reaction systems and detection methods. Furthermore, this work provides a systematic evaluation of analytical methods, including indophenol blue, Nessler's reagent, ion chromatography, an","au":["Wentao Shi","Bin Guan","Lei Zhu","Tiankui Zhu","Zhongqi Zhuang","Junyan Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"从哈伯-博施过程到绿色氨生产：光催化氨合成中的进展与挑战","zb":"研究对象为氨（NH3）作为基础工业材料和绿色能源载体，关键方法为光催化氨合成，包括pNRR反应机理、理论及实验研究方法、催化剂设计策略、AI应用、实验反应系统及检测方法；主要结果为系统评价了靛蓝蓝、纳氏试剂、离子色谱和NMR等分析方法，建立了实用方法选择框架，以指导研究人员匹配检测协议到特定反应配置。","ob":"光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/cphc.70480","t":"Beyond Conventional Catalyst Design: A Perspective on the Inverse Catalyst Strategy in Ammonia Synthesis and Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cphc.70480","s":"ChemPhysChem","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The development of heterogeneous catalysts for industrial reactions, such as ammonia synthesis and decomposition, is approaching the limits set by conventional design strategies that primarily aim to improve metal dispersion. In kinetically constrained reactions, however, catalytic performance is more strongly influenced by the structure and electronic properties at the interface between the metal and the support, or the metal and the promoter; thus, simply increasing metal dispersion does not necessarily lead to improved catalytic activity. This has spurred growing interest in inverse catalyst architectures, in which the traditional metal-on-support configuration is structurally inverted, and the metallic surface is loaded with promoters. Such architectures enable control of active-site structure, allowing high densities of efficient active sites even at lower specific surface areas. Im","au":["Hubert Ronduda","Magdalena Zybert"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"超越传统催化剂设计：氨合成与分解中逆催化剂策略的展望","zb":"研究对象为工业反应（如氨合成与分解）的非均相催化剂，关键方法为逆催化剂架构设计，即传统载体上金属配置的结构倒置，金属表面负载助剂；主要结果为逆催化剂架构通过控制活性位点结构，在较低比表面积下实现高效活性位点的高密度，特别适用于地球丰金属催化剂，最大化金属利用率并仅需少量助剂。"},{"id":"10.3389/fchem.2026.1864044","t":"AI-integrated manufacturing of advanced materials for energy storage, catalysis, and environmental applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.3389/fchem.2026.1864044","s":"Frontiers in Chemistry","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The incorporation of artificial intelligence (AI) into energy systems has become a transformative strategy for tackling global energy related challenges, particularly energy vulnerability (EVI). This work examines how AI contributes to mitigating EVI by evaluating its influence across several dimensions, including energy availability, operational efficiency, consumption patterns, renewable energy integration, and overall energy security. Based on insights derived from machine learning (ML) enabled developments in catalytic materials and CO 2 capture technologies, this study demonstrates how data-centric approaches expedite material discovery, refine energy processes, and strengthen system resilience. ML methodologies, including artificial neural networks (ANN), support vector regression (SVR), and ensemble learning techniques, exhibit strong predictive performance in estimating activatio","au":["Sreenivas Punna","Suvarshitha Pusuluru","Madhumita Ravikumar","Farid Menaa"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"人工智能集成的先进材料制造用于储能、催化和环境应用","zb":"将人工智能（AI）纳入能源系统已成为应对全球能源相关挑战（尤其是能源脆弱性（EVI））的变革性策略。这项工作检验了AI如何通过评估其对几个方面的贡献来缓解EVI，包括能源可用性、运行效率、消费模式、可再生能源集成和整体能源安全。基于机器学习（ML）在催化材料和CO2捕集技术方面的开发所获得的见解，本研究展示了以数据为中心的方法如何加速材料发现、改进能源流程并增强系统弹性。人工神经网络（ANN）、支持向量回归（SVR）和集成学习技术等ML方法在估计活化能、吸附特性和催化效率方面表现出很强的预测性能。这些方法大大减少了对照 computationally intensive density functional theory (DFT) 模拟的依赖，从而能够快速识别高性能催化剂。此外，ML辅助的框架支持检测活性催化位点、优化电催化过程以及设计用于氢析出、CO2还原和氨合成的材料。同时，ML在C","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.iecr.6c01147","t":"Ammonia Adsorption by Polyacrylonitrile-Based Carbon Nanofibers","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.iecr.6c01147","s":"Industrial & Engineering Chemistry Research","d":"2026-07-03","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"High Resolution Image Download MS PowerPoint Slide Polyacrylonitrile-based carbon nanofibers (PAN-based CNFs) have potential as tunable adsorbents for NH 3 capture from industrial processes, with adsorbent properties controlled by the carbonization temperature. Fibers prepared by electrospinning and carbonized between 800 and 1000 °C were characterized by NH 3 adsorption isotherms at 25 and 50 °C and equilibration curves at 50 and 100 mbar. The NH 3 uptake showed that pore architecture, rather than surface composition, primarily governs both adsorption kinetics and capacity. High affinity toward NH 3 and Type I isotherms were observed for samples carbonized at 800 and 850 °C, associated with specific ultramicropores that provide strong physisorption, as confirmed by the isosteric heat of adsorption. Increasing carbonization temperature reduced pore accessibility, leading to diffusion lim","au":["Paula Metschan","Ansgar Kretzschmar","Hermann Tempel","Eirini Goudeli","Colin A. Scholes","Rüdiger‐A. Eichel"],"o":"旧站本地库","zt":"聚丙烯腈基碳纳米纤维的氨吸附","zb":"聚丙烯腈基碳纳米纤维（PAN-based CNFs）作为可调吸附剂，用于从工业过程中捕获NH3，其吸附性能受碳化温度控制。通过静电纺丝制备并在800至1000°C碳化的纤维，通过在25和50°C下的NH3吸附等温线和在50和100 mbar下的平衡曲线进行表征。NH3吸附量表明，孔结构而不是表面组成主要控制吸附动力学和容量。在800和850°C碳化的样品表现出对NH3的高亲和力和I型等温线，这与提供强物理吸附的特定超微孔有关，由吸附等压热确认。增加碳化温度降低了孔的可达性，导致扩散限制和较低的NH3吸附量。这些发现表明，PAN-based CNFs通过控制碳化温度提供可调的吸附行为，可用于在环境条件下工业应用中的NH3分离和纯化。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及碳材料"},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzAwOTExNzg4Nw==&mid=2657945975&idx=3","t":"【催化】上海交通大学叶天南团队Nat. Commun.：富电子C2空位促进(N=N)δ-中间体用于化学链循环氨合成","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwOTExNzg4Nw%3D%3D&mid=2657945975&idx=3","s":"X-MOL资讯","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"上海交通大学变革性分子前沿科学中心叶天南团队在稀土金属碳化物LaC2中构建了大尺寸、富电子的阴离子缺陷位点，并证明 LaC2在负载 Ni 后是一种优异的化学链循环氨合成（CLAS）催化剂。 氨不仅是工农业生产的重要原料，也在能源存储与转化中扮演着关键角色，因此，在温和条件下实现高效氨合成对降低能耗至关重要。然而，氨合成反应受到N≡N三键极高键能的动力学阻碍，使其在温和条件下难以快速进行。为促进N2解离，常采用电子注入策略，即向N2的π反键轨道注入电子以降低其键级，为此，科研人员开发了富电子活性位点来构建高效氨合成催化剂。但由于氨的生成仅限于单一催化剂表面，该方法通常受标度关系制约。 为克服这一固有局限，双活性位点催化剂（如Ni/LaN）被提出。在该体系中，Ni负责氢活化，LaN则负责氮的吸附与活化，从而在更温和的温度下也能促进氨的生成。在此基础上，一系列基于空位的合成氨催化剂相继研究（Nature, 2020, 583, 391; J. Am. Chem. Soc., 2020, 142, 14374; J. Am. Chem. Soc., 2021, 143, 12857; Angew. Chem. Int. Ed., 2022, 61, e202211759; Nat. Commun., 2023, 14, 6373; Adv. Mater., 2024, 36, 2408434；J. Am. Chem. Soc., 2025, 147, 41308-41319）。例如，碱土金属碳化物BaC2中的C2缺陷位点被发现可作为专属的N2活化中心。该策略成功规避了传统上由金属-氮相互作用强度所施加的标度关系限制。然而，这类C2缺陷的给电子能力仍较为有限，制约了其对Ni/BaC2中N2活化的电子促进作用。在碳化物材料中，稀土金属因具有丰富的价电子，有望在C2缺陷位点产生高电子密度，这极大激励了作者深入探究稀土碳化物的氨合成能力。 针对上述挑战，近日上海交通大学变革性分子前沿科学中心叶天南团队在稀土金属碳化物LaC2中构建了大尺寸、富电子的阴离子缺陷位点，并证明 LaC2在负载","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","wx":1,"mt":["10.1038/s41467-026-74563-2"]},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2026.140557","t":"Catalyst-free ammonia synthesis in dielectric barrier discharge under mild Conditions: Effect of AC, unipolar and bipolar nanosecond pulses on energy utilization and nitrogen activation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2026.140557","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Xiaowang Yan","Dingkun Yuan","Zhongqian Ling","Lijian Wang","Jiangrong Xu","Xin Cheng Tu"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"无催化剂氨合成：DBD下温和条件下AC、单极和双极纳秒脉冲对能量利用率和氮活化的影响","bt":1},{"id":"10.1017/pds.2026.10561","t":"Design guidelines for electrical conductors and Joule-heating structures fabricated additively by material extrusion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1017/pds.2026.10561","s":"Proceedings of the Design Society","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT: Additive Manufacturing (AM) enables the local adjustment of material properties using multi-material strategies, especially with Material Extrusion (MEX). Electrically conductive structures like conductors, Joule heating structures, and their transitions can be realised with conductive polymer composites (CPC). However, specific Design for Additive Manufacturing (DfAM) guidelines for the afore mentioned structures are still missing. This work uses experimental data by thermography and the measurement of resistivity to derive twelve design rules. The rules are applied to an application example.","au":["Maximilian Nowka","Marvin Bergner","Till Hecker","Katja Ruge","Karl Hilbig","Wei-Song Hung"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-heat"],"zt":"材料挤出制造的电导体和焦耳热结构的设计指南","zb":"使用材料挤出技术制造电导体、焦耳热结构和它们之间的过渡。通过热成像和电阻率测量实验数据，推导出十二项设计规则，并应用于一个应用实例。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.proci.2026.106208","t":"Constructing CuCe/SAPO-34 with enhanced activity for ammonia combustion via rapid joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.proci.2026.106208","s":"Proceedings of the Combustion Institute","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Running Kang","Liwei Lu","Xiaokun Yi","Wenjun Liang","Feng Bin","Xiaolin Wei"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"通过焦耳加热构建具有增强氨燃烧活性的 CuCe/SAPO-34","ob":"焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.matdes.2026.116547","t":"Engineering oxide-structured niobium composites via atomic layer deposition and spark plasma sintering","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matdes.2026.116547","s":"Materials & Design","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The precise control of nanoscale oxide dispersions offers a promising route to improve the mechanical performance of refractory metal systems. This study employs an atomic layer deposition (ALD)-based approach to deposit conformal TiO 2 nanocoatings on pure niobium powder surfaces using a rotary reactor, followed by densification via spark plasma sintering (SPS). During SPS consolidation, amorphous TiO 2 shells undergo phase transformation and redistribution, yielding crystalline rutile TiO 2 nanoparticles (10–20 nm) and interfacial Nb–Ti–O composite oxide phases localized along grain boundaries. Multiscale characterization confirms the spatial segregation and microstructural distribution of these phases. The ALD-derived oxide dispersoids suppress grain growth and impede dislocation motion, increasing hardness by up to 43 % in oxide-rich regions, as measured through nanoindentation. This","au":["Ji Young Park","Seung-Hyeok Shin","Jongmin Byun","Byoungchul Hwang","Byung Joon Choi"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积和火花等离子体烧结工程氧化物结构铌复合材料","zb":"采用原子层沉积 (ALD) 方法在纯铌粉表面沉积致密 TiO 2 纳米涂层，然后通过火花等离子体烧结 (SPS) 进行致密化。在 SPS 致密化过程中，非晶态 TiO 2 壳发生相变和重新分布，产生 10–20 nm 的锐钛矿相 TiO 2 纳米颗粒和沿晶界分布的 Nb–Ti–O 复合氧化物界面相。多尺度表征证实了这些相的空间分离和微观结构分布。ALD 制备的氧化物分散体抑制了晶粒生长和位错运动，使氧化物富集区域的硬度提高高达 43%，通过纳米压痕测量得到。这种强化源于晶界钉扎、颗粒-位错相互作用和界面氧化物稳定，Nb–Ti–O 复合相的形成与离散的 TiO 2 分散体同样起重要作用。该研究提出了一种可扩展的无污染表面工程策略，用于制造具有精细微观结构和增强室温力学性能的纳米结构 Nb 基复合材料。该方法为耐火金属系统提供了一种可行的加工平台，未来可能扩展到高温结构应用。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.6942767","t":"In Situ Quantification of Hydrogen Radicals Disentangles Direct and Hydrogen‐Radical‐Mediated Pathways in Green Ammonia Electrosynthesis From Nitrate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.6942767","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"ABSTRACT The electrochemical reduction of nitrate (ERN) to ammonia (NH 3 ) has attracted increasing attention as a sustainable route for nitrogen recovery and green ammonia production, enabled by major advances in electrocatalyst design over the past decade. Two mechanistic pathways are generally well‐recognized: direct electron transfer and a hydrogen radical (H*)‐mediated mechanism. However, the latter remains difficult to quantify under practical electrochemical conditions, limiting mechanistic comparison across catalyst configurations. Herein, Ni/Co, Ni/Pt, and Ni/Pt/Co electrocatalysts were investigated to elucidate the interplay between direct and indirect ERN pathways. Quantitative electron spin resonance (ESR) measurements of H* under ERN‐relevant conditions, combined with bulk electrolysis in the absence and presence of an H* scavenger, enabled direct correlation between H* avai","au":["Gabriel A. Cerrón‐Calle","Andrea N. Arias‐Sanchez","Marco Flores","Manuel A. Roldan","Carlos M. Sánchez‐Sánchez","Sergi Garcia‐Segura"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"原位氢自由基定量解耦了从硝酸盐绿色氨电合成中的直接和氢自由基介导的途径","zb":"硝酸盐（ERN）电化学还原成氨（NH3）作为一种可持续的氮回收和绿色氨生产路线越来越受到关注，这得益于过去十年在电催化剂设计方面的重大进展。通常公认有两种机理途径：直接电子转移和氢自由基（H*）介导的机制。然而，后者在实际电化学条件下难以量化，限制了不同催化剂配置之间机理比较。在此，研究了Ni/Co、Ni/Pt和Ni/Pt/Co电催化剂，以阐明直接和间接ERN途径之间的相互作用。在ERN相关条件下对H*的定量电子自旋共振（ESR）测量，结合在存在和不存在H*清除剂的情况下进行的体电解，使H*可用性与NH3生产直接相关。Ni/Co主要遵循直接电子转移，而Ni/Pt在高于阈值电流密度的条件下转变为H*介导的机制。相比之下，Ni/Pt/Co表现出协同行为，其中两种途径共存。此外，H*的作用随电催化剂化学组成而变化，促进NO3 − 活化或NO2 − 加氢。这些发现建立了一个定量框架，用于解决ERN","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.6c01038","t":"Group-Additivity–Embedded Multiscale Modeling for Electric Field-Enhanced Nanocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.6c01038","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract Elucidating structure-performance relationships remains a central challenge in field-enhanced catalysis, where nanoparticles exhibit nonuniform surface sites with site-dependent responses to electric fields. Low-coordination sites (edges, corners, and tips) are particularly electric field-sensitive (EF), leading to nonuniform charge distribution, adsorption energies, and catalytic activity. Here, using ammonia decomposition on a ruthenium cluster as a model system, we develop a transferable multiscale framework integrating density functional theory, group additivity (GA), Brønsted-Evans-Polanyi scaling, and microkinetic modeling to predict EF-dependent activity across nonuniform cluster sites. Across sites and fields, the nitrogen adsorption energy (EN) emerges as the governing descriptor, yielding robust volcano relationships whose optimum shifts systematically with field: nega","au":["Qiang Li","Yilang Liu","Runze Zhao","Fanglin Che"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"用于电场增强纳米催化的群加和嵌入多尺度建模","zb":"该研究使用氨分解在钌簇上的模型系统，开发了一个可转移的多尺度框架，集成了密度泛函理论、群加和（GA）、布伦斯特德-埃万斯-波拉尼化学计量和微动力学建模，以预测电场依赖的活性跨非均匀簇位点。在不同场和位点之间，氮吸附能（EN）成为控制描述符，产生稳健的火山关系，其最佳点随场系统地变化：负场通过电子积累增强N结合，而正场通过电荷耗尽减弱N结合，将最佳EN移向较弱的结合。微动力学分析表明，N≡N键形成在大多数条件下仍然是关键动力学瓶颈；正场降低有效势垒，并且关键地增加接近最佳活性位点的比例，导致相对于零场和负场情况的整体活性提高。通过以高精度和低计算成本捕获场和位点依赖的能学，该GA嵌入的多尺度模拟工作流程为预测和设计电场增强纳米催化提供了一条物理解释的途径。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电场辅助，未证实焦耳供热","top":1},{"id":"wx:__biz=MzA3ODU2NTgzNA==&mid=2667030627&idx=1","t":"【动态】大连化物所发现氢化锂介导合成氨存在波长依赖的固氮和加氢机制","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA3ODU2NTgzNA%3D%3D&mid=2667030627&idx=1","s":"中国科学院大连化物所","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:53Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"近日，大连化物所氢能与先进材料研究部氢化物能源化学研究中心（DNL1901组群）陈萍研究员、郭建平研究员团队与厦门大学吴安安副教授合作，在氢化物固氮研究领域中取得新进展。 近日，大连化物所氢能与先进材料研究部氢化物能源化学研究中心（DNL1901组群）陈萍研究员、郭建平研究员团队与厦门大学吴安安副教授合作，在氢化物固氮研究领域中取得新进展。团队揭示了氢化锂（LiH）及其关键反应中间体的波长依赖光响应行为，并基于此构筑了紫外—可见光协同驱动的LiH光化学合成氨过程。 氨是化肥和含氮化学品的基础原料，其温和条件下的高效合成是化学科学研究的重要方向。传统Haber-Bosch工艺需在高温高压（温度大于400 °C，压力大于100 bar）下运行，能耗与碳排放较高。这源于热催化合成氨面临的一个核心难题：氮气活化和中间体加氢两个步骤在能垒上存在“标度关系”——催化剂若能有效活化惰性的N≡N键，则对含氮中间体的吸附也会较强，会阻碍后续加氢放氨；反之，若有利于产物脱附，则氮气活化能力不足。 光照为解决这一问题提供了新思路：不同波长的光子能量不同，理论上可以针对性地驱动特定反应步骤。然而，常规光催化体系中关键中间体丰度低、寿命短，难以研究其特异性的光响应行为。在前期LiH介导紫外光化学合成氨研究（Nature Chemistry，2024）基础上，团队注意到LiH在光化学固氮过程中会生成Li2NH和LiNH2等稳定中间体，这些物种具有不同的光激发性质，为研究波长对各反应步骤的选择性调控提供了平台。团队利用该特性发现，紫外光可以驱动氮气在LiH上还原生成含氮中间体，随后可见光可以驱动这些物种加氢成氨，从而解耦整个反应路径，绕过了标度关系。在常压、644 K条件下，该体系出口氨浓度可以达到0.25%，超出了该条件下的热力学平衡上限（0.13%）。 本工作提出了“步骤特异性光激发”策略：利用不同波长的光分别驱动氮气固定和中间体加氢这两个在热催化中相互制约的步骤，绕过了标度关系，实现了突破热力学平衡极限的光催化合成氨。该策略为温和条件下人工固氮提供了新思路，也为其他重要催化反应提供了新的调控途","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动","wx":1},{"id":"10.3390/eesp2026042012","t":"Dual Technical and Environmental Assessment of the Transition from Grey to Green Hydrogen in the Haber–Bosch Process: A Modelling and Simulation Approach","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/eesp2026042012","s":"","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This work evaluates the transition from grey to green hydrogen in the Haber–Bosch process through a case study of the Fertial ammonia plant. An integrated assessment per ton of NH3 was conducted using coupled process simulation with system-level mass, energy, and emission accounting, which link the electrolyser dynamics with ammonia loop operation under variable renewable conditions. The results show an electrical demand of 8.9 MWh/t NH3 and significant water consumption potential of 27–34 m3/t NH3. Compared with grey ammonia produced via SMR hydrogen (3.65–4.63 t CO2/t NH3), renewable electrolysis reduces total emissions by up to 64% and fossil resource use by approximately 71% (case of 100% PV), depending on electricity carbon intensity. While renewable electricity enables ammonia decarbonization, high water consumption potential represents a challenge. Additionally, hydrogen purity fl","au":["Nour El Imene Brahmi","Kaouther Kerboua"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zb":"通过Fertial氨厂案例研究，使用耦合工艺模拟与系统级质量、能量和排放核算相结合的方法，评估了哈伯-博施工艺从灰氢向绿氢的转型。每吨NH3的电需求为8.9 MWh，水消耗潜力为27–34 m3。与SMR制氢生产的灰氨相比，可再生电解减少了高达64%的总排放和约71%的化石资源使用（100%光伏情况下）。可再生电力实现了氨脱碳，但高水消耗潜力是一个挑战。氢气纯度波动和电解槽输出间歇性影响了循环转化和工艺稳定性，需要热集成和存储策略以保持稳定运行。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ra02156e","t":"Pathways to sustainable lithium-mediated ammonia electrosynthesis: tuning reaction environment and advancing reactor design","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ra02156e","s":"RSC Advances","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) is a promising renewable-powered route for decentralised, small-scale green ammonia synthesis, offering a sustainable complement to the energy-intensive Haber–Bosch process.","au":["Ngoc-Trung Nguyen","Thi Kim Cuong Phu","Minh Triet Nguyen","Trang Minh Pham","Phi Long Nguyen","Thi Viet Bac Phung"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"可持续锂介导氨电合成的途径：调节反应环境和推进反应器设计","zb":"研究对象为锂介导氮还原反应（Li-NRR）体系，关键方法为调节反应环境和推进反应器设计，采用电化学测试表征，结果显示该路线为分散式、小规模绿色氨合成提供可持续方案，是对能量密集型哈伯-博施过程的补充。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d6ra02155g","t":"A molybdenum-promoted nickel–aluminum alloy catalyst for high-efficient hydrogenation reduction of nitrate to ammonia and nitrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6ra02155g","s":"RSC Advances","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"A molybdenum-promoted Ni–Al alloy catalyst was developed for highly-efficient nitrate hydrogenation to N 2 /NH 3 . It achieved >99% conversion with remarkable stability, recyclability, and tolerance to common interfering ions.","au":["Ling-Feng Zou","Zi-Sheng Chao","Tao Xiang","Fen Wu","An Li"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"钼促进的镍-铝合金催化剂用于高效硝酸盐加氢还原为氨和氮","zb":"研究对象为硝酸盐加氢还原为N2/NH3体系，关键方法为制备钼促进的Ni-Al合金催化剂，采用加氢还原方法，结果显示该催化剂可实现>99%的转化率，具有优异的稳定性、可回收性和对常见干扰离子的耐受性。","ob":"其他催化反应"},{"id":"10.1021/acsnano.6c06638","t":"Interface Coordination Nucleation of Copper Nanoclusters on Covalent Organic Frameworks for Electrocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.6c06638","s":"ACS Nano","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Copper nanoclusters stand out as one of the most promising catalysts in the electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NITRR) for ammonia (NH3) synthesis, owing to their well-defined structures and high metal utilization. Herein, we report an interface coordination nucleation strategy for the uniform growth of copper nanoclusters (Cu NCs) on hydrazone-linked covalent organic frameworks (HL-COF). The periodically arranged hydrazone bonds in COF structure ensure uniform growth of copper nanoclusters, fully exposing active sites in electrocatalysis. Theoretical calculations reveal that the abundant low-coordinate Cu atoms within the Cu nanoclusters on HL-COF significantly enhance the adsorption of *NO3 intermediates. Moreover, these Cu nanoclusters effectively reduce the energy barrier for the rate-determining step (*NO→*NHO). The resulting 0.5-Cu NCs/HL-COF catalyst shows an impressive Fa","au":["Minghang Jiang","Fasheng Chen","Xinyu Zhong","Huaizhu Wang","Junjie Ding","Xuemei Liao"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"界面配位成核法制备的铜纳米簇/共价有机框架用于电催化氨合成","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐还原反应（NITRR）体系，关键方法为界面配位成核法制备铜纳米簇（Cu NCs）/水合肼连接共价有机框架（HL-COF），采用理论计算和电化学测试表征，结果显示0.5-Cu NCs/HL-COF催化剂在-1.0 V vs RHE下的Faradaic效率（FENH3）为98.6%，在流动池中可长时间维持工业级硝酸盐还原电流。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaem.6c01151","t":"Low-Volatility and High-Stability Solvents for Stabilizing Lithium-Mediated Electrochemical Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaem.6c01151","s":"ACS Applied Energy Materials","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Lithium-mediated electrochemical ammonia synthesis (Li-MEAS) is a promising green route for ammonia production. However, the widely used tetrahydrofuran (THF)-based electrolytes exhibit intrinsic drawbacks of high volatility and poor anodic stability, which necessitate frequent and excessive electrolyte replenishment, further resulting in increased operating costs and environmental risks. Therefore, developing electrolytes with low/nonvolatility and high electrochemical stability is critical to enable lean-electrolyte operation of Li-MEAS systems. In this work, we systematically evaluated ethylene carbonate (EC)-, propylene carbonate (PC)-, and 1-ethyl-3-methylimidazolium tetrafluoroborate ([EMIM][BF4])-based electrolytes for Li-MEAS. All three solvents show significantly lower volatility and higher anodic stability than the THF-based electrolyte. When employed in a Li-MEAS reac","au":["Zhou Zhou","Yifan Zhou","Jiaxin Kang","Bohao Han","Huamin Qiu","Hao Nan Jia"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"用于稳定锂介导电化学氨合成的低挥发性和高稳定性溶剂","zb":"研究对象为锂介导电化学氨合成体系，关键方法为评估乙二醇碳酸酯（EC）、丙二醇碳酸酯（PC）和1-乙基-3-甲基咪唑四氟硼酸盐（[EMIM][BF4]）基电解质，采用闪蒸焦耳热加热方式，通过Faradaic效率（FE）和循环伏安法表征，结果显示EC基和PC基电解质的FE分别为83.05%和74.76%，循环碳酸酯基电解质在贫电解质条件下可稳定运行超过40分钟。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141058","t":"Electronic structure modulation of Ni-decorated Cu nanowire electrode for efficient nitrate-to-ammonia conversion in neutral media","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.141058","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-09-28T19:38:42Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrate-to-ammonia conversion has emerged as a pivotal green technology that simultaneously enables waste valorization and sustainable ammonia production, offering a promising alternative to the energy-intensive Haber-Bosch process. Herein, we reported a highly efficient Ni-decorated Cu nanowire electrode (Ni-CuNW) that exhibited remarkable electrocatalytic activity under challenging neutral media, which typically suffers from insufficient H* supply and severe competition from the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). The optimized electrode achieved near complete nitrate removal with 99.5% NH4+-N selectivity and 95.5% Faradaic efficiency (FE) for NH3 production during treatment of nitrate-laden wastewater (50 mg L-1 NO3--N), and maintained an NH3 FE of 90% even in high-concentration wastewater containing 2000 mg L-1 NO3--N. An integrated reactor incorporating an in-situ am","au":["Lingli Lv","Lingxi Xia","Haoming Wang","Xue Xia","Xia Huang"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"Ni修饰的Cu纳米线电极的电子结构调制用于中性介质中硝酸盐向氨的高效转化","zb":"电催化硝酸盐向氨的转化已成为一种关键的绿色技术，它同时实现了废物增值和可持续氨生产，为能耗高的哈伯-博施过程提供了一种有希望的替代方案。在此，我们报道了一种高效的Ni修饰的Cu纳米线电极（Ni-CuNW），它在具有挑战性的中性介质下表现出卓越的电催化活性，其中通常存在H*供应不足和严重的析氢反应（HER）竞争。优化的电极在处理含硝酸盐废水（50 mg L-1 NO3--N）期间实现了近完全硝酸盐去除，NH4+-N选择性为99.5%，NH3生产法拉第效率（FE）为95.5%，即使在含有2000 mg L-1 NO3--N的高浓度废水中也能保持90%的NH3 FE。构建了包含原位氨回收单元的集成反应器，在各种硝酸盐浓度下实现了超过95%的硝酸盐去除和85%的NH3回收，展示了其强大的实际适用性。机制研究表明，优异的性能源于Ni(OH)2物种的引入，它调节了Cu的电子结构并诱导了表面电子重新分布","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/nitrogen7030070","t":"The Lag Effect of National Nitrogen Management on Nitrogen Use Efficiency and Greenhouse Gas Emission","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nitrogen7030070","s":"Nitrogen","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Effective nitrogen (N) management is essential for ensuring food security, promoting agricultural sustainability, and addressing climate change due to the rise in fertilizer use since the 20th century. However, environmental improvements from N management are subject to uncertainties and time lags. In this study, we analyzed data from 113 countries, focusing on N use efficiency and greenhouse gas emissions as key indicators. Our results illuminated a notable lag effect between improvements in these two indicators at the global scale, posing formidable challenges in achieving timely environmental benefits through N management strategies. We categorized countries into four groups based on agricultural sustainability, offering insights into the environmental impacts of various N management practices. Nations prioritize N management differently, reflecting the intricate interplay between soc","au":["Wangzheng Shen","Qianrui Jing","Sisi Li","Yanhua Zhuang","He Duan","Junchong Wei"],"o":"回填","zt":"国家氮管理的滞后效应对氮利用效率和温室气体排放的影响","zb":"该研究分析了113个国家的数据，重点关注氮利用效率和温室气体排放作为关键指标。结果表明，在全球范围内，这两个指标之间存在明显的滞后效应，通过氮管理策略实现及时的环境效益面临着巨大挑战。该研究根据农业可持续性将国家分为四组，提供了对各种氮管理实践环境影响的见解。各国优先考虑氮管理的方式不同，反映了社会经济决定因素和环境考虑之间的复杂相互作用。采用平衡农业生产力和环境保护的综合氮管理实践，对于可持续农业的进步是不可或缺的。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.26599/nr.2026.94908782","t":"Cu nanoparticles coated with porous N-doped carbon for the selective hydrogenation of quinolines under mild conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.26599/nr.2026.94908782","s":"Nano Research","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract The rational design and construction of high-performance heterogeneous non-noble metal catalysts is an urgent need for the practical application of selective hydrogenation of quinoline and its derivatives. In this work, N-doped porous carbons encapsulated highly-dispersed Cu nanoparticles catalyst (Cu@NC-900) was synthesized by pyrolysis of Cu-metal-organic framework (MOF) precursor, based on the design concept of high efficiency, low cost, and excellent durability. Interestingly, the Cu@NC-900 catalyst exhibits extremely high activity, chemo-selectivity, and recoverability for the hydrogenation of quinoline and its derivatives using ammonia borane as the hydrogen resources under mild conditions. The characterization results of powder X-ray diffraction (PXRD), scanning electron microscopy (SEM), transmission electron microscopy (TEM), Raman spectrum, X-ray photoelectron spectros","au":["Guanyu Wang","Zan Zhang","Taofen Wang","Zuxian Cai","Baishu Zheng","Zhaoxu Wang"],"o":"回填","zb":"以氨硼烷为氢源，在温和条件下对喹啉及其衍生物进行选择性加氢，合成了一种由MOF前驱体热解制备的N掺杂多孔碳包覆的Cu纳米颗粒催化剂（Cu@NC-900）。该催化剂表现出极高的活性、化学选择性和可回收性。表征结果表明，催化剂中的N掺杂和高分散Cu物种改变了催化剂表面的电子密度，从而提高了加氢催化性能。","ob":"氨硼烷水解；涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.1039/d6cc02673g","t":"Pyrolysis-tailored carbon defects in MOF-derived Cu/C catalyst for enhanced nitrate electroreduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d6cc02673g","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Moderate carbon defects and maximized ECSA endow the MOF-derived Cu/C catalyst with superior nitrate electroreduction activity, selectivity, and stability.","au":["Aijing Ma","Miaojun Wang","Jun Hu","Xueqian Li","Dan Liu","Jianzhou Gui"],"o":"回填","zt":"MOF衍生的Cu/C催化剂中热解调控的碳缺陷增强硝酸盐电还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸盐电还原为氨体系，关键方法为制备MOF衍生的Cu/C催化剂，通过热解调控碳缺陷，采用电化学测试表征，结果显示中等碳缺陷和最大化电化学活性表面积（ECSA）赋予催化剂优异的硝酸盐电还原活性、选择性和稳定性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cey2.70313","t":"B, N‐Co Doped Porous Carbon Nanotubes Supported Cu Single Atoms and B‐Doped Cu Nanoparticles for High‐Performance Electrocatalytic NO 3 RR and Zn‐Nitrate Batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cey2.70313","s":"Carbon Energy","d":"2026-07-02","f":"2026-09-28T19:19:30Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO 3 RR) is a green, environmentally benign, and energy‐efficient approach to ammonia synthesis; however, it is hampered by the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) and complex electron/proton transfer pathways, which lead to low selectivity and sluggish kinetics. Herein, a hierarchical catalyst, denoted as B‐Cu NPs/BNC, was constructed by co‐anchoring Cu single atoms (Cu–N/C) and B‐doped Cu nanoparticles (B–Cu) onto B, N co‐doped porous carbon nanotubes. Comprehensive structural characterizations (XRD, HRTEM, and XAFS) confirmed that interstitial B doping increased the Cu–Cu bond length and lattice spacing, whereas XPS and DFT calculations revealed that the introduction of Cu nanoparticles and B doping induced strong interfacial coupling between Cu atoms and the carbon substrate while regulating the local electronic structures of both ","au":["李祥定","Jiahui Xiang","Yilun Gao","Z Liu","Haozhi Wang","Hua Tang Yuan"],"o":"旧站本地库","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"B、N-掺杂多孔碳纳米管负载的Cu单原子和B-掺杂Cu纳米颗粒用于高性能电催化NO3还原和锌硝酸盐电池","zb":"电催化硝酸盐还原（NO3 RR）是一种绿色、环境友好且节能的氨合成方法；然而，它受到竞争的析氢反应（HER）和复杂的电子/质子转移途径的阻碍，导致选择性和动力学缓慢。在此，通过将Cu单原子（Cu–N/C）和B-掺杂Cu纳米颗粒（B–Cu）共锚定在B、N共掺杂的多孔碳纳米管上，构建了称为B-Cu NPs/BNC的分级催化剂。综合结构表征（XRD、HRTEM和XAFS）证实，间隙B掺杂增加了Cu-Cu键长和晶格间距，而XPS和DFT计算表明，引入Cu纳米颗粒和B掺杂诱导了Cu原子与碳基底的强界面耦合，同时调节了Cu单原子和Cu纳米颗粒的局部电子结构。结果，Cu d-带中心上移，优化了关键中间体的吸附和活化，改变了决速步骤，并降低了相应的能垒。这些电子调制被发现降低了决速步骤的能量势垒，抑制了副反应，并抑制了HER，从而提高了对NH3的选择性。因此，最优的B-Cu NPs/BNC-7催化剂实现了","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"wx:__biz=Mzg5MTAyNzY0MQ==&mid=2247528584&idx=1","t":"上海交通大学叶天南团队Nature Communications！！富电子双阴离子空位突破温和合成氨核心瓶颈","u":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MTAyNzY0MQ%3D%3D&mid=2247528584&idx=1","s":"材料研究进展","d":"2026-07-01","f":"2026-09-30T19:09:59Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"搭配金属 ni 纳米颗粒构建双活性位 ni/lac化学链合成氨催化体系，并于《nature communications》刊发完整研究成果，王佳琪、戴博等四名学者为论文共同一作，上海交通大学叶天南担任唯一通讯作者。","au":[],"o":"旧站公众号库","why":["合成氨"],"ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","wx":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.7036029","t":"Atomic layer deposited SnxFe2-xO3 photoelectrodes: Box-Behnken design guided optimization for enhanced photoelectrocatalytic performance and antibiotic degradation","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.7036029","s":"SSRN","d":"2026-07-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Earth-abundant materials combined with scalable fabrication methods are essential for advancing photoelectrocatalytic technologies for sustainable fuel production and water purification. In this study, we report a novel process for fabricating SnxFe2-xO3 photoelectrodes using atomic layer deposition (ALD), which provides angstrom-level thickness control, excellent scalability and conformal coating of complex 3D substrates, making it a promising technique for advanced thin film photoelectrode fabrication. Tin doping was achieved through a supercycle ALD approach. A Box-Behnken Design (BBD) based response surface methodology was employed to systematically optimize the synthesis parameters. The total number of ALD cycles, fraction of SnO2 cycles, and post-deposition annealing temperature were selected as independent variables, while photocurrent density at 1.6 V vs RHE and photocurrent onse","au":["Anjan Deb","Miika Mattinen","Mykhailo Chundak","Paavo Porri","Kenichiro Mizohata","Mikko Ritala"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积 SnxFe2-xO3 光电极：基于 Box-Behnken 设计的优化用于增强光电催化性能和抗生素降解","zb":"使用原子层沉积技术制备 SnxFe2-xO3 光电极，通过超循环 ALD 方法实现 Sn 掺杂。采用 Box-Behnken 设计响应面法优化合成参数，包括 ALD 循环总数、SnO2 循环分数和退火温度。优化后的光电极在 1.6 V vs RHE 下具有增强的光电流密度，并表现出优异的光电催化抗生素降解性能。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1049/icp.2026.1555","t":"The renewable energy-based hydrogen and ammonia synthesis system participates in the peak shaving optimization scheduling","u":"https://doi.org/10.1049/icp.2026.1555","s":"IET Conference Proceedings","d":"2026-07-01","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In response to the difficulty of internal regulation and grid peak shaving matching in the multi coupling system of new energy hydrogen production synthetic ammonia, this paper proposes an optimization scheduling method for the participation of source hydrogen ammonia system in grid peak shaving auxiliary services based on power deviation sharing. Firstly, with the goal of maximizing ammonia sales revenue, the economic optimal state of the source hydrogen ammonia system is obtained. Based on the amount of synthesized ammonia in the economic optimal state, a cost model for the source hydrogen ammonia system to participate in grid peak shaving is established using the power grid interaction deviation sharing strategy. Secondly, taking the cost of the hydrogen ammonia system participating in grid peak shaving as a component of the operating cost of the power system, with the goal of minimiz","au":["DeXin Li","JiYue Fu","JingYing Yang","GuanQun Zhuang","Ling Guo Kong"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zb":"针对新能源制氢合成氨多耦合系统内部调节和电网峰谷匹配的困难，提出了一种基于功率偏差共享的源氢氨系统参与电网峰谷辅助服务的优化调度方法。首先，以最大化氨销售收入为目标，获得源氢氨系统的经济最优状态。基于经济最优状态下的合成氨量，使用电网交互偏差共享策略建立源氢氨系统参与电网峰谷的成本模型。其次，将氢氨系统参与电网峰谷的成本作为电力系统运行成本的一部分，以最小化电力系统的运行成本和净负荷波动，构建氢氨系统参与电网峰谷的优化调度模型。最后，计算结果表明源氢氨系统参与电网峰谷的有效性。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cclet.2025.111820","t":"Electronic interactions and hydrogen migration over C60-modified Ru catalyst enhance ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cclet.2025.111820","s":"Chinese Chemical Letters","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":36,"ab":"","au":["Xuanbei Peng","Xiaohu Hu","Ruishao Mao","Mengqi An","Jiaxin Li","Yangyu Zhang"],"o":"回填","w":["Lilong Jiang"],"why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"C60修饰Ru催化剂增强氨合成中的电子相互作用与氢迁移","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.nxmate.2026.102468","t":"Probing the thermodynamic and kinetic sensitivities in ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nxmate.2026.102468","s":"Next Materials","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Decarbonizing ammonia production requires catalyst and reactor choices that sustain high intrinsic rates under lower and flexible operating conditions typical of green hydrogen supply. Here, a physically grounded Langmuir–Hinshelwood–Hougen–Watson (LHHW) sensitivity framework links descriptor-level catalyst properties to reactor operating choices for green ammonia synthesis. Across 320–440 °C and 25–140 bar, control of ln(rate) is concentrated in a physically interpretable subset of parameters. Global rank-correlation analysis identifies the effective activation energy E a , the pre-exponential factor A 0 for N₂ activation, and the adsorption enthalpy–entropy pairs for H₂ and NH₃ as the dominant kinetic levers. Their mean ∣ PRCC ∣ values are 0.78 for E a , 0.49 for ln A 0 , and 0.40–0.48 for H₂/NH₃ adsorption. Entropy and pre-exponential factors therefore emerge as design handles compara","au":["Salem M. Alsaedi","Keeran Ward","Andrew B. Ross","Valerie Dupont"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"氨合成热力学和动力学敏感性研究","zb":"基于 LHHW 框架分析了 320–440 °C 和 25–140 bar 条件下的动力学敏感性。温度是控制对数速率的主要变量，有效活化能和吸附焓熵对是关键动力学杠杆。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2026.03.053","t":"Tri-functional Ru catalyst drives efficient ammonia synthesis from N2 and H2O","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2026.03.053","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Ying Hou","Wei Hu","Qiao Zhao","Yuchuan Tu","Guang Yang","Yi Cui"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"三功能Ru催化剂驱动N2和H2O高效合成氨","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨；涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.compchemeng.2026.109614","t":"Optimisation and Robust Control of a Load-Flexible Haber-Bosch Ammonia Synthesis Loop","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.compchemeng.2026.109614","s":"Computers & Chemical Engineering","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"In this work, we present a detailed model of a Haber–Bosch synthesis loop that includes catalytic beds, heat-exchangers, compressors, steam turbines, and flash separators. The model provides a function for the total electrical power consumption of the synthesis loop, which accounts for compression, refrigeration power, and power generation via steam turbines. This total power represents the cost function for optimising the Haber–Bosch synthesis loop across its full operating envelope, ranging from 10% to 120% load in terms of the hydrogen feed flow. The optimisation considers six degrees of freedom: the inlet temperatures of three reactor beds, the H 2 /N 2 -ratio in the reactor feed, separator temperature, and loop pressure. Results reveal that the loop pressure is the most important parameter, with an optimal value varying from over 220 bar at maximum load to around 110 bar at minimum ","au":["Joachim Weel Rosbo","Anker Degn Jensen","Sigurd Skogestad","John Bagterp Jørgensen","Jakob Kjøbsted Huusom"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"负载柔性哈伯-博施合成回路优化与鲁棒控制","zb":"建立了包含催化床、换热器和压缩机的哈伯-博施合成回路详细模型，以总电耗为成本函数在全操作范围内（氢气进料流量10%-120%）进行优化。结果表明，回路压力是最重要参数，最优值随负载从最大负载时的220 bar降至最小负载时的110 bar。提出了保持反应床入口温度和H2/N2比恒定的控制架构，实现了从10%负载到3%/分钟的快速负载变化下的稳定柔性运行。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.177330","t":"CuFe dual single atoms synergistically modulate the reaction pathways to achieve efficient ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.177330","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Zhen Zeng","Mingtao Yang","Hongjin Xia","Kai Ge","Qingyang Li","Boxiong Shen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"CuFe双单原子协同调控反应路径实现高效氨合成","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2026.137863","t":"Turning plastic waste into a plastic solution: flash joule heating synthesis of iron-carbon composites for nanoplastic removal from water","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2026.137863","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Xiaoyi Wang","Jingyi Lin","Wenhui Su","Shuo Zhang","Kaiyue Yin","Fei Lian"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"将塑料废弃物转化为塑料解决方案：闪光焦耳热合成铁碳复合材料用于去除水中的纳米塑料","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2026.137579","t":"Millisecond flash joule-heating for rapid synthesis of dual-site graphene catalysts toward enhanced Peroxymonosulfate activation in water decontamination","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2026.137579","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Jingxiang Yin","Kaiyue Yin","Shuo Zhang","Meiyan Wang","Fei Wang","Binbin Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["joule-heat"],"zt":"毫秒闪光焦耳加热快速合成双位点石墨烯催化剂以增强过一硫酸盐在水净化中的活化","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jssc.2026.125936","t":"Enhanced catalytic oxidation via internal Joule heating over MnOx/NiCrAl monolithic catalyst for toluene oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jssc.2026.125936","s":"Journal of Solid State Chemistry","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Yongfeng Li","Qiyi Liang","Xiaomian Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"MnOx/NiCrAl 多孔催化剂内部焦耳热增强的甲苯氧化催化氧化","ob":"其他催化反应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jre.2025.07.001","t":"Support defect-mediated metal-support interactions in atomic layer deposition-prepared Pt/CeO2 catalysts for enhanced acetone oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jre.2025.07.001","s":"Journal of Rare Earths","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Ben Niu","Ziyi Shui","Zhenwen Yang","Xiaoxiao Duan","Weiqi An","Ganggang Li"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"载体缺陷介导的原子层沉积制备 Pt/CeO2 催化剂对丙酮氧化的增强","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.189640","t":"Atomic layer deposition technology and its applications in the synthesis of photocatalysts for organic reactions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.189640","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Jiayue Xu","Wentao Xu","Wence Xu","Wen-Jie Chen","Feng Wang","Shengli Zhu"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积技术及其在有机反应光催化剂合成中的应用","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.colsurfa.2026.140165","t":"Microwave-induced Ultrafast Synthesis of Nitrogen-doped Graphene for Enhanced Joule heating and Zinc-ion Battery Anodes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.colsurfa.2026.140165","s":"Colloids and Surfaces A: Physicochemical and Engineering Aspects","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Binqiang He","Ying Xie","Yuqing Yang","Yi Xu","Guole Zuo","Pengju Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"微波诱导氮掺杂石墨烯的快速合成及其在焦耳热和锌离子电池负极中的应用","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ces.2026.123852","t":"Joule heating-controlled single m-ZrO2 for highly selective isobutene synthesis via CO hydrogenation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ces.2026.123852","s":"Chemical Engineering Science","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Yanyun Shen","Kangzhou Wang","Xinhua Gao","Qingxiang Ma","Tian-Sheng Zhao","Jianli Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热控制的单相 m-ZrO2 用于通过 CO 加氢制备高选择性异丁烯","ob":"其他催化反应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.177425","t":"Joule heating-driven chemical looping dry reforming of CH4 and CO2 over monolithic LaFeO3/Ti wire oxygen carrier","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.177425","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Kun Wang","Haoyu Qi","Shengnan Zhao","Zezhou Ran","Hao Zhang","Kunlun Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热驱动的 CH4 和 CO2 在 LaFeO3/Ti 线状氧载体上的化学链干法重整","ob":"其他催化反应｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.177294","t":"Selective depolymerization of polyolefin copolymer via high-entropy alloy catalyzed pyrolysis in a double-layered ultrafast heating reactor","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.177294","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Seung Won Kim","Hansung Lee","Seonho Lee","Eunhyo Song","Yong Tae Kim","Byungmin Ahn"],"o":"回填","why":["ultrafast heating"],"zt":"高熵合金催化下的聚烯烃共聚物选择性解聚：双层超快加热反应器中的热解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.166554","t":"First-principles mechanism of TDMAH adsorption on pristine and laser-functionalized graphene toward area-selective atomic layer deposition of HfO2","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.166554","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"• First-principles investigation of TDMAH adsorption on pristine and oxygen-functionalized graphene surfaces. • DFT analysis shows that COOH, OH, and epoxide groups can enhance surface reactivity. • Proton-donating COOH/OH sites promote strong chemisorption, while epoxide groups act as anchoring sites during the initial half-cycle of ALD. • Oxygen functionalities increase charge transfer, strengthen interfacial Hf–O bonding and can provide nucleation centres. • Reactivity contrast revealed by DFT explains the origin of uniform and selective ALD nucleation on modified graphene. Hafnium oxide (HfO 2 ) is a leading high-κ dielectric for graphene-based field-effect transistors yet achieving conformal and defect-free HfO 2 films on graphene remains challenging. The chemical inertness of pristine graphene suppresses precursor chemisorption during atomic layer deposition (ALD), resulting in dis","au":["Atiye Khosravi","Xichun Luo","Wenkun Xie","Xiaolei Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"TDMAH 在原始和激光功能化石墨烯上的吸附的第一性原理机制：面向 HfO2 面积选择性原子层沉积","zb":"采用密度泛函理论研究四(二甲氨基)铪 (TDMAH) 在原位与激光功能化石墨烯表面的吸附行为。研究发现 COOH、OH 和环氧基团能增强表面反应性，其中 COOH/OH 促进强化学吸附，环氧基团在 ALD 初始半周期起锚定作用。氧官能团增加电荷转移，强化 Hf-O 键合并提供成核中心。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.189519","t":"Porous conductive ceramic-matrix composites produced by self-propagating high-temperature synthesis using natural minerals for heating applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.189519","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"This study reports on the fabrication of porous conductive Ti-Fe-Cr-Si-C/Al₂O₃ ceramic-matrix composites via self-propagating high-temperature synthesis (SHS, also known as combustion synthesis) using low-cost natural ilmenite and quartz minerals. Investigation of the reaction kinetics and phase formation revealed that silicon (Si) and carbon (C) concentrations are critical parameters for tailoring the microstructure and functional performance. We demonstrate that the incorporation of C suppresses the coalescence of the intermetallic phase during combustion, leading to structural refinement; the average particle size of the Ti-Fe-Cr-Si-(C) phase is reduced from 4.1 to 1.3 μm, promoting the formation of a dense, highly connected percolation network. This refinement results in a tunable electrical resistivity (0.15–1.3 Ω·cm) and enhanced compressive strength (up to 23.4 MPa). Furthermore, ","au":["A.I. Kirdyashkin","R.M. Gabbasov","V.D. Kitler","O.V. Ivanova","E.V. Yakovlev","A.V. Solovyov"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-heat"],"zt":"利用天然矿物通过自蔓延高温合成制备多孔导电陶瓷基复合材料用于加热应用","zb":"本研究报道了通过自蔓延高温合成（SHS）使用低成本天然钛铁矿和石英矿物制备多孔导电 Ti-Fe-Cr-Si-C/Al₂O₃ 陶瓷基复合材料。研究反应动力学和相形成表明，硅（Si）和碳（C）浓度是调节微观结构和功能性能的关键参数。碳的加入抑制了燃烧过程中金属间相的团聚，导致结构细化；Ti-Fe-Cr-Si-(C) 相的平均粒径从 4.1 减少到 1.3 μm，促进了致密、高度连接的渗透网络的形成。这种细化导致可调的电导率（0.15–1.3 Ω·cm）和增强的压缩强度（高达 23.4 MPa）。此外，结合 SHS 与专用化学炉的化学炉辅助燃烧合成（CFACS）有效地减少了合成过程中的热梯度（将中心到边缘的温度差从 320 减少到 70 °C），从而确保结构均匀性并最大限度地减少残余应力。合成的复合材料在高达 800 °C 的温度下作为焦耳加热催化元件表现出高运行稳定性。这些发现为工程高性能、低","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.26599/nr.2026.94909040","t":"In s itu synchrotron radiation unveils tandem electrocatalytic mechanism in nitrate-to-ammonia conversion enhanced by electron delocalization between cobalt oxide and copper","u":"https://doi.org/10.26599/nr.2026.94909040","s":"Nano Research","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Cu-based electrocatalysts are cost-effective and highly selective for electrochemical nitrate-to-ammonia reduction (NO3RR) but suffer from limited active hydrogen (H*) supplying, competing hydrogen evolution, and ill-defined active sites. Here, we demonstrate that CoO facilitates water dissociation to generate and capture H*, which migrates to neighboring Cu sites and both enhances NO3RR performance and suppresses hydrogen evolution on the CoO/Cu heterostructure by electron delocalization. In situ synchrotron radiation analyses reveal that metallic Cu strongly adsorb and electronically activate NO3−, CoO dissociate water to supply H*, and dynamic modulation of metal valence states and coordination environments synergistically enhances activity and stability by sustaining electron delocalization induced by electron transfer from Cu to CoO. Complementary in situ and ex situ spectr","au":["Yingsheng Zheng","Qian Guo","Tianyu Han","Baoluo Wang","Zhijian Liang","Lei Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"原位同步辐射揭示钴氧化物和铜之间电子离域增强的硝酸盐至氨转化串联电催化机制","zb":"研究对象为 CoO/Cu 催化剂，关键方法为原位同步辐射分析和多种光谱表征技术，主要结果为揭示了金属 Cu 对 NO3− 的强吸附和电子激活，CoO 水解提供 H*，电子转移和金属价态/配位环境的动态调制协同增强活性与稳定性。在 -0.4 V vs RHE 下，催化剂的 NH3 法拉第效率为 95%，产率率为 14,321 μg h−1 cm−2，在流动池中持续 200 mA cm−2 超过 220 h。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/s1872-2067(26)65043-7","t":"Decoupling competitive reactions by their differential orbital-coupling response to vacancy engineering for efficient electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1872-2067(26)65043-7","s":"Chinese Journal of Catalysis","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Dezhi Wang","Songhua Yang","Yiyi Yangliu","Xufa Peng","Fangyang Liu","Hao Fei"],"o":"回填","why":["electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"通过空位工程对竞争反应的差分轨道耦合响应解耦以实现高效的电催化氮还原","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2026.137621","t":"Strategies for catalyst design and mechanism regulation for photocatalytic NOX conversion: Purification and Ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2026.137621","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Lingling Liu","Chunling Zhang","Shuangshuang Yu","Ruimin Chen","Fan Dong","Jieyuan Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"催化剂设计和机制调控策略用于光催化 NOX 转化：净化和氨合成","ob":"光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.rser.2026.116943","t":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia production with an emphasis on copper-based electrocatalysts: from catalyst design to application and challenges","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.rser.2026.116943","s":"Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ruchun Li","Enguo Xiang","Xue Zhao","Fengyi Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"电化学硝酸盐还原为氨生产，重点介绍铜基电催化剂：从催化剂设计到应用和挑战","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.pup.2026.100005","t":"Ammonia synthesis by nanosecond pulsed atmospheric pressure plasma jets impinging on water","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.pup.2026.100005","s":"Pulsed Power","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Developing energy-efficient technologies for carbon-neutral ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis is critical for decentralized fertilizer production and global decarbonization. This study investigates generating NH 3 from water using a nanosecond pulsed atmospheric pressure plasma jet (ns‑APPJ) operating in either N₂ or dry air. The plasma jet reactor employed approximately 250 ns, up-to-22 kV pulses at 500 Hz to sustain a nonequilibrium discharge impinging directly on static liquid water. The kinetics, energy efficiency, and product selectivity of NH 3 formation were quantified as functions of the pulse voltage, repetition frequency (PRF), and gas flow rate. NH 3 production increased linearly with treatment time and scaled strongly with pulse voltage, reaching a maximum of 0.0345 mg h⁻¹ at 22 kV. Even at higher voltages, the production of NH 3 was more favorable than oxidative nitrogen species (i.","au":["Zach Caudell","Lynnet Rich","Olga Pakhomova","Chunqi Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"纳秒脉冲大气压等离子体射流冲击水制备氨","zb":"本研究调查使用在 N₂ 或干燥空气中运行纳秒脉冲大气压等离子体射流（ns‑APPJ）从水中生成 NH₃。等离子体射流反应器采用约 250 ns、高达 22 kV 的脉冲，频率为 500 Hz，以维持非平衡放电直接冲击静态液态水。量化了 NH₃ 形成的动力学、能量效率和产物选择性，作为脉冲电压、重复频率（PRF）和气体流量函数。NH₃ 产量随处理时间线性增加，并随脉冲电压强烈缩放，在 22 kV 时达到最大值 0.0345 mg h⁻¹。即使在较高电压下，NH₃ 的生成也比氧化性氮物种（即 NO₂⁻ 和 NO₃⁻）更有利，NH₃ 选择性从 17 kV 的 25% 增加到 22 kV 的 85%。降低 PRF 提高了能量效率，但降低了生产率，而较低气体流量增强了 NH₃ 形成，表明增加了停留时间和改善了等离子体-液体质量传输。光发射光谱揭示了主导的 N₂ (C–B) 发射，证实了电子冲击激发对","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.psep.2026.109110","t":"Qc-5-CuxCoy MOFs for boosting electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia in neutral electrolyte","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.psep.2026.109110","s":"Process Safety and Environmental Protection","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Min Wang","Wenyu Li","Huiting Qiao","Yadan Yu","Fanghua Ning","Yuyu Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"Qc-5-CuxCoy MOFs 用于增强中性电解液中硝酸还原为氨的电化学过程","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.nanoen.2026.112035","t":"Atomic scale distortion enables optimal Cu–Co coupling for selective electrochemical nitrate to ammonia conversion in neutral electrolytes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nanoen.2026.112035","s":"Nano Energy","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Gawon Sim","Jaemin Park","Ji Soo Byun","Jun Ho Seok","Youngeun Kim","Junbeom Park"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"原子尺度畸变实现 Cu–Co 耦合以在中性电解液中选择性电化学将硝酸盐转化为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jmgm.2026.109399","t":"Catalytic performance of La@Mg12O12 as a single atom catalyst toward nitrogen reduction reaction for ammonia generation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmgm.2026.109399","s":"Journal of Molecular Graphics and Modelling","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The catalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) offers an ecofriendly pathway for ammonia production under ambient conditions, yet the high bond dissociation energy of the N ≡ N triple bond necessitates highly efficient catalysts. Single atom catalysis (SAC) has emerged as cost effective and efficient technique for facilitating NRR to ammonia (NH3). Herein, density functional theory (DFT) calculations are implemented to investigate lanthanum doped magnesium oxide (La@Mg12O12) nanocage as SAC for efficient conversion of N2 to NH3. The calculated interaction energy (Eint. = -2.40 eV) and formation energy (-2.60 eV) reflect the thermodynamic stability of La@Mg12O12 complex. Non-covalent interaction (NCI), quantum theory of atoms in molecules (QTAIM) and Ab initio molecular dynamics (AIMD) simulations, further verified the strong and effective interaction between La and the Mg12O12 nanocage.","au":["Naveen Kosar","Tariq Mahmood","Abdulaziz A. Al-Saadi"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"La@Mg12O12 作为单原子催化剂在氮还原反应中生成氨的催化性能","zb":"研究对象为 La@Mg12O12 纳米笼单原子催化剂，通过密度泛函理论 (DFT) 计算、非共价相互作用 (NCI)、量子理论原子分子 (QTAIM) 和 ab initio 分子动力学 (AIMD) 模拟研究其用于 N2 转化为 NH3 的性能。La@Mg12O12 复合物具有 -2.40 eV 的相互作用能和 -2.60 eV 的形成能，表明其热力学稳定性。最优 NRR 路径为 N2 以端基吸附配置与 Mg12O12 (相互作用能 -0.64 eV)，第七步质子偶联电子转移 (PCET) (NH2∗ 转化为 NH3∗) 为决速步骤，过电位为 1.02 eV，吉布斯自由能变化为 1.59 eV。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2026.04.027","t":"“π Region-isolation-acceptor-contributor-enrichment” mechanism-guided design of double-atom catalysts for nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2026.04.027","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yibo Wu","Jiangman Xi","Bo Wang","Teng Li","Meixia Xiao","Cheng He"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"π 区域隔离-受体贡献者富集”机制指导的双原子催化剂设计用于氮还原反应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.140251","t":"Electron-rich graphene layer induces a H-down configuration of water molecules for efficient ammonia electrosynthesis from nitric oxide","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.140251","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electron-rich catalytic surfaces have been widely employed in the electrochemical reduction of nitric oxide (eNORR) for ammonia electrosynthesis. However, their influence on the reaction mechanism, particularly solvent effects, remains poorly understood. In this study, we developed an electron-rich core/shell catalyst by encapsulating tungsten trioxide with a graphene layer (WO3-x@GR) to investigate its role in modulating solvent effects. This catalyst achieved an ammonia yield of 4365 μmol mg-1 h-1 and a faradaic efficiency (FE) of 91.1% at -0.54 V vs. RHE over 100 h of continuous operation, surpassing most recently reported catalysts. Electronic structure analyses demonstrated that oxygen vacancies (Ov) in the WO3 core facilitated interfacial electron transfer, thereby generating electron-rich active sites within the graphene (GR) shell. Moreover, ab initio molecular dynamics (AIMD) si","au":["Wenyang Fu","Yanjun Yin","Rui Yang","Huimin Sui","Ling Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia electrosynthesis"],"zt":"富电子石墨烯层诱导水分子 H-down 配置以高效从一氧化氮中进行氨电合成","zb":"研究对象为 WO3-x@GR 核壳催化剂，通过电子结构分析和 ab initio 分子动力学 (AIMD) 模拟研究富电子表面对溶剂效应的影响。该催化剂在 -0.54 V vs. RHE 下实现了 4365 μmol mg-1 h-1 的氨产率和 91.1% 的法拉第效率，超过多数近期报道的催化剂。AIMD 模拟表明水分子在富电子活性位点处优先 H-down 配置，通过氢键减弱一氧化氮 (NO) 吸附而通过氢原子排斥增强 NOH 吸附，降低了 *NO → *NOH 的活化能从 2.18 eV 到 1.16 eV。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2026.140150","t":"Cu-doped NiAl layered double hydroxide enable the synergistic enrichment and hydrogenation of low-concentration nitrate for enhanced photocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2026.140150","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photocatalytic nitrate reduction not only mitigates nitrate pollution in aquatic environments but also offers a promising strategy for ammonia production within the nitrogen cycle. However, the low nitrate concentration in sewage presents a significant challenge for the design of photocatalytic materials. Herein, the NiAl layered double hydroxide (NiAl-LDH) with inherent physical adsorption capacity was employed as photocatalyst, and the incorporation of low-valent Cuδ+ (δ < 2) enhanced the chemisorption for nitrate while simultaneously reduced the hydrogenation reaction barriers of ammonia synthesis under photocatalytic conditions. Therefore, the optimized Cu doped NiAl-LDH achieved an outstanding low-concentration nitrate removal performance (75.6%) with a high selectivity for ammonia synthesis of 90.6%. This study proposes an innovative concept and technical pathway for the photocatal","au":["Huan Wang","Qing Wang","Panxing Zhu","Yongyao Tang","Xinyue Li","Miao Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Cu 掺杂 NiAl 层状双氢氧化物实现低浓度硝酸盐的协同富集和加氢以增强光催化氨合成","zb":"研究对象为 NiAl 层状双氢氧化物 (NiAl-LDH) 光催化剂，通过掺入低价 Cuδ+ (δ < 2) 增强对硝酸盐的化学吸附并降低光催化条件下氨合成反应的活化能。Cu 掺杂 NiAl-LDH 实现了 75.6% 的低浓度硝酸盐去除率和 90.6% 的氨合成选择性。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.gee.2026.06.021","t":"Lithium-mediated dinitrogen fixation for green ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.gee.2026.06.021","s":"Green Energy & Environment","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia, as a carbon-free fuel, is one of the essential raw materials for the production of industrial and agricultural chemicals. Currently, in contrast to the energy-intensive and high-emission conventional Haber-Bosch process 48that conflicts with global climate goals, electrochemical ammonia synthesis presents a promising sustainable alternative by using renewable energy to convert nitrogen into ammonia. However, aqueous systems are plagued by low ammonia generation rates and an ambiguous nitrogen source, primarily due to the intrinsically difficult nitrogen fixation process and the confounding competitive hydrogen evolution. By employing reactive metals such as lithium, the metal-mediated nitrogen fixation process offers a viable and superior solution, overcoming these challenges and enabling higher-efficiency ammonia synthesis. This review comprehensively summarizes recent advances","au":["Chen-Chen Cui","Ruonan Li","Li-Li Zhang","Zhen Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"锂介导的氮固定用于绿色氨合成","zb":"氨作为一种无碳燃料，是生产工业和农业化学品的重要原料。目前，与传统的哈伯-博施过程相比，该过程能耗高、排放量大，与全球气候目标相冲突，电化学氨合成利用可再生能源将氮转化为氨，为可持续替代方案提供了前景。然而，水体系受氨生成速率低和氮源不明确的问题困扰，主要是由于氮固定过程本质上困难以及竞争性的氢气析出。通过采用锂等活性金属，金属介导的氮固定过程提供了一种可行且优越的解决方案，克服了这些挑战并实现了更高效率的氨合成。本综述全面总结了锂介导的电化学氮固定用于氨合成的最新进展。它涵盖了反应机理和反应器优化，重点介绍了电解装置设计、气体扩散层结构和阳极过程耦合对效率的影响。还分析了锂盐、溶剂和质子传递体对催化层性能的影响。此外，文章探讨了非锂金属在氮固定效率、反应速率、自然丰度和稳定性方面的潜力，最后展望了未来的研究方向。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2026.138463","t":"Decentralized hydrogen production via ammonia decomposition: process simulation, techno-economic, and environmental assessment","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2026.138463","s":"Fuel","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mansi Chopra","Nitish Srivastava","Pratham Arora"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"通过氨分解实现分布式氢气生产：工艺模拟、技术经济和环境评估","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.electacta.2026.148777","t":"One step solvothermal synthesis of Fe-doped Cu3P nanosheets from metal-organic frameworks for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.electacta.2026.148777","s":"Electrochimica Acta","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yuhang Cao","Shuling Liu","Chao Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"从金属有机框架一步溶剂热合成Fe掺杂Cu3P纳米片用于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.colsurfa.2026.140195","t":"Unstable coordination induced by solvent effect for enhanced electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.colsurfa.2026.140195","s":"Colloids and Surfaces A: Physicochemical and Engineering Aspects","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Gaojie Zhu","Feifei Du","Jincheng Ji","Jinyu Yang","Jinjin Ma","Junjie Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"溶剂效应引起的配位不稳定增强电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cherd.2026.06.036","t":"Multilevel sustainability evaluation of chemical processes: A case study on ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cherd.2026.06.036","s":"Chemical Engineering Research and Design","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shentong Lin","Hanee Farzana Hizaddin","Mohd Izzudin Izzat Zainal Abidin"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"多级可持续性评估化学工艺：以氨合成为例","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.checat.2026.101757","t":"Unraveling promoter effects in ammonia cracking through multiscale simulations","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.checat.2026.101757","s":"Chem Catalysis","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Pragyansh Singh","Qiang Li","Fanglin Che"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia cracking"],"zt":"通过多尺度模拟揭示助剂效应对氨裂解的影响","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.checat.2026.101721","t":"Advances in plasma catalysis for ammonia synthesis from catalyst design to process intensification","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.checat.2026.101721","s":"Chem Catalysis","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is crucial for agriculture and a promising carbon-free energy carrier. Conventional production via the Haber-Bosch (H-B) process is highly energy intensive and a major source of CO 2 emissions. Plasma-catalytic ammonia synthesis has emerged as a promising route for decentralized and flexible production using intermittent renewable energy. This review summarizes recent advances in plasma-catalytic ammonia synthesis, focusing on catalyst development, reaction mechanisms, and process intensification. The roles of in situ characterization, computational modeling, and multi-scale system integration are highlighted as key to rational catalyst design and process optimization. Techno-economic considerations are also evaluated to assess the viability of plasma-catalytic ammonia synthesis. Overall, this review provides a timely perspective on advancing plasma catalysis as a sustainable rou","au":["Yaolin Wang","Weitao Wang","Mohammad M. Jaffar","Xiang Gao","Xin Tu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"氨合成等离子体催化的进展从催化剂设计到过程强化","zb":"氨对农业至关重要，是一种有前景的无碳能源载体。传统的哈伯-博施 (H-B) 过程生产氨能耗高，是 CO2 排放的主要来源。等离子体催化氨合成已成为利用间歇性可再生能源进行分布式和灵活生产的潜在途径。本综述总结了等离子体催化氨合成的最新进展，重点关注催化剂开发、反应机制和过程强化。强调原位表征、计算建模和多尺度系统集成在合理催化剂设计和过程优化中的关键作用。还评估了技术经济因素以评估等离子体催化氨合成的可行性。总体而言，本综述为推进等离子体催化作为可持续的分布式氨生产路线提供了及时的观点。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动","rb":["研之成理"]},{"id":"10.1016/j.ces.2026.123806","t":"Recent progress of Co-based materials in the electrochemical synthesis of ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ces.2026.123806","s":"Chemical Engineering Science","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xinrang Wang","Rufeng Zhang","Zhen Yuan","Wulin Li","Huijun Lin","Xuefeng Ren"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesis of ammonia"],"zt":"钴基材料在氨电化学合成中的最新进展","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cep.2026.110815","t":"Carbon-free hydrogen production via plasma-catalytic ammonia decomposition over 3D-printed Fe/Al2O3 catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cep.2026.110815","s":"Chemical Engineering and Processing - Process Intensification","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Weronika Bulejak","Jakub Borowicz","Hubert Ronduda","Blanka Seredyńska","Małgorzata Lemańska","Joanna Tańska"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"通过 3D 打印 Fe/Al2O3 催化剂上的等离子体催化氨分解制备无碳氢气","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Fe/铁体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.177493","t":"Modulating oxygen defects in MOF-derived cuprospinel–carbon electrodes for highly efficient electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.177493","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yu-Jen Shih","Zhi-Lun Wu","Ciao-Yu Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"通过 MOF 衍生杯铜矿-碳电极调节氧缺陷以实现高效电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.177214","t":"Coupling photoelectrochemical oxygen evolution with nitrate reduction for ultra-low energy ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.177214","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mingjie Cai","Hehe Qin","Xiaomeng Ran","Zhiyang Li","Taoyun Zhou","Shun Mao"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"耦合光电化学析氧与硝酸盐还原用于超低能耗氨合成","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2026.177135","t":"Biomass-derived porous carbon supported CuCo alloy for efficient electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2026.177135","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Abdulla Eziz","Yusan Turap","Abulikemu Abulizi","Changhai Liang","Wenli Zhu","Kenji Okitsu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"生物质来源的多孔碳负载CuCo合金用于高效的电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ccr.2026.217843","t":"Emerging trends in photocatalytic nitrogen fixation and nitrate reduction using MOF & COF-based catalysts: Recent progress and future perspectives","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ccr.2026.217843","s":"Coordination Chemistry Reviews","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["R. Karthikkumar","Moulidharan Ramamoorthy","G. Mayakannan","Sujoy Sarkar","Shyamapada Nandi"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"基于MOF & COF催化剂的光催化氮固定与硝酸盐还原的Emerging趋势：近期进展与未来展望","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ccr.2026.217803","t":"Multi-dimensional spatial confinement strategies for high-performance electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ccr.2026.217803","s":"Coordination Chemistry Reviews","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Huilin Mao","Wenle Xing","Guangming Jiang","Lijie Yang","Kanxin Jiang","Wangwang Tang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"多维空间限域策略用于高性能电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.166626","t":"Nitrogen-doped graphene supported heteronuclear dual-atom catalysts for electrochemical N2 reduction: A combined DFT and machine learning study","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2026.166626","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shize Liu","Zhou Wang","Zhiming Lu","Jiadi Xu","Guanru Xing","Lin Cheng"],"o":"回填","why":["N2 reduction"],"zt":"氮掺杂石墨烯负载的异核双原子催化剂用于电化学N2还原：结合DFT和机器学习的研究","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.applthermaleng.2026.131389","t":"PVT-Powered Green Ammonia Synthesis System: Coordinated Multi-Energy Optimization and Life Cycle Evaluation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.applthermaleng.2026.131389","s":"Applied Thermal Engineering","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The combination of water electrolysis with photovoltaic-thermal (PVT) technology has garnered interest recently as a low-carbon method for producing green ammonia. Research on PVT coupled green ammonia systems remains limited in terms of energy efficiency, carbon reduction potential, and dynamic operational optimization. A PVT-driven green ammonia system is developed that directly employs photovoltaic output for hydrogen electrolysis and thermal output for ammonia synthesis, thereby achieving green electricity to green ammonia integration and enabling process synergy. Ammonia yield improvement and renewable curtailment reduction are realized by applying the Wasserstein distributionally robust optimization method, which optimizes multi-energy flow coordination and enhances energy utilization. Lifecycle decarbonization and adaptability were assessed with a case study of a real ammonia plan","au":["Xuhong Wang","Wei Zhang","Kun Yang","Jiahong Guo","Zhangyu Li","Ruiwen Zou"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"PVT-驱动的绿色氨合成系统：协同多能源优化与生命周期评价","zb":"结合水电解与光伏-热（PVT）技术作为低碳绿色氨生产方法的研究尚有限。开发了一种PVT驱动的绿色氨系统，直接利用光伏输出进行氢电解，热输出进行氨合成，实现绿色电力到绿色氨的集成与工艺协同。通过应用Wasserstein分布鲁棒优化方法优化多能源流协调，提高能源利用率，实现氨产率提升和可再生能源消纳减少。对实际氨厂的案例研究表明，碳减排和成本降低，适用于季节、规模和区域变化。435 MWp系统配置为年产能180,000吨的氨厂实现53%电力自给，优化提高PVT利用率9.5%，氨产量增加6%。生命周期评估显示与传统路线相比碳减排51%。","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.126580","t":"Regulating nitrogen activation and proton supply to boost photocatalytic nitrogen fixation via Co-ZnO/ MIL-125(SH)2 S-scheme heterojunction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.126580","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Qi Chen","Zefeng Yang","Yueling Chen","Jionghua Wu","Jimmy C. Yu","Ling Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"通过调节氮活化与质子供应来提升 Co-ZnO/MIL-125(SH)2 S-方案异质结的光催化氮固定性能","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/cplu.70214","t":"Recent Advances and Perspectives of Metal Clusters for Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cplu.70214","s":"ChemPlusChem","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The rapid intensification of anthropogenic nitrogen cycle perturbations and the energy‐intensive nature of Haber–Bosch process have motivated the pursuit of sustainable routes for ammonia synthesis. Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) represents a compelling strategy to convert inert N 2 into NH 3 , yet its practical realization remains constrained by formidable activation barriers, sluggish kinetics, and strong competition from hydrogen evolution reaction. Well‐defined metal clusters have emerged as a distinctive catalytic platform, offering tunable electronic structures and active motifs that bridge the gap between single‐atom catalysts and nanoparticles. Our review establishes a unified framework for understanding cluster‐enabled NRR, beginning with the physicochemical principles of N 2 activation, including orbital interactions, reaction energetics, and key activity de","au":["Khalid Aljohani","Terigelema Hao","Irshad Ahamd","Khaled O. Sebakhy","Bassam S. Aljohani","Ijaz Ali"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zb":"金属团簇作为独特的催化平台，为将惰性N2转化为NH3的电催化氮还原反应（NRR）提供了可调的电子结构和活性位点。本文建立了理解团簇促进NRR的统一框架，包括N2活化的物理化学原理、轨道相互作用、反应能学和关键活性描述符，同时考虑电解质和质子偶联效应。分析了团簇的尺寸依赖性电子行为、几何构型和载体相互作用，及其对催化选择性的影响。系统概述了电催化平台，包括金属团簇、双金属系统、异质结构和氮ase启发架构，并讨论了可重复性、耐久性和未来发展方向。预计原位表征、理论建模和可扩展合成的集成将加速高效可靠的团簇基NRR系统的理性开发。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.26599/nr.2026.94908519","t":"Insights into DFT-guided synthesis of atomic clusters for electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.26599/nr.2026.94908519","s":"Nano Research","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract It is non-trivial to perform density functional theory (DFT) screening for experimental validation that can accelerate qualitative materials discovery to give priority to the top candidates. Cluster catalysts, owing to their adequate active sites, quantum effect, high ratio of volume/surface, excellent activity and selectivity, have garnered widespread attention in various complicated multi-step catalytic reactions. However, the design concept, structure formation principle, electrocatalysis process and potential reaction mechanism are rarely unveiled. This perspective will summarize the DFT calculation-assisted screening concept with emphasis on theoretical calculation descriptor, geometric structures, electronic properties, adsorption behaviors, and reaction mechanism to monitor the cluster catalysis. Thereafter, experimental design of advanced clusters will be presented, incl","au":["Hongyu Jing","Peng Zhu","Han Wu","Chang Cui","Nanyu Shao","Xinyi Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"基于 DFT 指导的原子簇电催化合成研究","zb":"研究对象为电催化原子簇催化剂，关键方法为 DFT 理论计算，包括几何结构、电子性质、吸附行为和反应机理的筛选与验证。实验设计包括原子簇的合成策略和表征技术。主要结果为阐明了结构-性能关系，并讨论了氧还原反应、氢氧化、酸氧化、水分解、氮还原和二氧化碳还原的反应机理。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.micromeso.2026.114220","t":"Bi-functional ZIF-8 supported palladium nanoparticles: Catalyst for hydrolytic dehydrogenation of ammonia borane and storage matrix for carbon-dioxide gas","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.micromeso.2026.114220","s":"Microporous and Mesoporous Materials","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Manish Ramesh Shingole","Siddhartha Kolay","Seemita Banerjee","Anandhu Mohan","Asheesh Kumar","Ankita Pathak"],"o":"回填","zt":"双功能 ZIF-8 支持的钯纳米颗粒：氨硼烷水解脱氢催化剂和二氧化碳气体储存基质","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jelechem.2026.120025","t":"Preparation of Cu2O-Cu multi-active-site catalysts with oxygen vacancies for enhanced electrocatalytic reduction of low-concentration nitrates to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jelechem.2026.120025","s":"Journal of Electroanalytical Chemistry","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Zihong Ma","Xingyao Ye","Xiaojun Niu","CaiYun Yan","Dongqing Zhang","Ling Li"],"o":"回填","zt":"制备具有氧空位的 Cu2O-Cu 多活性位点催化剂以增强电催化还原低浓度硝酸盐为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.189277","t":"Suppressing high-temperature losses in CuO-doped BaTiO3 ceramics via flash joule heating post-treatment","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2026.189277","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Lei Zhang","Yuxiang Li","Min Chen","Qin Yao","Gang He","Haoze Li"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"通过闪蒸焦耳热后处理抑制 CuO 掺杂 BaTiO3 陶瓷的高温损失","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.envres.2026.124516","t":"Green synthesis of graphene by flash joule heating for reinforcing low-carbon cement-based composites","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.envres.2026.124516","s":"Environmental Research","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Graphene has exceptional mechanical, electrical, and thermal properties, as well as ultra-high specific surface area, which has attracted interest as a potential modifier for reinforcing cement-based composites. However, traditional graphene production methods are often time-consuming, costly, and involve chemical solvents, limiting their widespread application in cementitious materials. This study employed a green and solvent-free flash Joule heating (FJH) technique to rapidly synthesize high-quality, low-defect flash graphene (FG) from inexpensive carbon black, which was subsequently used to produce high-performance cement-based composites. Experimental results indicated that both discharge voltage and discharge duration are critical factors influencing FG quality. X-ray diffraction (XRD) and Raman spectroscopy analyses revealed that FG synthesized at 200 V and 0.5 s exhibits a turbost","au":["Lei Wang","Weizhe Ge","Gang Huang","Liang Zhao","Atabaev F. Baxtiyarovich","Małgorzata Wiśniewska"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"通过闪蒸焦耳热绿色合成石墨烯用于增强低碳水泥基复合材料","zb":"石墨烯具有优异的机械、电气和热性能，以及超高的比表面积，作为潜在的改性剂引起了人们对强化水泥基复合材料的兴趣。然而，传统的石墨烯生产方法通常耗时、昂贵且涉及化学溶剂，限制了它们在水泥材料中的广泛应用。本研究采用绿色无溶剂的闪蒸焦耳热（FJH）技术，从廉价的碳黑中快速合成高质量的、低缺陷的闪蒸石墨烯（FG），随后用于制备高性能水泥基复合材料。实验结果表明，放电电压和放电时长是影响FG质量的关键因素。X射线衍射（XRD）和拉曼光谱分析显示，在200 V和0.5 s下合成的FG具有湍流堆叠结构，其层间距（0.343 nm）大于传统的AB堆叠石墨烯（0.335 nm）。这种结构特征增强了其在水泥基基质中的分散性。掺入0.20 wt% FG显著增强了水泥水化和改善了孔结构，使抗压强度提高了161%。生命周期分析显示，FG增强水泥复合材料实现了30%的碳减排和144%的性能成本指数提升。本研究结合了环","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcata.2026.121022","t":"CuO nanowires supported on nickel foam as a heterogeneous catalyst for the transfer hydrogenation of nitroarenes using ammonia borane","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcata.2026.121022","s":"Applied Catalysis A: General","d":"2026-07","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Jiahui Huang","Jiaxi Liu","Yanran Xu","Hong Liu","Jialei Du"],"o":"回填","zt":"负载在镍泡沫上的CuO纳米线作为使用氨硼烷对硝基芳烃进行转移氢化的非均相催化剂","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1}]);
